SUMMARY:Queer and Trans Salsa Classes @LGBTDanceUofT
DESCRIPTION:LGBT Dance is back with our queer and trans salsa classes! Stay
  warm this season by dancing with us on Sundays!\n\nIf you've ever wanted 
 to try salsa dancing\, this is your chance. Everyone is welcome\, not just
  students\, and you don't need a partner to join! Our classes are taught b
 y professional\, certified instructors.\n\nSundays\, January 25 to March 2
 9 2015 (9 weeks). There is no class on Sunday\, February 15\, 2015.\n\nSal
 sa 3 - Advanced: 3pm\nSalsa 2 - Intermediate: 4pm\nSalsa 1 - Beginner: 5pm
 \n\nPlease note: For the advanced classes\, you must have taken an interme
 diate salsa class before.\n\nCost (for 9 weeks):\n$45 for students (with v
 alid ID from any institution)\n$90 for non-students\n$15 drop-in for one c
 lass\n\nWe also offer discounts for people who self-identify as unemployed
  or underemployed. Payment plans are also possible.\n\nAll classes take pl
 ace at the Multi-Faith Centre on U of T's St. George campus\, 569 Spadina 
 Avenue\, 2nd Floor.\n\nTo register\, please send us an email with your nam
 e\, email\, the class you want to take\, and whether you're a student or n
 on-student to lgbtdance.club@utoronto.ca\n\nFor more info\, check out www.
 lgbtdance.com or follow us on Twitter @LGBTDanceUofT\n\n&nbsp\; Queer and 
 Trans Salsa Classes @LGBTDanceUofT
