SUMMARY:Belly Dance Class Sampler
DESCRIPTION:Belly dance was originally a dance created by women for women.L
 earn how Belly dance as an artistic cultural form of dance is not only emp
 owering and healing\, but also an excellent way to stay fit and have fun a
 ll at the same time. For flamenco dancers\, you will learn how it is possi
 ble to incorporate more body fluidity into your dance.In this 2hr belly da
 nce sampler Caliana will guide you through a dynamic warm-up\, teach essen
 tial basics of belly dance from sizzling shimmies to sultry hip movements\
 , teach a small combination and make sure you get a proper cool down.At th
 e end of this sampler you will be able to sign up for a new session of Int
 roductory level belly dance which starts at the beginning of February.Bell
 y dance Sampler\nDate &amp\; Time : Saturday January 25 @ 1:30-3:330pm\nLo
 cation: 2-228 Merton Street\, Toronto\, ON\nCost: $35 (includes HST)About 
 Caliana's teaching Method:\nCaliana teaches Hadia's "Body Logic" method of
  belly dance.\nThis is based on all the muscles of the body and their appr
 opriate planes/lines of movement. Learning belly dance in this way can hea
 l injuries and prevent injuries through dance.Belly dance was originally a
  dance created by women for women.\nLearn how Belly dance as an artistic c
 ultural form of dance is not only empowering and healing\, but also an exc
 ellent way to stay fit and have fun all at the same time. For flamenco dan
 cers\, you will learn how it is possible to incorporate more body fluidity
  into your dance.In this 2hr belly dance sampler Caliana will guide you th
 rough a dynamic warm-up\, teach essential basics of belly dance from sizzl
 ing shimmies to sultry hip movements\, teach a small combination and make 
 sure you get a proper cool down.\nAt the end of this sampler you will be a
 ble to sign up for a new session of Introductory level belly dance which s
 tarts at the beginning of February.Belly dance Sampler\nDate &amp\; Time :
  Saturday January 25 @ 1:30-3:330pm\nLocation: 2-228 Merton Street\, Toron
 to\, ON\nCost: $35 (includes HST)About Caliana's teaching Method:\nCaliana
  teaches Hadia's "Body Logic" method of belly dance.\nThis is based on all
  the muscles of the body and their appropriate planes/lines of movement. L
 earning belly dance in this way can heal injuries and prevent injuries thr
 ough dance.Caliana's short Bio:Caliana has been belly dancing for 10 years
  and teaching for 7 years. She has completed level's 1-3 of Hadia's Middle
  Eastern Dance Instructor Certification Course and attended and completed 
 her Professional Course 2 years on a row. As well Caliana has been studyin
 g flamenco since 1999. When she is not dancing\, Caliana is a full-time Pe
 rsonal Trainer and an Independent Travel Consultant with a background in R
 egistered Nursing who still maintains her license. Belly Dance Class Sampl
 er
