  the lights\, play a wild variety of awesome music\, and guide you through
  a few super simple moves. You can’t get them wrong\, because you’re s
 upposed to do them in your own way! Try on different styles\, workout diff
 erent parts\, and build up your confidence.Don’t dance like everyone els
 e: dance like yourself! If you don’t know what that looks like\, this is
