SUMMARY:3 Light Up Dance Summer Camp
DESCRIPTION:3 Light Up Dance Summer Camp 2015 in Toronto!With the emergence
  of popular shows\, such as So You Think You Can Dance\, a consistent obse
 rvation is that the most well-rounded dancers always shine. It is with thi
 s concept  in mind that we at Light Up The Floor are pleased to offer our 
 3 Dance Summer Camp 2015.  Learn 3 dance styles in a week!  Ballroom\, Soc
 ial Dance (e.g. salsa)\, &amp\; Dance Fit (Hip Hop &amp\; Acrodance!).  Ea
 ch of these styles has been selected with both boys and girls in mind.  Ou
 r camp’s main goal is to teach your child how to switch from one dance f
 orm to another with ease while having fun!  There is also pool &amp\; park
  time\; all for just $39/day!  We are conveniently located at 80 Advanced 
 Road\, Toronto\, Ontario.\nTo register\, click here: http://www.lightupthe
 floor.com/summer-camp-2015.html 3 Light Up Dance Summer Camp
