SUMMARY:Introduction To Flamenco/Bellydance Fusion (Zambra Mora)
DESCRIPTION:MONDAYS from 7:15 – 8:15pm\n\nIntroduction To Flamenco/Bellyd
 ance Fusion (zambra Mora) Sept 14 - Dec 7\n\nThis class is a fusion of fla
 menco and bellydance. Lower body and leg work pertains to bellydance while
  flamenco arms and hands and rhythmical sequences that flow with both art 
 forms make this class strengthening and beautiful. Taught by Anjelica Scan
 nura who has been leading workshops in this style of dance internationally
 .\n\nRegistration: $155 for 11 wks or $17 drop in. Introduction To Flamenc
 o/Bellydance Fusion (Zambra Mora)
