URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/introduction-to-modern-square-danc
 ing/
SUMMARY:Introduction to Modern Square Dancing
DESCRIPTION:This is a FREE introductory class. Come try it out!Are you look
 ing for an evening of laughs\, fun and friendship -- while learning an exc
 iting new skill -- this is for you!Were you able to make it on Sept 10th? 
 Doesn't matter....come either night or both nights! Whatever works for you
 !No partner required (although it's always more fun if you bring a buddy w
 ith you). No experience required. NO DANCE SKILLS required\, because you'r
 e simply walking. And if you have two or three left feet\, you will LOVE s
 quare dancing! No special clothes required (but dress to keep cool\, becau
 se dancing is very active and you'll get warm very quickly).Our beginners'
  class is a blast! We guarantee that you will never stop smiling. You'll g
 et a GREAT workout for your body AND your mind\, and you will experience e
 normous satisfaction as you and your dance team work together to solve rea
 l-time puzzles on the dance floor. You'll get to dance with everyone in th
 e class ... and you'll make new friends instantly. By the way\, if you're 
 kind of shy (like me!)\, square dancing is one of the best ways to meet pe
 ople.Classes are inexpensive\, and we have special rates for full-time stu
 dents. Full details will be provided in the class.Triangle Squares is Toro
 nto's LGBTQ* square dance club. The club welcomes all genders and orientat
 ions. You do not have to be LGBTQ*\, just friendly! Introduction to Modern
  Square Dancing
