SUMMARY:Groove Dance
DESCRIPTION:Groove School of Dance offers exciting and unique dance program
 ming. Groove's focus on self esteem and creativity\, rather than competiti
 on\, is what keeps the company growing. The atmosphere at Groove is family
 -friendly\, whether it be the home-made costumes or the warm\, loving teac
 hers who make sure each child feels like the individuals they are. Groove 
 is also one of the first dance studios that encourages children with speci
 al needs. Over the years children with autism\, downs syndrome\, and visua
 l and hearing impairment have danced here as well. Read more below to see 
 the wide range of offerings for ages 4-12! Groove Dance
