SUMMARY:Culture Days: Intro to Scottish Social Dance
DESCRIPTION:Drop by for some family-friendly Ceilidh Dancing fun. Ceilidh M
 aster\, Keith Bark\, will show you how to do fun easy dances -- and some m
 ore challenging. Scottish social dancing traditions date back centuries\, 
 but we have many new dances as well.\n\nYou don't need to come with a part
 ner because we change partners every dance anyway. You don't need to be a 
 Scottish person\; you need to be a *people* person. You will enjoy the liv
 ely jigs and reels even if you have no dance experience.\n\nWear cool clot
 hing and soft shoes. Enjoy samples of Scottish shortbread and tablet.\n\n&
 nbsp\; Culture Days: Intro to Scottish Social Dance
