URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/fall-for-dance-north/
SUMMARY:Fall for Dance North 2015
DESCRIPTION:Inspired by the internationally acclaimed Fall for Dance Festiv
 al&#x2122\;\, created in 2004 by New York City Center a new event comes to
  Toronto….Fall for Dance North – September 29th to October 1st at the 
 Sony Centre For The Performing Arts.\n\nRevel in dynamic mixed programs wh
 ere you will experience anything from classical and contemporary ballet to
  flamenco\, tap\, capoeira\, South Asian and Aboriginal dance forms in a s
 ingle evening. See 11 acclaimed Canadian and international companies over 
 two distinct programs\, with cultural influences that reflect the energy a
 nd diversity of Toronto.\n\nRemarkably\, for each performance\, every seat
  in every section of the venue will cost just $10!\nPROGRAM 1 details:\nTh
 e National Ballet of Canada – Canada\nNo.24\, by Guillaume Cote\n\nToron
 to Dance Theatre – Canada\nVena Cava\, by Christopher House\n\nAlvin Ail
 ey American Dance Theater – USA\nTakademe\, by Robert Battle\n\nNrtiyaga
 m – India *Toronto Debut*\, LIVE MUSIC!\nVibhakta\, by Surupa Sen (artis
 tic director) and Bijayini Satpathy\n\n“Inter-Hoop”\, featuring drum g
 roup “Crazy Eagle”\n**FESTIVAL COMMISSION**\, LIVE MUSIC!\nAn all-Cana
 dian\, special First Nations Hoop Dance performance\, curated and directed
  by the artistic director of the Kaha:wi Dance Theatre\, Santee Smith\n\nA
 tlanta Ballet – USA **Canadian Debut**\nMinus 16\, by Ohad Naharin\nPROG
 RAM 2 details:\nBallet BC – Canada\nTwenty Eight Thousand Waves\, by Cay
 etano Soto\n\nAlvin Ailey American Dance Theater – USA\nAfter the Rain P
 as-de-deux\, by Christopher Wheeldon\n\nDanceBrazil – Brazil LIVE MUSIC!
 \nMalungos\, by Jelon Vieira\n\nPeggy Baker\, featuring Sarah Neufeld (Arc
 ade Fire / Bell Orchestra) – Canada\nin WORLD PREMIERE of fractured blac
 k\n**FESTIVAL COMMISSION**\, LIVE MUSIC!\n\nDorrance Dance – USA **Canad
 ian Debut**\, LIVE MUSIC! (Body Percussion)\nSOUNDSpace\, by Michelle Dorr
 ance\n\nEsmeralda Enrique Spanish Dance Company – Canada LIVE MUSIC!\nDe
 sencuentros &amp\; Río del Tiempo\, by Esmeralda Enrique\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nMo
 re info: http://www.ffdnorth.com/\n\n&nbsp\; Fall for Dance North 2015
