 nEach event raises money for a local or not-for-profit charity of their ch
 oice.suggested donation - PWYC\nproceeds will go to One Walk To Conquer Ca
 ncer.www.onewalk.caThis year we will be doing a "Flash Mob" at Nathan Phil
 ips Square in front of TORONTO sign.4:30PM - registration begin\, donation
 s. Zombies arrive in costume. we will meet by the washroom at Nathan Phili
 ps Square. I will be wearing the red "Thriller Jacket".5:00PM - Rehearsal 
 if anyone wants one\, reviewing steps from the videos (please study at hom
 e using the videos and script from the website) www.thrilltheworld.com or
 https://youtu.be/heEFEOfAn4k\n5:50PM - last minute review\, check that eve
 rything is in order (signed in participants\, music cued\, call in to the 
 hotline\, etc)6:00PM - Thrill time.... Join Thrill The World Toronto 2015 
