DTSTAMP:20160117T082143Z
URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/dance-4-tanya-fundraiser/
SUMMARY:Dance 4 Tanya Fundraiser
DESCRIPTION:Toronto's well-respected dancesport teacher Tanya Cardinal is a
 t present battling Lymphoma and Neurolymphomatosis. This has had devastati
 ng effects on her body including paralysis and compromised breathing. Any
 one who knows Tanya realizes she is a quiet achiever who is incredibly st
 rong and resilient and with support from her wonderful and caring family a
 nd friends she will pull through. This fundraising effort is a wonderful
  opportunity to help with some of the financial challenges that Tanya and 
 her family face during this difficult time.The spectacular fundraising ev
 ent will feature top Canadian professional\, pro-am and amateur couples. Y
 ou will be dazzled by the sizzling Latin\, Ballroom and Show Dance perform
 ances while enjoying delicious food and connecting with friends from our s
 upportive\, generous and delightful community of dancers. There will be pl
 enty of opportunities for everyone to dance to a variety of music styles o
 n a large hardwood dance floor. You may further support fundraising effor
 ts by donating appropriate gifts for a raffle draw and silent auction.Even
 t organizers\, dancers and volunteers are generously giving away their tim
 e\, talent and effort free of charge.To purchase ticketsCall: 647-300-4090
 \n$95 / person – dinner and show ticket\nStanding tickets will be availa
 ble once dinner tickets are sold out.\nFREE parking Dance 4 Tanya Fundrais
 er
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2015/12/ESS_IMG_12613_NRrufa.jpg
