SUMMARY:Peggy Baker Dance Projects presents world premiere of Phase Space
DESCRIPTION:Peggy Baker Dance Projects proudly announces the world premiere
  of Phase Space\, a rich and surprising full-evening work choreographed by
  Peggy Baker\, one of Canada's most acclaimed dance artists. Playing with 
 time\, memory and transformation\, Phase Space features six extraordinary 
 dancers in a surreal and elegant fusion of contemporary dance\, live music
 \, and stage design.cPhase Space extracts choreographic fragments from acr
 oss the impressive spectrum of Baker's repertoire\, and then expands\, com
 presses\, and reassembles these moments to create thoroughly new and uniqu
 e choreographic episodes. Actions that were originally unrelated fold in o
 n one another in striking\, startling\, and fascinating new ways. Peggy Ba
 ker Dance Projects presents world premiere of Phase Space
