SUMMARY:PWYC Pilates & Tribal Bellydance Basics Workshop
DESCRIPTION:This 2 hour workshop will combine Pilates and tribal bellydance
 . The first hour will introduce you to Pilates concepts\, such as breathin
 g and alignment and then we'll be moving along throughout the exercises sa
 fely and efficiently. In the second hour\, we'll talk about foundational m
 ovements in the tribal vocabulary and drill\, drill\, drill.\n\nYou will n
 eed your own mat and a water bottle is recommended. Pilates mats are a bit
  thicker than yoga mats\, but a yoga mat will be helpful. Wear whatever cl
 othing you'd be comfortable working out in - leggings\, sweat pants\, and 
 fitted tee-shirts or tanks. Pilates will be done barefoot\, but if you req
 uire foot support for dancing\, feel free to bring in appropriate footwear
 .\n\nAll are welcome to join us! You can pay cash at the studio in whateve
 r amount you'd like.\n\nhttp://www.serpentinatribal.com/\n\n&nbsp\; PWYC P
 ilates &amp\; Tribal Bellydance Basics Workshop
