SUMMARY:Love Birds 2016 Dance Competition
DESCRIPTION:LOVE BIRDS 2016 is a scintillating\, romantic\, one of a kind d
 ance competition that allows couples to express their passion\, yearning a
 nd talent for the dance form through teamwork. As we are living in a multi
 cultural country\, our dance competition will be multicultural too. Means 
 couples who are participating can do any dance form\, whether it is Salsa\
 , Tango\, Jazz\, Sambas or Bollywood etc. There are no restrictions. The c
 ompetition aims to unravel the dancing superstars in the GTA and will be j
 udged by stalwarts in the field of dance including Puja Amin\, founder of 
 Sanskriti Arts Ensemble\, Divya Gowda\, founder of DK Bollywood Dance\, Mi
 ss Sohni\, Creative Director\, Academy of Cre8ive Arts\, Renee Delgado\, A
 rtistic Director and Co-Founder of United Salseros and Tushar Unadkat\, CE
 O and Creative Director of Mukta Advertising and Founder and Executive Dir
 ector of Nouveau iDEA.\nRegistrations are open NOW for the most-awaited da
 nce contest of 2016 – LOVE BIRDS.\nThe contest is open to all the promis
 ing dancers between 16yrs and 40yrs of age. Team up with your loved ones a
 nd ignite your passion for dance on the floor. But don’t forget –Monda
 y\, November 9\, 2015: register for the Dancing Superstars. Registration i
 s Free. Love Birds 2016 Dance Competition
