  Coast Swing. If you want more of David\, he will be in Ancaster Saturday.
  Music is 1/3 East Coast Swing\, 1/3 West Coast Swing\, 1/3 2Step\, Latin\
 , Hustle. No partner required. Beginners Welcome.\n7:30- Doors Open\n7:45-
 8:30 Beginner Lesson\n8:30- 9:00 Intermediate Lesson\n9:00- DJ dance until
  midnight\nWe look forward to seeing you there!\nMembers $8/Non-members $1
 2\nA $20 yearly TSDS membership gets you in at the member price.\nLithuani
 an House\n1573 Bloor Street West\, M6P 1A6\nBar available at all dances. D
 oor prizes!\nwww.torontoswingdancesociety.ca/friday-dances/\nLike TSDS on 
