 nuous training in Ballet in order to ensure you have the necessary strengt
 h and technique to proceed safely.What: Adult Ballet on Pointe Beginner Cl
 asses with Emily Tench\nWhen: Sundays from 10 a.m. to 11 a.m.\nWhere: Joy 
