SUMMARY:Kids Latin Dance Classes\, 8 - 12 years
DESCRIPTION:Sunday Feb. 21 - April 17\, 12pm - 1pm\nfor kids 8-12 yrs\n\nTh
 e Kids' Latin Dance class will place an emphasis on movement\, musicality\
 , coordination and fun. The children will learn the basics of Merengue (or
  Salsa or Cha Cha\, depending on the term) along with a short choreographe
 d dance routine they will perform for the parents at the end of the sessio
 n.\n\nSteps Dance Studio is dedicated to teaching children the art of Lati
 n dancing in a fun and caring environment. Our trained and experienced ins
 tructors strive to enhance students' self-esteem\, promote physical fitnes
 s\, discipline and a sense of accomplishment while encouraging a feeling o
 f team spirit and a greater awareness and appreciation of other cultures t
 hrough studying dance.\nClass is open for boys and girls. No dance experie
 nce necessary.\n\n8 week course: Sunday February 21 – April 17\n8 week c
 ourse: Sunday April 24 – June 19\n8 weeks: $140\n16 weeks: $250\n10% dis
 count for sibling\nph 416-656-STEP (7837) Kids Latin Dance Classes\, 8 - 1
 2 years
