 df3/
SUMMARY:The Queens of Dance Fitness III #QODF3
DESCRIPTION:Dione’s Fitness Group presents…\n\nThe Queens of Dance Fitn
 ess III\nIn support of Plan Canada Because I am a Girl\n\nThis dance fitne
 ss workout showcases some of the best female movers and shakers in the ind
 ustry\, who motivate and inspire people to improve their wellness through 
 dance. Dress to Sweat!. Event proceeds will be donated to Plan Canada Beca
 use I am a Girl.\nBecause I am a Girl is a global initiative to end gender
  inequality\, promote girls’ rights and lift millions of girls – and e
 veryone around them – out of poverty.\n\nDate: Sunday February 28\, 2016
 \nTime: 1:00 – 3:00PM (Doors 12:30PM)\nLocation: The Great Hall\, 1087 Q
 ueen St W\, Toronto\, ON M6J 1H3\n\nINSTRUCTORS:\nIoana Aboumitri - Kelani
