URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/esmeralda-enrique-spanish-dance-co
 mpany-presents-the-world-premiere-of-epocas/
SUMMARY:Esmeralda Enrique Spanish Dance Company  presents the World Premier
 e of  Épocas
DESCRIPTION:Esmeralda Enrique Spanish Dance Company\, voted Toronto’s Bes
 t Dance Company of 2015 by NOW Magazine readers\, presents the world premi
 ere of Épocas at Harbourfront Centre’s Fleck Dance Theatre as part of N
 extSteps from April 22-April 24\, 2016.\n\nÉpocas\, or ‘Eras’ in Engl
 ish\, journeys through time to pay tribute to many of the iconic figures w
 ho helped shape and influence the music and dance of Spain that we know an
 d love today.\n\nÉpocas honours the tremendous influence of great artists
  from significant eras that brought Spanish culture to the world and featu
 res live music\, song and dance. The program is influenced by La Argentini
 ta’s neoclassical Spanish dance of the 1930’s\, the immensely popular 
 José Greco and his flamenco company in the 1960s and the 1970’s flamenc
 o revival known best for the celebrated and enduring flamenco guitarist Pa
 co de Lucía and iconic flamenco singer Camarón.\n\nThis year\, the award
 -winning Esmeralda Enrique Spanish Dance Company welcomes two artists from
  Spain to perform alongside the dynamic company of dancers and musicians: 
 talented dancer/choreographer Rafael del Pino making his debut with the co
 mpany and exhilarating singer Manuel Soto who returns to work once more wi
 th the ensemble.\n\n&nbsp\; Esmeralda Enrique Spanish Dance Company  prese
 nts the World Premiere of  Épocas
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2016/03/ESS_IMG_13361_vj5u6U.jpg
CATEGORIES:Flamenco
LOCATION:Fleck Dance Theatre\, Harbourfront Centre\, 207 Queens Quay West\,
  Toronto\, Ontario\, M5J1A7\, GTA\, Canada
