URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/aavishkar-dance-talent-showcase/
SUMMARY:Aavishkar Dance Talent Showcase
DESCRIPTION:Aavishkar Dance Talent is providing a new opportunity for young
  Indian Classical Dancers. Our mission is to promote Indian classical tale
 nt in a non-competitive\, non-threatening arena where young\, emerging art
 ists can perform for and be recognized by industry experts.Indian classica
 l dance is slowly taking the backstage to Bollywood\, Contemporary and Fus
 ion. Aavishkar Dance Talent offers an opportunity to highlight the dancers
  who are dedicated to the classical styles. Our dance schools need to pool
  together to build awareness with the goal to grow a future for our young 
 talented dancers and to keep them centre stage. It is our responsibility t
 o promote these beautiful art forms and what better way than to bring toge
 ther the young and the experienced through Aavishkar Dance Talent!Date/Tim
 e: May 08\, 2016 @ 10am-6pm\nLocation: Yorkwoods Library Theatre\nAges: 6 
 to 17 years old\nRegister: Online Aavishkar Dance Talent Showcase
