SUMMARY:Veronica Tennant's Shadow Pleasures - Exclusive Screening
DESCRIPTION:Shadow Pleasures is a one-hour cinematic dance interpretation o
 f Ondaatje’s evocative poetry and prose. Structured in five distinct epi
 sodic sequences\, Ondaatje's imagination is ignited by a group of extraord
 inary artists.\n\nJoin us after the screening for refreshments and a discu
 ssion with artists: Veronica Tennant\, Andrea Nann\, Roberto Campanella\, 
 Astrid Janson\, John Gzowski... and more.\n\nProcedes from the evening wil
 l support Dance Collection Danse in their ongoing mandate to preserve\, il
 luminate and share Canada's theatrical dance history.\n\nTo reserve a spot
  call 416-365-3233 Veronica Tennant&#039\;s Shadow Pleasures - Exclusive S
 creening
