 nnual production\, the cast of PushPULL Dance will confess some of their d
 eepest secrets (some fact\, some fiction)! 'Can You Keep A Secret?' featur
 es 18 original dance pieces that explore a hidden world we all share. Feat
 ured styles include ballet\, hip-hop\, contemporary\, jazz\, musical theat
 re and tap.\n\nSix evening shows and two matinees will be hosted at the Wi
 nchester Street Theatre from June 16 - 25\, 2016. Children's pricing is al
 so available.\n\nThis is a secret you won't want to keep! 2016 PushPULL Da
 nce Show - Can You Keep a Secret?
