SUMMARY:Intermediate Tribal Bellydance Classes
DESCRIPTION:Thursdays from 8-9:30\nMay 26-June 30\n\nExperience the dynamic
  nature of tribal group improv! We'll work on technique and build upon tri
 bal movement vocabulary\, precision\, polishing up the basics\, as well as
  practice run lead and follow in formations. We cover a lot of ground and 
 will get your heart pumping -- previous experience required.\n\nOur warm u
 p is pilates-based and starts on the floor. If you have a yoga mat\, feel 
 free to bring it along.\n\nOptions for class cards are available\, or pay 
 as you go. Payable via Paypal/credit card or cash.\n\n&nbsp\; Intermediate
  Tribal Bellydance Classes
