URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/dancesport-shoes-flash-sale-june-1
 8-2016/
SUMMARY:Dancesport Shoes Flash Sale June 18\, 2016
DESCRIPTION:1 Day - 1 Price - 3 Hours - 4 Premium Brands\nDanceplus is hold
 ing a three hour Flash Sale this Saturday June 18\, 2016. Four premium dan
 cesport shoe brands (International Dance Shoes\, Freed of London\, Anatomi
 ca of Italy\, and introducing MERLET of France) will be marked down from u
 p to $210 to the same low price - $99.00 - for 3 hours only!\n\nTables an
 d tables of mens and ladies dance shoes will be available in the 30-up Clu
 b ballroom\, each pair just $99 that is 35% to 53% off! This is the lowes
 t price you will get from DancePlus all year.\n\nIn addition\, DanceVision
  instructional DVD's will be half price\, and all other DVD's and CD's w
 ill be at least 30% off.\nFlash Sale Survival Tips:\n\n 	Arrive Early. If 
 you wish to be among the first to peruse the selection\, arrive before noo
 n.\n 	Know Your English Size. Sizes are using the British sizing system\, 
 so subtract 2 1/2 from your normal size if you are female and 1/2 from you
 r normal size if you are male. That is\, if you are a size 7 female then y
 ou need to look for a size 4.5. Look for the pink balloon with your size o
 n it (blue balloon for men) and get there as fast as you can!\n 	Know Your
  Fit. All sales are final\, so evaluate the fit carefully before purchasin
 g. Dance shoes require a better fit than street shoes. A dance shoe should
  fit like a leather glove\, but still be comfortable.  If it’s loose\, 
 don’t buy it!\n 	Know Your Wardrobe. You may find unique or unusual styl
 es\, materials\, and colours that have been discontinued.  An unusual col
 our can still look fantastic with that dress that happens to be just the s
 ame shade\, so arrive at the sale knowing what colours may match or clash 
 with your wardrobe.\n 	Play Nice. Even though many people may be competing
  for shoes of a particular size\, limit yourself to trying on no more than
  two pairs at once. Dance Plus requests that you not hoard several pairs o
 f shoes you may not buy so everyone has a fair chance to find shoes in the
  three hours allocated to the sale.\n 	Don’t Stress. If you can’t find
  a pair you like\, Dance Plus will provide staff that will take you next d
 oor and fit you with your choice of any rebular stock shoes at 15% off.\n 
 	Bring Cash for Quick Checkout. If you want to get through quickly\, bring
  cash!  Expect longer lines for credit cards.\n\nGet Your Shoes for Free\
 nOn the Tuesday after the sale\, DancePlus will randomly pick a lucky dan
 cer from their Facebook RSVPs\, followers\, and newsletter subscribers to 
 win a $50 credit to use on a future pair of dance shoes. And if the winner
  bought a pair of shoes at the sale\, they will refund them the $99 they p
 aid and they get to keep the shoes!\n\nHOW TO WIN: Just RSVP for the sale 
 on Facebook\, or like DancePlus on Facebook or sign up for their newslette
 r. We just want to tell you about the good stuff.\nLinks\n\n 	Learn More a
 bout Dance Plus\n 	Dance Plus Sale Info\n\n&nbsp\; Dancesport Shoes Flash 
 Sale June 18\, 2016
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2016/06/sale_2016_fb_event_1200x444b.jpg
