SUMMARY:Summer Ballet Bootcamp especially for dancers and performers
DESCRIPTION:Whether you are a SALSA\, BACHATA\, ZOUK\, KIZOMBA\, or CONTEMP
 ORARY dancer\, we are always looking for that extended line\, beautiful po
 sture\, amazing flexibility\, nice stable turns\, or just physically more 
 strong and toned. These qualities are especially important if you are a pe
 rformer and looking to taking your dancing to the next level. The 8 weeks 
 summer ballet bootcamp explores the exercises and stretches that ballet da
 ncers use that could get you the mulitple turns\, nice high fan kicks\, fl
 exible back bend\, beautiful arm and legs lines and more! If you have a sp
 ecific goal\, let us know and we will guide you to it! No experience requi
 red but get ready for a real workout! Put your mind into something and you
  will definitely see the results in 8 weeks.\n\nCourse runs Jun 8 - Jul 27
  for 8 weeks\nTime: Wed 7:35-9:05pm\n\nCost: $180+hst full course ($15/hr)
 \n\n*Drops in welcomed though the more committed you are the better result
 s you will achieve!\n\nClass will be taught by Tania Wong\, a professional
  dancer and instructor\, 3-times Canadian Bachata Champion\, mulitple time
 s Toronto Salsa Champion\, who has been breathing\, teaching\, dancing bal
 let since the age of 6 and never forget to incorporate the techniques of b
 allet into every single dance she encounters.\n\n&nbsp\; Summer Ballet Boo
 tcamp especially for dancers and performers
