 \, Nancy Dinner and Angela Cecchino\, are hosting a two-day summer dance i
 ntensive.\n\nPlease join our talented teachers for fun-filled classes in a
 cro and contemporary at our studio at 15 Furbacher Lane\, Aurora on August
  10 &amp\; 11th. Schedule shown below.\n\nCLASS SCHEDULE\n\n10AM - All Lev
 els - Group Stretch and Strength\n\nInstructor: NANCY DINNER\n\n11:00 - Jr
 /Inter Acro Tech\n12:00 - Senior Acro Tech\n1:00 - 45 MINUTE BREAK\n1:45 -
  Jr/Inter Tumbling\n2:45 Senior Tumbling\n\nInstructor: ANGELA CECCHINO\n\
 n11:00 - Senior Contemporary\n12:00 - Jr/Inter Contemporary\n1:00 - 45 MIN
 UTE BREAK\n1:45 - Senior Floor Work\n2:45 Jr/Inter Floor Work\n\nBOTH DAYS
 \n\n3:45 - All Levels Double Tricks / Group Tricks\nAll Levels Tricks with
  Props\n4:45 - All Levels Teacher Q &amp\; A / Spotting Techniques\n\nFees
 :\n$75 - Per student - one day\n$130 - Per Student - two days\n$10 - Obser
 vation Fee - Parents\n$30 - Teacher Participation fee (Includes Q&amp\;A\,
  spotting class)\n\nCash/cheque/debit/ credit - cancellation charges may a
 pply.\n\n&nbsp\; Jaymor Acro &amp\; Contemporary Summer Intensive
