SUMMARY:Queer & Trans Salsa Classes
DESCRIPTION:Come learn to salsa with LGBT Dance this summer!This July &amp\
 ; August LGBT Dance is offering two levels of salsa classes on Thursday ni
 ghts.You don't need a partner to join and everyone is welcome to come lear
 n to dance with us!When:\nThursdays\, July 14th to August 18th (6 weeks)Sc
 hedule:\nSalsa 1 - Beginner: 6 to 7pm\nSalsa 2: Intermediate: 7 to 8pmCost
  (for full 6-week session):\n$75 - general rate\n$45 - student/underemploy
 ed/unemployed$15 drop-in fee for one classTo register\, please send us an 
 email at info@lgbtdance.comFor further information about LGBT Dance and ou
 r classes\, please visit our website at www.lgbtdance.com---\nLGBT Dance i
 s Toronto's non-profit LGBTQ salsa and hip hop dance club! We offer afford
 able dance classes in a welcoming\, gender neutral and queer environment.S
 ince 2002\, we have been providing a welcoming\, queer and trans centred\,
  gender neutral environment for lesbian\, gay\, bisexual\, transgender\, q
 ueer people &amp\; queer-friendly straight people to learn how to dance. Q
 ueer &amp\; Trans Salsa Classes
