SUMMARY:Auditions for Fall 2016 Performance Teams: Yamulee Toronto Salsa\, 
 Alma Toronto Bachata and Ladies Styling
DESCRIPTION:Are you ready to learn WORLD CLASS Choreography and Technique f
 rom the BEST DANCE COMPANIES IN THE WORLD?\n\nWelcome to the AUDITIONS for
  the Performance Teams for Fall 2016 directed and taught by Tania Wong (Da
 nce ConneXion)\n\nYamulee Dance Company Presents\nThe exciting and highly 
