URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/fin-de-fiesta-flamenco-brings-new-
 production-audacia-to-toronto/
SUMMARY:Fin de Fiesta Flamenco brings new production Audacia to Toronto
DESCRIPTION:Direct from Seville\, Spain: FIN DE FIESTA FLAMENCO dance and m
 usic ensemble presents "AUDACIA\," a bold new production that explores the
  many sides of one of the world's most passionate and intense art forms: f
 lamenco. Boasting a company of acclaimed international flamenco musicians 
 and starring esteemed Canadian flamenco dancer and choreographer Lia Grain
 ger\, AUDACIA takes audiences on a thrilling journey\, from flamenco's tra
 ditional roots in the music and culture of southern Spain\, all the way to
  its contemporary forms. Ancient rhythms meet avant-garde ideas and conver
 ge in an explosion of staccato guitar\, haunting flute and percussive foot
 work. To the south of Spain and back again\, AUDACIA will leave you breath
 less\, with the pulsing rhythms of flamenco beating in your heart.\n\nFIN 
 DE FIESTA FLAMENCO is Lia Grainger (artistic director\, dance)\, Dennis Du
 ffin (musical director\, guitar)\, Lara Wong (flute)\, Alejandro Ugarte Me
 ndia (voice)\, and Jessica Hana Deutsch (violin).\n\nFor more information 
 visit: WWW.FINDEFIESTAFLAMENCO.COM\nFor video visit:\n\nhttps://www.youtub
 e.com/watch?v=n12IrFQCoCM\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\; Fin de Fiesta Flamenco bri
 ngs new production Audacia to Toronto
