SUMMARY:Yoga &amp\; Tribal Grooves Workshop
DESCRIPTION:This two hour workshop is a double header with Sandy and Kelly!
 \n\nFluidity\, precision and strength are essential to our dance. Sandy wi
 ll start us off with a full body vinyasa flow practice\, with a focus on b
 reath-guided movement and graceful transitions.\n\nSandy is a 200 hour cer
 tified yoga teacher in the vinyasa lineage\, an Om Laila teacher training 
 graduate and a practitioner of various bellydance styles. No yoga experien
 ce required.\n\nAfter yoga\, Kelly will lead us through Tribal Grooves a n
 ew and exciting bellydance fitness program available through Serpentina No
 rth. Mixing popular tunes and tribal fusion music\, we will be blending ca
 rdio and strength exercises into a fun and interactive class. No experienc
 e necessary. Come and get your groove on!\n\nTribal Grooves was developed 
 by Paulette Rees-Denis\, Kelly is the first certified instructor in Toront
 o.\n\n$35 payable via credit card/paypal online at http://www.serpentinatr
 ibal.com/ or $40 cash at the door. Yoga &amp\; Tribal Grooves Workshop
