SUMMARY:JUMP START INTENSIVE
DESCRIPTION:Elite Dance Challenge will be hosting highly sought after Dance
  Technique and Conditioning Consultant Rebecca Davies of the Radar Techniq
 ue September 24-25 2016 at the Metro Toronto Convention Centre! With Speci
 al Guests Annie Wood of Dance Fuzion and Christina Digiuseppe Top Toronto 
 Dancer/Choreographer\n\nRebecca's Radar Technique Seminars have improved a
 nd inspired dancers in every major city in Australia and New Zealand. She 
 has traveled to 14 different cities in the USA! This will be her inaugural
  trip to Canada!\n\nDo not miss this amazing weekend of dance!\n\n* Turn I
 t Up Workshop- Pirouettes\, leg spin turns\, turn combination and drills a
 nd the conditioning exercises to enhance and analyse common mistakes\n\n* 
 Trick It Up Workshop- Combining Jumps and Turns\, progressions and back wo
 rk to combine WOW moments.\n\n* Power It Up Workshop- Jumps\, Leaps\, tilt
 s and kicks and the conditioning exercises to increase height and power\n\
 nClasses are 11 and Under &amp\; 12 and Over - Teacher Observing Passes ar
 e available\n\nCome as a group and see the savings!\n\nRegister today for 
 this action packed weekend of dance!\nLIMITED SPOTS AVAILABLE JUMP START I
 NTENSIVE
