SUMMARY:Dancemakers' FLOWCHART # 1
DESCRIPTION:FLOWCHART # 1\n2016-2017 Season Launch!\nSeptember 29\, 2016\; 
 8 pm\; Pay-What-You-Can at the Door\nDancemakers Centre for Creativity\, 9
  Trinity Street\, Toronto's Historic Distillery District\n\nFlowchart is a
  series of small-scale multidisciplinary performances\, featuring work by 
 artists who engage with the choreographic from the perspective of multiple
  fields - work which pays attention to organizing movement in space and ha
 ving it be affected by/also itself affect time. By contextualizing non-dan
 ce works within the choreographic\, an engagement with these ideas becomes
  newly visible. FLOWCHART # 1 featured artists are:\n\nMeg Foley\, dance\n
 Peg &amp\; Buzz\, multi-media performance art\nBridget Moser\, performance
  art Dancemakers&#039\; FLOWCHART # 1
