SUMMARY:ROLE NEUTRAL SALSA CLASS AT STEPS DANCE STUDIO
DESCRIPTION:Fridays 7pm-8pm Salsa level 1\nFridays 8pm-9pm Salsa level 2\nE
 ach student decides if they want to learn to lead or to follow.\nFirst cla
 ss for new students is FREE!\nThese classes (and all the classes at Steps)
  are LGBTQ+ friendly.\nThese classes are also great for higher level stude
 nts who want to learn the opposite role than what they normally dance.\nEv
 eryone will be rotating partners throughout the class.\nOngoing classes ev
 ery Friday. Students can start any time. Please note students must be asse
 ssed by teacher to take Level 2.\nNote: No classes on Friday Oct 7 due to 
 the Canada Salsa &amp\; Bachata Congress.\nhttp://stepsdancestudio.com/eve
 nts/ ROLE NEUTRAL SALSA CLASS AT STEPS DANCE STUDIO
