SUMMARY:Tribal Travels Workshop
DESCRIPTION:This two hour workshop will begin with a Pilates-based warmup f
 ollowed by various tribal steps that cover some distance. We'll take some 
 basics and move them forward\, back\, and in zig-zags in a couple differen
 t speeds to get your blood flowing and your heart pumping!\n\nAvailable to
  dancers of varying experience. Total newbie? No worries\, we'll get you m
 oving!\n\nPlease bring your own yoga/pilates mat for the warm up and a wat
 er bottle.\n\nFor details on tribal bellydance as well as online registrat
 ion\, please check our site at http://www.serpentinatribal.com/\n$35 payab
 le through credit card/paypal through our site or cash $40 at the door. Tr
 ibal Travels Workshop
