SUMMARY:TBN Cha-Cha Night
DESCRIPTION:You are invited!\n\nToronto Ballroom Nights would like you to j
 oin us for our tenth monthly ballroom dance social of 2016! What does a ni
 ght with Toronto Ballroom Nights offer? For $15.00 two lessons and three h
 ours of general dancing\, all in one night\n\nNever danced ballroom before
 ? No problem. From 8:15 until 8:45pm we will go over the basic footwork an
 d give you everything you need before jumping into our one hour featured l
 esson\, taught by professional ballroom instructor Stilian Kostov\, which 
 will teach a short choreographed routine in the sassy Cha-Cha. These group
  classes are scheduled separately during the evening so that all our guest
 s can join in for both.\n\nAfter the lessons are finished we open up the f
 loor from 9:30pm until 12:30am for over three hours of general social danc
 ing in all ballroom styles.  Practice what you’ve learned or just come 
 out and dance what you already know.  Young or old\, experienced or new\,
  all of us at TBN are looking forward to joining everyone out on the dance
  floor!\n\nRegards\,\nToronto Ballroom Nights TBN Cha-Cha Night
