SUMMARY:Daybreaker Toronto - Supernova Sunrise
DESCRIPTION:Toronto is back and ready for lift off!\n\nWe know — it’s b
 een too long. Like a lost astronaut floating through space\, you’ve wait
 ed. Well\, the stars have aligned\, and it’s time to take back your morn
 ing once again. Daybreaker is back and about to explode with SUPERNOVA SUN
 RISE!\n\nOn Wednesday\, October 19th we’ll be taking over The Commons\, 
 an awesome space on Richmond East\, which will serve as the perfect settin
 g for this glorious\, intergalactic reunion. We’ll stretch. We’ll danc
 e. And together we’ll produce more love and positive vibes than a giant 
 exploding star. So throw on your brightest colours\, strap on your moon bo
 ots\, and get ready to dance your way into the next dimension...\n\nHang o
 n tight!\n\nTICKETS:\nYoga &amp\; Dance Party: $35\nDance Party: $25 ($20 
 early bird)\n\n- - - - - -\n\nDAYBREAKER is a morning movement that will s
 tart your day off unlike anything else. It is about being in the here and 
 now\, surrounded by amazing people\, beautiful music\, and an incredible v
 ibe. It is about dancing your face off before work and feeling gloriously 
 healthy while doing so. It is about love\, it is about mindfulness\, and i
 t is about mischief.\n\n\n\nwww.daybreaker.com/city/to\n\n&nbsp\; Daybreak
 er Toronto - Supernova Sunrise
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2016/10/bubbles.jpg
