URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/danceworks-presents-the-toronto-pr
 emiere-of-wen-wei-dances-made-in-china/
SUMMARY:DanceWorks presents the Toronto Premiere of  Wen Wei Dance's Made i
 n China
DESCRIPTION:Made in China is an interdisciplinary performance uniting the t
 alents of four creators/performers whose contemporary art practices have b
 een influenced by China’s Cultural Revolution. Made in China will tour t
 o Halifax Nova Scotia (Live Dance Art) and to Montreal Quebec (MAI) before
  its Toronto premiere\, for two nights only\, Friday\, October 21 and Satu
 rday\, October 22 at 8pm at Harbourfront Centre Theatre. Tickets are now o
 n sale.\n\nThree of the artists\, Wen Wei Wang (Artistic Director\, Wen We
 i Dance)\; Gao Yanjinzi (Artistic Director\, Beijing Modern Dance Company)
 \; and Qiu Xia He (Musician\, Silk Road Music) grew up in China and studie
 d traditional arts from a young age. Video/sound artist Sammy Chien\, who 
 immigrated to Canada from Taiwan\, is their younger counterpart. Chien bri
 ngs a technological thrust to the work\, contributing electroacoustic musi
 c and digital imagery.\n\nMade in China emerges from the artists’ life s
 tories and shared cultural history. “All my work”\, explains Wang\, 
 “comes from my experience growing up. But this work is not narrative\, a
 nd it’s not only about me. It’s about how “made in China” is start
 ing to mean something else. It is about people in China needing art\, and 
 producing it.”\n\n“…by turns surprising and spellbinding…” – J
 anet Smith\, The Georgia Straight\n\n“a visual feast that asks questions
  about change and loss\, new life and what is left behind.” – Nancie O
 ttem\, Review Vancouver DanceWorks presents the Toronto Premiere of  Wen W
 ei Dance&#039\;s Made in China
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2016/09/MadeInChina_ChrisRandle4-1024x681.jpg
CATEGORIES:Contemporary
LOCATION:Harbourfront Centre Theatre (formerly Enwave Theatre)\, 231 Queens
  Quay West\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M5J 2G8\, Canada
GEO:43.639500;-79.383003
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=231 Queens Quay West\, Toro
