SUMMARY:Group Lesson &amp\; Dance Practice
DESCRIPTION:Come out for weekly Ballroom and Latin dance lessons!\n\nEnjoy 
 the 1 hour group lesson followed by a 2 hour dance practice held every Fri
 day evening beginning at 8 pm. Each month will feature a different dance i
 n the group lessons. October features the Viennese Waltz. November feature
 s an overall review of the year\, Q &amp\; A\, and Style &amp\; Technique.
 \n\nA professional licensed and insured DJ will be providing the latest an
 d greatest Ballroom and Latin music for your dancing pleasure. Requests ar
 e welcome. Try a new and exciting way to make requests\; input the followi
 ng http://www.virtualdj.com/ask/Jiver33 into your browser and instantly re
 quest your Song and Artist. The atmosphere is friendly and welcoming to al
 l dancers.\n\nThese group lesson and dance practices are attended by peopl
 e of all ages and levels. You may attend with or without a partner. Attend
 ance is on a show up any or all Friday evenings and enjoy basis! Very pati
 ent\, friendly\, and knowledgeable instructors will be available to offer 
 a helpful hint or assistance with new or previously acquired steps. Group 
 Lesson &amp\; Dance Practice
