URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/the-mid-day-fix-social/
SUMMARY:The Mid Day Fix Social
DESCRIPTION:Welcome back to the Mid Day Fix!!\n\nWe are very proud to be ho
 sting a very rare and very free Intro to On2 workshop for On1 dancers incl
 uded with the price of cover taught by Guest Instructor Sam Mardini!!!\n\n
 Sam Mardini is a Salsa &amp\; Bachata instructor that returned to Toronto 
 last year after having lived overseas in Seoul &amp\; Tokyo for many years
 . He started his own dance community of expats &amp\; Koreans in Seoul and
  has taught\, performed\, organized\, and promoted Salsa &amp\; Bachata in
  Seoul &amp\; across Asia from 2009-2015. He was invited around Asia to te
 ach Salsa &amp\; Bachata workshops at dance festivals in Taiwan\, Singapor
 e\, China\, Thailand\, Japan\, the Philipines\, and all over Korea for his
  “Sabor Aplenty” style of Salsa &amp\; Bachata. His annual “Salchata
 ” festivals in Seoul hosted world renowned instructors such as Jorge Eli
 zondo\, Troy Anthony\, Jorget Alcocer\, Lee Rios\, Rodchata\, Ataca y la A
 lemana\, &amp\; Zafire. His events brought dancers from all over East Asia
  to Seoul in celebration of their love of Salsa &amp\; Bachata. His passio
 n for dance is reflected in his eclectic and “sabor aplenty” style of 
 Salsa that he has formed over the past 15 years of dance. Sam is currently
  a guest instructor at City Dance Corps here in Toronto\, catch his classe
 s while you can before the travel bug hits him again!\n\nHosted by Team Fi
 x and DJ Will J. Lee! Hong Kong's most notorious Latin DJ! Giving you the 
 best in Salsa Dura\, Mambo\, Classica\, Latin Jazz\, Pachanga and Cha Cha!
  Urban and Traditional Bachata as well as a little Kizomba flavour!\n\nDAT
 E: Saturday October 29th\n\nWORKSHOP: 2-3PM\n\nSOCIAL: 3-7(ish)PM\n\n50% S
 alsa\n\n40% Bachata\n\n10% Kizomba\n\nLOCATION:\n\nThe 805 Studio – Grou
 nd Level of Dovercourt House\n\n805 Dovercourt Rd.\n\nCOVER:\n\n$8 (Includ
 es workshop!!)\n\nL.L.B.O\n\nAnd remember\, everybody needs a little Fix i
 n their lives! The Mid Day Fix Social
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2016/10/mid-day-fix.jpg
CATEGORIES:Bachata,Kizomba,Salsa
LOCATION:Dovercourt House\, 805 Dovercourt Road\, Toronto\, Ontario\, Canad
 a
GEO:43.662777;-79.429512
