DESCRIPTION:ANIMATED BY TORONTO DANCE THEATRE\n\nDates: November 1-5\, 2016
 \nLocation: Fleck Dance Theatre\, Harbourfront Centre\nTickets: $25-40 | C
 all 416.973.4000\nURL: http://www.harbourfrontcentre.com/nextsteps/toronto
 -dance-theatre/\n\nTDT returns to the Fleck Dance Theatre with a program o
 f short works by Christopher House\, featuring Martingales (2014) with liv
 e music by Thom Gill of which The Globe and Mail wrote at the premiere: ".
 .. I was gripped by this gorgeous\, atmospheric new work from start to fin
 ish." Also on the program is a remount of the hyper-kinetic Animated Short
 s (1984)\, set to a rollicking score by one of Canada's finest composers f
 or dance\, Michael J. Baker\, Fjeld (1990)\, a darkly poetic work danced t
 o gorgeous vocal music by Arvo Pärt\, and Colder Ink (1994)\, a virtuosic
  quartet.\n\nSocial media:\nTwitter: @TDTWinch\nInstagram: @TDTWinch\nFace
 book: /TorontoDanceTheatre\n#danceTO #NextSteps #AnimatedTDT Animated by T
 oronto Dance Theatre
