SUMMARY:Royal Winnipeg Ballet Professional Division’s 2016/17 Audition To
 ur in Toronto
DESCRIPTION:Local dancers will have the opportunity to audition and take ma
 ster classes with world-renowned instructors from the Royal Winnipeg Balle
 t School. Auditions will be held for all three of the RWB School professio
 nal training programs: the Ballet Academic Program for students in grades 
 6 to 12\, and RWB School’s two graduate programs\, the Aspirant Program 
 and the Teacher Training Program. Every student with a dream to dance or t
 each professionally is encouraged to attend. Students who participate in t
 he 2016/17 Audition Tour are auditioning to gain acceptance into the Profe
 ssional Division Summer Session (July 2017) in Winnipeg\, which serves as 
 the audition phase to gain acceptance into Regular Session (September 2017
 ). For more information about the 2016/17 Audition Tour\, please visit rwb
 .org/school/professional-division/audition. Royal Winnipeg Ballet Professi
 onal Division’s 2016/17 Audition Tour in Toronto
