SUMMARY:MODAS Dance Master Classes &amp\; Auditions
DESCRIPTION:We would like to invite you and your students to participate in
  the Modas Dance Toronto Workshop Nov. 12th and 13th at York University.\n
 \nModas Dance Workshops promote high quality dance instruction and valuabl
 e opportunities for young artists by fostering collaborations with dance o
 rganizations around the world. It is out mission to make continuing educat
 ion for young artists accessible while providing a platform for inspired i
 nstruction and valuable networking.\n\nOur Toronto workshop will give part
 icipants the opportunity to audition for acceptance and scholarships to Mo
 das Dance Summer Programs\, Modas Dance Year Round University and Training
  Program and National Ballet Academy of Denver Summer and Year Round Progr
 ams\, in addition\, two full days of master classes will be taught by \;\n
 \nDuncan Cooper – Co-Director Modas Dance/ Formerly San Francisco Ballet
  and Dance Theatre of Harlem\n\nLayla Amis- Co-Director Modas Dance/Direct
 or of Modas Training Program at Santa Fe University of Art and Design/Form
 er LINES Ballet School Director\n\nCornell Callender- Artistic Director Na
 tional Ballet Academy of Denver/formerly Pacific Northwest Ballet\n\nTo le
 arn more about Modas Dance Programs: www.modasdance.com\n\nTo learn more a
 bout National Ballet Academy of Denver: www.nbadenver.org/\n\nTo register 
 for Modas Dance Toronto at York University: Tel: 505-501-7116 or contact m
 odasdance@gmail.com for any questions or help with registering a group.\n*
 Ask about our group discounts\n\nAdvance Registration is highly encouraged
 !\n\nThank you for your time and consideration. We look forward to dancing
  with you!\n\nBest Wises\,\n\nLayla Amis &amp\; Duncan Cooper – Modas Da
 nce\nCornell Callender – National Ballet Academy of Denver\n\nlocal cont
 act: Benedita Wilkerson - e-mail by filling out the form. MODAS Dance Mast
 er Classes &amp\; Auditions
