SUMMARY:TBN Tango Night
DESCRIPTION:You are invited!\n\nToronto Ballroom Nights would like you to j
 oin us for our eleventh monthly ballroom dance social of 2016! What does a
  night with Toronto Ballroom Nights offer? For $15.00 two lessons and thre
 e hours of general dancing\, all in one night.\n\nNever danced ballroom be
 fore? No problem. From 8:15 until 8:45pm we will go over the basic footwor
 k and give you everything you need before jumping into our one hour featur
 ed lesson\, which will teach a short choreographed routine in the American
  Tango. These group classes are scheduled separately during the evening so
  that all our guests can join in for both.\n\nAfter the lessons are finish
 ed we open up the floor from 9:30pm until 12:30am for over three hours of 
 general social dancing in all ballroom styles.  Practice what you’ve le
 arned or just come out and dance what you already know.  Young or old\, e
 xperienced or new\, all of us at TBN are looking forward to joining everyo
 ne out on the dance floor! TBN Tango Night
