SUMMARY:Caribbean Dance Fitness Week 8 (North York) - soca\, dancehall\, ch
 utney &amp\; more
DESCRIPTION:Our Fall program runs from until Saturday\, December 3rd\, 2016
  in North York\, Mississauga\, and Downtown\, Toronto.\n\nMISSISSAUGA\n626
  Burnhamthorpe Road West (at Mavis)\n(inside Grooves Dance Studio)\nMONDAY
 s from 8pm – 9pm\n\nNORTH YORK\n38 Densley Avenue Unit C (Keele &amp\; L
 awrence)\n(inside the Milk &amp\; Honey Studio)\nTUESDAYs from 7:30pm – 
 8:30pm\n\nDOWNTOWN\, TORONTO\n527 Bloor Street West (at Bathurst)\n(inside
  The Dance Annex)\nSATURDAYs from 12:30pm – 1:30pm\n\n********\nWe provi
 de a space for you to unwind\, have fun\, and workout through our Caribbea
 n dance fitness experience.\n\nThe Carnival Spice Fitness Crew Are Made Up
  Of Those Who:\n\n– want to maintain or strengthen their fitness level\n
 – want to connect and grow with a tribe of positive people\nenjoy good m
 usic and good vibes as we dance away to the sounds of soca\, dancehall\, c
 hutney and more.\n– All body types\, all ethnicities\, and all dance lev
 els are welcome!\n\nMen\, doh be shy – you are welcomed and highly encou
 raged to attend!!\n\nTESTIMONIAL: “I felt like I came and did something.
  Lots of sweating. Lots of movements. No time to get bored. Very up liftin
 g. Immensely Enjoyed every moment.” – Winter 2016 Participant\n\nDROP 
 IN RATE*******\n\nClass cost is $20/person\n– Purchase 2 or more classes
  at once and pay only $15/class (i.e. 3 classes are $45)\n\nPAYMENT OPTION
 S******\n\nEmail Transfer\n– Please fill out this form for details\n\nAt
  The Start Of Class\n– Drop in can be paid at start of class via CASH or
  CREDIT\; credit is subject to 2% service fee. Caribbean Dance Fitness Wee
 k 8 (North York) - soca\, dancehall\, chutney &amp\; more
