SUMMARY:Caribbean Dance Fitness Week 9  (Downtown) – Soca\, Dancehall\, C
 hutney &amp\; More
DESCRIPTION:Our Fall program runs until Saturday\, December 3rd\, 2016 in N
 orth York\, Mississauga\, and Downtown\, Toronto.\n\nMISSISSAUGA\n626 Burn
 hamthorpe Road West (at Mavis)\n(inside Grooves Dance Studio)\nMONDAYs fro
 m 8pm – 9pm\n\nNORTH YORK\n38 Densley Avenue Unit C (Keele &amp\; Lawren
 ce)\n(inside the Milk &amp\; Honey Studio)\nTUESDAYs from 7:30pm – 8:30p
 m\n\nDOWNTOWN\, TORONTO\n527 Bloor Street West (at Bathurst)\n(inside The 
 Dance Annex)\nSATURDAYs from 12:30pm – 1:30pm\n\n********\nWe provide a 
 space for you to unwind\, have fun\, and workout through our Caribbean dan
 ce fitness experience.\n\nThe Carnival Spice Fitness Crew Are Made Up Of T
 hose Who:\n\n– want to maintain or strengthen their fitness level\n– w
 ant to connect and grow with a tribe of positive people\nenjoy good music 
 and good vibes as we dance away to the sounds of soca\, dancehall\, chutne
 y and more.\n– All body types\, all ethnicities\, and all dance levels a
 re welcome!\n\nMen\, doh be shy – you are welcomed and highly encouraged
  to attend!!\n\nTESTIMONIAL: “I felt like I came and did something. Lots
  of sweating. Lots of movements. No time to get bored. Very uplifting. Imm
 ensely Enjoyed every moment.” – Winter 2016 Participant\n\nDROP IN RAT
 E*******\n\nClass cost is $20/person\n– Purchase 2 or more classes at on
 ce and pay only $15/class (i.e. 3 classes are $45)\n\nPAYMENT OPTIONS*****
 *\n\nEmail Transfer\n– Please fill out this form for details\n\nAt The S
 tart Of Class\n– Drop in can be paid at start of class via CASH or CREDI
 T\; credit is subject to 2% service fee. Caribbean Dance Fitness Week 9  (
 Downtown) – Soca\, Dancehall\, Chutney &amp\; More
