 Knowles\nShahil Patel\n\nTICKETS:\nAdvance: $20\nDoor: $25\n*Group discoun
 ts available\n\nABOUT THE MOVEMBER FOUNDATION:\nThe Movember Foundation is
  a global charity committed to men living happier\, healthier\, longer liv
 es. Since 2003\, millions have joined the men’s health movement\, raisin
 g $677 million and funding over 1\,000 projects focusing on prostate cance
 r\, testicular cancer\, poor mental health and physical inactivity. More i
 nfo: https://ca.movember.com/\n\n&nbsp\; The Kings of Dance Fitness 3 #KOD
 F3
