SUMMARY:Steps Studio Party
DESCRIPTION:STEPS STUDIO PARTY\nSATURDAY NOVEMBER 12\, 8PM - MIDNIGHT\n2 PA
 RTIES IN 1!\n\nStudio 1: Bachata Lesson\, 8pm-9pm\nStudio 1: Salsa &amp\; 
 Bachata Music\, 9pm - midnight\, DJ Ef\n\nStudio 2: Hustle Lesson\, 8pm-9p
 m\nStudio 2: Hustle\, West Coast &amp\; Top 40 Music\, 9pm - midnight\, DJ
  DeTox\n\nMeet other students and dancers. Practice what you have learned 
 in a relaxed &amp\; friendly environment. Not confident to use some dance 
 moves in the nightclub yet? Try them here first. Dance with your fellow cl
 assmates\, Toronto dancers and your instructors. Join us for a fun lesson 
 and stay to party. All ages and all levels welcome\, including non Steps s
 tudents and dancers. No partner necessary - everyone dances with everyone 
 and most people rotate partners after every song. Cash bar.\n\nPrice: $10 
 per person all night long (includes lesson) Steps Studio Party
