URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/iam-freedom-5-weekend-healing-self
 -expression-playshop/
SUMMARY:iAM Freedom .5 - Weekend Healing Self-Expression Playshop
DESCRIPTION:iAM Freedom .5 A Weekend of Freedom of Expression\n\nWhat is it
 ? \n\nOur upcoming workshop iAM Freedom .5 is a powerful and playfully pa
 cked weekend immersion into the art of freedom of expression!\n\nIt will b
 e held November Fri 25th 7-10pm\, Sat/Sun 26/27th 10am-4pm\, and located a
 t the amazing and spacious 'Frolick Theatre' a 2500 square foot sprung-oak
  dance floor\, with change rooms and stage!\n\nLocated at:160 Bartley Dr. 
 Toronto\, ON (near Victoria Park and Eglington ave. East)\n\nThis 15 hr wo
 rkshop will take you from where you are in your self-expression\, to where
  you want to be!\n\n 	Sign up at www.iam-inspiration.com/iam-playshops.php
  and receive 15% off the cost!\n 	If funds are an issue\, you can enroll 2
  paying participants and your fee is free! (contact Ja-son for details)\n\
 nCost:$150\n\nGuaranteed Benefits (guaranteed meaning full money back if y
 ou are not satisfied!) :\n\n 	You will develop a more empowered self-expre
 ssion in all areas of life!\n 	You will have more emotional availability a
 nd the means to express your feelings!\n 	You will gain a greater response
  potential as a dancer\, singer\, player.\n 	You will feel more personal p
 eace and presence.\n 	You will learn about the inner tools needed to under
 stand your own personal freedom of expression.\n 	You will develop a cogni
 tive understanding of the guiding principles of freedom of expression.\n\n
 Overview:\n\nTo develop the power\, presence and the abilities to freely e
 xpress\, through creative movement\, voice\, and play. Utilizing the hum
 an expressions of Dance (movement)\, Singing (voice)\, and Clowning (play)
  to develop ones own unique understanding of  Freedom through self-expre
 ssion.  IAM Freedom (and all iAM work/playshops) revolve around guiding 
 principles rather than techniques.  Though techniques are utilized throu
 ghout\, they are designed to illuminate the underlying principles that are
  at work beneath all forms of self-expression. iAM Freedom .5 - Weekend He
 aling Self-Expression Playshop
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2016/11/iamfreedom.jpg
CATEGORIES:Ecstatic,Fitness,Indigenous,Other,Therapeutic
LOCATION:Frolick Theatre\, 160 Bartley Dr. \, North York\, Ontario\, Canada
GEO:43.7218143;-79.31115679999999
