URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/the-playbill/
SUMMARY:The Playbill
DESCRIPTION:November 26\, 2016\n2pm and 8pm\nAl Green Theatre 750 Spadina A
 ve. Toronto ON\n\nCity Dance Corps presents our 9th annual faculty showcas
 e\, The Playbill. Our talented faculty and dancers love to interpret art i
 n their own unique way and in this production\, we feature the best of Bro
 adway. There's no business like show business as our dancers perform their
  own ode to Broadway classics.\nBUY 2PM TICKETS\n\n2pm Advance Tickets: $2
 0+hst\n2pm At the Door Tickets: $26.55+hst\nBUY 8PM TICKETS\n\n8pm Advance
  Tickets: $30+hst\n8pm At the Door Tickets: $35.40+hst\n\nAll tickets that
  are purchased online will be available at the Theatre Box Office on the d
 ay of the show. The Box Office is located in the lobby of the Al Green The
 atre across from the Second Cup.\n\n2PM SHOWTIME: The Box Office will open
  at 1pm. Theatre doors open at 1:30pm.\n\n8PM SHOWTIME: The Box Office wil
 l open at 6:30pm. Theatre doors open at 7:30pm.\n\nAfter you make this pur
 chase\, you will receive a receipt as proof of purchase. Please bring this
  receipt and ID to the Box Office to pick up your ticket. There are no ref
 unds or credits for this purchase. You must present your receipt and ID fo
 r ticket pick up. Only the purchaser of the tickets will be able to pick u
 p tickets. The Playbill
