SUMMARY:Caribbean Dance Fitness - Final Week of Classes For 2016
DESCRIPTION:Join us at one of our 3 locations! ONLY ONE WEEK LEFT!\n\nMISSI
 SSAUGA\n626 Burnhamthorpe Road West (at Mavis)\n(inside Grooves Dance Stud
 io)\nMONDAY (28th) from 8pm – 9pm\n\nNORTH YORK\n38 Densley Avenue Unit 
 C (Keele &amp\; Lawrence)\n(inside the Milk &amp\; Honey Studio)\nTUESDAY 
 (29th) from 7:30pm – 8:30pm\n\nDOWNTOWN\, TORONTO\n527 Bloor Street West
  (at Bathurst)\n(inside The Dance Annex)\nSATURDAY (3rd) from 12:30pm – 
 1:30pm\n\n********\nWe provide a space for you to unwind\, have fun\, and 
 workout through our Caribbean dance fitness experience.\n\nThe Carnival Sp
 ice Fitness Crew Are Made Up Of Those Who:\n\n– want to maintain or stre
 ngthen their fitness level\n– want to connect and grow with a tribe of p
 ositive people\nenjoy good music and good vibes as we dance away to the so
 unds of soca\, dancehall\, chutney and more.\n– All body types\, all eth
 nicities\, and all dance levels are welcome!\n\nMen\, doh be shy – you a
 re welcomed and highly encouraged to attend!!\n\nTESTIMONIAL: “I felt li
 ke I came and did something. Lots of sweating. Lots of movements. No time 
 to get bored. Very up lifting. Immensely Enjoyed every moment.” – Wint
 er 2016 Participant\n\nDROP IN RATE*******\n\nClass cost is $20/person\n
 – Save $5 with a canned food donation\n\nPAYMENT OPTIONS******\n\nEmail 
 Transfer\n– Please fill out this form for details\n\nAt The Start Of Cla
 ss\n– Drop in can be paid at start of class via CASH or CREDIT\; credit 
 is subject to 2% service fee. Caribbean Dance Fitness - Final Week of Clas
 ses For 2016
