URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/jane-austen-birthday-ball/
SUMMARY:Jane Austen Birthday Ball
DESCRIPTION:Jane Austen loved to dance\, and she was born in December\, 177
 5. What better way to celebrate her birthday than a ball? Our re-enactment
  of a Regency-era ball features a pre-ball dance workshop\, clothing and h
 air makeover for those needing an outfit for the evening\, live music\, el
 egant historical refreshments and door prizes.\n\nNo partner or dance expe
 rience needed\, but the pre-ball basics workshop is prerequisite for those
  newer to English Country Dancing. The workshop is friendly and fun\, no m
 atter what your skill level. All welcome!\n\nThis event is suitable for mo
 tivated children from ten up. All children must be accompanied by an adult
 .\n\nHistorical clothing optional\, but warmly encouraged.\n\nVenues\n\nPl
 ease note that the afternoon pre-ball workshops take place at another venu
 e nearby\; see my website for details.\nEvening -- Ball with live music an
 d refreshments: Heliconian Hall\, 35 Hazelton Ave in Yorkville\n\nSchedule
 \n\n1-2 -- Regency clothing and hair session for gentlemen and ladies\n\n2
 -3.30 -- Fun and friendly pre-ball dance workshop (required for dancing at
  the ball if you are newer to English Country Dancing)\n\n6.30-9 --Dancing
  by the fire to live music with elegant refreshments\, &amp\; toasts to th
 e King and door prizes!\n\nMore details\, registration forms and ticket pu
 rchase through the website. Pre-registration is required\, and payment can
  be made either by cheque or electronic transfer.\n\nCost\n\nBall package 
 (includes both afternoon workshops\, ball and refreshments): $55 / $45 stu
 dents and seniors\nBall-only tickets for experienced English or Scottish C
 ountry Dancers (available only by prior arrangement): $25 / $20. If you're
  not sure where your experience level fits\, please check in with me\, eit
 her by phone or by filling out the form here.\n\n&nbsp\; Jane Austen Birth
 day Ball
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2016/11/Gorgeous-Regency-fashion-plate-slashed-sleeves-but-highly-unusual-
 T3JVvqbw_615x615.jpg
CATEGORIES:Celtic,English Country Dance,Other,Vintage
LOCATION:Heliconian Hall\, 35 Hazelton Ave\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M5R 1M6\, 
