URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/daybreaker-toronto-holiday-disco/
SUMMARY:Daybreaker Toronto - Holiday Disco
DESCRIPTION:WINTER IS COMING!!!\n\nAnd with it\, a beautiful holiday season
  to cozy up and remember what's truly important. As falling snow and shimm
 ering lights begin to transform our city\, let's come together to kick off
  the most magical time of the year. This is our last chance to dance our f
 aces off in 2016 and end it on a high note (more than ever now\, we need i
 t!) So say yes with us! After all\, where else can we completely let go of
  ALL our inhibitions?\n\nSo on Wednesday\, December 7th\, join us bright a
 nd early as we shake Toronto awake — this time with a little extra groov
 e in our step... It’s all going down at HOLIDAY DISCO .\n\nYOGA - 6AM-7A
 M\nDANCE - 7AM-9AM\n\nTICKETS:\nYoga+Dance Party - $35\nDance Party Only -
  $25 ($20 early bird)\n\nUse promo code TORONTODANCE for $5 off!\nWhat is 
 Daybreaker?\nFounded in NYC and now in cities around the world\, DAYBREAKE
 R is an early-morning experience that combines fitness\, dance and immersi
 ve theatre to turn nightlife on its head and create a whole new way to wak
 e up. It's about wellness\, mindfulness\, mischief\, self expression and c
 amaraderie. Head into your day the most positive\, energized version of yo
 urself!\n\n&nbsp\;\n Daybreaker Toronto - Holiday Disco
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2016/11/daybreaker.jpg
CATEGORIES:Disco,Ecstatic,House,Other,Yoga
LOCATION:Pursuit OCR\, 444 Dufferin Street\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M6K 2A3\, 
 Canada
GEO:43.6448411;-79.42973189999998
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=444 Dufferin Street\, Toron
 to\, Ontario\, M6K 2A3\, Canada;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Pursuit OCR:geo
 :43.6448411,-79.42973189999998
END:VEVENT
