SUMMARY:STEPS STUDIO CHRISTMAS PARTY
DESCRIPTION:STEPS STUDIO CHRISTMAS PARTY\nSATURDAY DECEMBER 10\, 8PM - MIDN
 IGHT\n2 PARTIES IN 1!\n\nStudio 1: Salsa Lesson\, 8pm-9pm\nStudio 1: Salsa
  &amp\; Bachata Music\, 9pm - midnight\, DJ Ef\n\nStudio 2: Hustle Lesson\
 , 8pm-9pm\nStudio 2: Hustle\, West Coast &amp\; Top 40 Music\, 9pm - midni
 ght\, DJ DeTox\n\nMeet other students and dancers. Practice what you have 
 learned in a relaxed &amp\; friendly environment. Not confident to use som
 e dance moves in the nightclub yet? Try them here first. Dance with your f
 ellow classmates\, Toronto dancers and your instructors. Join us for a fun
  lesson and stay to party. All ages and all levels welcome\, including non
  Steps students and dancers. No partner necessary - everyone dances with e
 veryone and most people rotate partners after every song. Cash bar. Snacks
  and hors d'oeuvres.\n\nPrice: $10 per person all night long (includes les
 son) STEPS STUDIO CHRISTMAS PARTY
