SUMMARY:Ecstatic Dance Thursdays
DESCRIPTION:Join us EVERY THURSDAY of the year for a SOULFUL DANCE GATHERIN
 G!\n\nEvery Thursday evening from 7:30pm-9:30pm is an opportunity to drop 
 into your body and essentially let your body be your guide. Move however y
 ou wish\, in sacred space within our ever-growing dance community.\n\nLet 
 the music take you on a journey with DJ Julia Ray\, Layah Jane\, Patricia 
 Kambitsch\, Michael Penarubia\, Mark Greenspan and Gary Capon.\n\nInvite y
 our dancing friends and spread the love of dance\, music and community!\n\
 nThe 'Ecstatic Dance Journey' will move through various rhythms and beats 
 and will most definitely start slow and build up to an energetic high peak
  and then move back down to a quiet\, meditative place.\n\n$12 - $15 Slidi
 ng Scale\n\nThe music starts slow\, builds to an energetic peak and ends i
 n a meditative space. In order to honor this flow\, late-comers are not 
 allowed\, so please arrive on time.\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/
 watch?v=p41iQlnNa-U\n\n&nbsp\; Ecstatic Dance Thursdays
