SUMMARY:New Years Swing &amp\; Blues Double Deck Ball!
DESCRIPTION:Come to Toronto's great swingin' New Years Eve Party!\n\n8pm to
  4am. Two Floors.\n\nBeginner dance classes 8pm to 9pm before the Party. Y
 our choice of Lindy Hop on one floor\, Blues on the other!\nNo prior exper
 ience is needed. There is no need to bring your own dance partners.\n\nNew
  Years Eve Swing &amp\; Blues Ball 9:15pm to 4am.\nFeaturing the Patrick T
 evlin Swing Band with Toby Hughes!\nAnd featuring a snacks &amp\; treats b
 uffet\, party favours and midnight bubbly (all included with admission)!\n
 \nDressing up is encouraged!\n\nNo prior experience is needed\, there is n
 o need to bring your own dance partners\, subway and parking are close by.
  Singles welcome. Couples welcome. Big sprung wood dance floors. Licensed 
 bar.\n\nPlease invite your friends.\n\nBand: Patrick Tevlin on trumpet &am
 p\; vocals\, Toby Hughes on saxophone &amp\; vocals\, Mike Evin on keyboar
 ds\, Lucas Gadke on upright bass\, Chuck Clarke on drums!\n\n$40 (includes
  snacks &amp\; treats buffet from 10pm on\, favours\, midnight toast). $35
  for full-time students.\n\nSimply show up and pay at the door\, no need t
 o pre-register or buy tickets in advance. (It is always very well attended
  but never sells out.)\n\n&nbsp\; New Years Swing &amp\; Blues Double Deck
  Ball!
