DESCRIPTION:We'll be kicking up our heels from 8.30 - 12.30\, with a cavalc
 ade of callers including Tara Bolker\, Bridget Whitehead\, Christine Robb\
 , Vivian Stephens\, Walter Zagorski and Karen Millyard. Music will be prov
 ided by the fantastic energy and inventiveness of Ben Bolker (fiddle)\, St
 ephen Fuller (fiddle) and Gwen Harper (keyboard).\n\nThere will be apple c
 ider\, an elegant spread of finger-foods and\, most important\, YOU!\n\nNo
  partner is needed\, but please bring a contribution to the nibbles -- sim
 ple is fine\, savoury or sweet\, all will be appreciated! (Remember to bri
 ng serving implements with you.)\n\n20 / 15 for students and seniors\, plu
 s a contribution of finger-foods (simple is just fine). Family rates avail
 able\; please enquire.\n\nSt Barnabas Anglican Church hall\, right on Danf
 orth at Chester subway\, south side of Danforth\, entrance around the corn
 er at 175 Hampton Ave. through the playground.\n\nKindly refrain from usin
 g scented products on the day of the dance\; thank you!\n\n&nbsp\; New Yea
 r&#039\;s Eve English Country Dance
