SUMMARY:Hustle Foundations
DESCRIPTION:Hustle Foundations\n\nPart 1: Thursday January 5 - January 26\,
  7pm-8pm\nPart 2: Thursday February 2 - February 23\, 7pm-8pm\n\nFirst 4 w
 eeks of a two-part 8 week intensive for students new to Latin Hustle. Lear
 n the Hustle basic step\, popular Hustle turns and turn patterns. Learn hu
 stle technique\, how to lead and follow well and turn patterns to get you 
 started on the dancefloor. Already know some Salsa? Like partner dancing b
 ut don’t always hear salsa music at the functions you go to? For those o
 f you who don’t know what Latin Hustle is\, think of applying your salsa
  turn patterns to different music (such as House\, Old School\, Top 40 and
  Disco) and therefore a different beat - it is so much fun! Dance with a p
 artner to practically any song anywhere!\n\nNo previous hustle experience 
 required. Students must start on the first day.\n$60 for 4 weeks. 10 &amp\
 ; 20 Class cards can also be used. Hustle Foundations
