URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/awareness-for-menace-fundraiser-in
 tensive/
SUMMARY:Awareness for Menace: Fundraiser Intensive
DESCRIPTION:Passionate. Authentic. Motivating. Loving.\n\nThese are the few
  words to describe the man that Andre "Menace" Christie developed to becom
 e. It is with a heavy heart to hear that the community has lost this influ
 ential and outstanding individual.\n\nAndre was known in the dance communi
 ty as a passionate individual. He was dedicated in bettering and impacting
  the lives of every person he crossed.\nWherever he was—he was dancing. 
 It was his craft.\n\nAlthough most people know him as a dancer\, he was mo
 re than just that.\nHe was a father\, a son\, an athlete\, an artist\, a t
 eacher\, a student\, an aspiring studio owner\, engineer and psychiatrist.
 \n\nAndre has built his reputation as a dancer\, but not many of you know\
 , he was also energetic about understanding the human mind. He studied Sig
 mund Freud\, read psychology books\, and watched anything that studied the
  human psyche.\n\nAndre experienced mental illness first hand in his famil
 y\, and was aware of his own disabilities. It struck a drive in him to stu
 dy psychiatry. His dream school was the University of Toronto.\n\nHe loved
  knowledge\; to study the body and mind. He always believed in keeping the
 m both sharp.\n\nHe was such a bright and intelligent individual and alway
 s had the greatest visions for himself.\n\nIt is in Andre's legacy that we
 \, the Toronto dance community\, unite to support Andre's family and frien
 ds by fundraising towards the honourable burial that he deserves.\n\nJoin 
 us on SUNDAY\, JANUARY 15\, 2017 to celebrate and raise Mental Health #Awa
 renessForMENACE\n\nEvery 1 in 5 children will grow to live with a serious 
 mental illness—but only 20% will receive the appropriate treatment.\n\nS
 tay educated.\nEmpower one another.\nWe are the future.\n\nPrice: $5/class
 \n\nClass Hosts: tba\n\nStay connected with the Facebook event link for cl
 ass hosts releases and times! Awareness for Menace: Fundraiser Intensive
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2016/12/rsz_screen_shot_2016-12-04_at_74716_pm.jpg
CATEGORIES:Hip Hop,Other
LOCATION:Dancelife X Centre\, 619 Yonge Street\, 2nd Floor\, Toronto\, Onta
 rio\, M4Y 1Z4\, Downtown Toronto\, Canada
GEO:43.667109;-79.3851348
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=619 Yonge Street\, 2nd Floo
 r\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M4Y 1Z4\, Downtown Toronto\, Canada;X-APPLE-RADIUS
 =100;X-TITLE=Dancelife X Centre:geo:43.667109,-79.3851348
END:VEVENT
