URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/shen-yun-2017-in-mississauga-start
 ing-january-18/
SUMMARY:Shen Yun 2017 in Mississauga starting January 18
DESCRIPTION:Shen Yun\, the spectacular show that draws audiences from hundr
 eds of miles away\, is back\, bringing to the GTA 5000 years of Chinese mu
 sic and dance in one night!  Shen Yun will be at the Mississauga Living A
 rts Centre January 18-22 .\n \nA Divine Culture\nIn ancient times\, Chin
 a was known as the Land of the Divine. Everyone\, from emperors to the com
 mon people\, believed that their culture was a gift from heaven. They live
 d in harmony with the universe and saw a connection among all things. Trad
 itional Chinese culture carried these principles for thousands of years—
 until this world was lost.\n\nTo bring back a taste of this lost civilizat
 ion Shen Yun has pushed the boundaries of performing arts\, combining anci
 ent legends with technological innovations as well as historically authent
 ic costumes with breathtaking animated backdrops.\nAnd a Lost Treasure\nIn
 credibly\, Shen Yun cannot be seen in China as the Communist Party sees tr
 aditional culture as a threat to its power. Fortunately in 2006\, a group 
 of elite Chinese artists came together in New York with a mission—to rev
 ive traditional culture and share it with the world. They created Shen Yun
  and brought this majestic culture back from the brink of extinction.\n\nD
 o not miss this opportunity - you are sure never to forget it! Filled wit
 h an enchanting orchestral sound\, this is a mesmerizing experience you wo
 n’t find anywhere else.\nBuy Tickets Here Shen Yun 2017 in Mississauga s
 tarting January 18
CATEGORIES:Asian,Ballet,Musical Theatre
LOCATION:Mississauga Living Arts Centre\, 4141 Living Arts Dr\, Mississauga
 \, Ontario\, Mississauga\, Canada
GEO:43.589582;-79.64608020000003
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=4141 Living Arts Dr\, Missi
 ssauga\, Ontario\, Mississauga\, Canada;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Mississ
 auga Living Arts Centre:geo:43.589582,-79.64608020000003
END:VEVENT
