SUMMARY:Rumba dance classes
DESCRIPTION:How about dancing the Rumba? Beautiful rhythms and body languag
 e make the Rumba one of the most popular dances and the one you can dance 
 at any event.\nYou’re invited to join our Rumba group classes in Mississ
 auga\, ON on Friday nights for the different level of dancing.\nOur Dance 
 classes are unique combination of a class and private lesson.\nEach class 
 is 1 hour long: 40 minutes of instructions followed by 20 minutes of super
 vised practice\, during which you get personal attention of a teacher and 
 answers to your questions. Our Dance classes courses are 5 weeks long.\nRu
 mba classes start on January 20\, 2017.\nEvery Friday: January 20\, Januar
 y 27\, February 3\, February 10\, February 17\n\nHere is what You get from
  our dance classes:\n\n 	You get clear understanding of dance steps and mo
 ves\, as we provide step-by-step explained instructions\n 	You get persona
 l attention and feedback from the teacher during the supervised practice p
 art of the class\n 	You get enough room to practice because our classes ar
 e small\n 	Your problems and stress fade away\, as you step on a dance flo
 or\, get focus and start moving\n 	You learn technical points to make your
  feel excited about your dancing\n 	You learn how to be a good dance partn
 er\, how to lead and follow\, how to communicate and connect in a dance co
 uple\n 	You get dance video with the dance routine at the end of 5 classes
 \n Rumba dance classes
