 w way of Waltzing and is the favourite Waltz style of many. It is done to 
 slower tempos than Viennese Waltz. We will focus on the core of the dance\
 , the turning basic\, plus some of the other excellent and flowing moves i
 n Cross-step Waltz!\n\nNo prior experience is needed. There is no need to 
 bring your own dance partners.\n\n$30. (Just $10 if you have done our Cros
 s-step Waltz beginner workshop before.)\n\nNote that if you take this work
 shop you can also take the Cross-step Waltz intermediate workshop in Pivot
 s and Pivaloops on Saturday January 28\, same location and time.\n\nMostly
  Waltz Toronto Schedule: http://swingtoronto.com/waltz-calendar/\n\nFacebo
 ok events: https://www.facebook.com/groups/142519259606/events/ Cross-step
  Waltz beginner workshop
