SUMMARY:New Flamenco Dance Classes 2017
DESCRIPTION:Start the new year with flamenco dance! Ritmo Flamenco has taug
 ht hundreds of people since 1996. Located in their beautiful Liberty Villa
 ge loft studios\, we provide and excellent and authentic environment to le
