 nce style.\n\nAfro-House is a great tool to add organic/natural flavour fo
 r kizomba and semba dancers. This is an energetic class that will work you
 r legs and core\, so come prepared to sweat!\n\nSATURDAYS\, 10am - 11am\nS
 TARTS: January 28\, 2017\nENDS: March 18\, 2017\n\n&nbsp\; AFRO-HOUSE Begi
