URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/dance-immersion-presents-ten-canad
 ian-premiere-of-uks-ace-dance-and-music/
SUMMARY:dance Immersion presents 'TEN' Canadian Premiere of UK's ACE Dance 
 and Music
DESCRIPTION:TEN explores humanity’s universal stories with an overarching
  tone that is both epic and poetic. The production also explores our commo
 n yearning to root deep into our heritage for the footprint of the ancesto
 rs.\nA carefully chosen Creative team each bring with them diverse world c
 ultures and experience to the making of this piece. ACE Dance and Music co
 ntinues thier relationship with Choreographer\, Jose Agudo\, and some of t
 he other stellar creative team behind A THOUSAND SHEPHERDS\, which was par
 t of the MANA repertoire.\nThe Jose Agudo collaboration delivers hints of 
 Flamenco movement to the contemporary vocabulary underpinned by the ACE Da
 nce and Musicinimitable African style. Music composition by Giuliano Modar
 elli will layer a haunting guitar melody onto these stories combined with 
 a powerful and dynamic soundscape created in collaboration with Beautiful 
 Noise (Vincenzo Lamagna).\n\nDates: Friday February 10\, 2017 - 8pm Saturd
 ay/ February 11\, 2017 -1pm Matinee/ Saturday February 11\, 2017 - 8pm\nTi
 ckets: $29 -$34 | Student\nSenior and Groups rates available\nharbourfront
 centre.com | 416-973- 4000 dance Immersion presents &#039\;TEN&#039\; Cana
 dian Premiere of UK&#039\;s ACE Dance and Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2016/11/TEN.jpg
CATEGORIES:African,Contemporary
LOCATION:Fleck Dance Theatre\, Harbourfront Centre\, 207 Queens Quay West\,
  Toronto\, Ontario\, M5J1A7\, GTA\, Canada
GEO:43.639301;-79.380898
