SUMMARY:Elvis Tribute Dinner Dance at Old Mill
DESCRIPTION:Make Valentine’s Day a night to remember and celebrate at the
  romantic\, historical\, Old Mill Toronto Dinner Dance Celebration. Be cap
 tivated by the amazing voice of Matt Cage as he embraces the musical styli
 ngs of Elvis.\n\nThis is one Elvis Tribute Artist you don’t want to miss
 ! Matt Cage is a multi-award winner\, holding Professional championship ti
 tles across Canada and the United States. Recently\, he won a first-place 
 professional title in the Images of the King Contest held in Memphis\, TN.
 \n\nThe Toronto-born performer has a love of Elvis and strives to keep his
  memory alive. Matt has portrayed the King in sold-out theatres\, festival
  headlining shows\, musical plays\, television and more. From the hip-swiv
 elling 50s to the stunning vocals of the 70s\, Cage does it all. Elvis Tri
 bute Dinner Dance at Old Mill
