DESCRIPTION:No partner or dance experience needed! Pre-registration is requ
 ired.\n\nTo celebrate Canada 150\, we are giving workshops in beginner-lev
 el Victorian social dancing! Canadians have always been dance-crazy\, so w
 e'll explore the rich history of the ballroom in a series of workshops. Th
 ese can be taken on their own or treated as preparation for our Canada 150
  ball\, to be held later this year.\n\nPlease note that only low heels wil
 l be permitted in the class\, and that it is fragrance-free. Victorian Soc
 ial Dance Classes
