 sic/
SUMMARY:English Country Dance with Live Music
DESCRIPTION:Easy traditional social dance to live music! All based on walki
 ng\, with no lead or follow and no gender-role difference. No partner or d
 ance experience is needed\, and all dances will be taught\, walked through
  and cued during the music (jigs\, reels and more). If you can walk and he
 ar the instructions\, you can do this dance form!\n\nThe tunes range from 
 lively to elegant\, dramatic and romantic\, and span almost 400 years of r
 epertoire. Come along or bring a friend -- all welcome!\n\n$10 / $7 studen
 ts\n\nPlease note that this event is fragrance-free.\n\nhttps://www.youtub
 e.com/watch?v=IfMIWtqGZjg English Country Dance with Live Music
