SUMMARY:The Queens of Dance Fitness IV #QODF4
DESCRIPTION:Dione’s Fitness Group presents…\n\nThe Queens of Dance Fitn
 ess IV #QODF4\n\nIn Celebration of International Women's Day\nIn support o
 f the Canadian Women's Foundation.\n\n4 Phenomenal Women + 1 Stage + 1 Pur
 pose = 1 Amazing Dance Fitness Experience!\n\nThis dance fitness experienc
 e will feature some of the best Female Instructors in the business giving 
 you Afro-Fusion\, Caribbean\, Latin\, Polynesian and Pop flavours.\n\nTHIS
  EVENT IS SUITABLE FOR MEN\, WOMEN AND CHILDREN (AGE 12 AND OVER).\n\nDate
 : Sunday February 26\, 2017\nEvent Time: 1:00PM – 3:00PM\nLocation: The 
 Great Hall (Longboat Hall*)\, 1087 Queen St W\, Toronto\, ON M6J 1H3\n*Ent
 rance off Dovercourt for Longboat Hall.\n\nINSTRUCTORS:\nIoana Aboumitri\n
 Dione Mason\nEsie Mensah\nMelissa-Jane Shaw\n\nTICKETS:\nAdvance: $20\nDoo
 r: $25\n*Group discounts available\n\nTICKET LINK: https://www.eventbrite.
 ca/e/the-queens-of-dance-fitness-iv-tickets-28870640864\n\nEARN MONEY BY S
 HARING THIS EVENT WITH YOUR FRIENDS. LEARN HOW: http://www.eventbrite.ca/a
 ffiliate-register?eid=28870640864&amp\;affid=147317534\n\nVENDOR\, SPONSOR
 \, and ADVERTISING OPPORTUNITIES:\nIf you would like to market your produc
 t\, service or upcoming event at this event\, please fill out the "More In
 fo" contact form.\n\nGETTING THERE\nBy car\, please allow extra time for t
 raffic as this is a busy part of Toronto with delays\, construction and on
  a streetcar line.\n\nBy TTC\, the 501 Queen Streetcar will drop you in fr
 ont of the venue.\nOR from Ossington Subway Station\, take the SOUTH - 63 
 OSSINGTON Bus towards LIBERTY VILLAGE\, arrive at Queen St W and walk to v
 enue.\n\nPARKING\nLimited free parking is available on the west side of Do
 vercourt\, south of Queen St West.\nPaid city parking is available on Quee
 n St W.\n\nDRESS CODE:\nDress to Sweat! Wear comfortable athletic wear. Br
 ing INDOOR athletic shoes. Please NO OUTDOOR SHOES as some prefer to go ba
 refoot and we want to ensure everyone's safety.\n\nVIDEOTAPING:\nThere is 
 no videotaping permitted. You may take as many pictures as you like\, but 
 no video.\n\nPHOTOGRAPHY:\nEvent photos will be available after the event.
 \n\nTICKETS ARE NON REFUNDABLE/NON TRANSFERABLE.\n\n&nbsp\; The Queens of 
 Dance Fitness IV #QODF4
