URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/shen-yun-2017-in-toronto-starting-
 february-28/
SUMMARY:Shen Yun 2017 in Toronto starting February 28
DESCRIPTION:Shen Yun\, the spectacular show that draws audiences from hundr
 eds of miles away\, is back\, bringing to the GTA 5000 years of Chinese mu
 sic and dance in one night!  Shen Yun will be at the Toronto Four Seasons
  Centre for the Performing Arts February 28- March 2. \n \nA Divine Cult
 ure\nIn ancient times\, China was known as the Land of the Divine. Everyon
 e\, from emperors to the common people\, believed that their culture was a
  gift from heaven. They lived in harmony with the universe and saw a conne
 ction among all things. Traditional Chinese culture carried these principl
 es for thousands of years—until this world was lost.\n\nTo bring back a 
 taste of this lost civilization Shen Yun has pushed the boundaries of perf
 orming arts\, combining ancient legends with technological innovations as 
 well as historically authentic costumes with breathtaking animated backdro
 ps.\nAnd a Lost Treasure\nIncredibly\, Shen Yun cannot be seen in China as
  the Communist Party sees traditional culture as a threat to its power. Fo
 rtunately in 2006\, a group of elite Chinese artists came together in New 
 York with a mission—to revive traditional culture and share it with the 
 world. They created Shen Yun and brought this majestic culture back from t
 he brink of extinction.\n\nDo not miss this opportunity - you are sure nev
 er to forget it! Filled with an enchanting orchestral sound\, this is a m
 esmerizing experience you won’t find anywhere else.\nBuy Tickets Here Sh
 en Yun 2017 in Toronto starting February 28
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2013/01/shen-yun-2013.jpg
CATEGORIES:Asian,Ballet,Musical Theatre
LOCATION:Four Seasons Centre for the Performing Arts\, 145 Queen St W\, Tor
 onto\, Ontario\, Downtown Toronto\, Canada
GEO:43.650666;-79.38549160000002
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=145 Queen St W\, Toronto\, 
 Ontario\, Downtown Toronto\, Canada;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Four Season
 s Centre for the Performing Arts:geo:43.650666,-79.38549160000002
END:VEVENT
