SUMMARY:Hustle Foundations Part 1
DESCRIPTION:Hustle Foundations Part 1\nThursday March 2 - March 23\, 7pm-8p
 m\nPart 1: First 4 weeks of a two-part 8 week intensive for students new t
 o Latin Hustle. Learn the Hustle basic step\, popular Hustle turns and tur
 n patterns. Learn hustle tecnhnique\, how to lead and follow well and turn
  patterns to get you started on the dancefloor. Already know some Salsa? L
 ike partner dancing but don't always hear Salsa music at the functions you
  go to? For those of you who don't know what Latin Hustle is\, think of ap
 plying your Salsa turn patterns to different music such as House\, Old Sch
 ool\, Top 40 and Disco and therefore a different beat. It is so much fun! 
 Dance with a partner to practically any song anywhere!\nNo previous hustle
  experience required to join Part 1. Students must start on the first day.
 \nPrice: $60 for 4 weeks. 10 and 20 Class Cards can also be used for this 
 workshop. Hustle Foundations Part 1
