SUMMARY:Adult Beginner Ballet for Salsa Dancers
DESCRIPTION:Adult Beginner Ballet for Salsa Dancers provides a strong basis
  in ballet technique for students of all skill levels\, including those wh
 o have never taken a ballet class before. All classes emphasize proper and
  healthy alignment\, teach flexibiity\, strength\, balance and endurance a
 nd accommodates a wide range of ages and physical abilities. Learn ballet 
 technique and drills to help improve your balance\, spins\, control\, coor
 dination and your overall dancing. Get fit and strong and have fun within 
 an encouraging and challenging atmosphere\,\nFor men and women of all leve
 ls. No previous ballet or dance experience required.\nAttire: comfortable 
 clothing in which you can move easily (no jeans!). Ballet slippers or thin
  socks.\n\nPrice: $10 drop in. Ballet included FREE with the Steps monthly
  auto-renew and the Steps annual membership. 10 and 20 Class Cards can als
 o be used for this class. Adult Beginner Ballet for Salsa Dancers
