SUMMARY:Casino Rueda Foundations
DESCRIPTION:Thursday March 9 - April 27\, 9pm-10pm\n8 week intensive for st
 udents new to Casino Rueda. This crash course workshop will teach you the 
 Casino fundamentals required to join the weekly Casino Rueda Level 2 class
 . Casino Rueda is a Cuban form of salsa often described as "Salsa in a Cir
 cle". Building on the basic salsa step\, it combines new turn patterns wit
 h a rotational movement of the whole circle\, exchanging partners continua
 lly throughout the song. It is a great way to interact with other people\,
  have fun and add variety to your salsa at the same time!\nOpen to levels 
 2-5\, or people with at least 4 months experience dancing Salsa. Previous 
 Casino Rueda experience not required. Students must start on the first day
 .\n\nPrice: $120 for 8 weeks. 10 and 20 class cards can also be used. Casi
 no Rueda Foundations
