URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/danceworks-presents-a-provocative-
 world-premiere-from-torontos-acclaimed-indance-holy-cows/
SUMMARY:DanceWorks presents Holy Cow(s)!
DESCRIPTION:DanceWorks\, Toronto's longest running contemporary dance serie
 s\, proudly presents cutting-edge Toronto dance company inDANCE with the w
 orld premiere of Holy Cow(s)!\, choreographed by Artistic Director Hari Kr
 ishnan.\n\nA subversive and physically complex full-length dance productio
 n\, Holy Cow(s)! runs rampant\, toppling South Asian-dance related taboos 
 of gender\, identity\, sexuality and cultural (mis)appropriation - provoki
 ng desire and derision through humor and eroticism.\n\nA highly personal w
 ork from Hari Krishnan\, Holy Cow(s)! also features solos choreographed by
  Sean Curran (New York City)\, David Brick (Philadelphia) and Jay Hirabaya
 shi (Vancouver).\n\nHoly Cow(s)! is performed by seven talented Toronto da
 nce artists: Paul Charbonneau\, Beth Despres\, Peter Hessel\, Roney Lewis\
 , Megan Nadain\, Vinod Para and Xi Yi.\n\nToronto’s NOW Magazine feature
 d Krishnan as one of the top ten artists to watch out for this winter - ht
 tps://nowtoronto.com/stage/10-artists-to-watch-this-winter/ .\n\nDynamic T
 icket Pricing: Prior to the week of the show - $36\; During the week of th
 e show - $40\; Day of Show - $42.\nDiscounts for seniors ($28)\, arts indu
 stry (20% discount)\, students ($15) and groups of 10+ ($23).\nCall the Ha
 rbourfront Centre Box Office: 416-973-4000 OR purchase online: harbourfron
 tcentre.com/nextsteps DanceWorks presents Holy Cow(s)!
