 e hips moving and get you more comfortable in dance sensuality. Especially
  great for Samba and Rumba. Bonus – learn how to do a body roll and “w
 ine.”\n\nFRIDAY MAY 5th| 8:30 – 10PM | RHYTHM &amp\; REGGAE: The power
