 l-festival-of-indian-dance-whirling-streams/
SUMMARY:16th Annual Kalanidhi International Festival of Indian Dance: Whirl
 ing Streams
DESCRIPTION:The 16th Kalanidhi International Festival of Indian Dance: Whir
 ling Streams runs Tuesday March 28-Sunday April 2\, 2017 at Harbourfront C
 entre’s Fleck Dance Theatre. The live and live streamed Festival will pr
 esent over 40 dancers from Canada\, the U.S\, and India and feature the cl
 assical and contemporary dance styles of Bharatanatyam\, Odissi\, Kathak\,
  Chhau\, Kathakali and Modern over the course of six days.\n\nLocation: Fl
 eck Dance Theatre\, Harbourfront Centre\, 207 Queens Quay W.\, 3rd Floor\,
  Toronto\, ON\n\nShow Times: Tuesday to Friday 7:30pm\; Saturday 10:30am\,
  2:30pm &amp\; 7:30pm\nSunday\, April 2 Demonstration/Symposiums: Teaching
  dance online 10:30am-12:30pm\; Film Retrospective 1:30pm-2:30pm\; Symposi
 um on Contemporary Dance 3pm-5pm.\n\nTickets are on sale now: Call the Har
 bourfront Centre Box Office at 416-973-4000 OR purchase online at www.kala
 nidhifinearts.org OR at www.harbourfrontcentre.com/nextsteps or email tick
 ets@harbourfrontcentre.com.\n\nThe Box Office opens 2 hours before evening
  performances and 1 hour before Matinees for in-person purchase.\n\nTicket
  Prices: EARLY BIRD SPECIAL! Up to and including March 15\, purchase any t
 icket to a Kalanidhi Festival of Indian Dance Whirling Streams performance
  at Fleck Dance Theatre and get 20% off regular prices!\n\nFor SHOWS at Ha
 rbourfront Centre’s Fleck Dance Theatre: Regular Prices $38-$25 (Discoun
 ts for seniors\, students\, arts workers and groups of 10 or more)\; Sunda
 y Retrospective and Symposiums: FREE.\n\n7 Show Passes: $175 &amp\; $119 
 – Get one ticket to all seven shows\;\n4 Show Passes: $120 &amp\; $90 
 – Get one ticket to four shows of your choice.\n\nFor live and/or encore
  STREAMING in public places and film theatres such as Cineplex: $20 single
  ticket\;\nHome viewing on internet devices single ticket $10\; Live strea
 ming locations and tickets will be available mid-March through the www.kal
 anidhifinearts.org website. For groups (of 10 or more) in an informal sett
 ing of a studio or a party room: Enquire at 647-215-8620.\n\nFor more info
 rmation\, connect with Kalanidhi:\nWebsite: www.kalanidhifinearts.org \; F
 acebook: Kalanidhi Fine Arts of Canada \;\nYouTube: Kalanidhi Fine Arts of
  Canada . 16th Annual Kalanidhi International Festival of Indian Dance: Wh
 irling Streams
