SUMMARY:Light Breaking Through BROKEN
DESCRIPTION:A creative collaboration by Margaret Grenier and Karen Jamieson
 \n\nPeeling back the layers of the unknown\, and forging a path to underst
 anding\, Light Breaking Through BROKEN is the personal journey of two arti
 sts reconnecting with language\, culture\, and identity. With different cu
 ltural perspectives and individual histories\, Grenier and Jamieson use th
 eir distinct dance styles to push each other’s boundaries and find an op
 ening to the light.\n\nThis performance is one show of the Niimi’iwe Ind
 igenous Dance Double Bill\, running at the Aki studio from March 30th 2017
  to April 1st\, 2017. Single tickets are $25 each and Double Bill tickets 
 are $40 each. Light Breaking Through BROKEN
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2016/08/light-breaking-through-BROKEN.jpg
