 who have taken a couple of Hustle workshops in the past. This 4 week cours
 e will teach you the hustle technique you will need to social dance well a
 nd some new turns and patterns to add to your repertoire. Once students ha
 ve completed Hustle Foundations Part 2\, they may join the Hustle Level 2 
 weekly course.\nPrice: $60 for 4 weeks. 10 and 20 Class Cards can also be 
