URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/niimiiwe-indigenous-dance-double-b
 ill/
SUMMARY:NIIMI'IWE- Indigenous Dance Double Bill
DESCRIPTION:Native Earth Performing Arts presents Niimi'iwe: Indigenous Dan
 ce Double Bill- its annual three-night Indigenous dance series. Featuring 
 powerful contemporary Indigenous dance works:light breaking broken by Vanc
 ouver's Margaret Grenier and Karen Jamieson\, and the world premiere of Br
 ian Solomon's the NDN way\, commissioned by Native Earth Performing Arts.\
 n\nlight breaking broken\n7PM Nightly\nMargaret Grenier | Karen Jamieson\n
 \nPeeling back the layers of the unknown\, and forging a path to understan
 ding\, light breaking broken is the personal journey of two artists reconn
 ecting with language\, culture\, and identity. With different cultural per
 spectives and individual histories\, Grenier and Jamieson use their distin
 ct dance styles to push each other's boundaries and find an opening to the
  light.\n\nthe NDN way\n9PM Nightly\nBrian Solomon Electric Moose\n\nIn 19
 74\, a budding artist created her first CBC documentary after finding insp
 iration in the synthesis of the Cree world views by Ron Evans. Inspired by
  the same original recording of the Cree storyteller\, Solomon's the NDN w
 ay re-imagines\, remixes and interprets these philosophies about medicine 
 teachings\, pipe ceremonies\, sweat lodges and death in a highly theatrica
 l\, visual art-warp.\n\nTickets available at www.nativeearth.ca/boxoffice 
 or by calling 416.531.1402 NIIMI&#039\;IWE- Indigenous Dance Double Bill
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2017/02/indigenous-dance-double-bill.png
CATEGORIES:Indigenous
LOCATION:Aki Studio Theatre @ Daniels Spectrum\, 585 Dundas St East\,\, Tor
 onto\, Ontario\, M5A 2B7\, Canada
GEO:43.660099;-79.362099
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=585 Dundas St East\,\, Toro
 nto\, Ontario\, M5A 2B7\, Canada;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Aki Studio The
 atre @ Daniels Spectrum:geo:43.660099,-79.362099
END:VEVENT
