SUMMARY:HUSTLE &amp\; WCS Intensive weekend with Daniel McGee &amp\; Jameso
 n Kilburn
DESCRIPTION:HUSTLE &amp\; WEST COAST SWING WEEKEND INTENSIVE!\n\nJoy of Dan
 ce is excited to announce that Daniel McGee &amp\; Jameson Kilburn will be
  back March 30-April 2\, 2017!\nThese amazing professionals will be offeri
 ng workshops and private lessons!\n\nFRIDAY March 31\, 2017\n9am - Noon : 
 Private lessons (please contact us to book)\n1 - 3.30pm: Teachers Master C
 lass (contact Joy of Dance to attend)\n3.30 - 6pm : Private lessons\n7 - 8
 pm : WEST COAST SWING 1 or HUSTLE Beginner 1\n8.15 - 9.15pm : WEST COAST S
 WING 2 or HUSTLE Beginner 2\n\nSATURDAY April 1\, 2017\n9am - Noon : Priva
 te lessons (please contact us to book)\n1 - 2.30pm : HUSTLE - Patterns Int
 ermediate\n3 - 4.30pm : HUSTLE - Travelling in Hustle\n5 - 6.30pm : HUSTLE
  - Rueda or Hustle in the round\n8 - Midnight : Saturday Night Dance Socia
 l\n\nSUNDAY April 2\, 2017\n10am - 1pm : Private lessons (please contact u
 s to book)\n1 - 4pm : HUSTLE - Patterns Intermediate/Advanced\n\nPRICES fo
 r PRICELESS Workshops:\nPrivate lessons: $138 +HST\nFRI Only - Early Bird 
 Special $65+hst - AFTER March 1 $75+hst\nSAT Only - Early Bird Special $89
 +hst - AFTER March 1 $109+hst\nFRI/SAT/SUN - Early Bird Special $169+hst -
  AFTER March 1 $225+hst\nSAT/SUN - Early Bird Special $139+hst - AFTER Mar
 ch 1 $179+hst\n\nFor more information or to purchase your pass please call
  the studio on 416-406-3262 HUSTLE &amp\; WCS Intensive weekend with Danie
 l McGee &amp\; Jameson Kilburn
