UID:1491@torontodance.com
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto;VALUE=DATE:20170401
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto;VALUE=DATE:20170402
DTSTAMP:20170306T060831Z
URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/workshops-with-guest-instructors-t
 ito-tamara-from-puerto-rico/
SUMMARY:Workshops with Guest Instructors Tito &amp\; Tamara from Puerto Ric
 o
DESCRIPTION:Workshops with World-Renowned Instructors TITO &amp\; TAMARA FR
 OM PUERTO RICO\nIn Toronto for one weekend only teaching on Saturday April
  1st and Sunday April 2nd at Steps Dance Studio.\n\nWorkshops in Salsa\, C
 ha Cha\, Pachanga\, Men's &amp\; Ladies' Styling and more. Don't miss this
  opportunity to train with 2 of the world's best dancers/instructors.\n\nT
 ito Ortos and Tamara Livolsi are world-renowned salsa dancers\, choreograp
 hers\, performers and instructors from Puerto Rico. They have performed an
 d taught in over 100 cities around the world. With more than 20 years of s
 alsa dancing experience\, as well as backgrounds in ballet\, jazz\, hip ho
 p and more\, Tito and Tamara are two of the most respected and well-rounde
 d dancers in the industry. They are part of the judging panel of numerous 
 competitions including the Global Salsa Championships &amp\; the World Lat
 in Dance Cup. They do all of the choreographic work for Gilberto Santa Ros
 a and Victor Manuelle and have choreographed for dozens of Salsa musicians
 . They have participated in several movies including El Cantante and Dirty
  Dancing: Havana Nights.\n\nSaturday April 1st:\n2pm-3pm ~ Salsa on 2\, Be
 ginner/Intermediate\n3pm-4pm ~ Pachanga\, All levels\n4pm-5pm ~ Cha Cha Ch
 a\, Intermediate\n5pm-6pm ~ Salsa on 2\, Intermediate/Advanced\n\nSunday A
 pril 2nd:\n12pm-1pm ~ Salsa on 1\, Beginner/Intermediate\n1pm-2pm ~ Latin 
 Funk\, All levels\n5:30-7pm ~ Ladies' Shines &amp\; Styling with Tamara\, 
 All levels\n5:30-7pm ~ Men's Shines &amp\; Styling with Tito\, All levels\
 n\nSpace in all workshops is limited - register early to reserve your spot
 .\nTito and Tamara will also be available for a limited number of private 
 lessons. To book a private\, please contact Steps Dance Studio at info@st
 epsdancestudio.com or 416-656-STEP (7837).\n\nAlso join us on Saturday nig
 ht April 1st for the Steps Studio Party with special guests Tito &amp\; Ta
 mara.\nStudio 1: Salsa Lesson with Steps instructor\, 8pm-9pm\nStudio 1: S
 alsa &amp\; Bachata Music\, 9pm - 1am\, DJ Ef\n\nStudio 2: Hustle Lesson\,
  8pm-9pm\nStudio 2: Hustle\, West Coast &amp\; Top 40 Music\, 9pm - 1am\, 
 DJ DeTox\n\nCash bar. Meet other students and dancers. Practice what you h
 ave learned in a relaxed &amp\; friendly environment. Not confident to use
  some dance moves in the nightclub yet? Try them here first. Dance with yo
 ur fellow classmates\, Toronto dancers and your instructors. Join us for a
  fun lesson and stay to party. All ages and all levels welcome\, including
  non Steps students and dancers. No partner necessary - everyone dances wi
 th everyone and most people rotate partners after every song.\n\nSpecial J
 ack &amp\; Jill Salsa &amp\; Bachata Competition with Guest Judges Tito &a
 mp\; Tamara. Join our fun &amp\; friendly competition and you may win a pr
 ize! No preparation necessary - just social dance to song chosen by the DJ
 . Your partner will be randomly assigned to you. Multiple couples on the f
 loor at one time. Divisions for Salsa Levels newcomer\, beginner\, interme
 diate\, advanced\, Bachata newcomer\, beginner\, intermediate\, advanced. 
 Entry fee $5 per person per division.\n\nParty Admission: $10 per person a
 ll night long (includes lesson) Workshops with Guest Instructors Tito &amp
 \; Tamara from Puerto Rico
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2017/01/april_tito-email.png
CATEGORIES:Cha Cha,Salsa
LOCATION:Steps Dance Studio - 819 Yonge\, 819 Yonge Street\, 3rd floor\, To
