URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/perform-with-garry-portugal-toront
 o-exclusive/
SUMMARY:Perform With Garry Portugal : Toronto Exclusive
DESCRIPTION:Dance ConneXion and Los Pachangueros are excited to present a T
 oronto exclusive Panchanga shines performance project.\n\nChoreographed by
  Garry Portugal and Instructed by both Tania Wong and Garry Portugal. Open
  to both men and women.\n\nGarry Portugal is known as El Pachanguero and i
 s considered one of New York &amp\; New Jersey’s top dancers and choreog
 raphers in Salsa\, Mambo\, Bachata\, Pachanga and other dance styles. With
  over 12 years of dance experience\, Garry has worked alongside many great
  dance professionals such as Eddie Torres – The Mambo King\, Griselle Po
 nce\, Freddie Rios\, Mike Ramos\, Albert Torres\, and many others. He and 
 his company Los Pachangueros are featured in numerous congresses and event
 s both nationally and internationally. A piece of advice Garry wishes to i
 mpart to his students is to "learn\, train and practice\, but above all\, 
 let your dancing reflect who you are!"\n\nTania Wong\, an accomplished dan
 cer with a diverse background\, has won numerous titles including 3-times 
 Canadian Bachata Champion\, Toronto Salsa Champion\, amongst many others. 
 Since 1995\, she has been instructing Salsa\, Bachata\, Kizomba\, Chacha\,
  Ballet\, Jazz and Creative dance classes at various dance schools\, commu
 nity centers and dance clubs internationally\, bringing her love of dance 
 to students from 2 to over 70 years old! While her technique is regularly 
 praised she is most proud to receive comments of Energetic\, Entertaining\
 , and Engaging! She is the Director of Dance ConneXion\, which recently ce
 lebrated 10 years in business\, as well as Alma Toronto &amp\; Yamulee Tor
 onto\, the official branches of the world famous Alma Latina and Yamulee D
 ance Company.\n\nThe performance team classes will be conducted every Satu
 rday (Starting 1st April) for a duration of 4 months.\n\nTo know more abou
 t the fees and registration details\, please fill out the contact form.\n
 \nWe are really excited about this new collaboration and cannot wait to ta
 ke this challenge with you all! Perform With Garry Portugal : Toronto Excl
 usive
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2017/03/collab-2-e1489470217516.gif
