DESCRIPTION:// UNION fest // Cypher\, Battle &amp\; Showcase //\nFriday\, A
 pril 7\, 2017 | Kerr Hall West - Upper Gym | 8-11 PM | Doors: 7 pm | Pay-W
 hat-You-Can (Suggested $5)\n\nUHHU is going back to its roots yet again. E
 xperience and celebrate Toronto's rich Hip-Hop culture - MCing\, DJing\, g
 raffiti\, dance &amp\; fashion. With an ongoing soulful dance and MC cyphe
 r\, street style clothing vendors\, performances by upcoming Hip-Hop artis
 ts\, dope DJs\, and one sick atmosphere - YOU DON’T WANNA MISS THIS.\n\n
 To celebrate the premier of Season 2 of The Get Down\, let your old school
  surface\, and dress in 70s\, 80s\, or 90s apparel!\n\n// All-styles Dance
  Battle // 7 to Smoke // 8:30 PM\nJudges:\nShawn de Ocampo (Moon Runners)\
 nStephanie Caldeira (Rebels De La Soul)\nRaoul Wilke (Moon Runners)\nPrize
 : Street Style Apparel package\n1st: $200 Value\n2nd: $100 Value\n\n// Art
 ist Showcase // Gene One\, Eyeda\, SHAOLIN\, Haf n' haf\, reaLije + specia
 l guests\n\n// MC Cypher // Open cypher\, sign up with reaLije before 8pm 
 to freestyle over some fresh beats!\n\n// DJs // Berma\, DJ Abscvnd\, GOVI
 \n\n// Street Style Photo Expo // Hard Knock Leadership\, Crooked Abstract
 \n\n// Street Style Vendors // Independent Project\, ANTI\, 100 Miles Bran
 d UNION fest - Battle
