SUMMARY:Caribbean Dance Cardio &amp\; Food Seminar Event
DESCRIPTION:To celebrate the end of our 7-week dance “fit" challenge we w
 ill be hosting a special 2 - hour event featuring:\n\n*A Caribbean Dance C
 ardio Class*\nAs featured on Breakfast Television\, Lululemon\, Toronto St
 ar and more\, the Carnival Spice dance cardio class is an excellent way fo
 r you to keep fit and stay healthy. It fuses Soca\, Latin and Dancehall mu
 sic through a high-energy\, fitness experience that strengthens upper body
 \, lower body and core. The Caribbean vibes in the space create an energy 
 like no other for all participants. All body types\, ethnicities\, and dan
 ce levels are welcome!\n\n*A Food Seminar presented by Whole Hearted Food*
 \nWhole Hearted Food is passionate about using food to whole-heartedly sup
 port you through your health journey! This team of wholistic nutritionists
  will sharing tips and providing samples of delicious holistic Caribbean t
 reats.\n\nYou must register in advance as it is food inclusive and will se
 ll out!\n\nWe can't wait to dance and sweat with you! Caribbean Dance Card
 io &amp\; Food Seminar Event
