  learning the art of flamenco dance. The School of Ritmo Flamenco has been
  offering classes for people of all ages since 1995. Artistic Director Val
 erie Scannura leads the class and students will learn all aspects of flame
 nco dance including palmas (hand clapping)\, taconeo (footwork) and arm wo
 rk while enjoying beautiful flamenco music. The 5-week course is $85 which
  includes taxes. Fill out "More Info" form to register. Introduction to F
 lamenco
