URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/momentum-dance-toronto-presents-on
 efifty/
SUMMARY:Momentum Dance Toronto Presents: ONEFIFTY
DESCRIPTION:Momentum Dance Toronto celebrates Canada's 150th anniversary th
 rough our featured 7th annual production: ONEFIFTY\n\nWHEN: APRIL 26th-29t
 h\nLOCATION: Al Green Theatre - 750 Spadina Avenue (at Bloor)\, Toronto\nI
 N CELEBRATION: 15% of all ticket proceeds will be donated to the Canadian 
 Council for Refugees: http://ccrweb.ca/\n____\n\nMomentum Dance Toronto (M
 DT) celebrates Canada’s 150th anniversary in our seventh annual producti
 on: ONEFIFTY. Through the exclusive use of Canadian music\, our dancers ha
 ve choreographed movement pieces that explore and celebrate all that it me
 ans to be a part of this great country.\n\nThis is a time of immense globa
 l complexity\; with technological innovation and globalization at an all-t
 ime high\, it can be hard to avoid the noise and onslaught of negative med
 ia content that exists as a result. Our MDT dancers have chosen to instead
  highlight the beauty that can come from change and how as Canadians\, we 
 work together to make this country better every day. Our dancers will show
 case the boundless beauty in the geography and topography of our country. 
 Choreography will celebrate everything from our four seasons\, to our musi
 cal\, athletic and artistic success stories. Most importantly\, our dancer
 s have chosen to highlight what is likely the best part of being Canadian:
  our growing acceptance\, diversity and love of one another. Indeed\, the 
 world could use a lot more Canada\, couldn’t it?\n____\n\nSHOWS:\nWed\, 
 APR 26 @ 8pm *(preview show\, only $20) I Thurs\, APR 27 @ 8pm (group rate
 s available\, see below for details) I Fri\, APR 28 @ 8pm I Sat\, APR 29 @
  2pm &amp\; 8pm\n\nTICKETS:\nTHURS – SAT: $25 IN ADVANCE I $30 AT DOOR\n
 **THURS GROUP DISCOUNT available when purchasing 10 or more tickets: $15 e
 ach (email for purchase)\n***CHILDREN UNDER 12: $15 each\n\nTickets availa
 ble through our ONLINE BOX OFFICE @ www.momentumdancetoronto.com or purcha
 se at the door. Limited quantities.\n\nFOLLOW MDT:\nFacebook\, Twitter\, I
 nstagram\n@momentumDT\nI #MDTonefifty I #dance I #toronto I #mdt Momentum 
 Dance Toronto Presents: ONEFIFTY
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2017/03/MDTpresentsONEFIFTY_Poster-Mock-Up-2017-1.jpg
CATEGORIES:Ballet,Contemporary,Hip Hop,Jazz,Tap
LOCATION:Al Green Theatre\, 750 Spadina Ave\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M5S 2J2\,
  Canada
GEO:43.66642;-79.403909
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=750 Spadina Ave\, Toronto\,
  Ontario\, M5S 2J2\, Canada;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Al Green Theatre:ge
 o:43.66642,-79.403909
END:VEVENT
