URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/dance-works-presents-glory-created
 -and-performed-by-shay-kuebler-radical-system-art/
SUMMARY:Dance Works presents Glory Created and Performed by Shay Kuebler Ra
 dical System Art
DESCRIPTION:DanceWorks\, Toronto's longest running contemporary dance serie
 s\, presents the Toronto premiere of cutting-edge Vancouver dance company\
 , Shay Kuebler Radical System Art with Glory\, a dazzling and startlingly 
 athletic performance which encompasses martial arts\, contemporary dance a
 nd hip hop to examine the complexities and glorification of violent behavi
 our throughout our media-drenched culture.\n\nThe show runs Friday April 2
 8 and Saturday April 29 at 8pm nightly at the Harbourfront Centre Theatre 
 as part of the NextSteps series.\n\nInspired by the imagined epic battles 
 of childhood\, video games and a passion for action films\, Kuebler\, “o
 ne of Vancouver’s most exciting choreographers known for an insanely coo
 l hybrid of street and contemporary dance\, martial arts\, and other popul
 ar forms” (The Georgia Straight)\, examines the commercialization and co
 mmodification of violence in today's society through visceral and impactfu
 l choreography.\n\nSee the Glory trailer here:\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/
 watch?v=qRfhQZAu8ek\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nTickets available at http://www.harbourf
 rontcentre.com/nextsteps/tickets/ Dance Works presents Glory Created and P
 erformed by Shay Kuebler Radical System Art
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2017/04/12-by-David-Coooper.jpg
CATEGORIES:Hip Hop
LOCATION:Harbourfront Centre Theatre (formerly Enwave Theatre)\, 231 Queens
  Quay West\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M5J 2G8\, Canada
GEO:43.639500;-79.383003
