SUMMARY:Hustle Foundations Part 1
DESCRIPTION:Part 1: First 4 weeks of a two-part 8 week intensive for studen
 ts new to Latin Hustle. Learn the Hustle basic step\, popular Hustle turns
  and turn patterns. Learn hustle tecnhnique\, how to lead and follow well 
 and turn patterns to get you started on the dancefloor. Already know some 
 Salsa? Like partner dancing but don't always hear Salsa music at the funct
 ions you go to? For those of you who don't know what Latin Hustle is\, thi
 nk of applying your Salsa turn patterns to different music such as House\,
  Old School\, Top 40 and Disco and therefore a different beat. It is so mu
 ch fun! Dance with a partner to practically any song anywhere!\n\nNo previ
 ous hustle experience required to join Part 1. Students must start on the 
 first day. Open to students in Salsa levels 2-5\, or people with at least 
 2 months experience dancing Salsa.\n\nPrice:\n$60 for 4 weeks. 10 and 20 C
 lass Cards can also be used for this workshop. Hustle Foundations Part 1
