SUMMARY:Dancesport Shoes Flash Sale
DESCRIPTION:The DancePlus annual Flash sale comes early this year. On Satur
 day May 6 four premium dancesport shoe brands (International Dance Shoes\,
  Freed of London\, Anatomica of Italy\, and MERLET of France) will be mark
 ed down from up to $210 to the same low price - $99.00 - for 3 hours only
 !\n\nTables and tables of mens and ladies dance shoes will be available in
  the 30-up Club ballroom\, each pair  35% to 53% off! This is the lowest
  price you will get from DancePlus all year.\n\nIn addition\, DanceVision 
 instructional DVD's will be half price\, and all other DVD's and CD's wi
 ll be at least 30% off.\nGet Your Shoes for Free\nOn the Tuesday after the
  sale\, DancePlus will randomly pick a lucky dancer from their Facebook R
 SVPs\, followers\, and newsletter subscribers to win a $50 credit to use o
 n a future pair of dance shoes. If you are the winner\, and you bought a p
 air of shoes at the sale\, DancePlus will refund you the $99 you paid an
 d you get to keep the shoes!  So RSVP below!\n\n\n\nFor a chance to win y
 ou can also like DancePlus on Facebook or sign up for their newsletter.\nF
 lash Sale Survival Tips:\n\n 	Arrive Early. If you wish to be among the fi
 rst to peruse the selection\, arrive before noon.\n 	Know Your European Si
 ze. The sizing systems are are different for each brand so print out this 
 shoe-size-conversion chart and bring it to the sale so you can quickly m
 ake a beeline to tables of your size.\n 	Play Nice. Even though many peopl
 e may be competing for shoes of a particular size\, limit yourself to tryi
 ng on no more than two pairs at once. Dance Plus requests that you not hoa
 rd several pairs of shoes you may not buy so everyone has a fair chance to
  find shoes in the three hours allocated to the sale.\n 	Don’t Stress. I
 f you can’t find a pair you like\, Dance Plus will provide staff that wi
 ll take you next door and fit you with your choice of any regular stock sh
 oes at 15% off.\n 	Bring Cash for Quick Checkout. If you want to get throu
 gh quickly\, bring cash!  Expect longer lines for credit cards.\n Dancesp
 ort Shoes Flash Sale
