SUMMARY:8-Week Kizomba Beginners Course
DESCRIPTION:AfroLatino Dance Company presents:\n8-Week course in Kizomba Le
 vel 1\, where you will learn the basics of this sensual partner dance that
  has been taking the world by storm.\n\nKizomba is a partner dance origina
 ted from Angola (West Africa)\, immensely popular in Europe and growing in
  popularity in North America and everywhere else. It evokes the feelings o
 f connection\, smoothness and sensuality.\n\nSATURDAYS\, 4pm - 4:55pm\nSTA
 RTS: May 6\, 2017\nENDS: June 24\, 2017\n\nThis course is held at our bran
 d new studio in the Junction\, on Dundas St\, just east of Runnymede.\n\nR
 egistration: go to our website 8-Week Kizomba Beginners Course
