SUMMARY:Esmeralda Enrique Spanish Dance Company presents An Iconic Journey:
  A Celebration of 35 Years
DESCRIPTION:Esmeralda Enrique Spanish Dance Company (EESDC) celebrates its 
 35th Anniversary with An Iconic Journey: A Celebration of 35 Years which r
 uns Friday\, May 5 – Sunday\, May 7\, 2017 at Harboufront Centre's Fleck
  Dance Theatre.\n\nArtistic Director Esmeralda Enrique marks this importan
 t milestone with a presentation that honours EESDC’s significant accompl
 ishments with re-imaginings of past works while it looks to the future wit
 h fresh and inventive new creations.\n\nThe program includes two world pre
 mieres - one from Artistic Director Esmeralda Enrique and one from Ana Mor
 ales\, an acclaimed choreographer of contemporary flamenco from Seville\, 
 Spain that EESDC commissioned for her powerful expression and innovation -
  as well as a number of beautifully revised and reworked creations\, from 
 traditional to contemporary.\n\nAn Iconic Journey showcases the consummate
  artistry of the Esmeralda Enrique Spanish Dance Company ensemble\, known 
 for its gorgeous\, ferocious\, passionate dancing. Olé!\n\nFriday\, May 5
  – Sunday\, May 7\, 2017\nFriday &amp\; Saturday at 8pm\, Sunday at 3pm\
 n\nTickets: $32-$48 (Discounts for students\, seniors\, groups &amp\; arts
  workers)\nCall the Harbourfront Centre Box Office: 416-973-4000 OR\npurch
 ase online at http://www.flamencos.net/OR www.harbourfrontcentre.com/nexts
 teps/ Esmeralda Enrique Spanish Dance Company presents An Iconic Journey: 
 A Celebration of 35 Years
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2017/03/EESDC-Épocas-Esmeralda-Enrique-in-front-ph-by-Hamid-Karimi-sm-e1
 491099467226.jpg
