SUMMARY:Flamenco - Bellydance Fusion Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Award-winning dancer Anjelica Scannura has been teaching and pe
 rforming throughout the world and is also the host of the successful TV sh
 ow for ONE TV called "Anjelica's Dance Workout".\n\nThe television critic\
 , John Doyle for The Globe and Mail\, took a look at One’s brand new\, f
 un and inspirational fitness series hosted by award winning Canadian dance
  pro Anjelica Scannura and couldn’t help but find it “mesmerizing” b
 ut\, motivational as well.\n\nStudents will learn the basic moves to both 
 flamenco and bellydance so expect a great workout but also learn about the
  mesmerizing beauty of these ancient art forms. This workshop will take pl
 ace at Ritmo Flamenco Studios on Thursday May 25 from 7:45-9:15. Registrat
 ion is $25 including taxes and you can pre-register by filling out the "m
 ore info" tab to book you spot.\n\nClass size is limited so book now! Flam
 enco - Bellydance Fusion Workshop
