SUMMARY:West Coast Swing Foundations
DESCRIPTION:4 week intensive for students new to West Coast Swing. West Coa
 st Swing is a great place for beginners to start and is incredibly practic
 al: you can dance it to almost any music: Top 40\, Blues\, Hip Hop\, RnB\,
  Big Band\, Jazz\, Country. What separates WCS from other partner dances\,
  it is famous for giving women much more freedom than other dances and inc
 redibly improvisational. West Coast Swing Foundations workshop requires no
  experience. You will learn all the foundation steps for this dance as wel
 l as the principles of connection\, leading and following. This class teac
 hes only 100% leadable moves.\nOpen to students in all levels. No prior We
 st Coast Swing experience required.\n\nPrice:\n$60 for 4 weeks. 10 and 20 
 Class Cards can also be used for this workshop. West Coast Swing Foundatio
 ns
