DESCRIPTION:Fri. May 26 - Sept 29\, 9pm-10pm\nLearn an entire choreographed
  Salsa on 2 routine then perform it at the Canada Salsa &amp\; Bachata Con
 gress and other nightclubs or events in Toronto. A performance class will 
 help to improve your memory of turn patterns and shines\, enhance your sty
 ling &amp\; body movement\, improve your timing and musicality and learn d
 ips and tricks. Unleash your inner performer\, increase your confidence on
  the dancefloor\, meet new people and have fun! Geared to students in leve
 ls 4 and 5 (or with at least 1 year's experience dancing Salsa). Great for
  first time performers as well as students who have previously joined a pe
 rformance class.\nPlease note all participants must commit for the full co
 urse.\n\nPrice: $300 for 18 weeks. Can pay in two instalments\, May 26 and
  August 4. Salsa on 2 Performance Class
