URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/caribana-fit-challenge/
SUMMARY:Caribana Fit Challenge
DESCRIPTION:Carnival Spice Presents: THE CARIBANA DANCE FIT CHALLENGE\n\nSa
 turday\, May 27th - Saturday\, July 15th (excluding July 1st)\n\nCarnival 
 Spice is back with a 7-week dance “fit" challenge for those who are seri
 ous about transforming their health and fitness! The challenge is designed
  to be fun\, energetic\, and transformative\, for both the body and mind a
 ll with a Caribbean twist. PLUS as Toronto celebrates its 50th year of Car
 nival\, we want to help you get “ready fuh di road” if you are interes
 ted in participating in Toronto Carnival.\n\nEACH CHALLENGE RECIPIENT WILL
  RECEIVE:\n\n7 Weekly Caribbean Dance Cardio Classes\nto the sounds of soc
 a\, dancehall\, and chutney we teach you the moves\, energy\, body placeme
 nt and style. No pressure to remember steps - move at your own pace and yo
 ur own style.\nInclusive to all body types\, ethnicities\, and dance level
 .\nClass runs Saturdays from 12pm - 1pm excluding July 1st.\n\nCarnival Sp
 ice Workbook\ntrack your progress\, learn new workout tips\, wellness stra
 tegies\, and more.\n\nCarnival Spice T-shirt\nOption of White or Gray\n\nA
 ccess to our Private Online Group\nEngage with other members for support p
 lus receive exclusive Carnival Spice offers\n\nSurprises and Event Discoun
 ts Throughout The Challenge\nCarnival Spice offer amazing events and pop u
 p workshops that challenge participants will receive discounted tickets on
  or complimentary access too. The surprises… well you will have to wait 
 and see!\n\nCaribbean Carnival (Caribana) Prep\nThis challenge leads right
  into Toronto Carnival 2017\; so we WILL be getting you ready for the road
 . Not just physically\, but our amazing team offers support in carnival co
 stume selection and road preparation! You may even find your Caribana Poss
 e in class!\n\nINVESTMENT: $112.99.\nSINGLE CLASS DROP IN: $20\nCARNIVAL S
 PICE T-SHIRT: $20 Caribana Fit Challenge
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2017/05/shakera.group_.jpg
