URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/casino-foundations/
SUMMARY:Casino Foundations
DESCRIPTION:4 week intensive for students new to Casino Rueda. This crash c
 ourse workshop will teach you the Casino fundamentals required to join our
  Sunday Casino Rueda Level 2 class.\nCasino Rueda is a Cuban form of salsa
  often described as "Salsa in a Circle". Building on the basic salsa step\
 , it combines new turn patterns with a rotational movement of the whole ci
 rcle\, exchanging partners continually throughout the song. It is a great 
 way to interact with other people\, have fun and add variety to your salsa
  at the same time!\n\nOpen to levels 2-5\, or people with at least 4 month
 s experience dancing Salsa. Previous Casino Rueda experience not required.
  Students must start on the first day.\n\nPrice: $60 for 4 weeks Casino Fo
 undations
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2017/04/june_casino.jpg
