SUMMARY:ALL ABOUT FORRÓ Workshop
DESCRIPTION:ALL ABOUT FORRÓ Workshop\n\nCome to learn the diversity of the
  Brazilian dance style Forró. Our amazing team of Toronto-based and guest
  instructors from Montreal will offer a comprehensive overview of Forró s
 tyles. During the three workshop hours you will learn to dance and enhance
  your knowledge of the following Forró styles:\n\n 	Roots Forró\n 	Elect
 ronic Forró\n 	Pé-de-serra Forró\n 	Universitário Forró\n\nThis works
 hop was designed to fit all levels of dancers\, from newcomers to advanced
 !\n\nFor that\, B-Arts and Lula World brought together these fantastic ins
 tructors for you:\n\n 	Montreal: Mohammed Mhirit (Mozinho)\n 	Brazil / Tor
 onto: Rita Fernandes\, Pedro Cheroto\, and Rafael de Oliveira.\n\nDetails:
 \n\nWHEN: Sunday\, June 4th - 12-3pm\n\n 	12-1pm- Mozinho (Montreal) - Pé
  de Serra and Universitario Forró\n 	1 - 2pm - Rita &amp\; Pedro (Brazil/
 Toronto) - Roots\, Pé de Serra and Universitário Forró\n 	2 - 3pm - Raf
 ael de Oliveira (Brazil/Toronto) - Electronic Forró\n\nWHERE: Lula Lounge
  – 1585\, Dundas Street West (west of Dufferin)\n\nHOW MUCH: $35 (3h Hou
 rs of Workshop)\n&gt\;&gt\; Save $10! -&gt\; $45 (3h Workshop + Sunday par
 ty and lesson)\n&gt\;&gt\; You pay half price-&gt\; Register 3 friends wit
 h you and your workshop will cost you half! (discount valid until May 26 -
 advance only).\n\nFor registration and further information fill out the fo
 rm on the "More Info" tab.\nThis workshop is presented by B. Arts with Lul
 aworld\, as part of the Lulaworld 2017. ALL ABOUT FORRÓ Workshop
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2017/05/18090714_10154227445876548_496354440_o.jpg
