 arian expression:\n\nPole\, Hungarian — two good friends\,\ntogether the
 y dance and drink their wine &#x1f609\;\n\nSo come and dance with us &#x1f
 642\;\n\nPolky Village Band &amp\; Folk Camp team!\n\nGo to "More Info" t
 ab  if you have any questions! Summer Polka in the Park
