SUMMARY:INTENSIVE KIZOMBA WORKSHOP: MUSICALITY &amp\; CHOREO
DESCRIPTION:This 3hr Kizomba workshop will focus primarily on musicality an
 d choreo development. Here's what you will learn:\n*Identifying and unders
 tanding the difference between Urban Kizomba &amp\;Traditional Kizomba mus
 ic.\n*Dance moves: Urban (linear) vs Traditional (circular) vs Fusions\n*T
 ips and tricks on formulating fun &amp\; elaborate combinations on the spo
 t.\n\nKnowledge of the following is required:\n\n 	Side basic (+ add a cha
  cha)\n 	Slow basic (+ pulses)\n 	Basic 3 (+ turns + 8 beat sets)\n 	Men's
  saïda (+ open men's saïda)\n 	Ladies saïda (+ turning option)\n 	Cha-c
 ha turn (+ 0\, 90 and 180 degree options)\n 	Virgula\n\nWe look forward to
  having you join us on the dance floor!\n\nMississauga SBK Social Dance Gr
 oup &amp\; West End Kizomba with Jules\nFind us on Facebook https://www.fa
 cebook.com/MississaugaSBK/\n\nBuy ticket: https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/inte
 nsive-kizomba-workshop-musicality-choreo-tickets-34412287077?aff=efbevent\
 n\nPlease note entrance is via back of the Dunwynn Centre (Delta Bingo) bu
 ilding\nStreet shoes are NOT permitted on the studio floor\, please bring 
 dance shoes or clean indoor footwear. INTENSIVE KIZOMBA WORKSHOP: MUSICALI
 TY &amp\; CHOREO
CATEGORIES:Kizomba
LOCATION:Rising Sun Academy Of Martial Arts\, 1650 Dundas St E\, Mississaug
 a\, ontario \,  L4X 2Z3\, Canada
