 rporates structured workout session and intense dance moves. The first 20 
 minutes of the class the participants do high intensity workouts and for t
 he remaining 40 minutes the participants learn repeated energetic moves fo
 r a full body workout.\n\nThe styles that are incorporated are Bollywood\,
  Belly dance\, and Hip hop. The class ends with a yoga/ breathing routine 
