SUMMARY:Kizomba Night with Sweet Maria
DESCRIPTION:Kizomba Night is an event designed to promote Kizomba Music and
  Kizomba dance. Kizomba is both a style of music and a style of dance that
 's taking over the world.\n\nThe Kizomba event will feature a live show fr
 om Sweet Maria\, Toronto's sexy Kizomba Queen. Sweet Maria was the first t
 o record and release Kizomba music in Canada. Her first Kizomba album was 
 released in 2005 in Toronto. Her songs are exotic\, romantic and her voice
  is soft and sexy. She is a polyglot and sings in 4 languages. Her rhythm 
 is addictive and involving. It will make you wanna dance.\n\nAttend the Ki
 zomba night and have an amazing musical experience. Open your minds to a d
 ifferent dimension in Music and in Dance. Kizomba Night with Sweet Maria
