 ur fellow classmates\, Toronto dancers and your instructors. Join us for a
  fun lesson and stay to party. All ages and all levels welcome\, including
  non Steps students and dancers. No partner necessary - everyone dances wi
 th everyone and most people rotate partners after every song.\n\nPrice: $1
 0 per person all night long (includes lesson) Steps Studio Party
