 fitness-choreography/
SUMMARY:The BollyTwist Workshop: Bollywood Fitness &amp\; Choreography
DESCRIPTION:Dance ConneXion presents 'The BollyTwist' - Bollywood fitness a
 nd choreography workshop\n\nTaught by Neha Balooja who has more than 12 ye
 ars of experience in Bollywood Dance!!\n\nWe want to help you achieve your
  fitness goals this spring &amp\; summer and ensure you have fun doing it!
 !\n\nJoin our super fun Bollywood Dance Fitness and Choreography class to 
 sweat away those calories and tone those muscles.\n\nLearn more about the 
 South Asian culture and its evolution in dance through these classes.\n\nA
 ll Ages Welcome!! No experience Required!!\n\nWhat to bring: Gym clothes\,
  running shoes\, water and lots of energy :)\n\nMore about Neha:\n\n 	Chor
 eographed and performed Bollywood dances for more than 12 years in India a
 t various events and weddings.\n 	Performed Maharashtrian folk dance with 
 Malaika Arora Khan - a famous celebrity in India\n 	Taught and performed L
 atin Ballroom and Salsa with the biggest dance school in Pune\, India for 
 more than 7 years\n 	Recently moved to Canada in 2016 and started pursuing
  her passion and love for dancing and teaching by joining the Dance ConneX
 ion\n 	Prominent member of Alma Toronto\, Dance ConneXion\, and Yamulee To
 ronto performance dance teams\n 	Started spreading her love of teaching in
  Canada at the Dance Connexion since 2017\n\nTRY OUT THE DEMO CLASS for $1
 0 only on 20th June!!!\n\n6-week full course package will start on June 27
 th 7:15 - 8:15 pm. To know more or to register for either the Demo class o
 r the full course fill out the form on the "more info" tab. The BollyTwist
  Workshop: Bollywood Fitness &amp\; Choreography
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2017/06/dreamstime_xl_9345238-custom.jpg
