URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/le-patin-libre-luminato/
SUMMARY:Le Patin Libre @ Luminato
DESCRIPTION:Ice skating in the summer? It’s happening! Vertical Influence
 s is a contemporary ice skating double-bill\, comprised of Vertical and In
 fluences. Le Patin Libre\, a collective from Montreal featuring high-level
  figure skaters and a sound-designer-turned-performer\, brings the attitud
 e of street dance and the athleticism of competitive skating to this exhil
 arating performance.\n\nInfluences explores the relationship between indiv
 iduals and the groups they belong to. Despite bullying\, individualism\, a
 nd rivalry\, a group experiencing obvious tensions evolves toward a new ha
 rmony. In Vertical\, the spectators sit right on the ice and the skaters f
 ly by so close that they literally move the air around the audience. Toget
 her\, the two pieces make for a fresh and joyous experience.\n\nVertical I
 nfluences takes Luminato to the heart of downtown Toronto at Ryerson’s M
 attamy Athletic Centre (formerly Maple Leaf Gardens) and to Scarborough at
  Don Montgomery Arena. With workshops for all skill levels\, an outdoor ro
 ller blade performance\, and an on-ice dance party\, Le Patin Libre provid
 e a joyous fusion of dance\, sport\, and play.\n\nPhotos by Alice Clark.\n
 \nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?time_continue=1&v=ocW-HZofY6s\n\n&nbsp\; L
 e Patin Libre @ Luminato
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2017/05/skating-luminato.jpg
CATEGORIES:Skating
LOCATION:Don Montgomery Community Recreation Centre\, 2467 Eglinton Avenue 
 East\, Scarborough\, ON\, Scarborough\, Canada
GEO:43.7327334;-79.2612216
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=2467 Eglinton Avenue East\,
  Scarborough\, ON\, Scarborough\, Canada;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Don Mo
 ntgomery Community Recreation Centre:geo:43.7327334,-79.2612216
END:VEVENT
