SUMMARY:Blueheel Islands Showcase
DESCRIPTION:Breezin’ in da ISLANDS\n\nBLUEHEEL JUNE 2017 SHOWCASE\n\nDINN
 ER | SHOW | DANCE\n\nOoooh Bahama Mama! We be jammin’ at our June 25th S
 howcase as we head for da islands. From Jamaica to Trinidad\, Aruba to Dom
 inican\, we be drawing on a little Calypso\, Reggae and island beats to sp
 ice up our dance. So take your tango to the islands\, add a dash of reggae
  to your rumba and we be waltzing to a whole new tune!\n\nEverything islan
 ds is coming your way\, so get ready for the "Breezin' in da Islands" show
 case\, which will feature lots of latin and ballroom dancing\, bright\, co
 lourful costumes\, island mocktails\, dance shows and more. From Jamaica t
 o Trinidad\, Aruba to Dominican\, we be drawing on a little Calypso\, Regg
 ae and island beats to spice up our dance. So take your tango to the islan
 ds\, add a dash of reggae to your rumba\, and we be waltzing to a whole ne
 w tune!\n\nBlueheel Dance Studio's Breezin' in da Islands Showcase is one 
 of many shows put on in the past 14 years. It's a fun\, relaxed event with
  plenty of latin and ballroom dancing\, as mentioned above\, as well as go
 od food and great company. It is an event that allows our students to show
  you and their loved ones what they've learned with us\, and we'd love for
  you to join us in what will definitely be a great night\n\nVenue: Lakesho
 re Convention Centre\,\n\nSign up now! Blueheel Islands Showcase
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2017/04/Islands_Ltr-e1491333078935.jpg
CATEGORIES:African,AfroCuban,Other,Reggaeton
