SUMMARY:Fiesta de Verano
DESCRIPTION:The dancers of the School of Ritmo Flamenco present a concert t
 hat runs the gamut from pure traditional flamenco to contemporary and clas
 sical styles featuring choreography by critically acclaimed Artistic Direc
 tor Valerie Scannura and award-winning choreographer Anjelica Scannura.\n\
 nRenowned composer and flamenco guitarist Roger Scannura will accompany th
 e dancers in many of the traditional forms such as the Caracoles\, the Sig
 uiriyas and the Solea por Bulerias.\n\nNew works this year are the mesmeri
 zing dance "Danza del Fuego" by composer Manuel de Falla and the famous Pa
 so Doble "El Gato Montes" straight from "la corrida" (the bullring).\n\nVa
 lued for its important pioneering contribution to the development of flame
 nco in Canada and gorgeous\, ferocious\, passionate dancing Ritmo Flamenco
  peerlessly stands on the pillars of traditional flamenco dance and music 
 while beautifully balancing classicism with a contemporary aesthetic. Fies
 ta de Verano
