URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/38th-annual-dora-mavor-moore-award
 s-a-star-studded-night-in-a-storied-theatre/
SUMMARY:38th Annual Dora Mavor Moore Awards: A Star-Studded Night in a Stor
 ied Theatre
DESCRIPTION:The Toronto Alliance for the Performing Arts (TAPA) presents th
 e 38th Annual Dora Mavor Moore Awards\non Monday\, June 26 in the Elgin Th
 eatre of the Elgin and Winter Garden Theatre Centre.\n\nRecognizing the ou
 tstanding achievements in Toronto's performing arts industry\, the Doras h
 onour the creators of over 200 theatre\, dance and opera productions annua
 lly.\n\nAccomplished actor and musician Raoul Bhaneja is host of the event
 . A Gemini\, Dora and Canadian Comedy Award nominee\, he has released five
  records with his band The Big Time\, who also perform at the event.\n\nMu
 lti-talented Emmy-nominated artist Diane Flacks is the writer for the show
 . Flacks writes for theatre and TV\, including most recently CBC's Barones
 s Von Sketch\, and Nightwood Theatre's Unholy\, which she wrote and starre
 d in.\n\nThe always-fabulous pre-show VIP Reception and the fun-filled Aft
 er-Party will both take place in the lobbies throughout the venue.\n\nTick
 ets for this celebratory evening go on sale May 31 through the box office 
 at the Elgin and Winter Garden Theatre Centre\, either in person at the th
 eatre at 189 Yonge Street or by calling 1-855-622-2787\, and online via ht
 tp://www.tapa.ca.\n\nRegular Tickets for Awards Show &amp\; After-Party: $
 90.00 (+HST &amp\; Ticketmaster fees)\nStudent\, Senior\, Artsworker Ticke
 ts for Awards Show &amp\; After-Party: $70 (+ HST &amp\; Ticketmaster fees
 )\n\n 	6:00pm-7:00pm Pre-Show VIP Cocktail Reception in the Lobbies of the
  Elgin and Winter Garden Theatre Centre\n 	7:30pm Dora Mavor Moore Awards 
 Show in the Elgin Theatre\n 	10:30pm After-Party in the Lobbies of the Elg
 in and Winter Garden Theatre Centre\n 38th Annual Dora Mavor Moore Awards:
  A Star-Studded Night in a Storied Theatre
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2017/04/Dora-Mavor-Moore-Award-Statue.jpg
CATEGORIES:Contemporary
LOCATION:Elgin and Winter Garden Theatre Centre\, 189 Yonge Street\, Toront
 o\, Ontario\, M5B 1M4\, Canada
GEO:43.6530329;-79.37929559999998
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=189 Yonge Street\, Toronto\
 , Ontario\, M5B 1M4\, Canada;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Elgin and Winter G
 arden Theatre Centre:geo:43.6530329,-79.37929559999998
END:VEVENT
