SUMMARY:2017 World Championships of Performing Arts
DESCRIPTION:We are searching for talented SINGERS I DANCERS I ACTORS I MODE
 LS I INSTRUMENTALISTS to represent Canada at the 21st Annual World Champio
 nships of Performing Arts - WCOPA This is an opportunity of a lifetime! A 
 chance to win a recording contract with Indasoul Entertainment http://inda
 soul.com/ who works with major labels and artists in Hollywood. Over $400\
 ,000 USD in Scholarships awarded from New York Film Academy\, The New York
  Conservatory for Dramatic Arts\, Millennium Dance Complex\, Cash prize an
 d much more...Professionals from the Entertainment Industry\, talent manag
 ers\, agents\, casting directors\, producers\, music industry representati
 ves from Hollywood\, Nashville and New York are invited to Judge\, conduct
  seminars and cast at WCOPA each year. What are you waiting for? To auditi
 on\,  fill out the contact form.\nJune 30 - July 9\, 2017 Long Beach\, Ca
 lifornia. See you in Hollywood at the beach!\n\nhttps://vimeo.com/18068355
