 uditions/
SUMMARY:2017/18 Toronto Raptors Dance Pak Auditions
DESCRIPTION:The Toronto Raptors are looking for talented dancers to join th
 e Pak. Do you have what it takes to rep the most electrifying dance team i
 n the Six?\n\nDATE: Sunday\, July 9th\, 2017\nCHOREOGRAPHER: AMBERLEY WADD
 ELL\nLOCATION: Air Canada Centre\, 40 Bay St\, Toronto\, ON. Enter through
  Gate 1.\nREGISTRATION: 10:00am. AUDITIONS BEGIN AT 11:00 AM\nBE PREPARED 
 TO STAY AS LONG AS NECESSARY.\n\nWHAT WE’RE LOOKING FOR:\nFemale Dancers
  – 18 and older (must be 18 by the day of the audition). We strongly enc
 ourage ages 22-30 to come out and audition!\nDancers must have the ability
  to show an extreme level of enthusiasm\, confidence and poise.\nDancers m
 ust be physically fit and have strong athletic skills and endurance.\nDanc
 ers must be dedicated\, professional\, hard working and strong team player
 s.\nMinimum 2 years dance/performance experience in Hip Hop or Jazz.\n22 t
 eam members.\nThere is no minimum or maximum height requirement.\nYou must
  also provide a resume and a current non-returnable 5x7 or 8x10 headshot.\
 n\nWHAT TO EXPECT:\nDancers will be taught a basic hip hop routine combine
 d with jazz. All participants who advance will be asked to perform the rou
 tine in small groups. A number of cuts will be made throughout the auditio
 n. All participants who advance will be asked to perform 4-6 eight counts 
 of their own choreography highlighting strengths and specialties. Music wi
 ll be provided. The audition is closed\, spectators will not be permitted.
 \n\nWHAT TO WEAR:\nAn attractive two-piece dance outfit (Half top and fitt
 ed shorts. Any style and colour)\nMid-area\, legs and arms must be exposed
 .\nNo baggy clothing or street wear. No pants\, leggings\, capris or cover
  ups.\nFull performance make-up and hair styled. Hair must be down\, no po
 nytails.\nParticipants may wear any kind of sneaker/dance shoe\, please ma
 ke sure they have non-marking soles.\n\nJUDGING:\nJudges will focus on ent
 husiasm\, energy\, dance ability\, personal appearance\, personality\, poi
 se and showmanship.\n\nCOMMITMENT INFORMATION:\nMandatory team rehearsals 
 – Mondays\, Wednesdays and Fridays 7:30-10:00pm\nAugust through April (o
 r until end of playoffs).\nMandatory team meeting\nPre-Season games – Oc
 tober\n41+ Regular Season Home Games – November to April. Schedule is av
 ailable in August\nPublic appearances and events\n\nPre-register by fillin
 g out the "more info" form. We will require your headshot and resume. 2017
 /18 Toronto Raptors Dance Pak Auditions
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2017/06/DancePakAuditions.jpg
CATEGORIES:Commercial Jazz,Contemporary,Hip Hop,Jazz
LOCATION:Air Canada Centre\, 40 Bay St\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M5J 2L2\, Down
 town\, Canada
