URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/unity-festival-dance-exhibition/
SUMMARY:Unity Festival Dance Exhibition
DESCRIPTION:Tangerine Presents Unity Dance Exhibition &amp\; Beatbox Compet
 ition 2017.\nCelebrating Our 10th Anniversary!!!!\n\n• Free Entry •\n\
 nToronto!!!!! The Unity Festival Dance Exhibition &amp\; Beatbox Competiti
 on Is Back For 2017 Celebrating 10 Years Of Hip-hop\, Dance\, Spoken Word\
 , Mc'ing And Beatbox With Special Guests ...\n\nKeysha Freshh • Nekkrak 
 • Obuxum • Bucc N Flvr\nAnd Dj's Andy B Bad + Soul Secta\n\nHosted By:
 \nUdoou Crew (Hannia &amp\; Gloria)\nUnstyld &amp\; Philly D\n\n__________
 _____________\n\nOn Friday July 14th we are very excited to host our UNITY
  DANCE EXHIBITION &amp\; BEATBOX BATTLE at UNDERPASS PARK\, under the East
 ern Avenue\, Richmond and Adelaide Overpasses. The DANCE EXHIBITION featur
 es Toronto's top youth nand professional street dancers in a number of dif
 ferent battles highlighting hip-hop\, breaking\, popping\, and house\, Our
  first round will focus on the community youth and alumni who have develop
 ed their skills alongside the guidance of Unity's program faciliatators.\n
 \nFor the second round\, selected mentors from various established dance c
 rews will battle alongside their top students against other mentor/student
  crews. And for our last round\, a number of the most well-respected crews
  including CASINO BOYS\, TENSE IMAGE\, ALIBINO ZEBRAZ\, WAREHOUSE JACKS\, 
 and many more will face off against each other for the first time on Unity
 's dancefloor.\n\nOnce again\, BEATBOX CANADA\, the most respected champio
 n of the beatbox community will showcase the underrated art of vocal percu
 ssion with an epic battle between Toronto's top beatboxers in a 1 vs 1 mus
 ical battle for 20 years and under. Battle judges are Unity Alumni PARALLE
 L (Sparx &amp\; Psyreine) and WORDOFMOUF (Killabeatz &amp\; Subconcious) w
 ill represent this art as a part of the human narrative and beatboxers as 
 true musicians while inspiring young talent to pursue new ways of artistic
  expression through their performances. Unity Festival Dance Exhibition
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2017/07/18950987_10155535362909391_6040676884848269140_n.jpg
CATEGORIES:Hip Hop,House
LOCATION:Underpass Park\, 29 Lower River Street\, Toronto\, Canada\, M5A 1M
 6\, Canada
GEO:43.6560117;-79.35509200000001
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=29 Lower River Street\, Tor
 onto\, Canada\, M5A 1M6\, Canada;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Underpass Park
 :geo:43.6560117,-79.35509200000001
END:VEVENT
