URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/workshops-with-2x-world-salsa-cham
 pion-anya-katsevman-from-new-york-city-at-steps-dance-studio-sat-july-15-s
 un-july-16/
SUMMARY:Workshops with 2x World Salsa Champion Anya Katsevman from New York
  City at Steps Dance Studio Sat. July 15 &amp\; Sun. July 16
DESCRIPTION:Workshops with 2x World Salsa Champion Anya Katsevman from New 
 York City at Steps Dance Studio\, Sat. July 15 &amp\; Sun. July 16\nDon't 
 miss this opportunity to learn from one of the world's best instructors! O
 riginally from Kiev Ukraine\, Anya Katsevman has already enjoyed a success
 ful ballroom dancing career that included many prestigious titles. After\,
  she began dancing salsa and together with Luis Aguilar\, she became the t
 wo-time World Salsa champion in the on 2 division. With over 20 years’ s
 tage\, competition and teaching experience\, Anya is sought after worldwid
 e for teaching\, performing\, competition coaching\, choreographing and ju
 dging.\n\nSat. July 15\n1pm-2pm Leading &amp\; Following Technique\, all l
 evels\n2pm-3pm Musicality\, all levels\n3pm-4pm New York Style Salsa on 2\
 , intermediate\n4pm-5:30pm Competition Training Workshop\, all levels (for
  anyone interested in competing in the future in heats or showcases)\n\nJo
 in us Saturday night for our Steps Studio Party from 8pm-1am with special 
 guest Anya Katsevman. See the events page at www.stepsdancestudio.com for 
 more info.\n\nSun. July 16\n4pm-5pm Ladies Styling\, geared to levels 2-3\
 n5pm-6pm Ladies Performance Training\, open to levels 3 and higher\n\nPric
 es:\n1 hour: $25 adv/$30 at door\n2 hours: $45 adv/$50 at door\n3 hours: $
 60 adv/$70 at door\n4 hours: $75 adv/$90 at door\n5 hours: $90 adv/$110 at
  door\n1.5 hours Competition Training Workshop: $25 adv/$30 at door Worksh
 ops with 2x World Salsa Champion Anya Katsevman from New York City at Step
 s Dance Studio Sat. July 15 &amp\; Sun. July 16
