DESCRIPTION:Can't get enough partner dancing? Now you can dance both Ballro
 om and Salsa\, all in one night!\n\nDance Art is running Saturday Night da
 nces with both a Ballroom Latin and Salsa/Bachata Party with dance class i
 ncluded.  Attend one or both dances! Dance Ballroom from 7pm until 10 pm
  and then stay for the Salsa party (extra cost).\n\nLocation:  Large Banq
 uet Hall near Dvp &amp\; Eglinton\,  with Air Conditioning and free parki
 ng!\n\nPartner Not Required.\n\nFirst Dance Session\n\n 	Ballroom\, Latin\
 , Social Dancing\, Strict Tempo\, 7-10pm\,\n 	Lesson Included\, 7-8pm\,\n 
 	Social Dance 8-10pm\n\nSecond Dance Session\n\n 	Salsa Bachata Social Dan
 cing 10pm-12.30am\n 	Lesson Included at 10pm - 10.30pm\,\n 	Dancing 10.30p
 m -12.30am\n\nCost :$10 At the Door for each dance session\, or stay for b
 oth $20\, 7:00pm until after midnight\n\nBring Flats/ Or Flexible Sole Sho
 es Or Dance Shoes With Suede Sole\n\nRefreshments will be provided.\n\n&nb
 sp\; Saturday Night Dual Dances @ Dvp And Eglinton
