URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/steps-studio-party-with-guest-anya
 -katsevman-new-york-city/
SUMMARY:Steps Studio Party With Guest Anya Katsevman\, New York City
DESCRIPTION:Studio 1: Salsa Dance Lesson\, 8pm-9pm\nStudio 1: Salsa &amp\; 
 Bachata Music\, 9pm - 1am\, DJ Ef\n\nStudio 2: Hustle Lesson\, 8pm-9pm\nSt
 udio 2: Hustle\, West Coast &amp\; Top 40 Music\, 9pm - midnight\, DJ DeTo
 x\n\nCash bar. Meet other students and dancers. Practice what you have lea
 rned in a relaxed &amp\; friendly environment. Not confident to use some d
 ance moves in the nightclub yet? Try them here first. Dance with your fell
 ow classmates\, Toronto dancers and your instructors. Join us for a fun le
 sson and stay to party. All ages and all levels welcome\, including non St
 eps students and dancers. No partner necessary - everyone dances with ever
 yone and most people rotate partners after every song.\n\nSpecial Amateur 
 Salsa &amp\; Bachata Heated Competition! This is about having fun on the d
 ance floor and improvising to the music! Join our fun &amp\; friendly comp
 etition on Sat. July 15th and you may win a prize!\n\nNo preparation neces
 sary - just social dance to a song(s) chosen by the DJ. You must sign up w
 ith a partner. Multiple couples dance on the floor at one time. Couples ar
 e being judged based on their timing\, musicality\, technique and showmans
 hip (i.e. how much fun they are having!). Divisions for Salsa Level 1-3\, 
 Salsa 4-5\, Bachata 1-2\, Bachata 3-5.\n\nEntry fee $5 per person per divi
 sion. You may enter your level plus one level up. Anyone can enter the com
 petition\, you do not have to be a Steps student to enter. Register for th
 e competition in advance by emailing Jennifer@stepsdancestudio.com or regi
 ster the day of the party. Registration closes at 10pm. Competition at 11p
 m.\n\nAdmission: $10 all night long Steps Studio Party With Guest Anya Kat
 sevman\, New York City
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2017/05/july_studio-party-anya.jpg
CATEGORIES:Bachata,Salsa
LOCATION:Steps Dance Studio - 819 Yonge\, 819 Yonge Street\, 3rd floor\, To
 ronto\, Ontario\, M4W 2G9\, Canada
GEO:43.67260580000001;-79.38748169999997
