URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/dancing-pier-star-big-band/
SUMMARY:Dancing on the Pier with All Star Big Band
DESCRIPTION:Dancing on the Pier is back weekly  this summer on Toronto's f
 avourite open-air dance floor.\n\nOne of the most exciting bands around\, 
 the Toronto All-Star Big Band revives the spirit style and sound of the 30
 s\, 40s and 50s – the golden age of big bands. Armed with brilliant prog
 ramming\, choreography and engaging cultural nostalgia\, this vibrant cast
  of awesome young talent has earned its position at the top list of presen
 ters throughout Ontario and in the USA.\n\nThe Toronto All Star Big Band e
 ntertains as usual.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/EKkDdko5J24?t=9s\n\nDancing on the
  Pier continues on Thursday evenings until August 31.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/
 rHXk2JBbm7Y\n\nEvery Thursday grab your partner\, put on your dancing shoe
 s and take a free dance class on Toronto’s waterfront. Styles of dance a
 re inspired by Harbourfront’s summer festivals\, varying from week to we
 ek including Flamenco\, Tango\, Swing\, Celtic\, and Latin. With dance ins
 tructors on site and live bands providing the tunes.  See the full list 
 here. And it's all free! Dancing on the Pier with All Star Big Band
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2017/07/dancing-on-the-pier-2.jpg
CATEGORIES:Swing
LOCATION:Harbourfront Centre\, 235 Queens Quay West\, Toronto\, Ontario\, G
 TA\, Canada
GEO:43.638847;-79.382996
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=235 Queens Quay West\, Toro
 nto\, Ontario\, GTA\, Canada;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Harbourfront Centr
 e:geo:43.638847,-79.382996
END:VEVENT
