SUMMARY:Foundations of Middle eastern dance with Itzel (Summer session)
DESCRIPTION:Summer 2017 session has started!\nEvery Wednesday evening from 
 July 5th to August 30th\, Join me to learn and review the foundation of Mi
 ddle Eastern Dance! all levels are welcome from total beginners to experts
 .\n\nWHERE: 100 Sheppard Avenue EAST (Yonge/Sheppard intersection)\nWHEN: 
 Every WEDNESDAY evening from 7:30pm to 9pm\n\nSUPER SPECIAL SAVING:\n\nONL
 Y DURING THE SUMMER SESSION 2 DANCERS FOR THE PRICE OF ONE! For drop-in or
  summer class cards if two of you register pay only the price of 1! (last 
 class Aug 30)\n\nThe class will have a different focus subject every week:
  Drop-ins are encouraged or buy a pack of multiple sessions to be danced b
 y AUG 30.\n\nWHAT to expect:\nEvery class will have it's own subject durin
 g the summer\n** Foundation technique (syllabus of moves) and combinations
  for DANCERS\n** Foundation Rhythms and styles.\n** Dancing for Performanc
 e level (advanced combination\, classical songs\, guided improvisation\, i
 nterpretation)\n\nPrice (HST tax included):\n-&gt\; 4 classes card $125\n-
 &gt\; cash drop-in $28\n\nSUPER SPECIAL SAVING:\n\nEntrance to the studio 
 and parking at the back of the building\nFerrero Building\n(second light f
 rom Yonge &amp\; Sheppard intersection to East\,\nexactly on Sheppard &amp
 \; Kenneth Ave. intersection)\nthe location is great\, close to Whole Food
 s\, parking and a few minutes from the 401!\n\nvisitor parking price: from
  6pm visitor parking is a flat fee of 3CAN Foundations of Middle eastern d
 ance with Itzel (Summer session)
