SUMMARY:Dancing on the Pier with Zuze and Mayada Belly Dance
DESCRIPTION:Dancing on the Pier is back weekly  this summer on Toronto's f
 avourite open-air dance floor.\n\nZuze\nZuze is a 10-piece folk-jazz ensem
 ble dedicated to interpreting Iranian pop/cabaret melodies to afrobeat rhy
 thms. The confluence of brass\, woodwinds\, strings\, and percussion creat
 e broad avenues for textural possibility. Zuze requires no pre-requisite i
 n Iranian culture &amp\; dance\; merely an open-mind and a willingness to 
 engage in the immediate experience of the wide world at our doorstep.\n\nM
 ayada Belly Dance\nMayada has taught bellydance classes across Toronto at 
 various venues\, as well as running specialty workshops across the contine
 nt. A background in fitness and personal training gives Mayada an informed
  perspective on the anatomy of movement\, which she designs her teaching a
 round. In September 2003\, Mayada opened Fierce Fitness\, giving her the o
 pportunity to share her experience and expertise by teaching at her own st
 udio.\n\nDancing on the Pier continues on Thursday evenings until August 3
 1.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/rHXk2JBbm7Y\n\nEvery Thursday grab your partner\, p
 ut on your dancing shoes and take a free dance class on Toronto’s waterf
 ront. Styles of dance are inspired by Harbourfront’s summer festivals\, 
 varying from week to week including Flamenco\, Tango\, Swing\, Celtic\, an
 d Latin. With dance instructors on site and live bands providing the tunes
 .  See the full list here. And it's all free! Dancing on the Pier with Z
 uze and Mayada Belly Dance
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2017/07/dancing-on-the-pier-2.jpg
CATEGORIES:African,Bellydance,Jazz
LOCATION:Harbourfront Centre\, 235 Queens Quay West\, Toronto\, Ontario\, G
 TA\, Canada
GEO:43.638847;-79.382996
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=235 Queens Quay West\, Toro
 nto\, Ontario\, GTA\, Canada;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Harbourfront Centr
 e:geo:43.638847,-79.382996
END:VEVENT
