SUMMARY:Toronto International Youth Dance Festival 2017
DESCRIPTION:Join us at 2017 Toronto International Youth Dance Festival!\n\n
 The Festival celebrates cultural diversity through the art of dance. Speci
 fically\, we focus on youth dancers\, with participation ranging from loca
 l to international dance schools. Opening ceremony begins July 28th\, at 7
 pm. The festival continues the next day (29th) with the main competitions\
 , and then concludes with a closing ceremony on the 30th.\n\nThe event is 
 free to the public. There will also be food vendors and merchant vendors p
 resent throughout the three-day event. This year\, we are also pleased to 
 announce we are partnered with SickKids\, which means we will be donating 
 a portion of our revenue to support their wonderful work!\n\nIf you are da
 ncers and would like to participate in our showcase and competition\, plea
 se feel free to contact us to register.\n\nOur qualifications:\n\n- Partic
 ipants must be between 6-25 years old.\n- All dance styles are welcomed.\n
 \nToronto International Youth Dance Festival video:\n\nhttps://www.youtube
 .com/watch?v=dHYYbAUoIuY\n\n&nbsp\; Toronto International Youth Dance Fest
 ival 2017
