SUMMARY:AFRO-CUBAN Classes (Ongoing)
DESCRIPTION:On-going Afro-Cuban Classes every Tuesday\, 7-8pm\, all levels 
 welcome!\n\nLearn Afro-Cuban dance\, featuring dances of the Orishas (Yoru
 ba tradition) as well as dances of Congo origin. Learn the roots of Cuban 
 dance\, while breaking a sweat and having fun! Steps are broken down in a 
 patient and organic way.\nFor the savvy salsa dancer this is a great way o
 f improving your flavour and repertoire of moves.\n\nVideo demo:\n\nhttps:
 //www.youtube.com/watch?v=CbiV04b9J7E\n\n&nbsp\; AFRO-CUBAN Classes (Ongoi
 ng)
