SUMMARY:Dancing on the Pier with Recipee Band and Cadence Academy
DESCRIPTION:Dancing on the Pier is back weekly  this summer on Toronto's f
 avourite open-air dance floor.\n\nThe Recipee Band\nThe Recipee Band's ded
 ication to constant learning\, staying current with music now and before\,
  along with being rooted in the origins of rock\, soul\, funk\, country\, 
 jazz\, reggae and blues ensures that they will find the right "mix" for an
 y crowd they are put in front of. Always a great time\, always the perfect
  Recipee!\n\nCadence Dance Academy\nCadence Dance Academy is known for its
  creativity\, professionalism\, unique teaching styles and charisma. Caden
 ce Dance Academy instructs\, trains\, and performs both locally and intern
 ationally in order to sharpen its skills and continue its growth. As train
 ed professionals in Salsa\, Afro-Cuban\, Cha-Cha\, Bachata\, Hip-Hop\, Dan
 cehall\, and many other genres of dance\, the company actively respects an
 d cherishes its art\, and continues to spread the joy of dance to others.
 \n\nDancing on the Pier continues on Thursday evenings until August 31.\n\
 nhttps://youtu.be/rHXk2JBbm7Y\n\nEvery Thursday grab your partner\, put on
  your dancing shoes and take a free dance class on Toronto’s waterfront.
  Styles of dance are inspired by Harbourfront’s summer festivals\, varyi
 ng from week to week including Flamenco\, Tango\, Swing\, Celtic\, and Lat
 in. With dance instructors on site and live bands providing the tunes.  S
 ee the full list here. And it's all free! Dancing on the Pier with Recipe
 e Band and Cadence Academy
