URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/butoh-practice/
SUMMARY:Butoh Practice
DESCRIPTION:Happening around the first Saturday of every month 2-5 pm\, thi
 s proposed gathering is a not for profit participant-run experimental prac
 tice\, exploration\, and collaborative learning of the art of butoh dance.
  We are very excited to organize this proposed ongoing collective practice
 \, which we hope will help to further foster this art in our city.\n\nNo p
 rior experience of the dance is needed\; just a willingness to contribute 
 and engage with creative ideas of other participant-movers. You may bring 
 music\, visuals\, poetry\, or anything basically that you think will stimu
 late our collective practice.\n\nPlease contact us if you have any questio
 ns\, suggestions\, or comments. Depending on the attendance\, we can make 
 our practice more frequent. We will have something prepared to get us star
 ted. We hope to see you soon! Butoh Practice
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2017/06/butoh-dance-workshop.jpg
