URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/fundraiser-for-dancer-killed-in-cr
 ash/
SUMMARY:Fundraiser for Alexander Shutov Funeral
DESCRIPTION:Toronto's salsa dance community is saddened by the loss of one 
 of their participants\, Alex Shutov\, just 34 years old. Due to cars stop
 ping abruptly at a construction site he was killed on Hwy. 48 in a horrifi
 c five-vehicle crash involving three gravel trucks\, a cube van\, and an S
 UV on Thursday July 27.\n\nThe Sunday Salsa Social\, which attracts dancer
 s from all over Toronto\, is hosting a fundraiser for Alex Shutov on the 
 August Civic Holiday long weekend.  Their goal is to raise a minimum of $
 5\,000 for a funeral and small ceremony.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/DGqV5y6DAE4\n
 \n&nbsp\; Fundraiser for Alexander Shutov Funeral
CATEGORIES:Bachata,Cha Cha,Salsa
