URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/dusk-dances-at-withrow-park/
SUMMARY:Dusk Dances at Withrow Park
DESCRIPTION:In its 23rd season\, Dusk Dances is an enchanting outdoor dance
  festival that brings high quality urban\, contemporary and traditional da
 nce to Withrow Park. Audiences are invited to enjoy works by top Canadian 
 choreographers and participate in free dance workshops.\n\nAn event for al
 l ages! Bring your chairs and blankets\, and get ready for a breathtaking 
 evening of live performances!\n\nWhen: Aug 7 - Aug 13\, 2017\n\nNightly Pe
 rformances Monday\, August 7th to Sunday\, August 13th\n- Opening band and
  dance workshop at 7:00 pm\n- Dance performances at 7:30 pm\n\nDaytime Per
 formances Thursday\, August 10th and Sunday\, August 13th:\n- Opening band
  and dance workshop at 2:00pm\n- Dance performances at 2:30 pm\n**Thursday
  and Sunday will have both daytime and evening performances\n\nPrice: Pay-
 What-You-Can (suggested contribution $15.00 per person)\n\nSchedule:\n- Fr
 ee YogaDance class by master teacher Marla Meenakshi Joy (Downward Dog Yog
 a Centre)\n- Opening band – Swaha\n- Hosted by Allegra Charleston\n\nPer
 formances:\n\n 	Rawrabide by Ofilio Sinbadinho\n 	Dusk Society by Rhodnie 
 Désir\n 	Homing Spirits by Sashar Zarif\n 	New Animal (excerpt) by Compan
