SUMMARY:Dancing on the Pier with Lissa Monet
DESCRIPTION:Dancing on the Pier is back weekly  this summer on Toronto's f
 avourite open-air dance floor.\n\nLissa Monet\nInventive and energetic\, L
 issa pleases crowds while controlling the vibe of the party mixing musical
  genres such as R&amp\;B\, hip hop\, soul\, house/dance\, rock\, reggae an
 d her favourite\, '80s classics. A one-of-a-kind talent\, DJ Lissa Monét 
 has captivated taste makers\, party goers and music lovers with ego-free t
 alent that delivers the right music and vibe to events that she has spun a
 t with modesty and intelligence.\n\nDancing on the Pier continues on Thurs
 day evenings until August 31.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/rHXk2JBbm7Y\n\nEvery Thu
 rsday grab your partner\, put on your dancing shoes and take a free dance 
 class on Toronto’s waterfront. Styles of dance are inspired by Harbourfr
 ont’s summer festivals\, varying from week to week including. With dance
  instructors on site and live bands providing the tunes.  See the full li
 st here. And it's all free! Dancing on the Pier with Lissa Monet
