SUMMARY:Steps Studio Party
DESCRIPTION:Studio 1: Bachata Dance Lesson\, 8pm-9pm\nStudio 1: Salsa &amp\
 ; Bachata Music\, 9pm - midnight\, DJ Ef\n\nStudio 2: Hustle Lesson\, 8pm-
 9pm\nStudio 2: Hustle\, West Coast &amp\; Top 40 Music\, 9pm - midnight\, 
 DJ DeTox\n\nCash bar. Meet other students and dancers. Practice what you h
 ave learned in a relaxed &amp\; friendly environment. Not confident to use
  some dance moves in the nightclub yet? Try them here first. Dance with yo
 ur fellow classmates\, Toronto dancers and your instructors. Join us for a
  fun lesson and stay to party. All ages and all levels welcome\, including
  non Steps students and dancers. No partner necessary - everyone dances wi
 th everyone and most people rotate partners after every song.\n\nPrice: $1
 0 per person all night long (includes lesson) Steps Studio Party
