 enced instructors\n 	Tuition is $425/month + HST\n 	Complimentary group cl
 asses\, workshops\, socials\, practice space\n 	Dancers lead and follow\n 
 	Discounted private lesson rates\n 	16-month program (no commitment\, pay 
 monthly)\, 4-month terms\n 	Study with other committed dancers who share y
 our passion\n 	Opportunities for assisting to get practical experience\n 	
