 \n\nLearn the thorough technique\, theory and other aspects of dance such 
 as musicality\, history and so much more. (Choreography\, designing progra
 ms\, goal setting\, staying motivated\, learning styles)\n\nFor more info\
 , fill in the "More Info" form.\n\n&nbsp\; Ballroom Certification Program 
 starting SEPT 2017
