SUMMARY:Women’s Pound® Rockout Workout Class
DESCRIPTION:POUND® is the world’s first cardio jam session inspired by t
 he infectious\, energizing and sweat-dripping fun of playing the drums. If
  you’ve always wanted to try drumming\, and like Hip Hop\, Rock and Trap
  music\, you’ll want to try this class out.\n\nClasses are beginner-frie
 ndly and medium impact to accommodate those from most fitness levels.\nMus
 t bring a Yoga mat/old towel for sitting and drumming.\n\nHappily welcomin
 g teenage girls to create a space for mom and daughter fitness time.\n\nTo
  register/class schedule\, please visit our website.\n\n&nbsp\; Women’s 
 Pound® Rockout Workout Class
