 ass/
SUMMARY:Women’s Bollywood Dance City Fit Class
DESCRIPTION:Bollywood City Fitness is a dance workout that combines South A
 sian and Middle Eastern rhythms and easy-to-follow exercises and movements
  to create a fun and exhilarating workout. Expect a class filled with exot
 ic rhythms all the way from India to Egypt right here in the city. No danc
 e experience required. Classes are always beginner-friendly and low to med
 ium impact to accommodate those from all fitness levels.\n\nHappily welcom
 ing teenage girls to create a space for mom and daughter fitness time.\n\n
 To register/for class schedule\, please visit our website. Women’s Bolly
 wood Dance City Fit Class
