URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/free-introductory-womens-bollywood
 -city-fitness-class/
SUMMARY:Free Introductory Women’s Bollywood City Fitness Class
DESCRIPTION:Fusion Cardio Toronto is pleased to offer one-time introductory
  spots in the Women’s Bollywood City Fitness class for new beginners-onl
 y to promote a 14-week class in the Fall.\n\nJoin me for an exhilarating d
 ance workout to the beautiful rhythms spanning from South Asia to the Midd
 le East. No dance experience required. This is a low to medium impact clas
 s to accommodate women of all fitness levels and ages. Totally welcoming m
