SUMMARY:Company Member Auditions - Momentum Dance Toronto
DESCRIPTION:JOIN MDT FOR OUR EXCITING 8TH SEASON!\n\nSeeking male &amp\; fe
 male dancers who want to bring their ballet modern\, jazz\, tap and/or hip
  hop talents to the stage again.\nOur dancers seek an outlet outside of th
 eir busy working lives to develop their training\, choreograph\, perform a
 nd build friendships along the way.\n\nSome previous dance experience requ
 ired. Other dance experience will also be considered.\n\n** PLEASE NOTE TH
 IS IS NOT FOR PAID WORK **\nThose invited into the performance company wil
 l be required to pay an ANNUAL MEMBERSHIP FEE.\n\nDATE: Wednesday\, Septem
 ber 6th\, 2016\n6:30 pm- Registration starts\n7:00 pm- Contemporary / Jazz
  audition CLASS &amp\; CHOREOGRAPHY\n\nPLEASE PRE-REGISTER by visiting our
  website and downloading our pre-registration form.\nIf you cannot make it
  on Sept. 7th\, but would still love the opportunity to audition\, please 
 let us know.\nWE LOOK FORWARD TO MEETING YOU and hopefully making the audi
 tion a FUN experience for you! Company Member Auditions - Momentum Dance T
 oronto
