SUMMARY:Beginner Flamenco
DESCRIPTION:INTRODUCTION TO FLAMENCO (Valerie)\nSept 7 – Oct 26 (8 weeks)
 \nAll the basics of flamenco will be covered in a fun but thorough way and
  emphasis will be on learning correct posture and how to do footwork and a
 rm work pertaining to flamenco while learning a lively choreography! Stude
 nts can wear any comfortable workout clothes and shoes with a bit of heel 
 that fit securely on the foot like character shoes or enclosed dress shoes
  with low heels. No running shoes or sandals. We can eventually order spec
 ialty flamenco shoes for students who wish to continue in flamenco. Give u
 s a call or email us to inquire further about shoes.\nRegistration: $130 f
 or 8 weeks (includes taxes)\nFill out the more info tab to register.\nStud
 ents must register in advance for the 8 weeks. Beginner Flamenco
