SUMMARY:Kinima Dance Presents: Loss Project
DESCRIPTION:Loss Project is a series of films curated and produced by Kinim
 a Dance. Focusing on bringing individuals who have faced loss in their liv
 es to a moment in time where they can be deep in the process of movement w
 hile honouring their experience within loss. Not in an effort to bring clo
 sure or change their journey\, individuals from every walk of life were gi
 ven a full day to have a movement piece created from their own kinesthetic
  experience and subsequently have it filmed.\n\nThe final piece of the puz
 zle is now here! September 15th\, lets honour our communities experiences 
 of loss by witnessing it on stage and in film.\n\nTickets are 10 online in
  advance and 15 at the door. General admission.\n\nhttp://www.brownpaperti
 ckets.com/event/3067522 Kinima Dance Presents: Loss Project
