SUMMARY:Karishma Chavan Master Class Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Bringing you a fresh mind to dance Shadow Entertainment present
 s Karishma Chavan from Mumbai\, India. She has over 12 years of work exper
 ience\, worked in more than 100 projects\, 10 reality shows and more than 
 25 Bollywood movies.\n\nShe has choreographed almost everyone in Bollywood
  to name a few\; Amitabh Bachan\, Shah Rukh Khan\, Ranveer Singh\, Akshay 
 Kumar\, Deepika Padukone\, Priyanka Chopra\, Saif Ali Khan\, Jacqueline Fe
 rnandez\, Katrina Kaif\, Sonam Kapoor and many more.\n\nDont miss your cha
 nce to take up on this opportunity for this pop up workshop. Limited spots
  available and EMT will required for spot reservation.\n\nWho: Karishma Ch
 avan\nWhen: September 16th &amp\; September 17th\nCost: One day ($35) Both
  Days ($50)\nTime: 4-6pm (2 Hour Workshop Each Day)\nWhere: DancelifeX\n61
 9 Yonge St\nToronto\, ON\n\n&nbsp\; Karishma Chavan Master Class Workshop
