SUMMARY:Audition Dance ConneXion\, Yamulee and Alma Latina Toronto Fall 201
 7
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to learn WORLD CLASS Choreography and Technique from 
 the BEST DANCE COMPANIES IN THE WORLD!\n\nWelcome to the AUDITIONS for the
  Performance Teams for Fall 2017!!\n\nAre you ready to join the Dance Conn
 eXion \, Yamulee Project Toronto\, or Alma Toronto performance teams? This
  is your chance to learn exciting\, challenging and sexy choreographies\, 
 directed by 3-time Canadian Bachata Champion &amp\; multi time Toronto Sal
 sa Champion Tania Wong.\n\nWe will be auditioning for the following levels
 :\n\n 	Salsa ADVANCED Performance Team\n 	Salsa AMATEUR Performance team\n
  	Bachata PRO-AM Performance Team\n 	Bachata ADVANCED Performance Team\n 	
 Bachata AMATEUR Performance team...\n 	Ladies Styling Team (All Levels)\n\
 nDepending on the final selected teams\, rehearsal location could be eithe
 r in Markham\, Downtown or North York.\n\nAudition: September 16th Saturda
 y\n\n4:30 pm - 5:15 pm: Salsa (All Levels)\n5:15 pm - 6:00 pm - Bachata (A
 ll levels)\n\nFor registration\, please reach the venue 15 minutes before 
 your audition time\n\nIt will be in the format of a workshop\, and you wil
 l be learning a shines and partner work sequence\n\nFee: $5\n\nPut on your
  Dancing Shoes and see you all there!! :) Audition Dance ConneXion\, Yamul
 ee and Alma Latina Toronto Fall 2017
