SUMMARY:CUBA BAILA 2017
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to Toronto's second annual CUBA BAILA Cuban Dance weeke
 nd!\n\nJoin us at Lula Music and Arts Center for a weekend full of Cuban m
 usic\, dance and culture! This year we are bringing together some of Toron
 to's top musicians and dancers along with an international artist to get y
 ou moving and grooving all weekend long!\n\nA Gozarrrrrrrrr!!!\n\nCost:\n$
 150 Early Bird - ( All Workshops &amp\; Concerts )\n$175/ all weekend - ( 
 All Workshops &amp\; Concerts )\n$70/day Pass (Sat OR Sun Workshops)\n$20 
 drop-in/per class\n$30 Concert Pass (Access to concerts only on Friday\, S
 aturday and Sunday night )\n\nPlease note there will be no refunds.\nQuest
 ions or to register: cubabailatoronto@gmail.com\n\nFRIDAY\n\n 	 Cuba Jazz
  with Kervin Barreto - 7:30-8:30pm\n 	Dance Class with Santos Lee at 9:30p
 m\n 	Community Conga ( featuring professional and amateur dancers and musi
 cians )\n 	Café Cubano 10:30pm\n\nSATURDAY WORKSHOPS:\n10:00 - 11:00 AM: 
 Percussion/music\n11:00 - 11.30 AM: Warm up\n11.30 - 12.30 PM: Afro-Cuban\
 nLUNCH (1hr)\n1.30 - 2.30 PM: Salsa con Timba\n2.30 - 3.30 PM: Rueda de Ca
 sino\nEVENING\nDance Class with Dreyser García\n\nBand: Charangón del No
 rte\n\nSUNDAY WORKSHOPS:\n10:00 - 10:30 AM: Warm-Up\n10:30 - 11:30 AM: Rum
 ba\n11:30 AM - 12:30 PM: Son\nLUNCH (1hr)\n1:30 PM - 2:30 PM: Mambo &amp\;
  Pilón\n2:30 PM - 3:30 PM: Styling and shines\n\nEVENING\nDoor open at 7p
 m\n\nDance Performance by:\n- City Dance Corps\n- Shum de Salsa\n- CU Danc
 e\n\n(more to be announced)\n\nBand: Guaracha y Son\n\nWE HOPE TO SEE YOU!
  CUBA BAILA 2017
