SUMMARY:Zumbini Class
DESCRIPTION:Designed for children ages 0-4\, and their caregivers\, Zumbini
  combines music and movement to create the ultimate bonding experience! Si
 ng\, dance\, and play together while developing your little one’s social
 \, cognitive\, emotional and motor skills.\n\n20 Original Songs\nTake home
  the same music you heard in class to listen at home or in the car!\n\nSon
 gbook\nIncludes song lyrics\, with fun animations that go with the songs\n
 \nPlushtoy\nA little treat for your little one\n\nThis Zumbini session inc
 ludes 8 classes\, 45 minutes each. They take place on Tuesdays\, from 10am
  to 10:45am\, September 26 — November 14\, 2017.\n\nSession Price (8 cla
 sses + a Zumbini Bundle)\nFirst child $164.57 CAD\nAdditional children $13
 0.73 CAD\n\nAdditional Information\nJCC Member Value Fee: $155 | EARLY BIR
 D SPECIAL: Sign up by September 19 and get $15 OFF! | Try a FREE demo on S
 eptember 19. Register at www.zumbini.com/demo-classes/331 | The Prosserman
  JCC is located on Bathurst Street just north of Sheppard on the West side
  of Bathurst if driving north. When driving to the building\, please enter
  the long curving driveway off Bathurst Street\, just north of Sheppard on
  the west side where you will see the Sherman Campus sign for 4588/4600 Ba
 thurst Street. Follow the road around and you will reach the security gate
 . If a guard is present\, you will be asked the purpose of your visit and 
 then directed to the first parking lot on the right for the Prosserman JCC
 . If there is no guard present\, simply press the intercom button and a gu
 ard will answer shortly. Please park in the first parking lot on the right
  in any visitor spot. Follow the foot path along the right-hand side of th
 e building around to the east side (facing Bathurst Street) where you will
  enter through the main doors of the Prosserman JCC. You will now be on th
 e ground level at our reception. Inside the building there are monitors th
 at list the room locations of all events and programs in the building for 
 that day. Take the elevators to the desired floor. Please register here: h
 ttps://www.prossermanjcc.com/pjcc_children_teens_families/zumbini.html (Ea
 rly Bird Special Promo Code: zumbini755 -- valid until Sep 19).\n\nCancell
 ation Policy\nCancel before September 15\, 2017 to receive a $164.57 CAD r
 efund\nCancel between September 16\, 2017 and September 24\, 2017 to recei
 ve $130.73 CAD refund\nCancel between September 25\, 2017 and September 25
 \, 2017 to receive $0.00 CAD refund Zumbini Class
