DESCRIPTION:An evening mixing live improvised music\, dj'd tracks and ecsta
 tic dance..This is our first of a monthly series that will blend live drum
 s with ecstatic dance\, on a barefoot dancefloor!\n\nMusic by:\n\nRahul Ba
 der (Drums. Handpan) - Raja Rhythmics\nTim Djentle  (World Percussion) 
 - Ripple Rhythm\nGregorian Beats (DJ)\n\n\nJoin us for our first monthly
  ecstatic dance combining world drums\, natural soundscapes\, and global g
 rooves... A journey of tribal sounds\, guided meditations and conscious mo
 vement.\n\nTeas and snacks will be complimentary. This is a sober space. W
 e will open with a guided meditation by Elena Klymenko and close with a 
 juicy sound bath courtesy of Jesse Buck\n\nTribal. Ecstatic. Rhythm.\n\nP
 urchase tickets here - http://www.brownpapertickets.com/event/3084099\n\n
