URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/introduction-to-belly-dance/
SUMMARY:Introduction to Belly Dance
DESCRIPTION:New to belly dance? This is the class for you!\n\nThis primer c
 lass is where to start\, as it will help you to understand the movements t
 hat create all styles of belly dance. We focus on technique created throug
 h isolations and it is here that we begin the muscular training required t
 o execute these beautiful movements. This class will focus on teaching a f
 ew fundamental body isolations\, with additional work on posture and body 
 awareness\, to start you on the path towards healthy dancing\, while provi
 ding you with a fun and fantastic\, low impact work out!\n\nWe recommend t
 hat as a new student to the art of belly dance\, you complete at least one
  full session of Introduction to Belly Dance before moving onto Basic Blac
 k classes. Introduction to Belly Dance
