 \, cognitive\, emotional and motor skills.\n\n20 Original Songs\nTake home
  the same music you heard in class to listen at home or in the car!\n\nSon
 gbook\nIncludes song lyrics\, with fun animations that go with the songs\n
 \nPlushtoy\nA little treat for your little one\n\nThis Zumbini session inc
 ludes 7 classes\, 45 minutes each. They take place on Wednesdays\, from 2:
 45pm to 3:30pm\, September 13 — October 25\, 2017.\n\nSession Price (7 c
 lasses + a Zumbini Bundle)\nFirst child $149.57 CAD\nAdditional children $
 76.38 CAD\nAlso $10.41 CAD class trials can be arranged if you are not rea
 dy to sign up for full session. Please contact the instructor to arrange y
 our trial.\n\nAdditional Information\nThe studio is just a 5-minute walk f
 rom Dundas West Station. There's tons of free parking in the rear of the b
 uilding in the Loblaws/LCBO plaza (entrance from Dundas Street). Please ob
 serve our NO outdoor shoe policy\; bring clean shoes or grip socks to each
  class. Facebook page: www.facebook.com/inTOzumbini.\n\nCancellation Polic
 y\nCancel before September 02\, 2017 to receive a $149.57 CAD refund\nCanc
 el between September 03\, 2017 and September 09\, 2017 to receive $115.73 
 CAD refund\nCancel between September 10\, 2017 and September 12\, 2017 to 
 receive $104.16 CAD refund Zumbini session (7 classes)
