SUMMARY:West Coast Swing Foundations
DESCRIPTION:4 week intensive for students new to West Coast Swing. West Co
 ast Swing is a great place for beginners to start and is incredibly practi
 cal: you can dance it to almost any music: Top 40\, Blues\, Hip Hop\, RnB\
 , Big Band\, Jazz\, Country. What separates WCS from other partner dances\
 , it is famous for giving women much more freedom than other dances and in
 credibly improvisational. West Coast Swing Foundations workshop requires 
 no experience. You will learn all the foundation steps for this dance as w
 ell as the principles of connection\, leading and following. This class te
 aches only 100% leadable moves. Open to students in all levels. No prior
  West Coast Swing experience required. Once students have completed West C
 oast Swing Foundations (and with approval/assessment of instructor)\, they
  may join the West Coast Swing Level 2 weekly course.     Price: 
  $60 for 4 weeks. 10 and 20 Class Cards can also be used for this works
 hop. FREE for students with a monthly auto renew or annual membership.\nht
