 the Steps Snowball Party and other nightclubs or events in Toronto. A per
 formance class will help to improve your memory of turn patterns and shine
 s\, enhance your styling &amp\; body movement\, improve your timing and m
 usicality and learn dips and tricks. Unleash your inner performer\, incre
 ase your confidence on the dancefloor\, meet new people and have fun!  Ge
 ared to role neutral students or those that prefer to choose whether they 
 want to be a leader or follower and geared to those in levels 2 and 3 (or 
 with at least 6 months’ experience dancing Salsa).  Great for first t
 ime performers as well as students who have previously joined a performanc
