 e.\nPrice:  $250 for 14 weeks. Can pay in two installments\, October 2
 0 &amp\; December 1st.  Price for Steps monthly auto renew and annual me
 mbers: $150 for 14 weeks.\nhttps://www.stepsdancestudio.com/workshops/ Rol
