 , 9pm - midnight\, DJ DeTox  Cash bar.\n\nMeet other students and dan
 cers.  Practice what you have learned in a relaxed &amp\; friendly enviro
 nment.\n\nNot confident to use some dance moves in the nightclub yet?  
