 cers and your instructors.  Join us for a fun lesson and stay to party. 
   All ages and all levels welcome\, including non Steps students and da
 ncers.  No partner necessary - everyone dances with everyone and most p
 eople rotate partners after every song.\n\nPrice: $10 per person all night
  long (includes lesson)\nhttps://www.stepsdancestudio.com/events/ Steps St
