SUMMARY:Zumbini Class
DESCRIPTION:Designed for children ages 0-4\, and their caregivers\, Zumbini
  combines music and movement to create the ultimate bonding experience! Si
 ng\, dance\, and play together while developing your little one’s social
 \, cognitive\, emotional and motor skills.\n\n20 Original Songs\nTake home
  the same music you heard in class to listen at home or in the car!\n\nSon
 gbook\nIncludes song lyrics\, with fun animations that go with the songs\n
 \nPlushtoy\nA little treat for your little one\n\nThis Zumbini session inc
 ludes 8 classes\, 45 minutes each. They take place on Thursdays\, from 10a
 m to 10:45am\, October 26 - December 14\, 2017.\n\nSession Price (8 classe
 s + a Zumbini Bundle)\nFirst child $164.51 CAD\nAdditional children $130.7
 3 CAD\n\nAdditional Information\nJCC Member Value Fee: $155 | EARLY BIRD S
 PECIAL: Sign up by October 19 and get $15 OFF! | Try a FREE demo class on 
 October 19. Register at www.zumbini.com/demo-classes/330 | The Schwartz/Re
 isman Centre is located at the South/West corner of Bathurst/Lebovic Campu
 s Drive (Weldrick Rd)\, just North of Rutherford Rd. The entrances to our 
 building and parking lot are accessible from Lebovic Campus Drive only. Gu
 ests should enter from the security gatehouse from Lebovic Campus Drive. G
 uests receive FREE 2 hour parking. Underground parking is available. Progr
 am will be located on the second floor of the building in Studio A. Turn l
 eft when existing the elevator and continue down the hallway until you rea
 ch the Studio on your left side\, it will be the first studio. Please regi
 ster here: https://srcentre.ca/families/mini-gym-music-and-movement-fall-a
 ges-0-to-4.html (Early Bird Special Promo Code: zumbini755 -- valid until 
 Oct 19).\n\nCancellation Policy\nCancel before October 15\, 2017 to receiv
 e a $164.51 CAD refund\nCancel between October 16\, 2017 and October 24\, 
 2017 to receive $130.73 CAD refund\nCancel between October 25\, 2017 and O
 ctober 25\, 2017 to receive $0.00 CAD refund Zumbini Class
