DESCRIPTION:This Saturday\, dance in costume!\n\nThe Toronto Salsa Practice
  is a friendly\, informal weekly gathering of salsa dancers of all levels.
  No formal instruction - we practice or just dance for fun. You don't need
  to come with a partner.\n\nBringing together salsa dancers from all over 
 the GTA and 'way beyond for almost sixteen years - since January 2001.\n\n
 There are two sessions every Saturday: 3:30-5:30 and 5:30-8:00. Admission 
 to each is $5.\n\nLots more information (and tons of photos) at website (s
 ee link below) and www.facebook.com/pages/Toronto-Salsa-Practice/15963051
