DESCRIPTION:Fusion Cardio Toronto is excited to introduce their fun Mommy a
 nd Baby Latin Dance Fit class to their Spadina and Bloor location. This on
 e-time introductory class is promoting a 12-week class starting in January
 .\n\nLatin Dance Fit is a dance workout that combines easy to follow moves
  with Latin and International music and rhythms. This class has been adapt
 ed to create a fun and safe environment for moms to bond with their babies
  ( 5 months and up) and other Toronto moms while getting in a workout. No 
 dance experience is required. This is a low to medium impact workout to ac
 commodate women of all fitness levels.\n\nTo Save a Spot and For More Info
 \, Please Visit Eventbrite:\nhttps://www.eventbrite.ca/e/introductory-momm
 y-baby-latin-dance-fitness-class-tickets-38927693780 Introductory Mommy &a
