 alled Mambo or New York or Puerto Rican style Salsa). This crash course wo
 rkshop will teach you the Salsa on 2 fundamentals - basic timing\, turns a
 nd technique – to get you started to social dance Salsa on 2. After comp
 letion of the workshop\, you may join our Salsa on 2 weekly class. Open 
 to students in Salsa levels 3-5. No prior on 2 experience required.\nPrice
 :  $60 for 4 weeks. 10 and 20 Class Cards can also be used for this wor
 kshop. FREE for students with a monthly auto renew or annual membership.\n
