DESCRIPTION:Lua Shayenne Dance Company (LSDC) is having an exciting fall cr
 eating a new piece titled FRONTIERS | FRONTIÈRES. The piece speaks of our
  personal and collective history within man-made frontiers. With a premier
 e set for 2020\, we invite you to see the outcome of our first exploration
  in the studio. After our short showing\, join us in for a fun 1hr dance w
 orkshop led by LSDC dancers. All ages and all levels are welcome!\n\nNOV 3
  | DOORS: 7 30pm\, SHOW + WORKSHOP: 8PM\nWHERE: Canada's National Ballet S
 chool\, Studio Concourse (no heels allowed in the studio)| 400 Jarvis St\,
  Toronto\nFEE: PWYC (pay-what-you-can) suggested min of $20 All donations 
 over $25 will receive a charitable tax receipt! FRONTIERS | FRONTIÈRES in
 -studio showing + dance workshop
