SUMMARY:Caribana Dance Cardio - Week 4/6
DESCRIPTION:Carnival Spice is been hosting a 6-week dance “fit" challenge
  for those who are serious about transforming their health and wellness! T
 he challenge is designed to be fun and energetic for both the mind and bod
 y all with a Caribbean twist.\n\nAs featured on Breakfast Television\, Lul
 ulemon\, Toronto Sun and more\, the Carnival Spice dance cardio class fuse
 s Soca\, Latin and Dancehall music through a high-energy\, fitness experie
 nce that strengthens upper body\, lower body and core.\n\nJoin us for Cari
 bbean Dance Cardio on Saturday\, Nov. 11th.\n\nHOW TO REGISTER\n\nOnline**
