SUMMARY:OPEN DANCE CALL AUDITIONS FOR THE ILLUSIONISTS
DESCRIPTION:OPEN DANCE CALL AUDITIONS FOR THE ILLUSIONISTS\n\nBroadways big
 gest selling smash hit magic spectacular THE ILLUSIONISTS – Live From Br
 oadway has shattered box office records around the globe and is returning 
 for a second run at Toronto's PRINCESS OF WALES THEATRE. This show dazzles
  audiences of all ages with a powerful mix of the most outrageous and asto
 nishing acts ever seen on stage. It's packed with thrilling and sophistica
 ted magic of unprecedented proportions. Website: www.TheIllusionistsLive.c
 om\n\nProducers: The Works Entertainment\, Simon Painter and Tim Lawson\nD
 irector and Choreographer: Neil Dorward\nAssociate Director and Choreograp
 her: Jenn Rapp\n\n***ALL TALENT MUST BE A CANADIAN CITIZEN AND A TORONTO L
 OCAL***\n\n***ALL TALENT MUST BE NON-UNION***\n\n***ALL TALENT MUST HAVE A
  VALID PASSPORT***\n\nSEEKING:\nFemale Dancer/Magician Assistant: Age 20s 
 - mid 30s. Open ethnicity (seeking strong dancers of all diverse backgroun
 ds). Height 5'4 or shorter. NON-UNION. NOTES:\n• Looking for dancers wit
 h excellent physiques with edgy\, unique\, interesting\, stand out and foc
 used look\n• Acting ability is a strong plus\n• Must be comfortable da
 ncing in heels\n• Dancers must have a solid grounding in contemporary\, 
 jazz and hip hop\n\nMale Dancers/Magician Assistants: Age 20s - mid 30s. O
 pen ethnicity (seeking strong dancers of all diverse backgrounds). NON-UNI
 ON. NOTES:\n• Looking for dancers with excellent physiques with edgy\, u
 nique\, interesting\, stand out and focused look\n• Acting ability is a 
 strong plus\n• Interested in male dancers with B-boy and tumbling skills
  and tricks\n• Dancers must have a solid grounding in contemporary\, jaz
 z and hip hop\n\nREHEARSAL AND SHOW DATES/ INFO:\nRehearsals: December 3rd
 -9th\, 2017 (Springfield\, Ohio\, USA)\nToronto Opening: December 12th\, 2
 017 (Princess of Wales Theatre\, Toronto\, ON)\nPerformance Run: December 
 12th\, 2017 to January 7th\, 2018 (Princess of Wales Theatre\, Toronto\, O
 N)\nRATE: $850 Canadian week/ $40 daily per diem/ Double hotel accommodati
 on (when out of Toronto)\n\nAUDITION DATES AND INFORMATION:\nOPEN DANCE CA
 LL AUDITION DATE: MONDAY\, NOVEMBER 13TH\, 2017\nDANCERS – NON-UNION\nTi
 me: Sign in from 9:00am – 10:00am\nOPEN DANCE CALL LOCATION: DanceLife X
  Centre Studio\, 619 Yonge St #D\, Toronto\, ON\n\nWHAT TO BRING:\nFEMALES
 : ***ALL TALENT MUST BE A CANADIAN CITIZEN AND A TORONTO LOCAL***ALL TALEN
 T MUST BE NON-UNION***ALL TALENT MUST HAVE A VALID PASSPORT***\n• Those 
 auditioning must bring a current photo and resume (STAPLED BACK TO BACK). 
 Make sure your\ncontact info (email and phone number) is on the resume.\n
 • Comfortable dance shoes (PLEASE ALSO BRING HEELS)\n• Something you f
 eel comfortable dancing in\n• NO BAGGY CLOTHING\n\nMALES: ***ALL TALENT 
 MUST BE A CANADIAN CITIZEN AND A TORONTO LOCAL***ALL TALENT MUST BE NON-UN
 ION***ALL TALENT MUST HAVE A VALID PASSPORT***\n• Those auditioning must
  bring a current photo and resume (STAPLED BACK TO BACK). Make sure your\n
 contact info (email and phone number) is on the resume.\n• Comfortable d
 ance shoes\n• Something you feel comfortable dancing in\n• NO BAGGY CL
 OTHING\n\nWant to audition?\nYou do not need permission to attend the open
  dance call! All you need to do is read the notice and if you fit what we 
 are looking for\, please attend!\nYou do not need permission to attend!\n\
 nIf you have any questions please fill out the "info tab".\n\nNO PHONE CAL
 LS PLEASE OPEN DANCE CALL AUDITIONS FOR THE ILLUSIONISTS
