SUMMARY:Steps Studio Party 
DESCRIPTION:Studio 1: Bachata Dance Lesson\, 8pm-9pm Studio 1: Salsa &a
 mp\; Bachata Music\, 9pm - midnight\, DJ Ef\nStudio 2: Hustle Lesson\, 8pm
 -9pm Studio 2: Hustle\, West Coast &amp\; Top 40 Music\, 9pm - midnight\
 , DJ DeTox  Cash bar.  Meet other students and dancers.  Practice w
 hat you have learned in a relaxed &amp\; friendly environment.  Not confi
 dent to use some dance moves in the nightclub yet?  Try them here first
 .  Dance with your fellow classmates\, Toronto dancers and your inst
 ructors.  Join us for a fun lesson and stay to party.   All ages and all
  levels welcome\, including non Steps students and dancers.  No partner 
 necessary - everyone dances with everyone and most people rotate partner
 s after every song.   Special show by our Pro-Am performers!\nPrice: $1
 0 per person all night long (includes lesson)\nhttps://www.stepsdancestudi
 o.com/events/ Steps Studio Party 
