URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/caribana-dance-cardio-finale-for-t
 he-season/
SUMMARY:Caribana Dance Cardio - finale for the season
DESCRIPTION:Thank you to everyone who joined us the past 5 weeks. Last fini
 sh off the session with endless vibes!\nAs featured on Breakfast Televisio
 n\, Lululemon\, Toronto Sun and more\, the Carnival Spice dance cardio cla
 ss fuses Soca\, Latin and Dancehall music through a high-energy\, fitness 
 experience that strengthens upper body\, lower body and core.\n\nHOW TO RE
 GISTER:\nPlease bring exact cash OR visit eventbrite https://celebrationch
 allenge.eventbrite.ca/\, OR send email money transfer and contact info to 
 info@carnivalspice.com\; password: “carnivalspice”\n\nHEAR FROM PAST P
 ARTICIPANTS:\n"This is one of the most fun\, challenging and expressive wa
 ys to spend your time. Shakera and her team are top notch in all respects 
 - professional\, well organized\, high energy and very committed to making
  sure that everyone taking part has a great time. You'll leave feeling ene
 rgized\, connected to other wonderful women and vibing to Caribbean rhythm
 s. All levels and abilities are welcomed and encouraged so don't feel cons
 trained to participate in any way. Highly\, highly recommend!”\n- Alanna
  R\n\n"My second challenge with #carnivalspice is now completed and I can
 ’t wait for the next one (to begin). It is always so much fun and it mak
 es me happy plus gives me energy. Good music\, great people and always won
 derful vibes. It is a powerful\, cardio workout which helps to control or 
 lose weight and makes you feel confident. I recommend it to everyone who i
 s looking for good times. Spice up your life with #carnivalspice"\n- Fran 
 S\n\n"It's not just about the quality of the great workout\, it's the qual
 ity of the amazing people. Love my Saturdays with this crew. Toronto squad
 !!!”\n- Michelle D Caribana Dance Cardio - finale for the season
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2017/11/22851470_10101926874800971_425377211_o-1.jpg
CATEGORIES:Caribbean,Dance Hall,Fitness
LOCATION:Dovercourt House\, 805 Dovercourt Road\, Toronto\, Ontario\, Canad
 a
GEO:43.662777;-79.429512
