URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/hustle-foundations-2/
SUMMARY:Hustle Foundations
DESCRIPTION:Part 1: Thurs Jan 4h- Thurs Jan 25th\, 7:00pm – 8:00pm\nPart 
 2: Thursday Feb 1st - Thurs Feb 22nd\, 7:00pm - 8:00pm\n\nPart 1: First 4 
 weeks of a two-part 8 week intensive for students new to Latin Hustle. Lea
 rn the Hustle basic step\, popular Hustle turns and turn patterns. Learn h
 ustle tecnhnique\, how to lead and follow well and turn patterns to get yo
 u started on the dancefloor. Already know some Salsa? Like partner dancing
  but don't always hear Salsa music at the functions you go to? For those o
 f you who don't know what Latin Hustle is\, think of applying your Salsa t
 urn patterns to different music such as House\, Old School\, Top 40 and Di
 sco and therefore a different beat. It is so much fun! Dance with a partne
 r to practically any song anywhere!\n\nNo previous hustle experience requi
 red to join Part 1. Students must start on the first day. Open to students
  in Salsa levels 2-5\, or people with at least 2 months experience dancing
  Salsa.\n\nPart 2: Continue on your Hustle journey. For those who have tak
 en our 4 week Hustle Foundations Part 1 or who have taken a couple of Hust
 le workshops in the past. This 4 week course will teach you the hustle tec
 hnique you will need to social dance well and some new turns and patterns 
 to add to your repertoire. Once students have completed Hustle Foundations
  Part 2\, they may join the Hustle Level 2 weekly course.\n\nCompletion of
  Part 1 required to join Part 2 (or approval of instructor). Students must
  start on the first day.\n\nPrice:\n$60 for 4 weeks. 10 and 20 Class Cards
  can also be used for this workshop. Hustle Foundations
