 'Bachata Level 1\n6:30-8:00pm Daniel's Men Style\n*Location=&gt\; DanceLif
 eX centre: 619 Yonge St # D (Yonge &amp\; Bloor) Toronto\n\nSpecial deal $
 165 -&gt\; $135/month by Dec. 31st\n$140/month after Dec 31st\n3 months pa
 yment: $360\n6 months payment: $700\n\nZoukN'Bachata: $120/8 weeks\n$105 w
 ith valid student ID\n(This is a partnerwork class focused on safety\, tec
 hnique &amp\; musicality)\n\nWe can't describe how excited we are to teach
  these choreographies in Toronto.\n*Private message or 613-612-5331 touten
 connexion@gmail.com\nPlease like and share this page.\n\nDesiree's ladies 
 style routines are already world famous. This is the her latest World Team
  Project choreography – very sassy\, energetic and elegant at the same t
 ime.\nThe song is “Ain't your Mama” by Jennifer Lopez (bachata version
  by DJ Khalid).\nThis is a choreography designed for ladies\, but ANY GEND
 ER is welcome &#x1f60a\;\n\nWe recommend this class for people with at lea
 st one year of dance experience in Bachata\, Salsa or Hip-Hop.\n\nPlease l
 ike and share the page Daniel's Men Style &amp\; Desiree's Ladies Style - 
