 eness and energy\, with an explosive latin hip-hop intro. We can't describ
 e how excited we are to teach this choreography in Toronto.\nThe song is 
 “Tu” by Dustin Richie with an intro taken from “El Ganador” (Nicki
  Jam).\nThis is a choreography designed for men\, but any gender is welcom
 e to join. :)\n\nWe recommend this class for people with at least one year
  of dance experience in Bachata\, Salsa or Hip-Hop. Daniel &amp\; Desiree 
