SUMMARY:Triple your friends and change your lifestyle in 9 weeks with SALSA
 !
DESCRIPTION:Want to meet more people\, get healthy\, and change your lifest
 yle this fall?\n\nJoin SALSA\, the hottest dance that has spread like fire
  around the world! Learn the dance and go out dancing at venues available 
 every night of the week and meet new friends along the way!\n\nLevel 1 of 
 our Salsa Fundamentals course explores different variations of left and ri
 ght turns for both leaders and followers\, Cross Body Leads\, Hammerlock\,
  Half Turns\, Figure 8 etc.\n\nLevel 2 of our Salsa Fundamentals course co
 ntinues exploring the different variations of followers travelling left an
 d right turns\, simple dips\, ladies styling\, and more. Pre-requisite of 
 Level 1 or equivalent experience required.\n\nNo partners required and all
  ages welcomed!\n\nSpecial Promo price in effect:\n\n$118/person per 9 hrs
  course\n$218/couple\n\n$218/person per 2 courses\n\nLevel 1 Class schedul
 e:\n\nMondays 9-10pm (course start Jan 15\, 2018) – Markham\n\nThursdays
  7:30-8:30pm (course start Jan 18\, 2018) – North York\n\nSundays 11:30-
 12:30pm (course start Jan 7\, 2018) – North York\n\nLevel 2 Class Schedu
 le:\n\nTuesdays 7-8pm (course start Nov 21) – North York\n\nSundays 2:30
 -3:30pm (course start Jan 7\, 2018) – North York\n\n• What to bring\n\
 n• Important to know\nRegistration required at www.thedanceconnexion.com
  to ensure great balance of leaders and followers. Limited spots available
