URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/eve-of-st-george-an-unnerving-inte
 ractive-theatre-experience/
SUMMARY:Eve of St. George - An Unnerving Interactive Theatre Experience
DESCRIPTION:Transcendence Project — a Toronto-based contemporary dance 
 company — announces the opening of EVE OF ST. GEORGE\, an immersive d
 ance production inspired by and with cast from New York City’s smash-hit
  theatrical experience Sleep No More. Equal parts disturbing and seducti
 ve\, EVE OF ST. GEORGE is a voyeuristic and immersive recreation of Bram
  Stoker’s chilling tale of Dracula\, scored by award-winning Canadian co
 mposer Owen Belton. The audience is greeted\, masked and set free to roam 
 four levels and a dozen daunting spaces within a creaky building as the st
 ory unfolds around and interacts with them. Evocative\, sensual and unnerv
 ing\, each guest experience is different as they follow a character\, expl
 ore uncharted spaces\, rifle through private effects and become entangled 
 in the lives of 16 characters. Choose your own adventure!\n\nTickets: $55
 \, https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/eve-of-st-george-tickets-39797743121\n\nPer
 formances:\nFriday\, January 26 at 7:00pm &amp\; 10:00pm (two shows)\nSatu
 rday\, January 27 at 7:00pm &amp\; 10:00pm (two shows)\nSunday\, January 2
 8 at 7:00pm (one show) Eve of St. George - An Unnerving Interactive Theatr
 e Experience
