  you need to do is show up with your baby in a car seat or stroller\, brin
 g a bottle of water and wear a comfortable pair of dance or cross training
  shoes. Must bring a yoga mat for you and a towel for your baby to sit on.
  Toys and baby drums are highly encouraged.\n\n&nbsp\; Mom and Baby Pound 
