SUMMARY:Mom and Baby Latin Dance Fit
DESCRIPTION:Latin Dance Fit is a dance workout that combines easy to follow
  movements and Latin and International music and rhythms. This class has b
 een adapted to create a fun and safe environment for moms to bond with the
 ir babies (6 months and up) and other Toronto moms while getting a workout
 . No dance experience is required. This is a low impact workout to accommo
 date women of all fitness levels.\n\nTo participate\, all you need to do i
 s show up with your baby in a car seat or stroller. A sling/carrier is opt
 ional. Bring a bottle of water and wear a comfortable pair of dance/cross 
 training sneakers.\n\n&nbsp\; Mom and Baby Latin Dance Fit
