DESCRIPTION:Fusion Cardio Toronto is happily accepting girls’ ages 8 to 1
 2 yrs-old to their 14-week class in the Annex.\n\nGirl's Dance Fit is a da
 nce-based exercise class that combines easy to follow dance moves and exer
 cises to popular world music. Girls get to learn cool moves to songs rangi
 ng from Canada’s Justin Bieber to Cuba’s Pitbull. Giving them the oppo
 rtunity to experience world arts and culture right here in the city. Bonus
 es include improved self-confidence and fitness levels\, doing better in s
 chool\, and opportunities for making new friends.\n\nNo dance experience r
 equired. This is low impact physical activity to accommodate girls of all 
 fitness levels and skills.\n\nTo sign up your child for a class or for mor
 e info\, please visit: www.fusioncardiotoronto.com Girl&#039\;s Dance Fit 
 - Spadina/Bloor
