URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/ronald-k-brown-evidence/
SUMMARY:Ronald K. Brown/EVIDENCE
DESCRIPTION:dance Immersion is proud to present a magical evening of dance 
 with Ronald K. Brown / EVIDENCE (New York) at the Fleck Dance Theatre\, Ha
 rbourfront Centre\, February 2 &amp\; 3\, 2018 for three performances only
 !\n\nCreating an atmosphere of connection\, Brown’s dance company EVIDEN
 CE blends traditional African dance with contemporary choreography and spo
 ken word. It uses movement as a way to reinforce the importance of communi
 ty in contemporary African culture\, and to acquaint audiences with the be
 auty of traditional African forms and rhythms.\n\nWith bounding leaps\, pa
 ssionate embraces\, and elongated lines\, Brown’s masterful movement cre
 ates deeply emotional works with a unique view of human struggles\, traged
 ies\, and triumphs.\n\ndance Immersion presents\nRonald K. Brown/EVIDENCE\
 nFleck Dance Theatre\, 207 Queens Quay West\, Harbourfront Centre\nFriday\
 , February 2\, 2018 @ 8pm\nSaturday\, February 3\, 2018 @ 1pm and 8pm\nTic
 kets: $40-$30 (Students/Seniors/CADA $25) – Groups 10+: $18\nHarbourfron
 t Centre Box Office at 416-973-4000 OR online at http://www.danceimmersion
 .ca/evidence/ Ronald K. Brown/EVIDENCE
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2018/01/Ronald-K.-Brown-banner-768x384.jpg
CATEGORIES:African
LOCATION:Fleck Dance Theatre\, Harbourfront Centre\, 207 Queens Quay West\,
  Toronto\, Ontario\, M5J1A7\, GTA\, Canada
GEO:43.639301;-79.380898
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=207 Queens Quay West\, Toro
 nto\, Ontario\, M5J1A7\, GTA\, Canada;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Fleck Dan
 ce Theatre\, Harbourfront Centre:geo:43.639301,-79.380898
END:VEVENT
