SUMMARY:Steps Snow Ball
DESCRIPTION:Stop hibernating and start dancing! Join us for our annual wint
 er gala event.\n\n8:15pm: Sexy Bachata Lesson\n9:30pm: Dance Performances\
 n10pm - 2am: Salsa\, Bachata\, Hustle &amp\; Top 40 by DJ Alberth Moreno\n
 \nBreaking news!!! We are excited to announce that our new home for the St
 eps Snowball will be the Rosehill Venue &amp\; Lounge. Best news? The enti
 re space is hardwood flooring and great for dancing!!\n2nd best news? Cent
 ral location 2 blocks south of Yonge and St. Clair\, this beautiful venue 
 is one block from the St. Clair subway and right next door to a multi leve
 l Green P parking lot.\n\nTickets on sale now. EARLY BIRD PRICING ENDS ON 
 DECEMBER 22ND. Get your tickets early and save money.\n\nFREE Prize Giveaw
 ays. \nCash Bar. Snacks\nSemi formal. Dress to impress.\n2 minute walk fr
 om St. Clair subway station. 5 level Green P next door.\n\nAll ages and al
 l levels welcome\, including non Steps students and dancers.\n\nPrice: $25
  early bird ~ by December 22nd\n$30 ~ between December 23rd and Feb. 1ts\n
 $35 ~ at the door price (based on ticket availability) Steps Snow Ball
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2018/01/snowball.jpg
CATEGORIES:Bachata,Cha Cha,Hustle,Salsa
LOCATION:Rosehill Venue\, 6 Rosehill Avenue\, Toronto\, Canada
GEO:43.6863333;-79.39301189999998
