SUMMARY:Contemporary African Dance Workshop with Ronald K. Brown
DESCRIPTION:Acclaimed Brooklyn based choreographer Ronald K. Brown conducts
  2 Contemporary African dance workshops open to the public.\n\nBrown's wor
 k incorporates modern dance\, Senegalese Sabar and other West African move
 ment vocabularies\, Afro-Caribbean dance\, and contemporary urban dance fr
 om around the world. He has choreographed numerous works for his own compa
 ny\, as well as for Philadanco\, Alvin Ailey American Dance Theater\, the 
 Jacob's Pillow\, and many others.\n\nChildren's Dance 1:00 - 2:00 pm\nAdul
 t Dance 2:30 pm - 4:00 pm (not recommended for beginners)\n\nLocation: Dan
 cemakers Studios - Theatre Studio 313\nDistillery District - 15 Case Goods
  Lane\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M5A 3C4\n\nVisit danceimmersion.ca for more in
 formation. Contemporary African Dance Workshop with Ronald K. Brown
