SUMMARY:FREE Afrofusion Dance Classes
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Tuesday evenings in February to learn Afrofusion dan
 ce. Afrofusion is a blend of traditional and contemporary African styles f
 used with a multitude of dance styles such as Hip Hop\, Dancehall\, Soca\,
  Contemporary\, House and more. It is a fusion of various vocabularies sea
 mlessly put together to create a very unique blend of movement. Special th
 anks to our partner Esie Mensah!\n\nEnter through the Yonge Street entranc
 e (west side of building\, south of Front Street). Doors open 15 minutes b
 efore class starts.\n\n• No previous dance experience required\, all lev
 els welcome!\n• Please wear comfortable clothing.\n• Washrooms are ava
 ilable for changing.\n• Please bring your own water.\n• Drop-in spaces
  available\n\nTuesdays 5:30pm-6:30pm\nFebruary 6\, 13\, 20\n\nREGISTER HER
 E\nwww.sonycentre.ca/education-and-engagement/community-programs FREE Afro
 fusion Dance Classes
