 ig Band Valentine's Dance[/w8_button]\n\nVIP\nTickets $100.00+HST+Gratuity
  which includes reserved seating and dinner\nWith Romantic Songs by Vivian
 na and Glenn\nDoors for VIP 6pm - Dinner at 6:30pm sharp\nCall The Palais 
 Royale at 416-533-3553 Ext.22\n\nBand starts at 8:00pm\n\nFree parking in 
