SUMMARY:Mom and Baby Pound Fit - High Park
DESCRIPTION:Fusion Cardio Toronto is excited to introduce Mom and Baby Poun
 d Fit class to their Runnymede and Bloor location for 14-weeks.\n\nPound c
 ombines easy-to-follow cardio moves with strength training and drumming. T
 he combo works the entire body and raises the heart to a fat burning zone.
  The workout's routines which include standing\, sitting and laying down r
 outines\, are paired to some of the hottest Rock\, HipHop\, and Trap remix
 ed songs. This class has been adapted to create a fun and safe environment
  for moms to bond with their babies (5 months and up) and other Toronto mo
 ms while getting in a workout. This is a low to moderate impact workout to
  accommodate women of all fitness levels.\n\nThere will be two classes on 
 Mondays with 6 spots allowed per class.\n\nTo take a class or for more inf
 o\, please visit\, www.fusioncardiotoronto.com. Mom and Baby Pound Fit - H
 igh Park
