SUMMARY:Series of 5 East Coast Swing Lessons
DESCRIPTION:Carmen Colangelo will teach a series of 5 beginner lessons from
  7:30 to 8:30 and an intermediate lessons between 8:45 and 9:45 on Februar
 y 12 &amp\;26 and March 5\, 12 &amp\; 19 (Note there is no lesson on Famil
 y Day\, Feb. 19.)\n8:30 -8:45 is practice time. You do not need a partner.
  We usually have a good balance between leaders and followers and we chang
 e partners regularly. So if you are without a partner it is only for a few
  minutes. If you cannot commit to the whole series you can pay $12 per day
 .\nThe series is $40 for members and $60 for nonmembers but nonmembers are
  given a year's membership and enjoy discounts for the rest of the year. S
 eries of 5 East Coast Swing Lessons
