SUMMARY:Audition for Dancers
DESCRIPTION:AfroLatino Dance Co. is looking for dancers to join their team 
 for performances throughout the GTA! We are a Toronto based company specia
 lizing in Brazilian carnival as well as Cuban Cabaret styles of shows\, pe
 rforming for over 13 years at a variety of events and venues in Ontario an
 d Quebec.\n\n★★ Audition Date: Saturday\, February 17\, 2018\n★★ A
 udition Time: 1:30pm - 2:50pm\n★★ Registration: 1pm-1:30pm\n\nWHAT WE 
 ARE LOOKING FOR:\n★ Versatile male and female dancers with some ballet a
 nd/or jazz technique as well as improvisational skills\n★ Latin dance ex
 perience (preferably Cuban) a plus\n★ African dance experience a plus\n
 ★ Be 18 years old or older\n★ Be attractive and physically fit\n★ Al
 l ethnicities welcome\n\nFURTHER REQUIREMENTS:\n★ Must be available to r
 ehearse every Wednesday from 5:30 to 7:30pm\, downtown Toronto\n★ Must h
 ave availability for majority of shows which are usually on weekends (nigh
 t time)\n\nWHAT WE OFFER:\n★ All shows are paid although rehearsals are 
 not\n★ Dance training in Cuban (Afro-Cuban\, Salsa\, Mambo\, Cha Cha Cha
 \, Rumba\, Conga) and Brazilian Samba\n★ Performance experience in a var
 iety of environments\n\n&nbsp\; Audition for Dancers
