 2018/02/20130402_TOWestCoast_2339_lyziane.jpg
CATEGORIES:West Coast Swing
LOCATION:Rhythm and Motion Studio\, 3352 Dundas St West\, Toronto\, Ontario
 \, GTA\, Canada
