SUMMARY:Hustle Foundations
DESCRIPTION:Part 1: Thursday March 1 - Mach 22\, 7:00pm – 8:00pm\nPart 2:
  Thursday April 5 - April 26\, 7:00pm - 8:00pm\n\nPart 1: First 4 weeks of
  a two-part 8 week intensive for students new to Latin Hustle. Learn the H
 ustle basic step\, popular Hustle turns and turn patterns. Learn hustle te
 cnhnique\, how to lead and follow well and turn patterns to get you starte
 d on the dancefloor. Already know some Salsa? Like partner dancing but don
 't always hear Salsa music at the functions you go to? For those of you wh
 o don't know what Latin Hustle is\, think of applying your Salsa turn patt
 erns to different music such as House\, Old School\, Top 40 and Disco and 
 therefore a different beat. It is so much fun! Dance with a partner to pra
 ctically any song anywhere!\n\nNo previous hustle experience required to j
 oin Part 1. Students must start on the first day. Open to students in Sals
 a levels 2-5\, or people with at least 2 months experience dancing Salsa.\
 n\nPart 2: Continue on your Hustle journey. For those who have taken our 4
  week Hustle Foundations Part 1 or who have taken a couple of Hustle works
 hops in the past. This 4 week course will teach you the hustle technique y
 ou will need to social dance well and some new turns and patterns to add t
 o your repertoire. Once students have completed Hustle Foundations Part 2\
 , they may join the Hustle Level 2 weekly course.\n\nCompletion of Part 1 
 required to join Part 2 (or approval of instructor). Students must start o
 n the first day.\n\nPrice:\n$60 for 4 weeks. 10 and 20 Class Cards can als
 o be used for this workshop. Hustle Foundations
