 -march-edition/
SUMMARY:Carnival Spice 6 Week Dance Series - March Edition
DESCRIPTION:Join Carnival Spice for our 6 week dance fitness experience.\n\
 nAs featured on CP24\, Lululemon\, Toronto Sun and more\, the Carnival Spi
 ce classes fuse Soca\, Latin and Dancehall music through a high-energy\, f
 itness experience that improves dance technique while strengthening upper 
 body\, lower body and core. Carnival Spice class is inclusive to all body 
 types\, ethnicities\, and dance levels. Don’t Be Shy!\n\nEach Participan
 t Will Receive:\n\n6 Weekly Caribbean Dance Fitness Classes (2 hours each)
 \n- To the sounds of soca\, dancehall\, and chutney we teach you the moves
 \, energy\, body placement and style.\n- No pressure to remember steps –
  move at your own pace and your own style.\nInclusive to all body types\, 
 ethnicities\, and dance level.\n- The first hour we sweat it out with Cari
 bbean Dance Cardio. The second hour we condition with Carnival Choreograph
 y.\n\nCarnival Spice Swag Item\n\nAccess to our Private Online Group\n- En
 gage with other members for support plus receive exclusive Carnival Spice 
 offers\n\nSurprises and Event Discounts Throughout The Challenge\n- Carniv
 al Spice offer amazing events and pop up workshops that challenge particip
 ants will receive discounted tickets on or complimentary access too. The s
 urprises… well you will have to wait and see!​\n\nInvestment:\nOur cla
 sses increase confidence\, provide growth\, allow you to burn a heck of a 
 lot of calories\, all while connecting with an amazing group of individual
 s.\nTotal series investment is: $150.00\n​\nEventbrite Or Via Email Tran
 sfer: Please send email money transfer and contact info to info@carnivalsp
 ice.com\; password: “carnivalspice”\n\nDrop In Participants Are Invite
 d To Attend Sunday\, March 11th ONLY\; entry rate is $20 cash for that ses
 sion. Carnival Spice 6 Week Dance Series - March Edition
