 -2/
SUMMARY:Discover Dance! with Natasha Powell
DESCRIPTION:You are invited to Discover Dance! Join us for the next present
 ation with Natasha Powell on March 14 at the Sony Centre for the Performin
 g Arts. Free\, monthly lunch-hour presentations from 12pm-1pm!\n\nThrough 
 demonstrations\, performance\, and conversation\, you will be introduced t
 o some of Toronto's incredible dance artists and discover how dance forms 
 from near and far are being woven into Toronto’s cultural scene. Hosted 
 by award-winning choreographer Nova Bhattacharya\, Discover Dance is free 
 and appropriate for all ages. Special thanks to our partners Nova Dance an
 d Toronto Arts Council for making this program possible! Visit the website
