URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/west-coast-swing-ladies-styling-se
 crets-3/
SUMMARY:West Coast Swing – Ladies Styling Secrets
DESCRIPTION:*** Feel and Look Better Than Ever On The Dance Floor! ***\n\nW
 hether you want to add some shaping and style to your West Coast Swing\, o
 r improve the quality of your movement\, this ladies styling class reveals
  all the little secrets to fun and gorgeous West Coast Swing.\n\nYou’ll 
 learn:\n\n– How to move your body with confidence\n– Body isolations\n
 – Beautiful arm styling\n– Shaping v​ariations on basic patterns\n
 – Timing variations\n– Creating beautiful lines\n– How to be the bes
 t dancer you can be with any style or level of leader\n\nShelley’s easy 
 to learn ladies styling tips for West Coast Swing will have you looking an
 d feeling awesome on the dance floor!\n\nWHEN:\n\nSaturday\, March 17\n1:3
 0pm to 3pm\nDovercourt House\, 805 Dovercourt Rd.\n\nPRICE: $20\n\nFor mor
 e information or to pre-register\, click the “More Info” tab at the to
 p of this listing\, or visit www.ShelleyDance.com\n\nClass size is limited
  so please register as soon as possible to confirm your spot.\n\nIf you ha
 ve any questions whatsoever\, please don’t hesitate to contact Shelley.\
 n\n*** FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS ***\n\nQ. Do I need to come with a partn
 er?\n\nNo\, you do not need a partner for the class. This is a followers O
 NLY class so no partner is required.\n\nQ. What type of shoes should I wea
 r?\n\nIf you already have dance shoes\, then bring those. If you don’t h
 ave dance shoes\, then something with a leather or suede sole is best. If 
 not\, then just wear your most comfortable pair of shoes.\n\nQ. What type 
 of clothes should I wear to class?\n\nWear whatever you will feel most com
 fortable in. West Coast Swing is a very casual dance so wear your favorite
  jeans and t-shirt if you want.\n\nQ. Who is the instructor?\n\nYour instr
 uctor is Shelley Saxena. Shelley has been dancing\, studying and competing
  in West Coast Swing for 18 years. With an extensive background in Jazz\, 
 Ballet and Modern dance\, Shelley now specializes in West Coast Swing.\n\n
 Q. Do I need any previous dance experience to take the Styling class?\n\nT
 his is not a class for complete beginners. You must have at least one year
  of recent experience as a follower in West Coast Swing and be comfortable
  with both the 6-count and 8-count basics.\n\nQ. I still have a question a
 bout the class. Can you help?\n\nOf course! If you have any other question
 s\, please don’t hesitate to contact Shelley by clicking the “More Inf
 o” tab at the top of this listing\, or visiting her website www.ShelleyD
 ance.com. She will be very happy to help you any way she can.\n\nQ. I’m 
 excited to get started! What’s my next step?\n\nSimply click the “More
  Info” tab at the top of this listing to let Shelley know you’d like t
 o register\, or contact her at her website www.ShelleyDance.com (class siz
 e is limited so it’s important to make sure you reserve your spot). West
  Coast Swing – Ladies Styling Secrets
