SUMMARY:Discover Dance! with Natasha Powell
DESCRIPTION:You are invited to Discover Dance! Join us for the next present
 ation with Natasha Powell on March 20 at the Toronto Centre for the Arts. 
 Free\, monthly lunch-hour presentations from 12pm-1pm!\n\nThrough demonstr
 ations\, performance\, and conversation\, you will be introduced to some o
 f Toronto's incredible dance artists and discover how dance forms from nea
 r and far are being woven into Toronto’s cultural scene. Hosted by award
 -winning choreographer Nova Bhattacharya\, Discover Dance is free and appr
 opriate for all ages. Special thanks to our partners Nova Dance and Toront
 o Arts Council for making this program possible! Visit the website to lear
 n more about the schedule and guest artist for each presentation. Discover
  Dance! with Natasha Powell
