 ques-of-the-present/
SUMMARY:Butoh Practice: the Body and Techniques of the Present
DESCRIPTION:This is a bit of a different butoh practice session oriented ar
 ound the body and techniques of the present. The arts are techniques that 
 by playing with time and space\, allow us to explore the potentialities of
  each body in its ecology. The practice then is a consideration of the (bu
 toh) body at the intersection of the arts.\n\nAs part of the practice we w
 ill try out what might be called body maps or floor drawing\, asemic writi
 ng as ways to explore embodied movement and vocalization\, and sounding mo
 vement.\n\nSupplies will be provided.\n$10-15 for attendance depending on 
 means.\nDo RSVP so that supplies are available.\n\nRegular practices are f
 ree. Butoh Practice: the Body and Techniques of the Present
