URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/encore-dance-hall-of-fame-launch/
SUMMARY:Encore! Dance Hall of Fame Launch
DESCRIPTION:The Encore! Dance Hall of Fame event will honour and celebrate 
 dynamic lifelong contributions to dance in Canada by some remarkable indiv
 iduals. Honorees are associated with many dance disciplines - from Kathak 
 to ballet to contemporary. They include Veronica Tennant\, Danny Grossman\
 , Karen Jamieson\, Rina Singha\, Alan and Blanche Lund\, René Highway\, a
 nd Jeanne Renaud.\n\nPresenters to the inductees include Evelyn Hart\, Mic
 ah Barnes\, Sheila McCarthy\, Deepti Gupta\, Louise Bédard\, Pam Grundy a
 nd Pierre Des Marais.\n\nHosted by CBC broadcaster Laurie Brown - the even
 t will take place on the 17th Floor of the new Globe &amp\; Mail Centre in
  downtown Toronto.\n\nPlease join us for the celebrations - recognize the 
 richness of our Canadian cultural heritage - take in the amazing views fro
 m the rooftop venue - raise a glass to honour these groundbreaking visiona
 ries.\n\nProceeds from the event will go towards operations of Dance Colle
 ction Danse. A Charitable Receipt will be issued for the maximum amount al
 lowable.\n\nFor ticket information go to:\n\n[w8_button color="purple" url
 ="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/encore-dance-hall-of-fame-tickets-426400896
 56" title="Get Tickets" target="blank" border_radius=""]Get Tickets[/w8_bu
 tton] Encore! Dance Hall of Fame Launch
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2018/02/dance-hall-of-fame.jpg
