URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/momentum-dancs-toronto-presents-po
 rta/
SUMMARY:Momentum Dance Toronto Presents: PORTA
DESCRIPTION:Momentum Dance Toronto is thrilled to present our 8th annual pr
 oduction: PORTA\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nTickets: $15 - $30\nAVAILABLE NOW ON OUR ONL
 INE BOX OFFICE\n\nLife is a journey of entrances and exits\, twists and tu
 rns and forks in the road. Along this journey\, we cross through many prov
 erbial doorways of change. Historically\, the door itself has been used sy
 mbolically across all cultures\, with transition and metamorphosis as the 
 themes most commonly portrayed. In literary terms\, a door may represent a
  passage from one place to another\, between different states\, and betwee
 n lightness and darkness. Additionally\, an open door can be seen as an op
 portunity to invite discovery and investigation. Counter to this\, a close
 d door often suggests rejection\, protection\, secrecy\, exclusion or impr
 isonment. These themes resonate in each of our lives\, time and again.\n\n
 Momentum Dance Toronto’s choreographers and dancers are thrilled to take
  you on a journey through a series of portals and doorways\, and of twists
  and turns. Our dancers use choreography to express both the symbolic and 
 literal interpretations of life\, dreams\, events and stories as we open a
 nd close doors to our own experiences.\n\nRegardless of what pathways we h
 ave already taken\, we are reminded that when one door closes in life\, an
 other one inevitably opens – leaving room for new possibilities and most
  importantly\, for the hope of new beginnings\, new dreams and new stories
  to tell.\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nPERFORMANCE DATES:\n\nWed. Apr 25 @ 8pm (Doors ope
 n at 7:30pm) * PREVIEW Show - $20 ADULT | $15 KIDS*\n\nThurs. Apr 26 @ 8pm
  * BOOK a group + save day! - $15pp GROUP RATE (10 people +) | $25 ADVANCE
  | $30 @ DOOR | $15 KIDS*\n\nFri. Apr 27 @ 8pm -$25 ADVANCE | $30 @ DOOR |
  $15 KIDS*\n\nSat. Apr 28 @ 2pm (Doors open at 1:30pm) | $25 ADVANCE | $30
  @ DOOR | $15 KIDS*\n\nSat. Apr 28 @ 8pm (Doors open at 7:30pm) | $25 ADVA
 NCE | $30 @ DOOR | $15 KIDS*\n\n* KIDS RATE: Children 12 years &amp\; unde
 r\n\n* GROUP RATE: email info@momentumdancetoronto to inquire + purchase\n
 \n--- ONLINE TICKETS TO BE PICKED UP AT VENUE BOX OFFICE ---\n\nCan't make
  it\, but would still like to SUPPORT Momentum Dance Toronto? You can cont
 ribute/donate by visiting our ONLINE BOX OFFICE.\n\nOn behalf of MDT\, THA
 NK YOU in advance for your support!\n\n&nbsp\; Momentum Dance Toronto Pres
 ents: PORTA
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2018/03/EEBA52BA-86D6-40FF-98AD-ECFDC1264958.jpeg
CATEGORIES:Contemporary
LOCATION:Al Green Theatre\, 750 Spadina Ave\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M5S 2J2\,
  Canada
GEO:43.66642;-79.403909
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=750 Spadina Ave\, Toronto\,
  Ontario\, M5S 2J2\, Canada;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Al Green Theatre:ge
 o:43.66642,-79.403909
END:VEVENT
