URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/andrea-spazianis-silver-venus/
SUMMARY:Andrea Spaziani's Silver Venus
DESCRIPTION:Dancemakers’ Curator Amelia Ehrhardt is pleased to announce R
 esident Artist Andrea Spaziani’s Silver Venus will make its première at
  Dancemakers Centre for Creation from Thursday\, April 26 to Saturday\, Ap
 ril 28\, 2018\, at 8 pm each evening.\n\nNow in her second year of a three
 -year residency\, Andrea’s group work Silver Venus played as a work-in-p
 rogress to sell out houses and audience acclaim in April 2017. Her work is
  feminist and critical of the aestheticized female body\, and it moves acr
 oss poles like personal/political\, vulnerable/powerful\, didactic/impenet
 rable. Her Dancemakers’ residency to date has also seen her present This
  Desiring Pony (December 2016) and Rafters (June 2017).\n\nThe Dance Curre
 nt said\, ”Andrea Spaziani generates a performance situation that holds 
 itself open in its complexity\, never indulging catharsis or didactic reso
 lution… [Her] work stands with that of a generation of (mostly female) c
 ontemporary dance artists who desire and romanticize a post-dramatic conte
 xt\, rejecting performativity and institutionalized expectations of male c
 horeographic gazes.”\n\nSilver Venus is created and performed with Irvin
  Chow\, Alicia Grant\, Julia Male\, Claire Turner Reid\, Nicole Rose Bond\
 , with Lights by Tanya Bregstein\, and Music by Matt Smith. Andrea Spazian
 i&#039\;s Silver Venus
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2018/04/Dancemakers-Alicia-Grant-and-Nicole-Rose-Bond-in-Silver-Venus-by-A
 ndrea-Spaziani-photo-by-Omer-Yukseker.jpg
CATEGORIES:Contemporary
LOCATION:Dancemakers\, 15 Case Goods Lane #301\, Toronto\, ON\, M5A 3C4\, C
 anada
GEO:43.6498686;-79.35847999999999
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=15 Case Goods Lane #301\, T
 oronto\, ON\, M5A 3C4\, Canada;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Dancemakers:geo:
 43.6498686,-79.35847999999999
END:VEVENT
