SUMMARY:Hit The Floor Toronto Competition
DESCRIPTION:Hit The Floor is one of the world’s largest multistyle dance 
 competitions and brings together more than 40\,000 spectators and 8\,000 d
 ancers annually! The Hit The Floor Tour will stop at the Metro Toronto Con
 vention Centre from April 27th to April 29th\, 2018.\n\nHTF TORONTO COMPET
 ITION - APRIL 28TH-29TH\nThe Competition brings around 1 000 dancers and m
 ore than 8 000 spectators with the same interest: dance! The schedule pres
 ent two full days of competition\, all styles included.\nThe ticket\, vali
 d for the whole weekend\, is sold $15 at the door.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/wkd
 CVu3gcgI\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nHTF TORONTO SHOWCASE - APRIL 28TH\n8:30pm to 11pm\n
 The All-Stars Showcase is a unique dance show\, featuring the best dancers
  of the competition as well as world-renowned artists. Among the thousands
  of routines presented during the competition\, our judges select 8 top pi
 cks who will have the opportunity to dance at the All-Stars Showcase and g
 et the chance to win one of the 3 cash prices.\nWe aim to produce pieces t
 hat are unique and based on innovation. That said\, we work closely with t
 he artists in the creation and validation process of their work for the sh
 owcase.\nTickets: https://showcasehtftoronto.eventbrite.ca\n\nHTF TORONTO 
 WORKSHOPS - FRIDAY APRIL 27TH\n6:30pm : Contemporary - Lex Ishimoto\n8:00p
 m : Hip Hop - Mel Charlot\nThis educational activity of the event is an am
 azing opportunity for dancers to learn and express themselves. Prestigious
  scholarships are also awarded during the workshops to reward dancers who 
 stood out during the activity. A unique learning experience!\nTickets: htt
 ps://workshopshtftoronto.eventbrite.ca Hit The Floor Toronto Competition
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2018/04/hit-the-floor.jpg
CATEGORIES:Ballet,Ballroom,Contemporary,Hip Hop
LOCATION:Metro Toronto Convention Centre\, 255 Front St West\, Toronto\, On
 tario\, M5V 2W6\, GTA\, Canada
