SUMMARY:Tour The Four Seasons Centre For The Performing Arts
DESCRIPTION:The Canadian Opera Company opens the doors of the Four Seaso
 ns Centre for the Performing Arts on April 8\, 15\, 22\, 29\, 2018 with
  90-minute tours for the general public. These extensive tours include b
 ackstage access and are exciting opportunities to learn more about the fi
 rst purpose-built opera house in Canada\, its history\, architecture and i
 nnovative acoustic design. Starting at 10:30 a.m.\, each tour is led by a
  trained docent and includes information and access to the magnificent Isa
 dore and Rosalie Sharp City Room\, the Richard Bradshaw Amphitheatre and R
 . Fraser Elliott Hall\, as well as backstage areas like wig rooms and dres
 sing rooms\, the orchestra pit\, and other spaces that only a stage door p
 ass could unlock.\nTickets for public tours are $20/adults and $15/seni
 ors and students\, and can be purchased in advance at coc.ca or at the
  Four Seasons Centre for the Performing Arts Box Office\, located at 145 
 Queen St. W.\, Monday to Saturday from 11 a.m. to 6 p.m. Tickets will al
 so be available on the morning of the tour starting at 10 a.m. at the we
 lcome desk located in the main lobby. Tour The Four Seasons Centre For The
  Performing Arts
