SUMMARY:Star War vs. Star Trek Saturday Night Swing featuring Alex Pangman 
 &amp\; Her Alleycats
DESCRIPTION:Star Wars vs. Star Trek Theme!\nComing as a character from Star
  Wars or Star Trek encouraged. Wearing a Star Wars or Star Trek T-shirt en
 couraged.\n\nBeginner classes 7pm to 9pm\, Charleston 7pm\, Lindy Hop 8pm.
