SUMMARY:Ongoing Gaga/people classes this summer
DESCRIPTION:Ongoing Gaga/People Classes starting May!\n\nGaga/people classe
 s are open to people ages 16+\, regardless of their background in dance or
  movement. No previous dance experience is needed.\n\nGaga/people classes 
 are taught by dancers who have worked closely with Ohad Naharin.\nGaga/peo
 ple classes offer a creative framework for participants to connect to thei
 r bodies and imaginations\, increase their physical awareness\, improve th
 eir flexibility and stamina\, and experience the pleasure of movement in a
  welcoming\, accepting atmosphere.\nParticipants should wear comfortable c
 lothes and be prepared to dance barefoot or in socks. It is advisable to b
 ring a bottle of water and a towel for use after class.\n\nFor Schedule &a
 mp\; Ticket Prices: http://alvincollantes.com/gaga\n\nWatch "Mr. Gaga" on 
 Netflix Canada for more info: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BK9AjyxNlJc\
 nFacebook Event: https://www.facebook.com/events/362083317630795/ Ongoing 
 Gaga/people classes this summer
