SUMMARY:dance Immersion Presents: Contemporary Dance Class with Germaul Bar
 nes
DESCRIPTION:Germaul Barnes has created JOY&#x2122\; - a contemporary dance 
 class that exposes students to the fundamentals of the Barnes' fusion of m
 ovement styles. Participants will focus on the ability in their relation t
 o the floor\, building power\, fluidity\, balance\, and speed. With additi
 onal focus on isometric conditioning and proper alignment\, the class teac
 hes dancers how to apply energy\, efficiency\, and accuracy to movement wh
 ile reclaiming the JOY&#x2122\; of dancing.\n\nOpen to all levels of dance
  practitioners.\n\nSee you then! dance Immersion Presents: Contemporary Da
 nce Class with Germaul Barnes
