 DGES ///\n- Lady C\n- Shawn de Ocampo\n- Tricky Troublez\n\nMC ///\n- Dani
 el Keith Morison\n\nDJ ///\n- WAVGODS\n\nBATTLE FORMAT /// (*1 min rounds)
 \n- Prelims (30 seconds round)\n- Top 16 (1 Round)*\n- Top 8 (1 Round)*\n-
  Top 4 (2 Rounds)*\n- Finals (2 Rounds)*\n\nREGISTRATION ///\n- $20 (Advan
 ce) $25 (at Door) for participants &amp\; spectators\n- Participants must 
 pay for registration to confirm spot Battle X - All Styles Dance Battle
