URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/bollywood-dance-workshop/
SUMMARY:Bollywood Dance Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Learn Bollywood Dance with Krystal Kiran\, Master Instructor!\n
 A unique opportunity to learn from a master Bollywood Dance instructor - f
 un for all ages and fitness levels.\nKrystal Kiran\, a professional actor/
 singer/dancer most recently performed the lead role of Saroj Rai in the st
 age adaptation of Monsoon Wedding in California. An award-winning choreogr
 apher\, Krystal has created choreography for commercials\, music videos\, 
 and dance studios. Her expertise has led her to being a judge on Boogie Wo
 ogie\, India’s longest running dance television show\, and as a juror fo
 r the Academy of Canadian Cinema and Television’s Screen Awards.\nPLUS -
  catch Krystal in an afternoon performance of The Orchard (After Chekhov) 
 - a tale of a Punjabi-Sikh family fighting to hold onto their Okanagan orc
 hard. Bollywood Dance Workshop
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2018/04/krystal-k.jpg
CATEGORIES:Bollywood
