DTSTAMP:20180315T201210Z
URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/dance-the-upper-room/
SUMMARY:Dance The Upper Room
DESCRIPTION:Dance your way though time in a Virtual Time Capsule's "Square 
 in the Round" and go back to 1822 when Campbell House was built and Sunday
  nights were spend dancing a Quadrille and not watching Netflix!\n\nMove y
 our body like the Georgians would have in this simple walking parter dance
  traditionally performed in a square or circle. We will teach you the danc
 e and then film it in Virtual Reality/ 360 video to be played in Campbell 
 House for visitors to watch! YOU will live on in Campbell House as part of
  an ongoing museum feature.\n\nThe evening will have a history lesson from
  one of Campbell Houses guides\, fun games to meet your dancing parters\, 
 a lesson from Laura Harris from Atelier School of Ballet\, and some celebr
 ation Georgian nibbles at the end of your performance!\n\nGet your 19th ce
 ntury wardrobe on and wear items from your own closet and mimic traditiona
 l pieces with their own closet wear. Don’t worry\, we will posting some 
 ideas and pics on how you can get your Georgian on.\n\nTickets are only $2
 0 + $2 service charge will be available on Eventbrite! Due to limited spac
 e inside Campbell house\, tickets are limited to 20 people so be sure to r
 eserve your space. Dance The Upper Room
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2018/03/campel-house-image.jpg
CATEGORIES:Folk
LOCATION:Campbell House\, 160 Queen Street West\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M5H3H
 3\, Canada
GEO:43.6510271;-79.38726559999998
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=160 Queen Street West\, Tor
 onto\, Ontario\, M5H3H3\, Canada;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Campbell House
 :geo:43.6510271,-79.38726559999998
END:VEVENT
