SUMMARY:Caribana Dance Workshop (Soca\, Dancehall\, &amp\; more)
DESCRIPTION:As featured on Breakfast Television\, Lululemon\, Toronto Star 
 and more\, the Carnival Spice dance workshops is an excellent way for you 
 to keep fit and have fun while doing it. It fuses Soca\, Latin and Danceha
 ll music through a high-energy\, fitness experience that strengthens upper
  body\, lower body and core. The Caribbean vibes in the space create an en
 ergy like no other for all participants involved. Plus all dance and fitne
 ss levels are welcome.\n\nENTRY:\n$25/workshop\nfirst 10 people to registe
 r get 50% off!! Use promo code: "earlybird"\n\nREGISTER:\n- via https://ww
 w.eventbrite.ca/e/spring-caribbean-dance-series-session-2-tickets-45458432
 395\n- or by sending email money transfer and contact information to info@
 carnivalspice.com\; password: “carnivalspice”\n\nREMINDERS:\nWEAR YOUR
  CARNIVAL SPICE SHIRT and/or ATHLEISURE ATTIRE!\nBRING YOUR RAG OR’ YOUR
  FLAG!\nBRING WATER!\nDRESS TO SWEAT!\nWEAR COMFORTABLE SHOES!\n\nTestimon
 ial:\n"Did a workshop with my girls yesterday...it was hype high energy an
 d a lot of fun we picked up the choreo n got some good cardio ...excited t
 o take more classes or workshop really good vibe and good people" - Barbra
  M. (February 2018) Caribana Dance Workshop (Soca\, Dancehall\, &amp\; mor
 e)
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2018/05/29101704_1659760294099901_4414516147316064256_o.jpg
CATEGORIES:Caribbean
LOCATION:Dovercourt House\, 805 Dovercourt Road\, Toronto\, Ontario\, Canad
 a
