URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/self-care-sunday-workshop-body-ima
 ge-eating-disorders/
SUMMARY:Self-care Sunday Workshop: Body Image &amp\; Eating Disorders
DESCRIPTION:SELF-CARE SUNDAY P2: BODY IMAGE &amp\; EATING DISORDERS\nCOMMUN
 ITY DANCE THEATRE WORKSHOP\n\nJoin us in necessary and powerful discussion
  and artivism on topics surrounding self-care\, support and mental health.
  As we share and explore these themes we will be co-creating unique multi-
 genre community dance-theatre pieces reflecting our experiences.\n\nThese 
 public workshops are inclusive and accessible\, open to all who wish to pa
 rticipate\; no previous dance or theatre experience required. All genders 
 welcome. We will be holding one workshop per month over the summer\, each 
 focusing on a different topic.\n\nCOST PER WORKSHOP:\n$15 in advance\n$20 
 at the door\nOR pay what you can\n\nTo register in advance please email je
 na@prettywingsto.com\n\n_________________________________\n\nOTHER UPCOMIN
 G EVENTS:\n\nJULY 22:\n#METOO #TIMESUP: SURVIVORS EDITION\n\nAUGUST 26:\n"
 FIVE FOOT TWO" EDITION: CHRONIC PAIN &amp\; INVISIBLE ILLNESS\n___________
 ______________________\n\n*Pretty Wings is committed to creating arts-base
 d therapeutic &amp\;\nrecreational programming and opportunities to serve\
 nmarginalized communities\, including but not limited to those\nwho are fa
 cing mental health challenges\, survivors of abuse\,\ndifferently-abled\, 
 youth\, BIPOC\, LGBTQ+ * Self-care Sunday Workshop: Body Image &amp\; Eati
 ng Disorders
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2018/06/SCS-June.jpg
CATEGORIES:Bachata,Contact Improvisation,Contemporary,Fusion,Hip
 Hop,Jazz,LGBT,Other,Salsa,Special Needs,Therapeutic,Urban,Yoga
