SUMMARY:Mom and Baby Latin Dance Fit - Bloor/Runnymede
DESCRIPTION:Join Mom and Baby Latin Dance Fit to dance your way back to sha
 pe while working out with other moms in Toronto.\n\nLatin Dance Fit is a d
 ance workout that combines easy to follow dance moves and Latin and Intern
 ational rhythms to create an exotic and fun exercise experience. This clas
 s is low impact to create a fun and safe environment for moms to bond with
  their babies (4 months and up) and other Toronto moms while getting in a 
 workout. No dance experience is required.\n\nTo participate\, all you need
  to do is show up with your baby in a car seat or carrier. Strollers must 
 be left outside of the center at this location. Bring a bottle of water\, 
 and wear a comfortable pair of dance or cross training shoes.\n\nNo walk-i
 ns allowed. Must register online in advance.\n\nTo take a class or for mor
 e info\, please visit: www.fusioncardiotoronto.com Mom and Baby Latin Danc
 e Fit - Bloor/Runnymede
