SUMMARY:Hustle Foundations Part 1
DESCRIPTION:Thursdays 7:00-8:00pm\nJuly 5 - July 26 (4 weeks)\n\nFirst 4 we
 eks of a two-part 8-week intensive for students new to Latin Hustle. Learn
  the Hustle basic step\, popular Hustle turns and turn patterns. Learn hus
 tle technique\, how to lead and follow well and turn patterns to get you s
 tarted on the dance floor. Already know some Salsa? Like partner dancing b
 ut don't always hear Salsa music at the functions you go to? For those of 
 you who don't know what Latin Hustle is\, think of applying your Salsa tur
 n patterns to different music such as House\, Old School\, Top 40 and Disc
 o and therefore a different beat. It is so much fun! Dance with a partner 
 to practically any song anywhere! Hustle Foundations Part 1
