SUMMARY:Casino Foundations
DESCRIPTION:Thursdays 9:00-10:00pm\nJuly 5 - July 26 (4 weeks)\n\n4-week in
 tensive for students new to Casino Rueda. This crash course workshop will 
 teach you the Casino fundamentals.\n\nCasino Rueda is a Cuban form of sals
 a often described as "Salsa in a Circle". Building on the basic salsa step
 \, it combines new turn patterns with a rotational movement of the whole c
 ircle\, exchanging partners continually throughout the song. It is a great
  way to interact with other people\, have fun and add variety to your sals
 a at the same time! Casino Foundations
