SUMMARY:Viennese Waltz Beginner Workshop
DESCRIPTION:3pm to 6pm\n\nLearn traditional Viennese Waltz one of the best\
 , most fun and most romantic dances ever! Popular from the early 19th cent
 ury on\, done to great music of the 21st\, 20th and 19th centuries\, a tem
 pos from fairly slow to very fast!\n\nTeachers: Bonnie &amp\; Simon\n\nNo 
 prior experience is needed\, and you don't need to bring your own dance pa
 rtners. Big sprung wood dance floor\, subway and parking are close by.\n\n
 $30. (Just $10 if you have taken this workshop with us before.)\n\nNote th
 at if take this workshop you can also take the Viennese Waltz intermediate
  workshop on Saturday May 12 from 3pm to 6pm.\n\nMostly Waltz Toronto Sche
 dule: http://swingtoronto.com/waltz-calendar/\n\nFacebook: https://www.fac
 ebook.com/groups/142519259606/events/ Viennese Waltz Beginner Workshop
