URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/buti-yoga-sweat-with-intention-wor
 kshop/
SUMMARY:Buti Yoga: Sweat with Intention Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Buti® your soulmate workout.\n\nButi® classes utilize spiral 
 structure technique® to facilitate the release + toning of the body - phy
 sical\, emotional and energetic. Through primal movement\, dynamic asana a
 nd cardio-sprints\, students breakdown the emotional barriers that hold th
 em back from achieving self-love and true human connection.\n\nBring your 
 yoga practice to life and Sweat with Intention.\n\nThis 2-hour workshop wi
 ll breakdown the fundamentals of Buti Yoga. Proper form\, alignment and tr
 aditional Buti dance movements will be covered. Foundational movements suc
