SUMMARY:Summer Intensive | Urban / Commercial Training Program for Women
DESCRIPTION:Apply now for a chance to secure your spot early and get $75 of
 f your tuition fee!\n*we are happy to answer any and all questions you may
  have!\n\nSchool Of Groove is a dance training and mentorship program dedi
 cated to nurturing strong and confident young female dancers. We act as a 
 bridge – connecting dancers to like minded peers\, mentors and the large
 r dance community. Our mission lies in giving emerging talent a holistic a
 pproach to the learning experience and the tools they need in order to ref
 ine their practice and find success on their personal dance journey.\n\nOu
 r program uses urban and commercial dance techniques as a means to provide
  you with the skills and mindset to help you accomplish your personal danc
 e goals\, all while keeping the female voice in mind. Our school-of-though
 t focuses on an in-depth understanding and application of the SOG pillars:
  music\, movement\, style\, empowerment.\n\n 	Limited class sizes &amp\; p
 ersonalized attention\n 	structured curriculum\n 	technical and artistic e
 nrichment\n 	guest workshops\n 	professional development\n 	and more...\n\
 nWho can apply?\n\n 	ages 15-30 years old\n 	identify as female\n 	previou
 s dance training an asset (formal or informal)\n 	able to commit to full p
 rogram (July 23-27\, 9:30-4:30pm)\n 	must have strong work ethic\, team me
 ntality and desire to grow\n\nMore info: www.schoolofgroove.ca\nApply now:
  www.schoolofgroove.ca/application\n\nUnder direction of Queenie Seguban a
 nd Kelly Gammie of @deucendip dance crew.\n\nEarly acceptance deadline: Ma
 y 15\, 2018 (11:59pm)\nFinal deadline: June 15\, 2018 (11:59pm)\n\n**Appli
 cants will be notified within one week of submission** Summer Intensive | 
 Urban / Commercial Training Program for Women
