 self-care-sunday-at-steps-p3/
SUMMARY:Me Too/ Times Up Survivors Edition: Self-Care Sunday at Steps P3
DESCRIPTION:This event is open to survivors and allies.\n\nJoin us in neces
 sary and powerful discussion and artivism on topics surrounding self-care\
 , support and mental health. As we share and explore these themes we will 
 be co-creating unique multi-genre community dance-theatre pieces reflectin
 g our experiences.\n\nThis workshop is inclusive and accessible\, open to 
 all who wish to participate\; no previous dance or theatre experience requ
 ired. All genders welcome. We will be holding one workshop per month over 
 the summer\, each focusing on a different topic.\n\nOTHER UPCOMING EVENTS:
 \n\nAUGUST 26:\n"FIVE FOOT TWO" EDITION: CHRONIC PAIN &amp\; INVISIBLE ILL
 NESS\n_________________________________\n\nCOST PER WORKSHOP:\n$15 in adva
 nce\n$20 at the door\nOR pay what you can\n\nTo register in advance please
  email jena@prettywingsto.com\n\n*Pretty Wings is committed to creating ar
 ts-based therapeutic &amp\;\nrecreational programming and opportunities to
  serve\nmarginalized communities\, including but not limited to those\nwho
  are facing mental health challenges\, survivors of abuse\,\ndifferently-a
 bled\, youth\, BIPOC\, LGBTQ+ *\n\n&nbsp\; Me Too/ Times Up Survivors Edit
 ion: Self-Care Sunday at Steps P3
