SUMMARY:Boat Cruise
DESCRIPTION:Masala Masti Boat Cruise VIII sails into this year with a bang!
 \nEnjoy the ultimate cruising experience in a perfect summer afternoon!\nF
 rom jaw dropping performances to grooving on peppy numbers\,\nTo savoring\
 nmouth - watering delicacies\, you have it all\non board the\nMasala Masti
  Boat Cruise VIII\nSo\, put your dancing shoes on and get on the cruise fo
 r non-stop fun!\n\nLive performances\, awesome music\, and\na mouth wateri
