SUMMARY:GROOVY Thursdays Guided Conscious Dance Party
DESCRIPTION:Every Thursday from 8:00 - 9:30 pm\n\nWhat dance is for the bod
 y\, Groove extends to the soul! Grooving is simply delicious — there's n
 o choreography\, no front or back\, no left or right\, and no judgement. S
 uper simple steps coach mindful movers to connect with their body &amp\; u
 nite in rhythm. Instead of following a leader\, there’s an invitation to
  express your authentic self. Feel grounded by the rhythm\, playful with p
 artners\, &amp\; free to boogie down like no one’s watching. Every Groov
 e class unites holistic intention with a hypnotizing energy that inspires 
 conscious creation\, moving meditation\, connected community\, &amp\; self
 -care!\n\nWear comfortable clothing and footwear. Snacks and beverages are
  available for purchase\, or BYO water.\n$15 drop-in\; $50 / 5-class pass\
 ; $100 / 10-class pass (shareable) GROOVY Thursdays Guided Conscious Dance
  Party
