URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/the-groove-conscious-dance-mom-bab
 y-friendly/
SUMMARY:The GROOVE Conscious Dance (Mom &amp\; Baby Friendly)
DESCRIPTION:This Friday is bring a friend for free day!\n\nImagine a dance 
 class that feels like a party\, where no one cares what you look like\, th
 ere's no way to get the steps wrong\, and you get an amazing mind-body wor
 kout...that's The GROOVE. We dim the lights\, play a wide variety of music
 \, and guide you through a few super simple moves that you do in your own 
 way. Try on different styles\, workout different parts\, de-stress\, breat
 he\, shake\, sweat\, stretch\, meditate\, connect\, smile\, and radiate se
 lf-love.\n\nWhat is conscious dance? Conscious dance is a form of moving m
 editation. It is a fun\, non-competitive\, invigorating practise based on 
 the belief that the mind\, body\, and soul are one\, and that all three ca
 n be awakened through movement\, creative self-expression\, and inspiring 
 music. Let the music stir your whole being to a higher level of consciousn
 ess\, while you get a workout that feels nothing at all like work.\n\nInst
 ructor: Shannon Hancocks\n\nSessions are 1 hour\, from 2 to 3pm\nTaught by
  a certified Groove Movement instructor\nCome alone or bring your child(re
 n)\nPurchase a single class for $20 or cards of 4 classes for $72 or 8 cla
 sses for $120.\nGroove Schedule:\n\nFridays 2-3pm starting September 7th -
  ongoing! The GROOVE Conscious Dance (Mom &amp\; Baby Friendly)
