SUMMARY:Parks N' Wreck 2018
DESCRIPTION:Parks n' Wreck is a one day\, FREE outdoor event aimed to gathe
 r the Toronto streetdance community and local residents at Prairie Drive P
 ark. As part of TAC's Arts in the Parks program\, Parks N' Wreck gets peop
 le outside and socially connected through music and dance.\n\nThe day incl
 udes free workshops in the morning and battles\, featuring the styles of H
 ouse\, Waacking\, and Popping\, as well as showcases throughout the day. I
 t's a day to bring together local residents and artists to enliven our par
 ks and celebrate the diversity and artistry this city has to offer!\n\nSat
 urday • September 08 • 2018\n70 Prairie Dr\, Scarborough\, ON M1L 1L5\
 nBrought to you by Parks N' Wreck and #artsintheparksTO\nAdmission to batt
 le and workshops: FREE\nClosest TTC Station: Victoria Park Station\n\n♢
 ♢♢DJs ♢♢♢\nDJ Dirty Dale | DJ Dirty Dale\nDJ M4RS | www.soundclo
 ud.com/djm4rs\nDJ Iced Misto\n•Spinning Hip Hop\, Funk\, Disco\, House
 •\n\n♢♢♢HOST ♢♢♢\nMariano "Glizzi" Abarca\n(Bag of Trix | Tw
 isted Ankles Dance Crew | ABS CREW (Abstract Breaking Systems) | FOOTNOTES
  | FACTION | Bazaar DANCE Showcase)\n\n♢♢♢BATTLES ♢♢♢\n1X1 HOU
 SE\n1v1 WAACKING\n2v2 POPPING\n\n•PRIZES•\n1st Place WAACKING: $400\n1
 st Place HOUSE: $400\n1st Place POPPING TEAM: $800\n\n•FORMAT•\nBattle
 s begin at Top 16\n\nPreliminary battle showcase rounds to secure a spot i
 n Top 16\nWaitlist begins after 32 dancers. Dancers on waitlist are not gu
 aranteed a preliminary round and will proceed to prelims if a registered d
 ancers does not show up\n\n♢♢JUDGES♢♢\nHOUSE - Lady C\nWAACKING - 
 Ebony\nPOPPING - Icy (Moon Runners)\n\n- POPPING 2V2 -\n[BATTLE GUESTS] CA
 SINO KINGZ\n1. EBC1 (Electric Boogie Company)\n2. EBC2 (Electric Boogie Co
 mpany)\n3. BLVCKOUT SLAYERS\n4. 5cent and Seema\n5. TENSE IMAGE (G-Fun and
  Shiv)\n6. ParaGlyphs\n7. DAMN!\n8. Mina&amp\;Maruša\n9. House of Hunniez
 \n\n- WAACKING 1V1 -\n[BATTLE GUESTS] CADDY MEOW\n[BATTLE GUESTS] WILDFOXY
 \n1. Honey Badger\n2. Wigglypuff\n3. Scorpio\n4. Saki\n5. Drama\n6. Rubie 
 Magnitude\n7. Mr. November\n8. Chawla\n9. David\n10. Chantelle\n11. Colour
 s\n\n- HOUSE 1V1 -\n[BATTLE GUESTS] JEAN-MARC\n1. Miha\n2. Knox\n3. Happy 
 Feet\n4. Crystal\n5. Moose\n6. Cece\n7. Kay\n8. KC\n9. Steve\n10. Afternoo
 n (Mix'd Mafia)\n11. Foo\n12. JESS\n13. Joel\n14. Keys 2 Da House\n15. Far
 rah\n16. Caldeira\n17. Will\n18. Nelly nel\n19. BJ\n20. Kylie\n21. Kate\n\
 n♢♢PLUS SHOWCASES\, CYPHERS\, &amp\; SOCIAL DANCING♢♢\n-------\n\n
 ♢♢TIMELINE♢♢\n•10am Locking workshop with Kosi\n•11am Waacking
  with Ashley Colours Perez\n•12-7pm Mainstage Battle\n\nFor more informa
 tion:\nWebsite: http://www.parksnwreck.ca/\nTwitter: @parksnwreckTO\nInsta
 gram: @parksnwrecktoronto\n\nParks N’Wreck would like to thank the Toron
 to Arts Council for their financial support.\n------- Parks N&#039\; Wreck
  2018
