SUMMARY:Open House at Lindy Hop Revolution
DESCRIPTION:OPEN DOORS! FREE CLASSES\nSomething new and exciting is happeni
 ng in the neighborhood!\nSWING DANCING!\n\nWe are running an open doors da
 y\, with FREE classes and a lot of music. Join us for a fun day! All class
 es are drop-in so no need to register in advance - just show up and join i
 n for the classes you want to try!\n\nSPECIAL DISCOUNTS FOR BEGINNERS\n\nW
 e are located on the 2nd floor at 374 Dupont Street\, with more than 4500 
 sf\, divided into two studios. The dancer's dream!\n\nEveryone is welcome!
 \n\nRemember\, FREE classes!! Bring your friends!\nJOIN THE REVOLUTION!\n\
 nSchedule\nA full day of classes from 11am to 6pm. Each class will be 45mi
 n long\, no need to bring a partner. Please bring a pair of clean shoes to
  change before entering the dance floor.\n\n11am_ Lindy Hop class\n\n12pm_
  Charleston class\n\n1pm_ Balboa class\n\n2pm_ Lindy Hop class\n\n3pm_ Cha
 rleston class\n\n4pm_ Solo Jazz class\n\n5pm_ Lindy Hop class\n\nYou can c
 ome to as many classes as you want! Bring your friends and family!! Open H
 ouse at Lindy Hop Revolution
