URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/polish-heritage-day-in-the-park/
SUMMARY:Polish Heritage Day in the Park
DESCRIPTION:Polky Village Band with support from the Polish Consulate in To
 ronto invite you to the POLISH HERITAGE DAY in the Park!\n\nFREE EVENT cel
 ebrating Polish heritage open to the public with live music and folk danci
 ng from Poland\, Hungary and beyond!\n\nEveryone knows that Poles and Hung
 arians are good friends\, so we invited our Hungarian friends to share the
 ir traditions and dances with us!\n\nDETAILS:\nSaturday\, September 8th\n2
  - 6 PM\nDufferin Grove Park\n875 Dufferin Park Ave\, Toronto\n(beside the
  Big Baking Owen\, on the north - west side of the Park)\n\nSCHEDULE:\n3 -
  4 PM - Polky Village Band – Polish folk music and dancing\n4 - 5 PM - C
 sángó Unchained - Hungarian folk music and dancing\n5 - 6 PM - Eastern E
 uropean jam session (everyone is welcome!)\n\nand more!\n\nABOUT THE BANDS
 \n\nPOLKY VILLAGE BAND\nCreated by two courageous ladies from Poland\, sin
 ger Ewelina Ferenc and dancer Ala Stasiuk\, Polky Village Band is not a ty
 pical "polka band" but an authentic\, energetic Polish-Canadian folk music
  group. The band performs authentic and energetic Polish folk songs and da
 nces that Ewelina and Ala learned while growing up back in Poland.\n\nhttp
 s://polkyband.com/\n\nCSANGO UNCHAINED\nThe band plays traditional Hungari
 an-Moldavian music of the Csángó/Ceangăi people of Romania.\nThey teach
  very simple and fun dances with the accompaniment of live music on unique
  folk instruments like koboz and kaval!\n\nhttps://www.facebook.com/Csango
 Unchained/\n\nFREE ADMISSION!\n\nIf you have any questions please contact 
 Ewelina Ferenc at ewe.ferenc@gmail.com or polkyvillageband@gmail.com.\n\nT
 hank you to the Polish Consulate in Toronto for helping to make this event
  happen. Polish Heritage Day in the Park
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2018/09/20662_image_38747546_1837566346322260_1338924615367393280_n.jpg
CATEGORIES:Folk
LOCATION:Dufferin Grove Park\, 875 Dufferin Street\, Toronto\, ON\, M6H 4J3
 \, Canada
GEO:43.6562;-79.4325
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=875 Dufferin Street\, Toron
