 l over the GTA and 'way beyond for more than seventeen years - since Janua
 ry 2001.\n\nThe practice is held every Saturday\, from 3:30 to 5:30. Admis
 sion is $7.\n\nLots more information (and tons of photos) at www.torontosa
 lsapractice.com and www.facebook.com/pages/Toronto-Salsa-Practice/15963051
