 on social enjoyment!\n\nFresh off his two month excursion to Cuba we thoug
 ht it would be fun if we had the already amazing Sam Mardini kick off our 
 first ever two-part workshop centred around Rumba based shines!\n\nSalsa V
 s Bachata feat. Kizomba\n\nSALSA LESSON: 4-5PM\nRumba infused shines w/ Sa
 m Mardini\n\nSOCIAL: 5PM-8:30PM\nDJ MamboD (September 8th) DJ Tarek (Septe
 mber 15th)\n\nCOVER: (Includes Lesson)\n$10\n\nDress to dance and have fun
 !! Toronto Daytime Salsa I Bachata Party
