 ies\, LGBTQ friendly. We welcome new dancers of all ages\, quite literally
  with open arms!\n\nNew dancers are welcome - please come to the beginner'
 s class at 7pm.\nContra Basics Class: 7:00pm\nContra dance: 7:30-10:30pm T
 oronto Contra Dance
