 us dance experience is needed.\n\nSUNDAY SEPT 9\n2:00-3:00pm\nAges 18+\nNo
  registration required\; just drop-in!\n\nOur adult programs offer the opp
 ortunity to enjoy all the benefits of dance\, including physical fitness\,
  body awareness and confidence.\n\nParticipating dancers should wear or br
 ing comfortable clothing for movement (change rooms available on site) and
  will be barefoot (remove shoes before entering the studio). You also may 
 want to bring a water bottle (no other beverages or food in the studio).\n
