 sy-to-follow cardio moves with resistance training and drumming.\n\nTo par
 ticipate\, all you need to do is show up with your baby (4 months and up) 
 in a car seat. Strollers must be left outside of the center at this locati
 on. Bring a Yoga mat for you and towel for your baby to lay and play on\, 
 a bottle of water\, and wear a comfortable pair of dance or cross training
  shoes.\n\nNo walk-ins allowed. Must register online in advance.\n\nTo tak
 e a class or for more info\, please visit:\nwww.fusioncardiotoronto.com Mo
