SUMMARY:Free Argentine Tango Class with World Class Teachers
DESCRIPTION:Start Argentine Tango with World Class Masters !\nIt is sensual
 \, passionate and they call it the dance of love &lt\;3\nIt is a FREE tast
 ing class for all who are interested in Argentine Tango.\nNO PARTNER requi
 red.\n\nWhy do you want to learn from the best dancers and most experience
  teachers ?\n\n 	 Best techniques &amp\; Good habits. We all know changin
 g bad habits later is painful and takes double amount of effort and time.\
 n 	Tango made simple. Like peeling an onion\, you get to learn the core\, 
 breaking down into the most concise and easy way.\n 	First hand informatio
 n from real professionals\, world class dancers. Tried and true\n 	We unde
 rstand we need to have fun to facilitate learning. Our students become the
  best dancers in community with fastest learning curve.\n 	We are not a co
 mmercial studio\, we are real people and teachers that truly cares and aim
  to build a tango space with the most friendly people\n Free Argentine Tan
 go Class with World Class Teachers
