 y and a serious dose of awesome each time you leave class.\n\nLicensed Ins
 tructor Bianca Bold has prepared a series of low-impact classes for this s
 ession – perfect for Zumba beginners and new moms (little ones are welco
 me to join in carriers/car seats).\n\nTake advantage of our launching spec
