URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/celtic-island-music-festival/
SUMMARY:Celtic Island Music Festival
DESCRIPTION:The Celtic Island Music Festival takes place on Saturday\, Sept
 ember 15 (noon-10pm) on Toronto Island. The event is run by the organizing
  committee behind the St. Patrick's Day Parade.\n\nThis annual celebration
  of Irish-Canadian culture features music and dance performances from the 
 Old World and the New. The stage will be full all day with programming sta
 rting shortly after the doors open. From noon-4pm\, there will be a large 
 children's play area with guaranteed fun for the young and the young at he
 art.\n\nThe Venue\n\nThe Toronto Island BBQ &amp\; Beer Company is located
  beside the main ferry dock on Centre Island. It is fully licensed with a 
 menu broad enough to suit every appetite. Vegetarian options are available
 .\n\nThe facility features a huge deck and multiple shaded areas for those
  who want to get out of the sun. There are several large covered areas in 
 the case of poor weather. The event will go on rain or shine.\n\nPerforman
 ce Schedule\n\nProgramming will begin around 12:30pm. The day will be host
 ed by Hugo Straney with the final schedule being announced shortly before 
 the event. The line-up will feature both modern and traditional performanc
 es including:\n\n• 163 Pipes &amp\; Drums from Hamilton\n• Graham Scho
 ol of Irish Dance\n• Inez Hargaden &amp\; Elaine Ryan\n• Michael O’G
 rady &amp\; The Craic Pipes\n• Shreem Celtic Remixing\n• The Cheery O
 ’s\n• Tiz McNamara\n• Toronto Fire Pipes &amp\; Drums\n\nTicket Info
 \n\n• Available online and at the door (while quantities last)\n• Adva
 nce tickets available here - https://bit.ly/2vCQGIW\n• Adults $20 in adv
 ance and at the door after August 15\n• Children under 12 free are free 
 when accompanied by an adult\n• Price inc. one hotdog\, burger or cold t
 reat (while quantities last)\n\nTransportation\n\n• Transportation to th
 e island not included in ticket price\n• Centre Island ferry schedule - 
 https://bit.ly/2xq2y2C\n• Toronto Harbour Water Taxi - https://bit.ly/2O
 8VVaj\n\nKey Info\n\n• No outside food or alcohol allowed\n• ATM acces
 s on the island is limited so please bring cash\n• Dress appropriately\,
  as the island gets cooler in the evening\n• Sorry\, no pets will be all
 owed Celtic Island Music Festival
