SUMMARY:Intensive TANGO Weekend Workshop for Beginners
DESCRIPTION:Start Argentine Tango with World Class Masters !\nIt is sensual
 \, passionate and they call it the dance of love &#x2665\;\n\nNO PARTNER r
 equired.\n\n2-Day Intensive workshops cover everything you need to know at
  TANGO BEGINNER LEVEL one. It is perfect for busy bees that can't make it 
 to group classes on weekdays.\n\nDate and Time\nSaturday\, 15 Sep and Sund
 ay 16 September\n1pm - 3.30pm on both days.\n\nPre-registration a must at 
 https://bulentylina.com\nFull-time post secondary student or teens: $80 fo
 r 2 days course\n\n**You are also advised to read terms &amp\; conditions 
 as well as TANGO FAQ before coming to class.\n\nYou are learning from some
  of the best teachers in the world in a very warm and welcome space.\n\nQ.
  Why do you want to learn from the best dancers and most experience teache
 rs ?\n\n 	 Best techniques &amp\; Good habits. We all know changing bad h
 abits later is painful and takes double amount of effort and time.\n 	Tang
 o made simple. Like peeling an onion\, you get to learn the core\, breakin
 g down into the most concise and easy way.\n 	First hand information from 
 real professionals\, world class dancers. Tried and true\n 	We understand 
 we need to have fun to facilitate learning. Our students become the best d
 ancers in community with fastest learning curve.\n 	We are not a commercia
 l studio\, we are real people and teachers that truly cares and aim to bui
 ld a tango space with the most friendly people\n\nHope you find this helpf
 ul\nAbrazos\,\nhttps://bulentylina.com Intensive TANGO Weekend Workshop fo
 r Beginners
