DESCRIPTION:Join Mom and Baby Pound Fit to drum your way back to shape whil
 e having fun with your baby and other Toronto moms.\n\nPound Fit combines 
 easy-to-follow cardio moves with resistance training and drumming.\n\nTo p
 articipate\, all you need to do is show up with your baby (4 months and up
 ) in a car seat. Strollers must be left outside of the center at this loca
 tion. Bring a Yoga mat for you and towel for your baby to lay and play on\
 , a bottle of water\, and wear a comfortable pair of dance or cross traini
 ng shoes.\n\nNo walk-ins allowed. Must register online in advance.\n\nTo t
 ake a class or for more info\, please visit:\nwww.fusioncardiotoronto.com 
