 to shape while working out with other moms in Toronto.\n\nLatin Dance Fit 
 is a dance workout that combines easy to follow dance moves and Latin and 
 International rhythms to create an exotic and fun exercise experience. Thi
 s class is low impact to create a fun and safe environment for moms to bon
 d with their babies (4 months and up) and other Toronto moms while getting
  in a workout. No dance experience is required. This is a low impact worko
 ut to accommodate women of all fitness levels.\n\nTo participate\, all you
  need to do is show up with your baby in a car seat or carrier. Strollers 
 must be left outside of the center at this location. Bring a bottle of wat
 er\, and wear a comfortable pair of dance or cross training shoes.\n\nNo w
 alk-ins allowed. Must register online in advance.\n\n&nbsp\; Mom and Baby 
 Latin Dance Fit - Bloor/Runnymede
