SUMMARY:Zumba Fitness Classes – Fall 2018
DESCRIPTION:Come try Zumba Fitness for free and commitment free (valid for 
 new students only)! Our upcoming session at Damask Studios will run every 
 Wednesday at 3:00pm starting on September 19.\n\nZumba Fitness is a total 
 workout\, combining all elements of fitness – cardio\, muscle conditioni
 ng\, balance and flexibility\, boosted energy and a serious dose of awesom
 e each time you leave class.\n\nSave your spot today at bit.ly/fall-zumba 
 - space is limited and filled out on a first-come\, first-served basis. Pl
 ease follow the Eventbrite prompts\, and Bianca will email you shortly.\n\
 nAbout this session\n.This is a low-impact class\, so beginners and new mo
 ms are more than welcome to join (please bring your little one in a carrie
 r or car seat).\n.Pre-registration is required. Please register via Eventb
 rite or Facebook\, and we'll contact you regarding your payment.\n.Punch C
 ards may be used for any 8 of Bianca's Zumba Fitness classes within a year
  of purchase.\n.Everyone entering the studio must bring clean shoes\, as n
 o outdoor shoes are allowed inside.\n.Our Early Bird Special ($10 OFF) is 
 valid for payments completed by September 12 and for punch cards only.\n\n
 Pricing\n.$12 drop-in fee - 1 class\n.$75 Punch Card with 8 classes **EARL
 Y BIRD SPECIAL**\n.$85 Punch Card with 8 classes\n\nPayment options\n.Cash
 \n.Credit card\n.E-transfer\n\nAbout this location\nDamask Studios is just
  steps from Dundas West Station\, and there's a ton of free parking!\n\nFe
 el free to reach out to hello@intofun.ca if you have any questions. :)\n\n
 Cheers!\nBianca Bold\nLicensed Zumba Fitness Instructor\nbiancabold.zumba.
 com Zumba Fitness Classes – Fall 2018
