SUMMARY:NEW BEGINNER FLAMENCO!
DESCRIPTION:Join us in a fun and lively flamenco dance course designed for 
 new students interested in learning flamenco dance. Mondays from 6:45-7:45
 pm\nINTRODUCTION TO FLAMENCO Sept 10 – Nov 5 (8 wks) (no class Oct 8)\nR
 egistration: $145 for 8 wks (includes taxes)\nThis level is for new studen
 ts who have no previous experience. Emphasis will be placed on all areas o
 f technique like footwork\, posture\, arms and rhythms and student will be
  exposed to live flamenco guitar to gain awareness of the music and how it
  relates to the dance. Students will also learn palmas and rhythms related
  to learning a simple but fun choreography. This 8 -week course will have 
 the option to continue for another 5-week session. Email ritmoflamenco@hot
 mail.com for more info. NEW BEGINNER FLAMENCO!
