SUMMARY:Zumbini Trial Class
DESCRIPTION:Come try a Zumbini class for just $10 per family\, commitment f
 ree!\n\nDesigned by Zumba and Baby First for children ages 0-4\, and their
  caregivers\, Zumbini combines music and movement to create the ultimate b
 onding experience! Sing\, dance\, and play together while developing your 
 little one’s social\, cognitive\, emotional and motor skills.\n\nSpace i
 s limited\, and pre-registration is absolutely required. To save your spot
 \, please fill out the form at www.zumbini.com/demo-classes/5869 and follo
 w the payment instructions (credit and e-transfer accepted) you'll get by 
 email. The small $10 fee will go toward your fall session if you register 
 on the spot.\n\nWindermere United Church is just steps from either Jane St
 ation (accessible) or Runnymede Station\, and there's free street parking.
  Details on our upcoming Thursday afternoon session: www.zumbini.com/class
 es/4483 Zumbini Trial Class
