URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/free-zumba-kids-class-fall-2018-2/
SUMMARY:FREE Zumba Kids Class - Fall 2018
DESCRIPTION:Licensed Zumba Kids Instructor Bianca Bold is excited to be lau
 nching Zumba Kids classes this fall at Windermere United Church\, starting
  off with a FREE demo class for kids ages 4 and up!\n\nPlease note space i
 s limited\, and pre-registration is absolutely required. :) To RSVP\, plea
 se click 'Register' here on Eventbrite\, follow the prompts\, and Bianca w
 ill email you shortly.\n\nFall session at this location: www.facebook.com/
 events/997825723753298\n\nZumba® Kids is perfect for our younger Zumba® 
 fans! In this fun class\, kids get the chance to socialize with friends an
 d jam out to their favorite music.\n\nZumba® Kids classes are rockin'\, h
 igh-energy dance parties packed with kid-friendly routines. We break down 
 steps\, add games\, activities and cultural exploration elements into the 
 class structure.\n\nBenefits - Helps develop a healthy lifestyle and incor
 porate fitness as a natural part of children’s lives. Classes incorporat
 e key childhood development elements such as leadership\, respect\, team w
 ork\, confidence\, self-esteem\, memory\, creativity\, coordination\, bala
 nce\, cultural awareness.\n\nAges - 4 and up\nDrop-off program\n\nWinderme
 re United Church is just steps from either Jane Station (accessible) or Ru
