URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/shades-created-by-esie-mensah-sept
 ember-27-30-2018/
SUMMARY:Shades – Created by Esie Mensah
DESCRIPTION:Award-winning dancer and choreographer Esie Mensah presents the
  world premiere of Shades at the Factory Theatre from September 27 – 30\
 , 2018. The work is a powerful and visually striking exploration into the 
 discrimination between lighter- and darker-skinned people within communiti
 es of colour known as shadeism. A stunning piece of dance and theatre\, th
 e deeply personal Shades has been carved from real-life experiences by Men
 sah and her team of six ground-breaking collaborators. The urgent work off
 ers the opportunity to start a conversation of healing across all communit
 ies to ultimately lead towards a path of reconciliation. Shades – Create
 d by Esie Mensah
