 sary-conference/
SUMMARY:Healthy Dancer Canada 10th Anniversary Conference September 28 - 30
 \, 2018.
DESCRIPTION:Healthy Dancer Canada's annual conference brings together dance
 rs\, dance educators\, dance scientists\, health care professionals and da
 nce families for a weekend of networking and learning. Through lectures\, 
 workshops\, posters\, panels and performances\, attendees share in the op
 portunity to pool their respective knowledge and resources to enhance the 
 health\, well-being and performance of all dancers.\n\nhttps://www.youtube
 .com/watch?v=36Zmc0Ytl80\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nThis year we are celebrating the la
 st decade of Healthy Dancer Canada’s growth and community impact. Our 10
 th Anniversary Conference theme is Create\, Communicate\, Collaborate.\n
 \n​Healthy Dancer Canada endeavours to highlight the many facets of a d
 ancer’s lifespan\, and the importance of an interdisciplinary approach t
 o knowledge translation and application to practice.\n\nCreate\, Communica
 te\, Collaborate aims to encourage all attendees to utilize their creativ
 e skill sets\, communicate both their personal and collective experience\,
  and collaborate effectively together to realize Healthy Dancer Canada’s
  vision of optimal health\, well-being and performance for all dancers. Th
 e Keynote Address will be given by Donna Krasnow\, PhD. Healthy Dancer Can
 ada 10th Anniversary Conference September 28 - 30\, 2018.
