SUMMARY:Ballet Variations with Irene Yacoub
DESCRIPTION:Calling adult ballet dancers of all levels. Move beyond the bar
 re and discover variations from five timeless ballets\, including Swan Lak
 e\, the Nutcracker\, and Jewels.\n\nThis exciting and challenging offer fr
 om Joy of Dance allows dancers to hone their performance skills\, with the
  rare opportunity to perform for family and friends at the end of each thi
 rd week. Classes will feature a short and dynamic warmup at the barre\, fo
 llowed by a comprehensive dive into repertoire from classical and modern b
 allets.\n\nTaught by Irene Yacoub\, a former member of corps de ballet of 
 the Cairo Opera Ballet\, this class is suitable for dancers with 2+ years 
 of recent ballet experience\, and can be taken in either soft shoes or poi
 nte shoes.\n\nRegister online at www.joyofdance.ca or meet us in class and
  jump-in! Ballet Variations with Irene Yacoub
