URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/west-coast-swing-ladies-styling-se
 crets-5/
SUMMARY:West Coast Swing – Ladies Styling Secrets
DESCRIPTION:*** Feel and Look Better Than Ever On The Dance Floor! ***\n\nW
 hether you want to add some shaping and style to your West Coast Swing\, o
 r improve the quality of your movement\, this ladies styling class reveals
  all the little secrets to fun and gorgeous West Coast Swing.\n\nYou’ll 
 learn:\n\n– How to move your body with confidence\n– Body isolations\n
 – Beautiful arm styling\n– Shaping v​ariations on basic patterns\n
 – Timing variations\n– Creating beautiful lines\n– How to be the bes
 t dancer you can be with any style or level of leader\n\nShelley’s easy 
 to learn ladies styling tips for West Coast Swing will have you looking an
 d feeling awesome on the dance floor!\n\nWHEN:\n\nSaturday\, September 29\
 , 2018\n3pm to 5pm\n1st Floor\, Dovercourt House\, 805 Dovercourt Rd.\n\nP
 re-registration by Sept 28 - $25\nAt the door - $30\n\nFor more informatio
 n or to pre-register\, click the “More Info” tab at the top of this li
 sting\, or visit www.ShelleyDance.com\n\nClass size is limited so please r
 egister as soon as possible to confirm your spot.\n\nIf you have any quest
 ions whatsoever\, please don’t hesitate to contact Shelley.\n\n*** FREQU
 ENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS ***\n\nQ. Do I need to come with a partner?\n\nNo\, 
 you do not need a partner for the class. This is a followers ONLY class so
  no partner is required.\n\nQ. What type of shoes should I wear?\n\nIf you
  already have dance shoes\, then bring those. If you don’t have dance sh
 oes\, then something with a leather or suede sole is best. If not\, then j
 ust wear your most comfortable pair of shoes.\n\nQ. What type of clothes s
 hould I wear to class?\n\nWear whatever you will feel most comfortable in.
  West Coast Swing is a very casual dance so wear your favorite jeans and t
 -shirt if you want.\n\nQ. Who is the instructor?\n\nYour instructor is She
 lley Saxena. Shelley has been dancing\, studying and competing in West Coa
 st Swing for 18 years. With an extensive background in Jazz\, Ballet and M
 odern dance\, Shelley now specializes in West Coast Swing.\n\nQ. Do I need
  any previous dance experience to take the Styling class?\n\nThis is not a
  class for complete beginners. You must have at least one year of recent e
 xperience as a follower in West Coast Swing and be comfortable with the 6-
 count and 8-count basics.\n\nQ. I still have a question about the class. C
 an you help?\n\nOf course! If you have any other questions\, please don’
 t hesitate to contact Shelley by clicking the “More Info” tab at the t
 op of this listing\, or visiting her website www.ShelleyDance.com. She wil
 l be very happy to help you any way she can.\n\nQ. I’m excited to get st
 arted! What’s my next step?\n\nSimply click the “More Info” tab at t
 he top of this listing to let Shelley know you’d like to register\, or c
 ontact her at her website www.ShelleyDance.com (class size is limited so i
 t’s important to make sure you reserve your spot). West Coast Swing – 
 Ladies Styling Secrets
