 u will find a series of activations where you will be able to jam out to m
 usic\, learn new dance moves and describe special moments you had with str
 angers and friends alike while bonding over music. Sidewalk Salsa is a s
 afe\, bright and colourful space for all Torontonians to enjoy – whether
