SUMMARY:Panic: 80's & 90's Video Dance Party
DESCRIPTION:Saturday Sept 29\, 2018 - Living On Video Presents -\nPANIC - 8
 0's &amp\; 90's Video Dance Party w/ U2 Spotlight with DJ Lazarus\n\nCome 
 dancing with hundreds of like minded retro people at PANIC.\n\nYou'll be d
 ancing to extra U2 tracks from their earlier career (80's &amp\; 90's) pla
 yed throughout the night mixed into the PANIC format.\n\nPANIC is a brilli
 ant evening of new wave\, post-punk\, classic alternatives\, synth pioneer
 s\, britpop\, shoegaze\, madchester\, new romantic\, classic industrial\, 
 ska\, and more.\n\nSaturday Sept 29\, 2018\nPANIC - Video Dance Party w/ U
 2 Spotlight\nRemix Lounge - 1305 Dundas St West - Toronto\n10pm-3am 19+ ev
 ent\n\n----------\n\nLiving On Video is a full service video dance product
 ion company. We setup over $20\,000 worth of professional video gear to cr
 eate a unique and memorable video dance experience. Living On Video is boo
 kable for your next corporate event\, wedding\, store opening\, film wrap 
 party\, or private event.\n\nDJ Lazarus has been djing since 1993 and has 
 created some of Toronto most beloved alternative events.\n\n&nbsp\; Panic:
  80&#039\;s &amp\; 90&#039\;s Video Dance Party
