URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/toronto-international-dance-festiv
 al-tidf-2018/
SUMMARY:Toronto International Dance Festival TIDF-2018
DESCRIPTION:The 5th Annual Toronto International Dance Festival (TIDF) will
  spotlight the phenomenal caliber of dance and dancers from the city and G
 TA.\n\n20 professional dance companies will present their own latest and e
 xclusive productions\, showcasing more than 25 dance styles at this festiv
 al.\nDance styles like Bharathnatyam\, Ballet\, Break Dance\, Bollywood\, 
 Serbian\, Capoeira\, Salsa\, Chhau\, Aerial\, Tap\, Tango\, Kuchippudi\, J
 apanese\, Chinese\, Spanish\, Irish\, Fan Dance\, Jewish\, Odissi\, Portug
 uese\, Hip Hop\, Kathak\, Belly Dance\, Bolivian\, Afghanian\, Mexican and
  more…… will be presented there for you to witness a mosaic fusion of 
 multicultural dance styles amplified in exhilarating theatrical performanc
 es showcasing rhythmic patterns and dynamic sequential art forms.\n\nhttps
 ://youtu.be/GTIPHZ9Eewk\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nAlso you can meet and greet highly a
 cclaimed dance instructors and professional choreographers at the festival
  and find out how you can join beginner classes in a particular dance styl
 e\, polish technique and form or create a masterpiece choreography to your
  favourite musical selection. This will be a golden opportunity for dance 
 students\, teachers and dance lovers to learn about different varieties of
  dance styles in the world.\n\n“Dynamic and distinguished\, the event is
  ground-breaking in its ability to offer a singular platform for performer
 s from a myriad of backgrounds to showcase their talent and love for the p
 erforming arts. This one-of-a-kind model has allowed TDIF to emerge as one
  of the GTA’s most attended events: a must-come for artists and art love
 rs far and wide. The event brings together members of the entire community
 \, bound together by their love and appreciation for the arts.” said Mar
 y Ashok\, managing director at Dancing Damsels.\n\nTIDF is the only dance 
 festival in Canada that encompasses all dance forms from across the globe.
  In addition to the performances\, the festival is a community bonding opp
 ortunity. With vendors situated around the forum offering food\, drink and
  even custom clothing\, TIDF is the perfect family night-out.\n\nhttps://w
 ww.youtube.com/watch?v=CkYNPLoQ1KY\n\n“The arts and culture are a vibran
 t part of life in this province\, and it is wonderful to see this celebrat
 ion of dance bring so many people together. The diverse talent being showc
 ased today is truly inspiring\,” said honourable Sylvia Jones\, minister
  of tourism\, culture and sport\, in greetings to the organizers.\n\n&nbsp
 \; Toronto International Dance Festival TIDF-2018
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2018/07/SHOWCARD-FINAL3.jpg
