SUMMARY:Salsa/Latin Dance Classes
DESCRIPTION:Salsa\, Cha Cha\, Bachata\, Merengue\, Rumba …\n\nThe emphasi
 s is on DANCING. The focus is on Salsa\, with excursions into Rumba\, Cha 
 Cha\, Merengue and Bachata. You’ll learn to move to and with\, the rhyth
 m and tempo of the music and apply the movements learned to the various da
 nces.\n\nFall classes will begin Monday Oct. 1st - so you better dust off 
 those dancing shoes and prepárate para calentar la pista de baile.\nPartn
 er not required. All levels welcomed.\n\n9 lessons (9 weeks)\nMondays\, 7:
 00pm - 8:30pm - 1 1/2hrs.\n\nStarts Monday Oct. 1st\, 2018\n(Oct. 1st - No
 v. 26th)\n\nPartner not required. All levels welcomed.\nFree Parking.\n\nT
 o Register By Phone - 416-338-4386 [7am - 5pm].\n\nYou can also register i
 n person at the North York Civic Ctr.\n\n 	Hispanic Dance Instructor\n 	 
 18 years teaching in dance studios\, night clubs\, privately and with recr
 eation organizations.\n 	Qualified Dance Instructor\n 	25+ years of dance 
 experience in Latin\, Ballroom and Swing.\n\nDeep Experience. Trusted Inst
 ruction Salsa/Latin Dance Classes
