SUMMARY:Free Newcomer Girls Zumba and Latin Dance Program
DESCRIPTION:Newcomer girls ages 10 to 17 years old living in the Flemingdon
  Park community are welcome to join us for a chance to learn some new move
 s to popular music\, have fun\, and meet new friends. All classes include 
 volunteer hours for high school\, meals\, and dance bags.\n\nClasses held 
 on Wednesdays and Saturdays at Flemingdon Health Center - 10 Gateway Blvd\
 , Toronto\, ON.\n\nFor more information/to see if you're eligible to join\
 , please e-mail us: fusioncardiotoronto@gmail.com. Free Newcomer Girls Zum
 ba and Latin Dance Program
