SUMMARY:Zumba Fitness Classes – Fall 2018
DESCRIPTION:Come try Zumba Fitness for free and commitment free (valid for 
 new students only)! Our upcoming session at Windermere United Church will 
 run every Thursday at 2:00pm starting on September 27.\n\nZumba Fitness is
  a total workout\, combining all elements of fitness – cardio\, muscle c
 onditioning\, balance and flexibility\, boosted energy and a serious dose 
 of awesome each time you leave class.\n\nSave your spot today at bit.ly/zu
 mba-wuc – space is limited and filled out on a first-come\, first-served
  basis. Please follow the Eventbrite prompts\, and Bianca will email you s
 hortly.\n\nAbout this session\n.This is a low-impact class\, so beginners 
 and new moms are more than welcome to join (please bring your little one i
 n a carrier or car seat).\n.Pre-registration is required. Please register 
 via Eventbrite or Facebook\, and we'll contact you regarding your payment.
 \n.Punch Cards may be used for any 8 of Bianca's Zumba Fitness classes at 
 Damask Studios or Windermere United Church (or other locations that might 
 become available) within a year of purchase.\n.Everyone entering the studi
 o must bring clean shoes\, as no outdoor shoes are allowed inside.\n.Our E
 arly Bird Special ($10 OFF) is valid for payments completed by September 2
 7 and for punch cards only.\n\nPricing\n.$12 drop-in fee - 1 class\n.$75 P
 unch Card with 8 classes **EARLY BIRD SPECIAL**\n.$85 Punch Card with 8 cl
 asses\n\nPayment options\n.Cash\n.Credit card\n.E-transfer\n\nAbout this l
 ocation\nWindermere United Church is just steps from either Jane Station (
 accessible) or Runnymede Station\, and there's free street parking.\n\nFee
 l free to reach out to hello@intofun.ca if you have any questions. :)\n\nC
 heers!\n\nBianca Bold\nLicensed Zumba Fitness Instructor\nbiancabold.zumba
 .com Zumba Fitness Classes – Fall 2018
