SUMMARY:Toronto Salsa Practice
DESCRIPTION:A friendly\, informal weekly gathering of salsa dancers of all 
 levels. No formal instruction - we practice or just dance for fun. You don
 't need to come with a partner.\n\nBringing together salsa dancers from al
 l over the GTA and 'way beyond for more than seventeen years - since Janua
 ry 2001.\n\nWe meet every Saturday\, from 3:30 to 5:30. Admission is $7.\n
 \nLots more information (and tons of photos) at www.torontosalsapractice.c
 om and www.facebook.com/pages/Toronto-Salsa-Practice/159630517485078.\n\nF
 eel free to contact us at info@torontosalsapractice.com or 416-536-7663. T
 oronto Salsa Practice
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2018/04/28mar15_11.jpg
CATEGORIES:Salsa
