 o Register By Phone - 416-338-4386 [7am - 5pm].\n\n 	Hispanic Dance Instru
 ctor\n 	18 years teaching in dance studios\, night clubs\, privately and w
 ith recreation organizations.\n 	Qualified Dance Instructor\n 	25+ years o
