SUMMARY:Zumba Fitness Classes – Fall 2018
DESCRIPTION:Come try Zumba Fitness for free and commitment free – Offer v
 alid for new students in October only! Our current session at Windermere U
 nited Church is running every Thursday at 2:00pm.\n\nZumba Fitness is a to
 tal workout\, combining all elements of fitness – cardio\, muscle condit
 ioning\, balance and flexibility\, boosted energy and a serious dose of aw
 esome each time you leave class.\n\nSave your spot today at bit.ly/zumba-w
 uc – space is limited and filled out on a first-come\, first-served basi
 s. Please follow the Eventbrite prompts\, and Bianca will email you shortl
 y.\n\nAbout this session\n.This is a low-impact class\, so beginners and n
 ew moms are more than welcome to join (please bring your little one in a c
 arrier or car seat).\n.Pre-registration is required. Please register via E
 ventbrite or Facebook\, and we’ll contact you regarding your payment.\n.
 Punch Cards may be used for any 8 of Bianca’s Zumba Fitness classes at D
 amask Studios or Windermere United Church (or other locations that might b
 ecome available) within a year of purchase.\n.Everyone entering the studio
  must bring clean shoes\, as no outdoor shoes are allowed inside.\n\nPrici
 ng\n.FREE - 1 free trial class in October (new students only)\n.$12 drop-i
 n fee – 1 class\n.$85 Punch Card with 8 classes\n\nPayment options\n.Cas
 h\n.Credit card\n.E-transfer\n\nAbout this location\nWindermere United Chu
 rch is just steps from either Jane Station (accessible) or Runnymede Stati
 on\, and there’s free street parking.\n\nFeel free to reach out to hello
 @intofun.ca if you have any questions. &#x1f642\;\n\nBianca Bold\nLicensed
  Zumba Fitness Instructor\nbiancabold.zumba.com Zumba Fitness Classes – 
 Fall 2018
