SUMMARY:Audition for the Steps Teams
DESCRIPTION:Open Audition for Steps Teams on Saturday October 13th.\n\nAudi
 tion for Men's Team: 4pm-5pm\nAudition for Ladies' Teams: 4pm-5pm\nAuditio
 n for Amateur Co-ed Team: 5pm-7pm\n\nThis is your chance to step our of yo
 ur shell and unleash your inner performer! If you have a hunger to perform
 \, have knowledge of Salsa and Bachata basics\, are able to commit to atte
 nding weekly rehearsals and have a great team spirit\, this is for you!!!\
 n\nTrain in body isolations\, body movement\, shines\, styling\, spins\, p
 artnerwork\, dips and tricks\, plus dance and performance technique. We no
 rmally only hold auditions one time per year so don't miss out!\n\nAuditio
 n is FREE. No preparation necessary for the audition.\n\nTo reserve your a
 udition spot\, please email angelo@stepsdancestudio.com by Thursday Octobe
 r 11th. Audition for the Steps Teams
