 n\nNo dance experience required. Classes are always beginner-friendly and 
 low to medium impact to accommodate those from all fitness levels. Classes
  are drop-in friendly.\n\nTotally welcoming moms and their teenage daughte
 rs to create time for mother and daughter bonding too.\n\n&nbsp\; Women&#0
