UID:2662@torontodance.com
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20181117T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20181117T170000
DTSTAMP:20181030T021259Z
URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/west-coast-swing-ladies-styling-se
 crets-6/
SUMMARY:West Coast Swing – Ladies Styling Secrets
DESCRIPTION:*** Feel and Look Better Than Ever On The Dance Floor! ***\n\nW
 hether you want to add some shaping and style to your West Coast Swing\, o
 r improve the quality of your movement\, this ladies styling class reveals
  all the little secrets to fun and gorgeous West Coast Swing.\n\nYou’ll 
 learn:\n\n– How to move your body with confidence\n– Body isolations\n
 – Beautiful arm styling\n– Shaping v​ariations on basic patterns\n
 – Timing variations\n– Creating beautiful lines\n– How to be the bes
 t dancer you can be with any style or level of leader\n\nShelley’s easy 
 to learn ladies styling tips for West Coast Swing will have you looking an
 d feeling awesome on the dance floor!\n\nWHEN:\n\nSaturday\, November 17\,
  2018\n3pm to 5pm\n1st Floor\, Dovercourt House\, 805 Dovercourt Rd.\n\nPr
 e-registration by Nov 16 – $25\nAt the door – $30\n\nFor more informat
 ion or to pre-register\, click the “More Info” tab at the top of this 
 listing\, or visit www.ShelleyDance.com\n\nClass size is limited so please
  register as soon as possible to confirm your spot.\n\nIf you have any que
 stions whatsoever\, please don’t hesitate to contact Shelley.\n\n*** FRE
 QUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS ***\n\nQ. Do I need to come with a partner?\n\nNo\
 , you do not need a partner for the class. This is a followers ONLY class 
 so no partner is required.\n\nQ. What type of shoes should I wear?\n\nIf y
 ou already have dance shoes\, then bring those. If you don’t have dance 
 shoes\, then something with a leather or suede sole is best. If not\, then
  just wear your most comfortable pair of shoes.\n\nQ. What type of clothes
  should I wear to class?\n\nWear whatever you will feel most comfortable i
 n. West Coast Swing is a very casual dance so wear your favorite jeans and
  t-shirt if you want.\n\nQ. Who is the instructor?\n\nYour instructor is S
 helley Saxena. Shelley has been dancing\, studying and competing in West C
 oast Swing for 18 years. With an extensive background in Jazz\, Ballet and
  Modern dance\, Shelley now specializes in West Coast Swing.\n\nQ. Do I ne
 ed any previous dance experience to take the Styling class?\n\nThis is not
  a class for complete beginners. You must have at least one year of recent
  experience as a follower in West Coast Swing and be comfortable with the 
 6-count and 8-count basics.\n\nQ. I still have a question about the class.
  Can you help?\n\nOf course! If you have any other questions\, please don
 ’t hesitate to contact Shelley by clicking the “More Info” tab at th
 e top of this listing\, or visiting her website www.ShelleyDance.com. She 
 will be very happy to help you any way she can.\n\nQ. I’m excited to get
  started! What’s my next step?\n\nSimply click the “More Info” tab a
 t the top of this listing to let Shelley know you’d like to register\, o
 r contact her at her website www.ShelleyDance.com (class size is limited s
 o it’s important to make sure you reserve your spot). West Coast Swing 
 – Ladies Styling Secrets
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2018/10/ladies-styling.jpg
CATEGORIES:West Coast Swing
LOCATION:Dovercourt House\, 805 Dovercourt Road\, Toronto\, Ontario\, Canad
 a
GEO:43.662777;-79.429512
