SUMMARY:Citadel + Compagnie: Citadel Dance Mix 2018
DESCRIPTION:Citadel + Compagnie proudly presents its inaugural seasonal tri
 ple bill Citadel Dance Mix 2018\, running November 21–24 &amp\; November
  28–December 1 at The Citadel: Ross Centre for Dance.\n\nSome of Toronto
 ’s most exciting and sought-after dance creators will present three elec
 trifying works:\n\n 	Lady Baby choreographed by DA Hoskins follows a woman
  — her myth\, her sexuality\, her stories — in an exploration of ident
 ity.\n 	Allison Cummings’ As she shall obtain such command of her mass v
 ein passageways is an unraveling and despairing duet between a dancer and 
 her desire to control\, and\n 	Tori Mehaffey presents the world premiere o
 f Avoidance\, commissioned by Citadel + Compagnie for Bright Nights\, abou
 t the resurfacing of embedded events.\n Citadel + Compagnie: Citadel Dance
  Mix 2018
