 ic and exhilarating Latin dances. These ongoing classes will focus on Samb
 a no Pé\, for beginner to intermediate level students. We break the steps
  in a clear and methodical way\, providing you with a framework to learn t
 his fast syncopated dance\, its body movements and flavor.\n\nPrice (HST a
 pplicable):\nDrop-in: $19\nFlex card of 5 lessons: $85\nFlex card of 10 le
 ssons: $155\nFlex card of 20 lessons: $275 BRAZILIAN SAMBA - Ongoing Begin
 ner/Intermediate Classes
