URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/audition-for-female-dancers/
SUMMARY:Audition for Female Dancers
DESCRIPTION:AfroLatino Dance Co. is looking for dancers to join their team 
 for performances throughout the GTA! We are a Toronto based company specia
 lizing in Brazilian carnival as well as Cuban Cabaret styles of shows\, pe
 rforming for over 13 years at a variety of events and venues in Ontario an
 d Quebec.\n\n★★ Audition Date: Saturday\, December 1\, 2018\n★★ Au
 dition Time: 2:00pm - 3:00pm\n★★ Registration: 1:30pm-2:00pm\n\nWHAT W
 E ARE LOOKING FOR:\n★ Versatile female dancers with some ballet and/or j
 azz technique as well as improvisational skills\n★ Latin dance experienc
 e (preferably Cuban) a plus\n★ African dance experience a plus\n★ Be 1
 8 years old or older\n★ Be attractive and physically fit\n★ All ethnic
 ities welcome\n\nFURTHER REQUIREMENTS:\n★ Must be available to rehearse 
 every Thursday from 5:30 to 7:00pm\, at our studio\n★ Must have availabi
 lity for majority of shows which are usually on weekends (night time)\n★
  Availability to take additional in-house training in related dance forms 
 (samba\, afro-cuban\, salsa)\n\nWHAT WE OFFER:\n★ All shows are paid alt
 hough rehearsals are not\n★ Dance training in Cuban (Afro-Cuban\, Salsa\
 , Mambo\, Cha Cha Cha\, Rumba\, Conga) and Brazilian Samba\n★ Performanc
 e experience in a variety of environments\n\nContact: www.afrolatinodance.
 com / info@afrolatinodance.com Audition for Female Dancers
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
