SUMMARY:Peck the Halls: The 5th Annual BKD Holiday Dance Party
DESCRIPTION:HOLIDAY AT THE HIVE!\n\nToss on something festive and come by t
 he Dovercourt House for a peckin' good time hosted by your team of dancin'
  Bee-Keepers! Join us for some hilarious contests\, delicious snacks\, buz
 z-worthy performances and of course\, some of the best social dancing Toro
 nto has to offer!\n\nAll are welcome: bring your non-dancing honey and sho
 w off our Bee-eautiful Colony of Bees!\n\n7:30PM - Holiday Tease Beginner 
 Lesson\n8:00PM - Talk &amp\; Toddy Time\nDANCE DANCE DANCE until 11:00PM!\
 n_________________________\n\nBEES SWARM THE STAGE\nMany of our December c
 lasses feature mini-choreography challenges\, all of which will be perform
 ed by some amazing Bees during the party! Registration for choreo classes 
 will be up soon!\n_________________________\n\nTIPPLES N' TREATS\nWe'll be
  baking up some pot-luck holiday snacks\, but we can't do it alone! Donati
 ons of the edible variety are most certainly encouraged.\n\nGot a hankerin
 ' for holiday hooch? The cash bar will be available to spike your Toddys a
 nd more.\n_________________________\n\nPAY WHAT YOU CAN\nT'is the season o
 f giving! The party is our gift to you\; so proceeds will be donated to a 
 charity TBA.\n_________________________\n\nCover art by Kris Light. Peck t
 he Halls: The 5th Annual BKD Holiday Dance Party
