 king tapestry of seasonal dance inspired by the world’s rich solstice tr
 aditions. A world premiere by Dora Award-winning choreographer Hanna Kiel 
 highlights the program\, set to an original score by Greg Harrison and Fra
 nces Miller with live musical performance by Miller. Also featured are the
  return of Against the Dark by Colin Connor (Artistic Director\, Limón Da
 nce Company)\, Sylvie Bouchard’s exquisite Petits rêves\, Apolonia Vela
 squez’s hyper-kinetic contemporary street dance fusion UNHUSH\, and Caro
 l Anderson’s signature creation for the mid-winter season\, Nowell Sing 
 We. WinterSong - dances for a sacred season
