SUMMARY:Jennifer Archibald's ARCHCORE Winter Dance Intensive (Contemporary 
 &amp\; Hip Hop)
DESCRIPTION:Jennifer Archibald's ARCHCORE Dance Intensive is coming to Toro
 nto December 27th\n\nOn Dec 27th\, New York City based Canadian Choreograp
 her Jennifer Archibald (bio) is holding her ArchCore Winter Intensive at T
 he School of Toronto Dance Theatre. This is a 3-hour contemporary and hip 
 hop event open to advanced professional and pre-professional dancers that 
 will incorporate the technical fundamentals of modern dance and hip hop in
 to a gritty street level execution of contemporary dance.\n\nIn this progr
 am\, Jennifer pushes dancers athletically to move with and against gravity
  and lyrically fly across space\, encompassing the hard edge of street dan
 ce and the fluidity of classical technique. The intensive includes a 90 mi
 n technique class\, repertory\, partnering\, and improvisation acting conc
 epts.\n\nParticipants are eligible to win a partial scholarship or early a
 dmission to Jennifer's 1-week ArchCore40 NYC Summer Intensive.\n\n&nbsp\; 
 Jennifer Archibald&#039\;s ARCHCORE Winter Dance Intensive (Contemporary &
 amp\; Hip Hop)
