DTEND:20181231T190000Z
DTSTAMP:20181228T013812Z
URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/ecstatic-dance-toronto-new-years-e
 ve-celebration/
SUMMARY:Ecstatic Dance Toronto - New Years Eve Celebration
DESCRIPTION:A beautiful extended New Years Eve Gathering of Music\, Dancing
 \, Naming our Desires\, and Indulgence in Food and Community-inspired Crea
 ting and Celebrating!\n\nWhen we sat down and began to imagine how to put 
 together an unforgettable evening\, we took into account what can so often
  make New Years an ungrounded and frantic night that ends up missing somet
 hing vital. What came through so clearly is to simply have a celebration w
 here we get EXACTLY what we ALL Love ...only MORE of it and then some MORE
 ! So we are giddy to be offering an extended 4 HOUR Ecstatic Dance Journey
  where we really get to dance our hearts out!\n\nWe are also driven to cre
 ate an experience where we get to name what we really want for the coming 
 year and then powerfully root and grow an intention around this.\n\nSo we 
 would like to ask you to consider NOW...\n\nWHAT DO YOU WANT?? What would 
 you like to give a Big Juicy YES to?! … and perhaps a Big Fat NO to?! Yo
 u will have the option to partake in a variety of intention expanding acti
 vities that we have scheduled for the evening to Energize the resolve to p
 ursue what you want!\n\nDancing freely with our tribe\, we will celebrate 
 all of life through this ritual of dance until midnight\, greeting the fir
 st winds of the new year with a Group Intention Ritual that every willing 
 member of our community will be able to partake in. Then a toast and reple
 nishment of our dance saturated bodies with Kombucha supplied by Cathy’s
  Kombucha. This will be followed by the re-gathering of our community in a
  full Hearty Delicious Vegan Meal enjoyed in the delight of our post-dance
  hunger. Dessert will follow.\n\nFlowing into community-inspired Music\, S
 inging and\; Sound Making (so bring your own instruments)\, Art and anythi
 ng organic and participatory that you would like to share\, guide and insp
 ire us into. Please share your inspirations on our FB event page. A crysta
 l bowl sound bath will also be held and lead by Jesse buck.\n\nThe festivi
 ties will continue until 3am.\n\nThere is a limited capacity for the eveni
 ng\, so please purchase your tickets in advance.\n\nEVENING FLOW:\n\n 	7p 
 | 1-HR WELCOMING DANCE | DJ RAY\n 	8p | OPENING CIRCLE with CORE ENERGETIC
 S EXERCISES (optional) to charge up your intentions for the year.\n 	9p | 
 3-HR ECSTATIC DANCE JOURNEY | DJ RAY and DJ GREGORY\n 	12a | MIDNIGHT CERE
 MONY with KOMBUCHA BREW at CLOSING CIRCLE followed by HEARTY VEGAN MEAL WI
 TH DESSERT!!!\n 	...until 3am | CELEBRATION WITH COMMUNITY-INSPIRED MUSIC 
 MAKING\, SINGING\, SOUNDING\, DANCING\, ART ETC. SOUND BATH with JESSE BUC
 K\n\nTICKETS: At the Door (NYE):- $65 (Subject to availability)\n\nWhere:
 \n- Dovercourt House\,  3rd Floor\n\n*** This is a Drug and Alcohol-FREE 
 event ***\n\nLook forward to celebrating this fabulous night with you all!
 \n\n**NOTE: If you are unable to pay the full admission price due to your 
 financial circumstances\, please contact us by FB messenger or email (rock
 stoneconsultin@gmail.com) to let us know your situation. We wouldn't want 
 to turn anyone down for financial reasons. We may need help with food &amp
 \; cleaning &amp\; could work out an exchange with a certain number of tic
 kets that could be offered at a reduced rate.​ Ecstatic Dance Toronto - 
 New Years Eve Celebration
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2018/12/21400_image_47447341_1420997034698186_620625484396363776_o.jpg
CATEGORIES:Ecstatic,Experimental
LOCATION:Dovercourt House\, 805 Dovercourt Road\, Toronto\, Ontario\, Canad
 a
GEO:43.662777;-79.429512
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=805 Dovercourt Road\, Toron
 to\, Ontario\, Canada;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Dovercourt House:geo:43.6
 62777,-79.429512
END:VEVENT
