 uring-bertie-the-gents-2/
SUMMARY:New Years Eve Swing Ball 2019 featuring Bertie &amp\; The Gents!
DESCRIPTION:Come to Toronto's New Years Eve Swing Ball 2019!\n7pm to 3am.\n
 \nSingles welcome. Couples welcome. No prior experience is needed. There's
  no need to bring your own dance partners. Big sprung wood dance floor in 
 high ceilinged hall. Licensed bar. Subway and parking close by.\n\nLindy H
 op (classic swing dance) beginner class before the Party 8pm to 9pm.\n\nBa
 ll 9:15pm to 3am.\n\nBand: Bertie (Robert Hunt) &amp\; The Gents!\nThis is
  one of Toronto's best and favourite swing dance bands!\n\nDJ Nomad when t
 he band is on break.\n\nParty favours included with admission.\n\nDressing
  up is encouraged.\n\nPlease invite your friends.\n\nSome light snacks wil
 l be served at 12:15am (no charge)\, and if you like you may also bring yo
 ur own snacks. (But of course don't bring your own drinks because there is
  a bar\, and of course bringing your own alcoholic drinks is illegal.)\n\n
 Early bird prices til December 15\, Party $25\, $30 with the beginner clas
 s\, $5 off for full-time students.\n\nPrices after December 15 and at the 
 door\, Party $30\, $35 with the beginner class\, $5 off for full-time stud
 ents. Advance tickets can be purchased at Saturday Night Swing. (If you wi
 sh to buy advance tickets but cannot come to Saturday Night Swing contact 
 Swing Toronto re paying online.) New Years Eve Swing Ball 2019 featuring B
 ertie &amp\; The Gents!
