SUMMARY:Nia Technique
DESCRIPTION:This is a Nia Technique class.\n\nNia combines dance\, martial 
 arts\, and mindfulness with heart-pumping music to create a high-energy wo
 rkout without any straining or forcing. Nia conditions your body while tra
 nsforming your self-awareness\, body image\, and agility.\n\nIt is not yet
  another fitness trend designed to make you feel bad about your body. The 
 magic of Nia is that although many participants attend their first class b
 ecause they want to become stronger\, more flexible\, or healthier but the
 y stay because it works.\n\nNia is effective and enjoyable for all bodies:
  no matter your age\, ability\, shape\, size\, or mobility. It adapts to y
 ou\, where you are\, without losing the benefits or the amount of fun you 
 have. Nia Technique
