URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/ellison-ballet-summer-intensive-au
 dition-tour-toronto-audition/
SUMMARY:Ellison Ballet Summer Intensive Audition Tour - TORONTO AUDITION
DESCRIPTION:TORONTO AUDITION FOR ELLISON BALLET SUMMER PROGRAMS\n\n 	Ages 1
 2-14 Check-In: 12:00pm Audition: 12:30-2:00pm\n 	Ages 15-19 Check-In: 1:30
 pm Audition: 2:00-3:30pm\n\nMr. Edward Ellison will conduct the auditions.
 \n\nAudition for three unique summer programs in New York City that offer 
 the highest quality ballet education for serious students.\n\nELLISON BALL
 ET SUMMER INTENSIVE\nJune 24-July 19\, 2019\n4-Week Program\nAges 12-19\nT
 his session is designed for students who wish to experience concentrated e
 xposure to exceptional classical ballet training in New York City. The cur
 riculum affords an excellent opportunity to greatly improve technical skil
 l\, develop greater self-awareness and gain a deeper understanding of indi
 vidual artistic potential.\n\nCLASSICAL VARIATIONS INTENSIVE\nJuly 22-Augu
 st 2\, 2019\n2-Week Program\nAges: 13-19 *Ladies Only\nThis special progra
 m is for young ladies who wish to be immersed in the details of classical 
 ballet variations. The curriculum includes daily classes in classical tech
 nique\, pointe\, and intensive study of some of the most famous choreograp
 hy in the history of ballet.\n\nCLASSICAL PAS DE DEUX INTENSIVE\nJuly 22-A
 ugust 2\, 2019\n2-Week Program\nAges: 16+\nThis exclusive program will foc
 us on the study of various pas de deux from the great classical ballet rep
 ertoire\, immersing students in the pas de deux\, variations\, and codas a
 ssociated with each selected ballet.\n\nYEAR-ROUND PROFESSIONAL TRAINING P
 ROGRAM\nSeptember 2019-May 2020\nAges: 12-19\nThis year-round program is d
 esigned to meet the needs of those dedicated students\, from across the U.
 S. and abroad\, who seek the highest standard of classical ballet educatio
 n to prepare for a professional career. Working daily under Edward Ellison
 ’s artistic direction\, and his faculty’s careful guidance\, students 
 develop the essential skills to fully explore and realize their greatest i
 ndividual potential. This program is based on the Vaganova method\, a syst
 em of training that is logical\, thought-provoking\, inspiring and highly 
 effective. There is great emphasis on our men’s program\, focusing on th
 e development of the power\, stamina\, and masculinity associated with str
 ong male technique.\n\n___________________\n\nAUDITION REQUIREMENTS\n–Ap
 plicants should be between 12-19 years of age and have a strong basic clas
 sical foundation in relation to their level and age. (11-year-olds may aud
 ition as long as they are age 12 by June).\n–Dancers should audition wit
 h the age group that they fall into on the date of the audition.\n\nAUDITI
 ON PROCESS\n–Audition Registration Fee: $40\n–Please bring two recent 
 photos to your audition: 1st arabesque and tendu a la seconde. Photographs
  will not be returned.\n–Girls should wear a solid color leotard and ful
 l-length pink tights with ballet slippers\, and should bring pointe shoes.
  Boys should wear white t-shirts and full-length black tights.\n–Upon co
 mpleting a summer intensive audition\, participating students will receive
  a letter indicating acceptance\, wait-list\, or non-acceptance within thr
 ee weeks.\n\nREGISTER TO AUDITION NOW at website below. Ellison Ballet Sum
 mer Intensive Audition Tour - TORONTO AUDITION
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2018/12/Summer2019Ad_Toronto_small.jpg
CATEGORIES:Ballet,Kids / Youth
LOCATION:Canadian Contemporary Dance Theatre\, 509 Parliament St.\, Toronto
 \, Ontario\,  M4X 1P3\, Canada
GEO:43.665091;-79.367973
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=509 Parliament St.\, Toront
 o\, Ontario\,  M4X 1P3\, Canada;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Canadian Contem
 porary Dance Theatre:geo:43.665091,-79.367973
END:VEVENT
