 ompletion of the workshop\, you may join our Level 2 Cha Cha class running
  Sundays February 3 - February 24 at 1pm.\n\nWho's it for?\n\nOpen to stud
 ents in Salsa levels 2-5. No prior Cha Cha experience required.\n\nPrice\n
 \n$60 for 4 weeks.\n10 and 20 Class Cards can also be used for this worksh
 op. FREE for Steps students on monthly auto-renew membership (Must be memb
 er for duration of workshop). FREE for Steps students on an annual members
 hip. Cha Cha Foundations at Steps Studio
