SUMMARY:Hustle Foundations Part 1
DESCRIPTION:First 4 weeks of a two-part 8-week intensive for students new t
 o Latin Hustle. Learn the Hustle basic step\, popular Hustle turns and tur
 n patterns. Learn hustle technique\, how to lead and follow well and turn 
 patterns to get you started on the dance floor. Already know some Salsa? L
 ike partner dancing but don’t always hear Salsa music at the functions y
 ou go to? For those of you who don’t know what Latin Hustle is\, think o
 f applying your Salsa turn patterns to different music such as House\, Old
  School\, Top 40 and Disco and therefore a different beat. It is so much f
 un! Dance with a partner to practically any song anywhere! Hustle Foundati
 ons Part 1
