SUMMARY:Viennese Waltz beginner workshop
DESCRIPTION:3pm to 6pm.\n\nLearn traditional Viennese Waltz\, one of the be
 st and most fun partner dances ever\, popular since the early 19th century
 \, and done all around the world! Done to great music of the 21st\, 20th a
 nd 19th centuries\, usually at tempos from medium to very fast.\n\nIt is e
 asy to learn.\n\nNo prior experience is needed\, there is no need to bring
  your own dance partners\, and it is easy to learn.\n\nTeachers: Bonnie &a
 mp\; Simon.\n\nThis workshop focuses on Right Turning Viennese Waltz (revo
 lving to your right as you travel around the room with a partner). If you 
 take this workshop you can also take our Viennese Waltz intermediate works
 hop on Saturday January 26.\n\n$30. ($10 if you have taken this workshop w
 ith us before.)\n\nSchedule: www.mostlywaltz.ca Viennese Waltz beginner wo
 rkshop
