 ove to and with\, the rhythm and tempo of the music and apply the movement
 s learned to the various dances.\n\nWinter classes will begin Sunday Jan. 
 13\, 2019 - so you better dust off those dancing shoes and prepárate para
  calentar la pista de baile.\nPartner not required. All levels welcomed.\n
 \nAdults (19+)\n$109 for 9 lessons (9 weeks)\nSundays\, 6:00pm - 7:30pm - 
 1 1/2hrs in an actual dance studio.\n\nParkway Forest C. C.\n55 Forest Man
 or Rd.\n(East of Don Mills Rd. &amp\; South of Sheppard Ave. E and Fairvie
 w Mall)\n\nStarts Sunday Jan. 13th\, 2019\n(Jan. 13th - Mar. 10th)\n\nFree
  Parking.\n\nTo Register By Phone - 416-338-4386 [7am - 5pm].\n\nYou can a
 lso register in person at the North York Civic Ctr.\n\n* Hispanic Dance In
 structor\n* 18 years teaching in dance studios\, night clubs\, privately a
 nd with recreation organizations.\n* Qualified Dance Instructor\n* 25+ yea
 rs of dance experience in Latin\, Ballroom and Swing.\nDeep Experience. Tr
 usted Instruction Salsa/Latin Dance Classes (Club Latin)
