SUMMARY:Yoga for Dancers
DESCRIPTION:The Yoga for Dancers class aims to build up strength and flexib
 ility which is extremely important for a dancer’s body. It will give stu
 dents the time and space to disconnect from their hectic life and bring aw
 areness into the breath and the functions of the body. Come try this new Y
 oga class with Steps’ very own Emily\, which will allow you to build a s
 trong mind/body connection. Open to all levels. No previous yoga experienc
 e required. Please wear stretchy\, comfortable clothing (no jeans\, no soc
 ks\, no shoes). Please bring a yoga mat (we have some yoga mats but not en
 ough for everyone).\n\nWho's it for?\n\nOpen to all levels.\nNo prior Yoga
  experience required.\n\nPrice\n\n$20 drop-in per class.\n10 and 20 Class 
 Cards can also be used for this class. FREE for Steps students on monthly 
 auto-renew membership. FREE for students with an annual membership. Yoga f
 or Dancers
