DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20190117T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20190117T210000
DTSTAMP:20181124T215716Z
URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/eve-of-st-george-an-unnerving-inte
 ractive-theatre-experience-2/
SUMMARY:Eve of St. George - An Unnerving Interactive Theatre Experience
DESCRIPTION:Event Description\nFollowing a sold-out run last January\, Tran
 scendance Project’s award-winning artistic director Julia Cratchley anno
 unces the return of EVE OF ST. GEORGE\, an immersive dance production insp
 ired by New York City’s smash-hit theatrical experience Sleep No More.\n
 \nEqual parts unnerving and seductive\, EVE OF ST. GEORGE is a voyeuristic
  and immersive recreation of Bram Stoker’s chilling tale of Dracula\, sc
 ored by award-winning Canadian composer Owen Belton. Upon arrival\, guests
  don masks and are set free to roam the four levels of The Great Hall\, re
 -imagined as a gothic Victorian setting for the stories of 16 characters 
 — both choreographed and improvised — to unfold. Each guest decides th
 eir own path for the evening\, by choosing to follow a character\, rifflin
 g through their personal effects as they travel through the building\, or 
 remaining in one room to watch what unfolds — and perhaps even interacti
 ng with a character. This is the first interactive theatrical experience o
 f its kind in Toronto.\n\nShowtimes:\n\nJanuary 17 - 20\, 2019 | 7:00 pm\n
 January 24 - 27\, 2019 | 7:00 pm\n\nLate-Night Showtimes:\n\nJanuary 19 &a
 mp\; 26\, 2019 | 10:15 pm\n\nTickets: $60 general admission\, $90 VIP expe
 rience. Available here: https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/eve-of-st-george-ticke
 ts- 49927595783\nVIP tickets include priority entry\, coat check\, a glass
  of pre-show bubbly and a program signed by the cast Eve of St. George - A
 n Unnerving Interactive Theatre Experience
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2018/11/eosg2019posterTWO.MEDIA-copy.jpg
CATEGORIES:Contemporary
LOCATION:The Great Hall\, 1087 Queen Street West\, Toronto\, Ontario\, Cana
 da
GEO:43.643200;-79.422096
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=1087 Queen Street West\, To
 ronto\, Ontario\, Canada;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=The Great Hall:geo:43.
 643200,-79.422096
END:VEVENT
