X-SOURCE:Toronto Dance
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/
UID:2810@torontodance.com
DTSTART:20190117T193000Z
DTEND:20190117T235900Z
DTSTAMP:20190112T203033Z
URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/ecstatic-dance-toronto-3-hr-dance-
 jan-17/
SUMMARY:Ecstatic Dance Toronto - 3 HOUR DANCE
DESCRIPTION:DJ Patsy Kambitsch will bring you into 3 hours of delicious dan
 ce from 7:30 – 10:30pm. Lifelong dancer\, learning coach\, and multidisc
 iplinary artist\, DJ Patsy brings playful possibility wherever she goes. P
 atsy's influences include clown\, Butoh\, and street performance. Her ecle
 ctic musical journeys include jazz\, funk\, old school house\, electronica
 \, and beats from around the world.\n\nPatsy will also be guiding us throu
 gh a Butoh-inspired moving meditation experience\, allowing us to heighten
  our attention to our own senses. As we deeply give our full presence to t
 he sensations of our moving bodies\, we can more fully access what’s tru
 e and real for us\, move with our body’s wisdom\, drop into ourselves an
 d what comes up on the dance floor and in our lives.\n\nFollowing our ecst
 atic dance\, Julia Ray will then continue into our Intention Ceremony wher
 e everyone can revisit\, state &amp\; reclaim what we desire for this comi
 ng year. Everyone will then be invited to congregate on our dance floor f
 or some delicious hearty probiotic salad\, homemade by Ian\, and socialize
  until midnight.\n\nThis is a special evening with lots of dance\, enliven
 ing experiences &amp\; food.\n\nAdmission for the night will be $25 at the
  door. Ecstatic Dance Toronto - 3 HOUR DANCE
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2019/01/21538_image_49637479_1444898788974677_7885714698832707584_o.jpg
CATEGORIES:Butoh,Ecstatic
LOCATION:Dovercourt House\, 805 Dovercourt Road\, Toronto\, Ontario\, Canad
 a
GEO:43.662777;-79.429512
