SUMMARY:Epic Teen Dance Party in a Nightclub for Teens
DESCRIPTION:GLOW EVENT CENTRE AND PARTY LOUNGE\n\nAre you a dancer\, lookin
 g to take your passion outside of the studio but don't have anywhere to go
 ? Grab your friends and come on out to out dance party just for teens in a
  nightclub especially for teens ages 13-16.\n\nSafe. Fun. Unique\n\nDance 
 to the latest tunes spun by our talented DJ\, make song requests\, get you
 r glow on with face and body paint\, relax with friends in our VIP booths 
 (on availability)\, walk the red carpet and take selfies\, hang out or dan
 ce up a storm.\n\nConcert style light and sound\nVIP Birthday party packag
 es available\nSecurity\nParent Lounge available\nFood and beverages availa
 ble at The Glow Store inside the venue\n\nTickets are advanced sales only 
 due to limited capacity. Please call 905-660-5555 or visit http://www.glow
 eventcentre.com/public-events.html Epic Teen Dance Party in a Nightclub fo
 r Teens
