URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/strength-cardio-dance-party/
SUMMARY:Strength & Cardio Dance Party
DESCRIPTION:SIGN UP FOR YOUR FREE CLASS!\n\nLadies\, join the fun! Do somet
 hing good for YOU and make this 1 hour your new weekly party. Combining da
 nce fitness and strength training\, I will help you achieve your health go
 als! Vibe to the best of latin\, soca\, dancehall\, hip hop and more!\n\n
 Most of all\, it's about working out while having FUN! There's no judgment
 \, no right or wrong\, and low impact / high impact options for all our la
 dies. I want you to feel challenged but also feel like this is a class tha
 t you enjoy being in!\n\nIf you're a busy woman during the week with no ti
 me for exercise (or you enjoy doing a variety of activities) and don't wan
 t to sign up for memberships of doing classes that you don't enjoy\, then 
 this is the perfect opportunity to fit in 1 hour of feel-good sweat and ca
 lorie burn to fun music.\n\nIncludes:\n\n 	Bi-monthly Meal Plan Inspiratio
 n Guides (emailed to you twice per month)\n 	Bi-monthly In-Home Exercise G
 uides (emailed to you twice per month)\, so you can practice these moves a
 t home\n 	Recipe booklets (during special times of the year)\n 	Accountabi
 lity group (because we're all a group of women that need that extra push a
 nd help along the way)\n 	A fun fitness instructor (I'm your cheerleader\,
  cheering you on every step of the way)\n 	Free giveaways from time to tim
 e\, and much more!\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nFAQs\n\nWhat are my transportation/parkin
 g options for getting to and from the event?\n\nClose to Morningside / Hwy
  401\, there is free parking on site. The dance studio is up the stairwell
 \, on the 2nd floor. Just come on in!\n\nWhat can I bring into the event?\
 n\nPlease bring water\, a yoga mat\, and towel (optional).\n\nHow can I co
 ntact the organizer with any questions?\n\nContact Jasmin at info@greensou
 lvibe.com. Strength &amp\; Cardio Dance Party
