 juries and miscommunications.\n \nPrices: Note the workshop price includes
  FREE admission to the Steps Studio Party that night\, Sat. January 19\, f
 rom 8pm-1am\nIn advance: $50 non-members\, $40 members\nAt the door: $60 n
 on-members\, $50 members Social Sensual Bachata Workshop
