SUMMARY:Citadel + Compagnie: SKOW — January 30 – February 2\, 2019
DESCRIPTION:Citadel + Compagnie proudly present through Bright Nights the w
 orld premiere of SKOW\, running January 30–February 2\, 2019 at the Cita
 del: Ross Centre for Dance. Choreographed by William Yong of Zata Omm Danc
 e Projects\, SKOW is a full-length solo created for Johanna Bergfelt that 
 transforms the ordinary into extraordinary through Yong’s inventive expl
 oration of wonder and curiosity. The title is an acronym derived from the 
 phrase ‘some kinds of wonder\,’ and intentionally sparks curiosity. Yo
 ng will take advantage of the Citadel’s intimate setting by inviting aud
 iences to accompany Bergfelt on an emotional journey that merges the profo
 und with the ridiculous and the quotidian with the sublime.\n\nTickets $20
 -$25. Full details at citadelcie.com Citadel + Compagnie: SKOW — January
  30 – February 2\, 2019
