 ience is needed and there is no need to bring your own dance partners. Big
  sprung wood dance floor.\n\nTeachers: Bonnie &amp\; Simon.\n\n$30. (Just 
 $10 if you have taken this workshop with us before.) Note that if you take
  this workshop you can also take the Cross-step Waltz intermediate the fol
 lowing Saturday.\n\nWebsite\, waltz pages\, Waltz Schedule: mostlywaltz.ca
  Cross-step Waltz beginner workshop
