 ot-stompers-beginner-classes/
SUMMARY:Saturday Night Swing with Sugar Foot Stompers + beginner classes
DESCRIPTION:Everyone is welcome! No prior experience is needed. There is no
  need to bring your own dance partners. Parking and subway are close by. L
 icensed bar.\n\nBeginner dance classes 7pm to 9pm before the Dance Party\,
  Charleston 7pm\, Lindy Hop 8pm.\nTeachers: Dave Tom &amp\; partner.\n\nSw
 ing Dance Party 9:10pm to 1am.\nBand: Sugar Foot Stompers!\n\nDJ Nomad on 
 the band's breaks.\n\nPlease invite your friends.\n\nThe event is 19 years
  old and up after 10pm. Teenagers under 19 are very welcome to attend til 
 then (for just $10 for both classes and the dance til 10pm). If you are un
