SUMMARY:Introductory Women’s Bollywood Dance Fitness
DESCRIPTION:Bollywood City Fitness is a dance workout that combines easy to
  follow dance movements and exercises and beautiful rhythms spanning from 
 South Asia to the Middle East. No dance experience required.\n\nThis is a 
 low to moderate impact class to accommodate women of all fitness levels an
 d ages. Totally welcoming moms and their teenage daughters (ages 13 to 17)
  to create time for mother and daughter bonding.\n\nFor more info\, visit:
  https://fusioncardiotoronto.com/. Introductory Women’s Bollywood Dance 
 Fitness
