SUMMARY:Women's Barre Workout
DESCRIPTION:If you've always wanted to learn ballet as an adult but were to
 o scared to take a class\, here's your chance! This fun workout program co
 mbines Ballet dance movements\, slow flexibility exercises\, and resistanc
 e training (using your own body weight) to burn fat and tone your body’s
  appearance\, improve flexibility\, and build strength. Classes combine ch
 airs and resistance bands on occasion.\n\nNo dance experience required. Cl
 asses are always beginner-friendly and adapted for women of all ages and f
 itness levels.\n\nFor more info\, please visit: https://fusioncardiotoront
 o.com/ Women&#039\;s Barre Workout
