SUMMARY:Opera Atelier: The Angel Speaks — February 21\, 2019
DESCRIPTION:Opera Atelier presents a gorgeous one-hour concert experience m
 elding musical masterpieces by the great English composer Henry Purcell wi
 th baroque dance – and a new Canadian commission.\nWith Mireille Asselin
  (soprano)\, Jesse Blumberg (baritone)\, Artists of Atelier Ballet in baro
 que costume\, and members of Tafelmusik Baroque Orchestra.\nThe Angel Spea
 ks also features Edwin Huizinga’s Annunciation\, a new commission first
  performed at the Royal Chapel in Versailles in December 2018.\nFollowing 
 the performance\, join us at an informal reception to meet the artists. Li
 ght refreshments/cash bar available. (9pm to 10pm)\nSamuel Hall Currelly G
 allery at the Royal Ontario Museum\n100 Queens Park\nToronto\, ON\nM5S 2C6
  Opera Atelier: The Angel Speaks — February 21\, 2019
