SUMMARY:The House of Hustle Social
DESCRIPTION:A collaboration between Steps Dance Studio\, T.O Hustle Session
 s and Joy of Dance Centre\n\nA whole night just for Hustle! We love hustle
  dancing and want to create an event every couple of months where the whol
 e Toronto hustle community can come together\, practice\, socialize and da
 nce the night away. Everyone welcome – all levels\, all ages. No partner
  necessary\, most dancers switch partners every song. And if you don’t k
 now how to dance hustle\, don’t worry – come at 9pm and we will teach 
 you.\n\nHustle lesson from 9pm-9:45pm\nDancing until 1am to DJ Iced Misto 
 (mostly Hustle with a bit of Salsa\, Bachata and West Coast Swing) The Hou
 se of Hustle Social
