URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/celebration-of-life-gathering-for-
 anna-devuyst/
SUMMARY:Celebration of Life Gathering for Anna Devuyst
DESCRIPTION:Anna Devuyst\, ballroom dance performer\, competitor\, teacher\
 , adjudicator\, and proprietor of Koreatown's Anna's Dance Centre\, passed
  away peacefully this September 4\, 2018.\n\nFamily of Anna Devuyst invite
  former students\, friends\, tenants\, and teachers (including CDTA profes
 sionals) who knew Anna to attend her Celebration of Life Ball on Friday\, 
 Feb. 22 from 7 to 11 pm\, at Anna's Dance Centre\, 622 Bloor St West (a bi
 t west of Bathurst TTC Station). There is no admission charge.\n\nThose wh
 o knew Anna may bring an escort or partner\, whether their partner knew An
 na or not.\n\nDoors open\, and the dance music starts\, at 7pm. Anyone wis
 hing to share a memory of Anna can ask for the microphone between dance so
 ngs.\n\nThe family will provide sandwiches\, salad and some other food\, s
 imilar to how Anna often put out for dances\, as well as coffee\, tea\, wa
 ter\, and maybe pop or juice. People are also welcome to bring their own d
 ishes to share\, as in the pot lucks Anna often held.\n\nPeople may dress 
 as they wish\, but Anna's nephew Frank says to show off your best -- and s
 piciest -- dance clothes\, to impress Anna!\n\nPlease spread the word to t
 hose who knew Anna. Both the upstairs and downstairs studios will be open.
  Come and sign the guestbook\, even if you have other plans for the evenin
 g. Celebration of Life Gathering for Anna Devuyst
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2019/02/anna-devuyst.jpg
CATEGORIES:Ballroom,Latin
LOCATION:Anna's Dance Centre\, 622 Bloor Street West\, Toronto\, Canada
GEO:43.66467309999999;-79.41427529999999
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=622 Bloor Street West\, Tor
 onto\, Canada;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Anna's Dance Centre:geo:43.664673
 09999999,-79.41427529999999
END:VEVENT
