SUMMARY:Saturday Night Swing fts Shim Sham Band + beginner classes
DESCRIPTION:Everyone is welcome! No prior experience is needed. There is no
  need to bring your own dance partners. Parking and subway are close by. L
 icensed bar.\n\nBeginner dance classes 7pm to 9pm before the Dance Party\,
  Charleston 7pm\, Lindy Hop 8pm.\nTeachers: Dave Tom &amp\; partner.\n\nSw
 ing Dance Party 9:10pm to 1am.\nBand: Shim Sham Band!\n\nDJ Roy on the ban
 d's breaks.\n\nPlease invite your friends.\n\nThe event is 19 years old an
 d up after 10pm. Teenagers under 19 are very welcome to attend til then (f
 or just $10 for both classes and the dance til 10pm). If you are under 19 
 you may stay past 10pm only with parental accompaniment. (This is a policy
  of the venue\, not of Swing Toronto.)\n\nWebsite: swingtoronto.com\n\nFac
 ebook events: https://www.facebook.com/groups/157279846382/events/\n\nDanc
 e Party $15\, $17 with one class\, $20 with both. $5 off for full-time stu
 dents. Saturday Night Swing fts Shim Sham Band + beginner classes
