SUMMARY:Intermediate Pointe Workshop with Irene Yacoub
DESCRIPTION:Calling all ballet dancers!\n\nLooking to take your pointe work
  from the barre to centre stage? Beginning March 1st\, Joy of Dance will b
 e offering a monthly Intermediate Pointe Workshop\, for only $65 for 4 ses
 sions.\n\nTaught by Irene Yacoub\, a former member of the Cairo Opera Ball
 et\, this class is intended to build dancers technique and ease on pointe.
  Designed for dancers with 3+ years pointe experience\, this workshop will
  be split into 4 sessions (Mar 1\, Apr 5\, May 3\, Jun 7)\, Fridays 7:30 -
  9 PM.\n\nRegistration for this workshop is required in advance. Dancers c
 an miss one session\, with 24 hrs notice\, can apply the credit to one of 
 our JOD jump-in classes. Keep an eye out on our social media for more info
 rmation\, coming soon. Intermediate Pointe Workshop with Irene Yacoub
