URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/right-to-dance-free-contemporary-c
 lasses-2/
SUMMARY:Right To Dance Free Contemporary Classes
DESCRIPTION:FREE Drop In Dance Class for young people 16-29 living on the m
 argins.\nEvery Wed 6-8pm\n+ Free Meal 4-5pm\n\nContemporary Dance is fun\,
  physical\, and emotionally expressive dance form. Come learn it in an aff
 irming environment for LGBTQ &amp\; BIPOC folks.\n\nEach session will have
  a guided warm up\, stretch and conditioning\, movement in the centre\, &a
 mp\; movement that travels through the space. This class draws from variou
 s movement techniques including: modern\, contemporary\, kung fu\, hip hop
 \, street styles\, &amp\; ballet\, to create a hybrid form of contemporary
  dance.\n\n**No experience necessary. Dialogue is encouraged. Movement var
 iations with lower impact are discussed and provided to create greater acc
 essibility\n\nClasses will be facilitated by Sze-Yang Ade-Lam of ILL NANA/
 DiverseCity Dance Company- a queer multiracial dance company that embraces
  difference as strength and are committed to changing the landscape of dan
 ce by performing our stories on stage as well as providing more accessible
  education and performance opportunities for LGBTTIQQ2S communities priori
 tizing people of colour\, various body types\, backgrounds\, classes\, and
  abilities. ILL NANA/DCDC coordinates and facilitates Right To Dance: free
  affirming drop-in dance classes and 2 month intensive.\n\n&nbsp\; Right T
 o Dance Free Contemporary Classes
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2019/02/21821_image_51758549_2189399944415720_1527343417598672896_o.jpg
CATEGORIES:Contemporary,LGBT
LOCATION:SKETCH Working Arts\, 180 Shaw Street\, lower level\, Toronto\, ON
 \, M6J 2W5\, Canada
GEO:43.6469;-79.41755
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=180 Shaw Street\, lower lev
 el\, Toronto\, ON\, M6J 2W5\, Canada;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=SKETCH Wor
 king Arts:geo:43.6469,-79.41755
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Toronto Dance
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/
UID:2887@torontodance.com
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20190306T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20190306T213000
DTSTAMP:20190228T050006Z
URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/reset-90-min-immersive-dance-exper
 ience/
SUMMARY:RESET: 90 min immersive dance experience
DESCRIPTION:Next Wednesday (March 6)\, Reset is hosting a 90-min dance part
 y and experiment in group flow through movement\, sound and light from 7-9
 pm at 918 Bathurst. We're taking pieces of our annual weekend away and bri
 nging it to the city\, to create more access\, more regularly. No phones\,
  no photos and no speaking -- just dance.\n\nWe held our first one in Dece
 mber\, and it was such an energizing and life-giving experience. All the s
 erotonin of a Friday rager\, but on a Wednesday\, and in bed by 10pm!\n\nT
 his month we will explore Groundwork -- the seeds we are sowing\, planting
  and tending to in service of our future self\, vision\, and becoming.\n\n
 Global sounds and diverse musical journey curated by DJ SnazzieJ\n\nTicket
 s available here: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/reset-in-the-city-tickets-5
 6219860115\n\n*******\nThis is a tech-free\, consent driven\, co-created a
 nd brave space. We aim to hold space for BIPOC and LGBTQ2+ folks.\n\nRegre
 ttably\, we have not been able to secure an affordable space that is acces
 sible for folks with mobility devices\, but continue to look for a suitabl
 e venue.\n\n*******\nReset produces immersive experiences that transport f
 olks into deeply present and playful alternative realities that have the p
 ower to shift perspectives. RESET: 90 min immersive dance experience
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2019/02/Email-1-Graphic.png
CATEGORIES:Experimental,Therapeutic
LOCATION:918 Bathurst Centre\, 918 Bathurst Street\, Toronto\, Canada
GEO:43.668594;-79.4130002
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=918 Bathurst Street\, Toron
 to\, Canada;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=918 Bathurst Centre:geo:43.668594,-
 79.4130002
END:VEVENT
