SUMMARY:Hustle Foundations
DESCRIPTION:Continue on your Hustle journey. For those who have taken our 4
 -week Hustle Foundations Part 1 or who have taken a couple of Hustle works
 hops in the past. This 4-week course will teach you the hustle technique y
 ou will need to social dance well and some new turns and patterns to add t
 o your repertoire. Once students have completed Hustle Foundations Part 2\
 , they may join the Hustle Level 2 weekly course.\nWho's it for?\n\nComple
 tion of Part 1 required to join Part 2 (or approval of instructor). Studen
 ts must start on the first day.\nPrice\n\n$60 for 4 weeks.\n10 and 20 Clas
 s Cards can also be used for this workshop. FREE for Steps students on mon
 thly auto-renew membership (Must be member for duration of workshop). FREE
  for Steps students on an annual membership. Hustle Foundations
