URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/casino-foundations-5/
SUMMARY:Casino Foundations
DESCRIPTION:4-week intensive for students new to Casino Rueda. This crash c
 ourse workshop will teach you the Casino fundamentals.\n\nCasino Rueda is 
 a Cuban form of salsa often described as "Salsa in a Circle". Building on 
 the basic salsa step\, it combines new turn patterns with a rotational mov
 ement of the whole circle\, exchanging partners continually throughout the
  song. It is a great way to interact with other people\, have fun and add 
 variety to your salsa at the same time! After completion of this course\, 
 you can join the Casino Rueda Level 2 class on Tuesdays at 9pm.\nWho's it 
 for?\n\nOpen to levels 2-5\, or people with at least 4 months experience d
 ancing Salsa. Previous Casino Rueda experience not required. Students must
  start on the first day.\nPrice\n\n$60 for 4 weeks.\n10 and 20 Class Cards
  can also be used for this workshop. FREE for Steps students on monthly au
 to-renew membership. (Must be member for duration of workshop). FREE for S
 teps students with an annual membership Casino Foundations
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2019/02/march_casino.jpg
