SUMMARY:Triangle Squares Drop-in Fun Night
DESCRIPTION:For our March installment\, we're holding the dance at St. Hild
 a's College\, 44 Devonshire Pl.\, on the U of T Campus. Barry Clasper is b
 ack\, and sharing the microphone is line-dance caller Bobby Chong from the
  Toronto Wranglers.\n\nBring sensible shoes\, and a sense of adventure. We
 'll explore various forms of social dance: circles\, lines\, contras and s
 quares. No lessons necessary\, we'll walk you through each dance on the sp
 ot. No need to sign up for lessons\, this is just meant to be a good-old-t
 ime mixer. Each month we hope to have a different caller\, who will bring 
 a different mix of dances. Refreshments provided. Triangle Squares Drop-in
  Fun Night
