DTSTAMP:20190305T204914Z
URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/farnaz-ohadi-and-mashregh-ensemble
 -present-bird-dance-a-persian-flamenco-concert/
SUMMARY:Farnaz Ohadi and Mashregh Ensemble present: Bird Dance -  A Persian
  Flamenco Concert
DESCRIPTION:Canadian Folk Music Award Nominee\, Farnaz Ohadi\, weaves the s
 oft lyricism of Persian poetry with the intoxicating rhythms of flamenco a
 nd Latin percussion in her latest album and touring concert ‘Bird Dance
 ’. Performing what has become known as Persian-Flamenco\, Ohadi is accom
 panied by the Eastern-inspired Mashregh Ensemble\, comprised of world-reno
 wned musicians on flamenco guitar\, santur\, cajon\, bass\, and flamenco d
 ancers.\n\nThe title\, “Bird Dance” conveys the repression of female a
 rtists in Iran and features lyrics that build on the metaphor of the caged
  bird yearning to sing. From here\, she takes the audience through a journ
 ey of spiritual conflict and resolution\, unimaginable revelations of relo
 cating to a foreign land\, the hope needed to move forward\, and the joy i
 n building a new life while looking back with pride. She sings with defian
 ce and passion as she declares her love for her cultural roots and her int
 entions dignify it in the only way she knows how: through music. Farnaz Oh
 adi and Mashregh Ensemble present: Bird Dance -  A Persian Flamenco Concer
 t
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2019/03/Tirgan_NowruzPoster_Bird-Dance_SM.jpg
CATEGORIES:Flamenco
LOCATION:Meridian Arts Centre\, 5040 Yonge St\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M2N 6R8
 \, North York\, Canada
GEO:43.766058;-79.414495
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=5040 Yonge St\, Toronto\, O
 ntario\, M2N 6R8\, North York\, Canada;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Meridian
  Arts Centre:geo:43.766058,-79.414495
END:VEVENT
