SUMMARY:Saturday Night Swing with Denielle Bassels Swing Band + beginner cl
 asses
DESCRIPTION:Everyone is welcome! No prior experience is needed. There is no
  need to bring your own dance partners. Parking and subway are close by. L
 icensed bar.\n\nBeginner dance classes 7pm to 9pm before the Dance Party\,
  Charleston 7pm\, Lindy Hop 8pm.\n\nSwing Dance Party 9:10pm to 1am.\nBand
 : Denielle Bassels Swing Band!\n\nPlease invite your friends.\n\nThe event
  is 19 years old and up after 10pm. Teenagers under 19 are very welcome to
  attend til then (for just $10 for both classes and the dance til 10pm). I
 f you are under 19 you may stay past 10pm only with parental accompaniment
 . (This is a policy of the venue\, not of Swing Toronto.)\n\nWebsite: swin
 gtoronto.com\n\nFacebook events: https://www.facebook.com/groups/157279846
 382/events/\n\nDance Party $15\, $17 with one class\, $20 with both. $5 of
 f for full-time students. Saturday Night Swing with Denielle Bassels Swing
  Band + beginner classes
