SUMMARY:Viennese Waltz beginner workshop
DESCRIPTION:3pm to 6pm.\n\nLearn traditional Viennese Waltz\, one of the be
 st and most fun partner dances ever\, popular since the early 19th century
 \, and done all around the world! Done to great music of the 21st\, 20th a
 nd 19th centuries\, usually at tempos from medium to very fast. Easy to le
 arn.\n\nNo prior experience is needed\, and there is no need to bring your
  own dance partners.\n\nTeachers: Bonnie &amp\; Simon.\n\nThis workshop fo
 cuses on Right Turning Viennese Waltz (revolving to your right as you trav
 el around the room with a partner). If you take this workshop you can also
  take our Viennese Waltz intermediate workshop on Saturday January 26.\n\n
 $30. ($10 if you have taken this workshop with us before.)\n\nfacebook: ht
 tps://www.facebook.com/groups/142519259606/ Viennese Waltz beginner worksh
 op
