SUMMARY:Sensual Bachata Workshop
DESCRIPTION:With Angelo &amp\; Jena. In the Social Sensual Bachata Workshop
 \, Angelo and Jena will focus on the technique behind dancing Sensual Bach
 ata and the etiquette to dance it socially. We will concentrate on connect
 ion\, body isolations\, and more importantly\, gauging and understanding o
 ur partners’ capabilities and comfort level to prevent injuries and misc
 ommunications. This workshop will have different content than the January 
 workshop.\nWho's it for?\nStudents in Bachata levels 2 - 5.\nNo partner ne
 cessary. Students will be rotating partners during workshop.\nPrice\n\nSte
 ps Members: $40 in adv/$50 at door\nNon Members: $50 in adv/$60 at door\nP
 rice includes FREE admission to Steps Studio Party that night\, 8pm-1am (i
 ncluding lesson at 8pm)\nA Steps member is a student on a monthly auto-ren
 ew contract or with an annual membership. Sensual Bachata Workshop
