URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/tantra-101-online-workshop-for-bus
 y-people/
SUMMARY:Tantra 101 Online Workshop - For busy people!
DESCRIPTION:Have you ever wondered what Tantra is and if it could improve y
 our life?\n\nWould you love to attend a workshop but don't have the time?\
 n\nAre you a little hesitant to jump into a live workshop with a bunch of 
 strangers?\n\nWould you prefer learn about the Instructor and get a chance
  to take a workshop for a test drive before buying an expensive ticket?\n\
 nThis FREE online workshop gives you a chance to experience Tantra:\n\n 	I
 n the safety of your own comfort zone\n 	Without dealing with traffic or t
 ransit schedules\n 	In a risk-free setting - if for any reason it's not fo
 r you\, all you need to do is click out of the Zoom room :)\n\nThe worksho
 p is a live\, interactive experience where you'll get a chance to talk wit
 h other participants and ask questions to a live facilitator.\n\nWhat you'
 ll learn and experience in the workshop:\n\n 	What is Tantra\n 	Do you nee
 d a partner to practice Tantra?\n 	Is it all about sex? Or is there more t
 o it?\n 	How can developing both your masculine and feminine energies impa
 ct your effectiveness in relationship and work?\n 	Why is connection so im
 portant to happiness and success?\n 	Cultivating a magnetic presence\n\nFa
 cilitated by Heidi Loeppky\n\nHeidi is a Tantra facilitator\, coach and or
 ganizer of the Canadian Tantra Festival.  Her clients include corporate V
 P's\, energy healers\, IT professionals and individuals and couples who've
  made the decision to live an intentional\, satisfying life.\n\nShe's spok
 en to audiences in Canada\, the US\, and Asia in settings all the way from
  boardroom to beachside.\n\nAs a former Chartered Professional Accountant\
 , she offers a rare blend of practicality\, groundedness and deeply rooted
  spirituality.  Her work integrate elements of Hatha Yoga\, Classical In
 dian Tantra\, Taoist Tantra\, Neo-Tantra\, Osho style body awareness pract
 ices\, Energy work\, relationship coaching and Shadow Work&#x2122\;.\n\n&
 nbsp\;\n\n[w8_callout margin_bottom="30px" button_text="More Info and Regi
 ster" button_color="pink" button_url="https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/tantra-1
 01-online-workshop-for-busy-people-tickets-58729826492?aff=TPG4" button_re
 l="nofollow"]Tantra 101 Workshop[/w8_callout]\n\nTestimonials:\n“Heidi i
 s a remarkable facilitator who can intuitively adapt a workshop to partici
 pants’ needs and experience. She creates a safe space for self-expressio
 n\, connection\, and growth. She is very knowledgeable about Tantra\, but\
 , more importantly\, lives what she teaches. This comes across in her work
 shops and makes them all the more valuable.” ~DALLAS M.\n\n“Heidi’s 
 teachings felt authentic and genuine and it allowed me to go deeper into t
 he experience. It felt good\, through and through.” ~MATHEW R.\n\n“My 
 experience in Heidi’s tantra classes was transformational. She is a frie
 ndly\, unassuming\, genuine\, and joyful guide in these explorations. I lo
 ok forward to learning more with her.” ~TRAVIS M.\n\n&nbsp\; Tantra 101 
 Online Workshop - For busy people!
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2019/03/22040_image_original.jpg
CATEGORIES:Therapeutic,Yoga
LOCATION:** ONLINE\, ONLINE\, Toronto\, Canada
GEO:43.658317;-79.382174
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=ONLINE\, Toronto\, Canada;X
 -APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=** ONLINE:geo:43.658317,-79.382174
