URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/tantric-speed-dating-toronto-march
 -29/
SUMMARY:Tantra Workshop with SPEED Dating
DESCRIPTION:Usiing the tantric principles of energy\, subtle bodies and the
  senses\, Tantric speed dating is a unique approach to dating that bypasse
 s the typical humdrum and cuts straight to what matters: making meaningful
  connections with people who see us for who we truly are - beyond the job 
 titles and the superficiality of typical dating events.\n\nTantric Speed D
 ating is like a cross between a speed dating event and a Tantra workshop. 
 Each date is a fully facilitated experience. You will learn fun new ways t
 o perceive people and determine compatibility. The exercises are non-sexua
 l in nature and will leave you in a beautiful\, heartwarming space.\n\nTan
 tric speed dating allows you to experience the pleasure of meeting someone
  for real\, without masks and without games. All In a safe space where you
 r essences are gently coaxed to the surface and celebrated.\n\nhttps://www
 .youtube.com/watch?v=zG9Bj4rUoIQ\n\nEach date is a unique facilitated expe
 rience – a light and playful blend of Tantra workshop and speed dating e
 vent. A wonderful place to start if you’ve new to Tantra. And a great pl
 ace to network with resonant folks if you’re a long-time traveller on th
 e path.\n\nThis event is designed for people ages 25 and up. Most attendee
 s tend to be within the 30 - 45 age range. Please bring an open heart\, pl
 ayful mind\, and a healthy dose of curiosity :)\n\n[w8_callout margin_bott
 om="30px" button_text="Tantric Speed Dating Workshop" button_color="pink" 
 button_url="https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/tantric-speed-dating-toronto-march
 -29-tickets-56700047368?aff=TPG4" button_rel="nofollow"]More Info and Regi
 ster [/w8_callout]\nAbout Heidi Loeppky\nHeidi began a yoga practice at th
 e age of 18 and first heard the whispers of a Tantric calling years before
  discovering a language for it. Following her formal introduction to Tantr
 ic sadhana in 2012 with Agama Yoga\, her life has been primarily dedicated
  to the discovery of the inner self and raising of consciousness. This ini
 tially took the form of a 3 year sabbatical\, where she immersed herself i
 n a range of schools\, teachers\, wisdom traditions\, and ashrams to glean
  a wide and unifying perspective on Tantra.\n\nHer approach is a pragmatic
  synthesis of her total life’s work including elements of Hatha Yoga\, C
 lassical Indian Tantra\, Taoist Tantra\, Neo-Tantra\, Osho style body awar
 eness practices\, Energy work and Shadow Work. She is single-mindedly dedi
 cated to reminding people of their own inherent divine nature. Tantra Work
 shop with SPEED Dating
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2019/03/couple.jpeg
CATEGORIES:Therapeutic,Yoga
LOCATION:Dream Yoga Dance\, 371 Danforth Ave\, Toronto\, ON M4K1P1\, Toront
 o\, ON\, M4K1P1\, Canada
