URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/ladies-learn-to-lead-bachata/
SUMMARY:Ladies Learn to Lead - Bachata
DESCRIPTION:Stuck in a dance rut? Tired of hearing\, “just follow”? Lad
 ies Learn to Lead offers Latin dance workshops for followers to gain a new
  perspective on leading fundamentals.\n\nThe goal of our workshops is to b
 reak the communication barrier between leaders and followers. Participants
  will leave workshops with a more complete understanding of partner dancin
 g and more options on the dance floor.\n\nOur small workshop sizes allow f
 or a personalized experience with individual feedback if required. Followe
 rs can safely step out of their comfort zone in a judgement free atmospher
 e.\n\nIn this 2 hour workshop you will learn and practice the basic fundam
 entals of leading Bachata. You will leave being able to confidently bring 
 the moves you learn onto the dance floor.\n\nFollowing experience is requi
 red to participate as we will only be covering leading techniques.\n\nDate
 : Saturday\, March 30th\, 2019\nTime: 11 am - 1 pm\nLocation: 68-5359 Timb
 erlea Blvd Mississauga\, ON L4W 4N5\n\nCost:\nBEFORE MARCH 15TH\nEarly Bir
 d - $35+tax (https://bit.ly/2FWpqMj)\nRegister with a friend - $30+tax p/p
  (https://bit.ly/2CR27Q3)\n\nFROM MARCH 15TH\nRegular price - $40+tax\nReg
 ister with a friend - $35+tax p/p\n\nMax capacity 30 people. Cash\, credit
  card or e-transfer accepted onsite. Sorry no refunds.\n\nTry something di
 fferent and improve your dancing at the same time. Challenge yourself to l
 earn how to lead!! What are you waiting for? Ladies Learn to Lead - Bachat
 a
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2019/02/Bachata-March-30.png
CATEGORIES:Bachata
LOCATION:City Centre Dance\, 68-5359 Timberlea Blvd\, Mississauga\, ON\, L4
