URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/2019-toronto-argonauts-dance-team-
 auditions/
SUMMARY:2019 Toronto Argonauts Dance Team Auditions
DESCRIPTION:The Toronto Argonauts are looking for show stopping performers 
 to represent the Argos dance team!\n\nDATE: Sunday\, March 31st\nCHOREOGRA
 PHER: LATOYA BEDEAU TEAM MANAGER: AMBERLEY WADDELL\nLOCATION: The Undergro
 und Dance Centre\; 224 Richmond St. W.\n12:00pm – Women\n2:00pm – Men\
 n3:00pm – Final Callbacks\n**Choreography will begin promptly\nBE PREPAR
 ED TO STAY AS LONG AS NECESSARY.\n\nWHAT WE’RE LOOKING FOR:\nFemale and 
 Male Dancers – 18 and older\nProficient dancers with dynamic personaliti
 es and strong individual styles.\nDancers of all training backgrounds who 
 are skilled and able to grasp challenging choreography.\nThere is no minim
 um or maximum height requirement.\nYou must also provide a resume and curr
 ent non-returnable 5x7 or 8x10 headshot.\n\nWHAT TO EXPECT:\nDancers will 
 be taught a basic Hip Hop/Street Jazz routine. All participants will be as
 ked to perform the routine in small groups. Dancers who advance will be as
 ked to perform 4-6 eight counts of freestyle choreography highlighting str
 engths and specialties. Music will be provided. The audition is closed\, s
 pectators will not be permitted.\n\nWHAT TO WEAR:\nArrive camera ready! Da
 nce Attire that shows off your personal style\nParticipants may wear any k
 ind of sneaker/dance shoe with non-marking soles.\n\nJUDGING:\nJudges will
  focus on dance ability\, enthusiasm\, energy\, personality and showmanshi
 p.\n\nCOMMITMENT INFORMATION:\n20-25 Mandatory team rehearsals\nMay throug
 h November\nMandatory team meeting\nPre-Season game – May 2019\n9 Regula
 r Season Home Games – June to October. Schedule available on Argonauts.c
 a\nPotential Post-Season Game – November 2019\nPublic appearances and ev
 ents\nPre-register by emailing your headshot and resume to Amberley.waddel
 l@mlse.com 2019 Toronto Argonauts Dance Team Auditions
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2019/02/Argos-Dance-Team-Audition-IG-1080x1080.jpg
