SUMMARY:Salsa on 2 Foundations
DESCRIPTION:4-week intensive for students new to dancing Salsa on 2 (also c
 alled Mambo or New York or Puerto Rican style Salsa). This crash course wo
 rkshop will teach you the Salsa on 2 fundamentals — basic timing\, turns
  and technique — to get you started to social dance Salsa on 2. After co
 mpletion of the workshop\, we recommend that you take the Salsa on 2 Level
  2 class on Sundays\, March 31 to April 28 to help you convert some of you
 r on 1 moves and shines to on 2. We also offer a weekly Salsa on 2 class f
 or Levels 2/3 on Wednesdays at 9pm to continue your Salsa on 2 journey and
  improve your on 2 timing\, technique and add more patterns and shines to 
 your repertoire.\n\nPrice\n\n$60 for 4 weeks.\n10 and 20 Class Cards can a
 lso be used for this workshop. FREE for Steps students on monthly auto-ren
 ew membership (Must be member for duration of workshop). FREE for Steps st
 udents on an annual membership. Salsa on 2 Foundations
