SUMMARY:Free Concert Series: Ballet Jorgen
DESCRIPTION:Canada’s Ballet Jörgen (CBJ) seeks to build dance from coast
  to coast to coast. In this program\, the dancers present highlights from 
 the classic ballet comedy Coppélia\, a bold and funny story that takes us
  into the mysterious mind of Dr. Coppélius\, a lonely and disillusioned t
 oy maker who wishes he could bring his dolls to life. CBJ’s contemporary
  retelling of the story will delight audience of all ages.\n\nAdmission is
  on a first-come\, first-served basis and seating is limited. Please joi
 n the line-up early to avoid disappointment. Latecomers will not be admitt
 ed.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PCLV-1NIMc4 Free Concert Series: Ba
 llet Jorgen
