URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/special-blues-classes-with-alfredo
 -hong-kong/
SUMMARY:Special Blues Classes with Alfredo (Hong Kong)
DESCRIPTION:We just can't help ourselves! We loved him so much last year (a
 nd so did you!!!) that we're bringing him back!!\n\nJoin us Thursday\, Apr
 il 4th for a very special 2-hr blues class with Alfredo Melendez!\n7:30-9:
 30PM\n\nAnd plan to stick around... we're working on some fun 'post-class'
  dancing options!\n\nAlfredo is briefly returning to this continent... and
  we've been lucky enough to entice him here yet again!! You absolutely do 
 not want to miss this opportunity!\n\nMore About Alfredo:\nAlfredo Melende
 z has been performing\, teaching\, and competing partner dancing for more 
 than 15 years. He has won multiple competitions in blues and west coast sw
 ing\, has collaborated and taught with nationally and internationally reco
 gnized artists\, and has studied Argentine tango\, blues\, and multiple ki
 nds of swing with world class instructors from all over the globe.\n\nHis 
 joy is in imparting the knowledge he has gained and sharing his love of th
 e beauty of partner dancing. He specializes in the power of connection and
  musicality between partners. Special Blues Classes with Alfredo (Hong Kon
 g)
