 2019/
SUMMARY:Opera Atelier: Idomeneo — April 4-13\, 2019
DESCRIPTION:Opera Atelier is honoured to present Mozart’s Idomeneo\, from
  April 4-13\, 2019 at the Ed Mirvish Theatre. The radiant Canadian superst
 ar Measha Brueggergosman makes a triumphant return to the Toronto stage as
  Elettra – the role which won her a Dora Award and numerous internationa
 l accolades. Brimming with Mozart’s show-stopping arias\, deeply emotion
 al ensembles\, and spectacular dancing\, Idomeneo tells the story of the G
 reek hero who is forced to choose between the life of his son and a terrib
 le promise he has made to the god of the sea.\n\nTickets from $39 and more
  information at operaatelier.com Opera Atelier: Idomeneo — April 4-13\, 
 2019
