SUMMARY:Femme! Experience
DESCRIPTION:* Honour your sexy soulfulness\n* Unleash yourself to the sound
 s of live djembe drumming by Walter Maclean\n* Explore movement as a form 
 of creativity\, celebration\, self-expression and empowerment\n* Feel libe
 rated from judgment and celebrate yourself in all of its curves and comple
 xities\n\nFemme! is a 90-minute fusion of sensual movement\, meditation an
 d celebration inspired by African\, Tribal and Free Dance. Set to live Afr
 ican drumming.\n\nDesigned in NYC by Somatic Healer\, Keynote Speaker and 
 Wellness Expert\, Bernadette Pleasant\, this powerful practice uses a vari
 ety of movement and musical styles to create a multi-sensory experience th
 at expresses the entire body.\n\nFrom your head\, to your heart\, to your 
 hips\, it’s an empowered\, fun\, fit and sexy way to warm it up\, work i
 t out\, make it move\, and cool it down with ease and sensuality.\n\n“It
 ’s your body\; you can do whatever you want with it – including love i
 t\, unapologetically.”\n\nDress to sweat (barefoot recommended). Bring W
 ater. No previous dance experience required. Femme! Experience
