SUMMARY:Citadel + Compagnie: Four Old Legs — April 11-14 and 17-20\, 2019
DESCRIPTION:VIP night: April 11 at 8pm\nMatinee: April 14 at 4pm\n\nCitadel
  + Compagnie presents the world premiere of Canadian dance luminary James 
 Kudelka’s Four Old Legs\, running April 12-13 &amp\; 17-20\, 2019 at 8pm
 \, and on April 14 at 4pm\, at the Citadel: Ross Centre for Dance. Citadel
  + Compagnie’s resident choreographer and Order Of Canada appointee Jame
 s Kudelka has created this performance piece celebrating time\, memory and
  experience. Ballet icon Evelyn Hart and Zhenya Cerneacov eloquently explo
 re the premise that growing older is something better practiced by young p
 eople.\n\nTickets $20-$25. Full details at citadelcie.com.\nVIP night: $10
 0 Citadel + Compagnie: Four Old Legs — April 11-14 and 17-20\, 2019
