SUMMARY:2019 Canada Kizomba Congress
DESCRIPTION:Canada Kizomba Congress 2019 is back for another fantastic year
 \n\nTwo rooms: More LESSONS\, more SHOWS\, more DANCING\, more FUN\n\nDate
 : Friday\, April 19 - Sunday\, April 21 2019 (Easter Long Weekend)\nVenue:
  Sheraton Centre Toronto\, 123 Queen St West\, M5H2M9\n\nCanada Kizomba Co
 ngress Exclusive Artists:\n\n 	Carola &amp\; Curtis - (France &amp\; Spain
 )\n 	Morenasso Crack &amp\; Adi Baran (France &amp\; Israel)\n 	Lucia Nogu
 eira (Portugal/U.S)\n 	Tarah Stéphanie from Urkiz (Montreal)\n 	Kizomba G
 erry from Kizomba Sem Limite (Montreal)\n 	Elyse Jurutka &amp\; Melissa Pa
 rkhurst from Roc Kizomba (Rochester)\n 	Upa Dança (New Jersey)\n 	Lindsay
  Hutton from Toca Kizomba (Ottawa)\n 	Lynnette Adeline from Capital Kizomb
