URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/citadel-compagnie-unmoored-may-1-4
 -2019/
SUMMARY:Citadel + Compagnie: unmoored — May 1-4\, 2019
DESCRIPTION:Citadel + Compagnie presents the highly anticipated return of t
 he 2018 Dora Award-winning unmoored\, running May 1-4\, 2019 at 8pm at the
  Citadel: Ross Centre for Dance. Hailed by critics as a work “of total p
 erfection\,” (Paula Citron) this spoken word and movement piece was crea
 ted by dance story innovator Sarah Chase in collaboration with revered dan
 ce artist Peggy Baker. Finely honed text\, action and staging create the f
 ramework for a performance of raw and searing emotion that addresses the t
 hemes of love\, disability\, caregiving and death.\n\n&nbsp\; Citadel + Co
 mpagnie: unmoored — May 1-4\, 2019
