SUMMARY:B-Girl Battle @ Sony Centre
DESCRIPTION:TO Live\, and the artist-based collective KeepRockinYou\, celeb
 rate the 6th season of the Toronto B-GIrl Movement program in the Sony Cen
 tre for the Performing Arts lobby\, Sunday\, May 5\, 2019\, 4PM – 9PM.\n
 \nThe participants are celebrating their participation and the completion 
 of their three month commitment to a Break dancing program facilitated by 
 Soupy &amp\; Caerina.\n\nThe event will open with cyphers (an informal gat
 hering of rappers\, beatboxers\, and/or breakdancers) and fellowship with 
 a communal pot luck provided by the participants for everyone. Then the Ba
 ttles will begin – judged by B-boy Piecez\, B-Girl Soupy and B-boy Illz 
 and hyped tunes presented by DJs M4RS and Fly Lady Di. A $500 prize will b
 e awarded! B-Boys are welcome to participate as well as B-Girls.\n\nTicket
 s are now on sale and available online at www.sonycentre.ca\, by calling t
 he TO Live Box Office at 416.368.6161 x 1 or in person at select TO Live B
 ox Offices. Tickets are $10 ($5 early bird price until April 14).\n\n[w8_b
 utton color="pink" url="https://www.torontodance.com/hip-hop-battle-sony-c
 entre/" title="More Info" target="blank" border_radius=""]More info: [/w8_
