SUMMARY:Royal Ontario Ball
DESCRIPTION:Royal Ontario Ball is a Ballroom dance showcase and social danc
 e event that pays homage to the 1950s era of dancing. "The fabulous '50s."
  is considered to be the golden era of ballroom dancing. Big bands\, grand
  dance halls\, and Rock &amp\; Roll music. It’s the time when Arthur Mur
 ray and Frank Sinatra were dancing away on television and on the big scree
 n. Bringing that energy\, ambiance\, and feeling back is what the Royal On
 tario Ball is all about. Live Music by The Bob Cary Orchestra\nFour Course
  Sit Down Dinner By Executive Chef\, Martin Buehner\nProfessional Shows\, 
 General Dancing &amp\; More... Royal Ontario Ball
