 nners are welcome. There is no need to bring your own dance partners. Park
 ing and subway are close by. Licensed bar.\n\nThe event is 19 years old an
 d up after 10pm. Teenagers under 19 are very welcome to attend til then (f
 or just $10 for both classes and the dance til 10pm). If you are under 19 
