SUMMARY:Traditions III - Downtown Toronto Kizomba & Urban Kiz Festival.
DESCRIPTION:Workshops\, Socials\, Concerts\, Performances &amp\; Angolan Ga
 stronomy.\n\nGet ready for TRADITIONS III\, 2019\, the movement where Kizo
 mba\, Semba\, Tarrachina\, Urban Kiz\, Brazillian Zouk meet strongly. TRAD
 ITIONS III is a festival of unity\, honnor for Angolan and African dances\
 , and traditions being built througout this dances all over the world.\n\n
  	 Workshops from International Kizomba &amp\; Urban Kiz instructors. Kiz
 omba\, Urban Kiz\, Tarrachinha\, Semba\, Afrohouse and much more workshops
  will be featured.\n 	Four or more amazing theme parties and a non stoppeb
 le social room throughout the festival with the best international Deejas 
 the world has seen.\n 	Exclusive dance performances.\n 	Concert\n 	4 days 
 of non stop action.\n 	Tasteful Angolan gastronomy and the best pizza of T
 oronto from DOVERCOURT VILLAGE PIZZA throughout the entore festival.\n\nIN
 STRUCTORS\n\n 	Dasmara Dos Santos &amp\; Iolanda Rangel\n 	Cherry Blackche
 rry &amp\; Mair Onça\n 	Mário Jordão &amp\; Laury Esmeralda Full\n 	Vas
 co Moestus\n\nDEEJAYS\n\n 	DJ THE BEST\n 	DJ DO MARCAL\n 	DJ RAFEIRO\n 	Dj
  VASCO\n 	VICTOR MANUEAL BERNARDO\n\n&nbsp\; Traditions III - Downtown Tor
 onto Kizomba &amp\; Urban Kiz Festival.
