SUMMARY:Toque Toronto Kizomba Festival
DESCRIPTION:Toque Toronto Kizomba Festival is a unique Kizomba Festival hel
 d in the beautiful city of Toronto. The festival's main purpose is to prom
 ote the original roots of Kizomba within Canada and abroad through music\,
  dance and more.\n\nThe event features dance classes from international an
 d local instructors\, complemented by day time socials\, night parties and
  yearly surprises.\n\nPERFORMANCE by &#x1f31f\; IVAN ALEKXEI &#x1f31f\;\n
 \nDJs\n\n&#x1f3a7\; DJ Virus\n&#x1f3a7\; DJ Sponky\n&#x1f3a7\; DJ Guelas\n
 &#x1f3a7\; DJ Oscar B.A.\n&#x1f3a7\; DJ NS\n&#x1f3a7\; DJ Galo\n\nACCOMMOD
 ATIONS\n\nNOVOTEL TORONTO MISSISSAUGA HOTEL\n\nFor guest rooms reservation
 s\, please make reservations no later than cut-off date March 22\, 2019 by
  calling directly to the hotel Front Desk at 905-896-1000 or emailing dire
 ctly to our reservations team at reservations@novotelmississauga.com and m
 ention the rate for TOQUE Toronto Kizomba Festival 2019 when making the re
 servations.\n\n&nbsp\; Toque Toronto Kizomba Festival
