SUMMARY:Light Years
DESCRIPTION:Canadian Contemporary Dance Theatre presents “Light Years” 
 for two nights only at Toronto’s prestigious Fleck Dance Theatre. The pr
 oduction boasts a vibrant program of fresh and diverse contemporary works 
 by local and international artists performed by professional emerging arti
 sts. “Light Years” highlights include 2 world premieres by Jennifer Ar
 chibald and Nicole Caruana\, CCDT favourites by Roderick George\, Ryan Lee
  and Deborah Lundmark\, and a live musical performance by Dr. Draw!\n\nWha
 t is it in the eye of the young artist that so mesmerizes? The blaze of a 
 challenge met? The shine of a battle won? In time\, shadows will intrude\,
  but for now behold the light years of youth. Here strides the future… L
 ight Years
