SUMMARY:Pivotal Moments: A Relaxed Performance
DESCRIPTION:​In keeping with our commitment to diversity and making dance
  accessible to everyone\, PushPULL Dance is proud to offer a Relaxed Perfo
 rmance of its 15th annual show\, "Pivotal Moments"\, in addition to our fu
 ll show. The Relaxed Performance will offer 10 dance numbers in a sensory-
 friendly\, relaxed environment that we hope will be comfortable for neuro-
 diverse folks on the autism spectrum\, people with sensory processing diff
 erences\, or anyone who would like to see the show in an open and acceptin
 g setting. ​​The relaxed performance will take place Sun\, May 26\, 20
 19\, 1:00pm – 2:00pm at the Al Green Theatre\, located at 750 Spadina Av
 enue. Admission is PWYC (pay what you can) with a suggested donation of $1
 0.\n\n&#x1f64c\; This show will be interpreted in ASL &#x1f64c\;\n&#x1f64c
 \; The Al Green Theatre is a fully accessible space &#x1f64c\;\n&#x1f64c\;
  All ages and all bodies welcome! &#x1f64c\;\n\nReserve Tickets: https://w
 ww.eventbrite.ca/e/pushpull-dance-toronto-presents-pivotal-moments-tickets
 -60292957860 Pivotal Moments: A Relaxed Performance
