SUMMARY:Sharing Dance Day 2019
DESCRIPTION:NBS Sharing Dance encourages all Canadians to embrace the joy o
 f dance. The nationwide NBS Sharing Dance Day performance engages communit
 ies by breaking down barriers to access with free\, high-quality\, cultura
 lly inclusive dance activities. It empowers communities to join in celebra
 ting movement for health and fun. Each celebration will reflect the intere
 sts and flavour of the local community while featuring performances of the
  NBS Sharing Dance Day choreography. From Canada’s newest arrivals to it
 s founding Indigenous peoples\, NBS Sharing Dance Day will provide a platf
 orm for all to engage in a joyful and healthy way. Sharing Dance Day 2019
