 ome! No prior experience is needed\, absolute beginners are welcome. There
  is no need to bring your own dance partners. Parking and subway are close
  by. Licensed bar.\n\nLindy Hop is the joyful dance of the Swing Era and i
 s done all around the world today!\n\nThe event is 19 years old and up aft
 er 10pm. Teenagers under 19 are very welcome to attend til then (for just 
