 stay past 10pm only with parental accompaniment. (This is a policy of the 
 venue\, not of Swing Toronto.)\n\nWebsite: swingtoronto.com\n\nFacebook ev
 ents: https://www.facebook.com/groups/157279846382/events/\n\nDance Party 
 $15\, $17 with one class\, $20 with both. $5 off for full-time students. S
 aturday Night Swing fts Bertie &amp\; The Gents plus beginner classes
