SUMMARY:Pivotal Moments
DESCRIPTION:​For its 15th annual production\, PushPULL Dance Toronto is p
 roud to present “Pivotal Moments”\, a show that takes us on a journey 
 through some of the highs and lows that life can throw our way. From new b
 eginnings to unexpected endings with some twists and turns along the way\,
  this show offers a glimpse into some of life’s most defining moments.\n
 ​\nPivotal Moments features 21 original dance numbers in a variety of st
 yles including ballet\, contemporary\, tap\, jazz and more! The show runs 
 from June 12-15th\, 2019 at the Al Green Theatre\, located at 750 Spadina 
 Avenue​.\n\nShowtimes\nWednesday\, June 12 - 8:00 p.m ​\nThursday\, Ju
 ne 13 - 8:00 p.m. ​ ​\n​Friday\, June 14 - 8:00 p.m\n​Saturday\, J
 une 15 - 2:00 p.m &amp\; 8:00 p.m.\n\nTicket are $25 ($15 for children age
  12 and under) Pivotal Moments
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2019/05/PushPULL-flyer.jpg
