 holesome understanding of partner dancing.\n\nIn this 2 hour workshop you 
 will learn and practice the basic fundamentals of leading Salsa. You will 
 leave being able to confidently bring the moves you learn onto the dance f
 loor.\n\nFollowing experience is required to participate as we will only b
 e covering leading techniques.\n\nCost:\nBEFORE JUNE 15TH\nEarly Bird: $35
 +tax (http://bit.ly/LL2LSalsa)\nRegister with a friend: $30+tax p/p (http:
 //bit.ly/LL2LSalsaFR)\n\nFROM JUNE 15TH\nRegular price: $40+tax\nRegister 
 with a friend: $35+tax p/p\n\nMax capacity 30 people. Cash\, credit card o
 r e-transfer accepted onsite. Sorry no refunds.\n\nLOCATION: 3425 Semenyk 
 Ct. Mississauga\, ON L5C 4P9 Ladies Learn to Lead - Salsa
