SUMMARY:Saturday Night Swing fts Combo Royale plus beginner classes
DESCRIPTION:Beginner dance classes 7pm to 9pm before the Dance Party\, Char
 leston 7pm\, Lindy Hop 8pm. Teachers: Bees Knees Dance.\n\nSwing Dance Par
 ty 9:10pm to 1am.\nBand: Combo Royale!\n\nPlease invite your friends.\n\nE
 veryone is welcome! No prior experience is needed\, absolute beginners are
  welcome. There is no need to bring your own dance partners. Parking and s
 ubway are close by. Licensed bar.\n\nLindy Hop is the joyful dance of the 
 Swing Era and is done all around the world today!\n\nThe event is 19 years
  old and up after 10pm. Teenagers under 19 are very welcome to attend til 
 then (for just $10 for both classes and the dance til 10pm). If you are un
 der 19 you may stay past 10pm only with parental accompaniment. (This is a
  policy of the venue\, not of Swing Toronto.)\n\nWebsite: swingtoronto.com
 \n\nFacebook events: https://www.facebook.com/groups/157279846382/events/\
 n\nDance Party $15\, $17 with one class\, $20 with both. $5 off for full-t
 ime students. Saturday Night Swing fts Combo Royale plus beginner classes
