X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/
UID:3015@torontodance.com
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20190705T161500
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20190705T171500
DTSTAMP:20190622T172655Z
URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/the-laundry-list/
SUMMARY:The Laundry List
DESCRIPTION:Frankie's Laundry is THE swinging hotspot - and not just for wa
 shing\nclothes. Frankie and his tap dancers are gunning to be the number o
 ne bootlegging\noperation\, but his competition thinks otherwise. Can Fran
 kie's gals dance their way out of\nthis one? The Laundry List will whisk y
 ou back to the golden age of jazz\, flappers and\ngangsters. With live mus
 ic\, singing\, and tap dancing\, this cast of 13 will leave you with a\nso
 ng in your heart and a skip in your step.\n\nThe Roaring Twenties was the 
 birthplace of women empowerment and the rise of tap dance\nand jazz music.
  The Laundry List is an original story that shines a spotlight on the stro
 ng\nfemale flappers who were trailblazers in women's rights. They rebelled
  against gender\ninequality\, including defying Prohibition\, and bootlegg
 ing alcohol. The Laundry List is both\nunique and entertaining because it 
 is a story told through tap dance. The show features 6\nprofessional femal
 e tap dancers as it's lead characters. Highlighting both vaudeville and\nr
 hythmical styles of tap dancing\, the two are intertwined seamlessly and c
 ompliment the\nintriguing original story that is\, The Laundry List.\n\nVi
 ntage Taps​ in association with ​The Toronto Fringe Festival​ presen
 ts: THE LAUNDRY LIST\n\n 	Friday\, July 5 - 4:15pm\n 	Saturday\, July 6 - 
 6:30pm\n 	Monday\, July 8 - 3:30pm\n 	Tuesday\, July 9 - 3:45pm\n 	Thursda
 y\, July 11 - 10:30pm\n 	Friday\, July 12 - 7:30pm\n 	Sunday\, July 14 - 5
 :45pm\n\n&nbsp\; The Laundry List
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2019/06/04-22-2019-023012-4431.jpg
CATEGORIES:Tap
LOCATION:Factory Theatre\, 125 Bathurst St\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M5V 2R2\, 
 Canada
GEO:43.6455699;-79.40273730000001
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=125 Bathurst St\, Toronto\,
  Ontario\, M5V 2R2\, Canada;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Factory Theatre:geo
 :43.6455699,-79.40273730000001
END:VEVENT
