URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/casino-rueda-4-week-introductory-w
 orkshop/
SUMMARY:Casino Rueda 4-week Introductory Workshop
DESCRIPTION:4 week intensive for students new to Casino Rueda. This crash c
 ourse workshop will teach you the Casino fundamentals required to join our
  Casino Rueda Level 2 class. Casino Rueda is a Cuban form of salsa often d
 escribed as "Salsa in a Circle". Building on the basic salsa step\, it com
 bines new turn patterns with a rotational movement of the whole circle\, e
 xchanging partners continually throughout the song. It is a great way to i
 nteract with other people\, have fun and add variety to your salsa at the 
 same time!\n**Open to students with beginner Salsa experience. Previous Ca
 sino Rueda experience not required. Students must start on the first day.\
 n\nPrice: $60 for 4 weeks.\n\nDates: July 4\, 11\, 18\, 25 Casino Rueda 4-
 week Introductory Workshop
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2019/06/Casino-Foundations-Banner.jpg
CATEGORIES:Salsa
LOCATION:Steps Dance Studio - 819 Yonge\, 819 Yonge Street\, 3rd floor\, To
