SUMMARY:Salsa on2 4-week Introductory Workshop
DESCRIPTION:4 week intensive for students new to dancing Salsa on 2 (also c
 alled Mambo or New York or Puerto Rican style Salsa). This crash course wo
 rkshop will teach you the Salsa on 2 fundamentals - basic timing\, turns a
 nd technique – to get you started to social dance Salsa on 2. After comp
 letion of the workshop\, you may join our upcoming Salsa on 2 weekly class
 .\n**Open to students in Salsa levels 3-5. No prior on 2 experience requir
 ed. No partner required.\n\nDates: Sunday July 7\, 14\, 21\, 28 Salsa on2 
 4-week Introductory Workshop
