SUMMARY:Women's Bollywood Dance Fitness - High Park
DESCRIPTION:Bollywood Dance Fitness is a dance workout that combines easy-t
 o-follow dance movements and exercises and South Asian and Middle Eastern 
 rhythms to create a fun and exhilarating workout. Expect a friendly class 
 filled with exotic rhythms all the way from India to Egypt\n\nNo dance exp
 erience required. Classes are always beginner-friendly and low to moderate
  impact to accommodate those from all fitness levels. Totally welcoming mo
 ms and their teenage daughters to create time for mother and daughter bond
 ing.\n\nTo take a class\, please visit: https://fusioncardiotoronto.com/ W
 omen&#039\;s Bollywood Dance Fitness - High Park
