 com to secure their spot\; Subject: “Hourglass”\nor purchase tickets h
 ere: https://spicesummerny.eventbrite.ca\n\nAs featured on Breakfast Telev
 ision\, Lululemon\, Toronto Star and more\, the Carnival Spice dance works
 hops is an excellent way for you to keep fit and have fun while doing it. 
 It fuses Soca\, Latin and Dancehall music through a high-energy\, fitness 
 experience that strengthens upper body\, lower body and core. The Caribbea
 n vibes in the space create an energy like no other for all participants i
 nvolved. Plus all dance and fitness levels are welcome.\n\nREMINDERS:\n- W
 EAR YOUR CARNIVAL SPICE SHIRT and/or ATHLEISURE ATTIRE!\n- BRING YOUR RAG 
 OR’ YOUR FLAG!\n- BRING WATER!\n- DRESS TO SWEAT!\n- WEAR COMFORTABLE SH
 OES!\n- HATS ARE RECOMMENDED Caribana Dance Workshop - NORTH YORK (Soca\, 
 Dancehall etc.)
