 making. This is a unique combination of sensual body movements and abstrac
 t art. This event will include 30 minutes of belly dancing lessons\, follo
 wed by 30 min of dancing\, and for the final hour\, through the inspiratio
 n of Arabic music that will play in the background\, you will paint an abs
 tract form that expresses the way you feel.\n\nWardrobe: Please come in co
 mfortable tights or skirt/ tank top\, tube top/and scarf for the waste\, a
 nd will be barefoot when dancing.\n\nEvent outline\n\n 	Middle Eastern-ins
 pired appetizers and drinks will be provided\n 	An experienced belly dance
 r and artist that will help guide in learning belly dancing steps and crea
 ting abstract art.\n 	All Material included 16 X 20 canvas board and paint
 \n 	Health and Wellness gift bag - command hook\, health and wellness mind
 fulness tool and special BGI treats\n 	Unedited Pictures &amp\; Video High
 lights – emailed to you\n 	Ask us about our custom BGI T-Shirt with your
  name on it\n 	Exclusive access to an accountability community that will c
 elebrate your achievements and help you stay focused on your goals.\n\nLOT
 S OF FREE PARKING:  This is our parking location the event will take pla
 ce across the street. A Big Girl Interrupted representative will be at the
  location to help you with parking.\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nPlease be advised all Bi
 g Girl Interrupted events are non-refundable we only issue credits. Arabes
 que Paint &amp\; Dance Experience
