 les on-line on Eventbrite.\n\nJoin a mature 30+ crowd in a fun and friendl
 y atmosphere.  Live Latin Music by the talented Grupo Rey &amp\; DJ Fiest
 sa playing top Salsa\, Bachata\, Merengue and more.  Amazing Free Giveawa
 ys. Food and Drink Specials and a Complimentary Dance Lesson at 8:00 pm.\n
