 able.  Only $20 cash @door.  For more details read on:\n\nFOOD &amp\; DR
 INK Specials - Come and have dinner and drinks on the Patio and then liste
 n to Top Latin Music by Grupo Rey and DJ Fiesta\n\nVENUE eZone Tap &amp\; 
 Grill has a restaurant and party room with 340 person capacity\; both the 
