 ng available. 2 FREE PARKING LOTS are available and eZone is just 5 minute
 s from TTC Kipling Station.\n\nGROUP/BIRTHDAY/SPECIAL OCCASION PACKAGES av
 ailable.  Balloons\, Decorations\, Cake\, Champagne and more are availabl
 e upon request. Call TSC at least 72 hours in-advance of the event to disc
 uss your Group/ Special Occasion needs at (647) 501-0269.\n\nTABLE/SEATING
  RESERVATIONS can be booked online. Table Reservations guarantee a table a
 nd seats for you and all your guests with many (not all) tables allowing g
 reat views of the dance floor\, stage\, DJ and more. Food and drinks avail
 able for order. Reserve your VIP Table Today! It's where you want to be.\n
 \nACCESSIBILITY TSC Inc. is fully accessible to person(s) with disabilitie
 s. Please contact TSC in-advance to arrange accommodations (647) 501-0269.
 \n\nCOAT CHECK may be available onsite for a small fee. Please note that C
 oat Check is not available at all times. TSC does not assume responsibilit
 y for loss of personal items. Please leave all valuables in your vehicle o
 r at home.\n\nDOORS OPEN 15 minutes prior to the event start time. Early a
 rrival is strongly suggested. First come\, first serve. Note: In-advance T
 icket Holders and Groups by-pass pay-at-the-door lineups.\n\nNote: The Sal
 sa Club VIP Rewards Cards - This is a Special Event and does not apply. Lo
 ng Weekend Summer Party! Live Latin Music by Grupo Rey
