SUMMARY:10 Week Showgirl Intensive
DESCRIPTION:The BurlesqueUni Showgirl Intensive is a 10 week training progr
 am for students looking to further their dance and performance skills. Stu
 dents develop their own burlesque personas\, learn basic - advanced dance 
 techniques\, become familiar with costume design &amp\; creation\, partici
 pate in themed photo shoots\, and perform in a full ticketed showcase at t
 he end of the ten weeks.\n\nMandatory Placement Day:\nSunday\, September 8
 th\, 2019 1pm-3.30pm\nLocation: 333 Spadina Ave - 2nd floor\n\nThis Open L
 evel placement class will be for all students signed up for current Burles
 que Uni Showgirl Training Semester (Sept 8). Instructors will place studen
 ts in the appropriate level and full training will commence the week of Se
 pt 15th. The placement class is required for all registered students.\n\nF
 ull 10 week training begins the week of Sunday\, September 15\, 2019. Show
 case dates: Thursday\, November 28 - The Velvet Underground Friday\, Novem
 ber 29 - Cherry Cola's *Please note that the Velvet showcase is the interm
 ediate/advanced showcase &amp\; the Cherry Colas showcase is the beginner 
 showcase. Select students may be involved in both showcases*\n\nWeekly Tra
 ining Schedule:\nSundays: 1pm-3:30pm : Intermediate\nTuesdays: 6:30-9pm: A
 dvanced\nWednesdays: 6:30-9pm: Beginner\nLocation: 333 Spadina Ave (2nd fl
 oor)\n\nRegister: www.burlesqueuni.com/intensive\n\nPayment plans are avai
 lable. E-mail directly for more details. **Not available for SALE prices**
 \nPrice includes ($452.00 tax included) 20 plus hours of rehearsal trainin
 g and 1 hour long solo workshop. Extensive solo workshopping can be schedu
 led for an additional cost. Some students may also be selected for small g
 roup numbers\, extending the number of training hours. Price does not incl
 ude costumes.\n\nPlease note that all sales are final. BurlesqueUni does n
 ot offer refunds. In certain cases\, class credit may be applied. Students
  enrolled in the intensive who miss more than 2 weeks of class time will b
 e required to purchase private training to stay up to date with course con
 tent. 10 Week Showgirl Intensive
