SUMMARY:Bachata and Salsa Party and Dance Lessons
DESCRIPTION:Salsa and Bachata Party with Latin DJ\, Dance Lessons and Socia
 l Dancing\n\n\n\nJoin a fun &amp\; friendly Salsa &amp\; Bachata Party!\n\
 n3 amazing dance lessons: 7:00 pm Beginner Bachata Lesson &amp\; 7:00 pm I
 ntermediate Bachata Lesson. 7:45 pm Salsa Styling &amp\; Footwork Lesson.\
 n\n8:15 pm Latin DJ playing top Salsa &amp\; Bachata until 11:00pm\n\nONLY
  $10.00 online or cash at the door. Doors open 6:45 pm.\n\nShy to arrive a
 lone? No worries! Contact The Salsa Club in-advance (thesalsaclubinfo@gmai
 l.com) and we'll have a Social Rep meet you at the door.\n\nDetails are li
 sted below: The Salsa Club aims to provide unparalleled artistry\, lightin
 g\, music and entertainment in a fun and friendly atmosphere\, with a larg
 e dance floor\, lounge area and food and beverage service.\n\n1. LATINO DJ
  FIESTA playing top Salsa\, Bachata\, Merengue\, Cumbia\, Cha Cha Cha\, Re
 ggaeton y mas.\n\n2. FOOD &amp\; DRINK Specials http://ezonetapandgrill.ca
 /menu/ Starting at $9.99\n\n3. VENUE eZone Tap &amp\; Grill has a restaura
 nt and party room with 340 person capacity\; both the restaurant and party
  room have large wood dance floors (conditions permitting). PATIO OPEN (we
 ather permitting). Tables/Seating is available on reservation or first com
 e\, first serve basis. Note the venue has large dance floors and limited s
 eating available. 2 FREE PARKING LOTS are available and eZone is just 5 mi
 nutes from TTC Kipling Station.\n\n4. GROUP/BIRTHDAY/SPECIAL OCCASION PACK
 AGES available. It's your Birthday week? Show your ID and get in for FREE*
 ! (*applies to regular events only/special events do not apply). TSC offer
 s entrance discounts for groups of 10 people or more. Balloons\, Decoratio
 ns\, Cake\, Champagne and more are available upon request. Call TSC at lea
 st 72 hours in-advance of the event to discuss your Group/ Special Occasio
 n needs at (647) 501-0269.\n\n5. TABLE/SEATING RESERVATIONS can be booked 
 in-advance by calling TSC (647) 501-0269. Table Reservations guarantee a t
 able and seats for you and all your guests with many (not all) tables allo
 wing great views of the dance floor\, stage\, DJ and more. Food and drinks
  available for order. Reserve your VIP Table Today. It's where you want to
  be!\n\n6. ACCESSIBILITY TSC Inc. is fully accessible to person(s) with di
 sabilities. Please contact TSC in-advance to arrange accommodations (647) 
 501-0269.\n\n7. COAT CHECK may be available onsite for a small fee. Please
  note that Coat Check is not available at all times. TSC does not assume r
 esponsibility for loss of personal items. Please leave all valuables in yo
 ur vehicle or at home.\n\n8. DOORS OPEN 15 minutes prior to the event star
 t time. Early arrival is strongly suggested. First come\, first serve. Not
 e: In-advance Ticket Holders and Groups by-pass pay-at-the-door lineups.\n
 \n9. FREE ENTRANCE possessors\, early arrival is strongly suggested to gua
 rantee admittance.\n\n10. The Salsa Club VIP Rewards Cards shown at the do
 or for regular events will be stamped and accepted. (Special Events do not
  apply).\n\nFeel free to contact The Salsa Club if you have any additional
  questions (647) 501-0269. Thanks and see you at Salsa Sunday!\n\n\n\n Bac
 hata and Salsa Party and Dance Lessons
