 lessons/
SUMMARY:TSDS Series of 5 East Coast Swing Lessons
DESCRIPTION:Steven James teaches ECS to Intermediates at 7:30 and Beginners
  at 8:45.  You don’t need to bring a partner. Most people who come to 
 our lessons don’t come with a “designated partner”. We exchange part
 ners every few minutes and there is a good balance of leaders and follower
 s.  Intermediates can also join the beginners for half price ($20 more).
   Each class in the series builds on previous lessons. Unless you have p
 revious swing dance experience\, we recommend that you do not start or dro
 p in after the first classes are completed\, as that might disrupt the pro
 gress of the class. To take the intermediate class you should have a solid
  knowledge of the basic steps.  Register on line at TorontoSwingDanceSoc
 iety.ca. Class sizes will be limited\, so register early to ensure your pl
 ace. TSDS Series of 5 East Coast Swing Lessons
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2019/02/TSDS-Logo-Print-RGB-1.jpg
CATEGORIES:East Coast Swing
LOCATION:Lithuanian House\, 1573 Bloor Street West\, Toronto\, ON\,\, Toron
 to\, Ontario\, M6P 1A6\, Junction\, Canada
