 /
SUMMARY:Viennese Waltz beginner workshop
DESCRIPTION:3pm to 6pm.\n\nLearn traditional Viennese Waltz\, one of the be
 st and most fun partner dances ever\, popular since the early 19th century
 \, and done all around the world! Done to great music of the 21st\, 20th a
 nd 19th centuries\, usually at tempos from medium to very fast. Easy to le
 arn.\n\nNo prior experience is needed. Absolute beginners are welcome. The
 re is no need to bring your own dance partners.\n\nTeachers: Bonnie &amp\;
  Simon.\n\nThis workshop focuses on Right Turning Viennese Waltz (revolvin
 g to your right as you travel around the room with a partner). If you take
  this workshop you can also take our Viennese Waltz intermediate workshop 
 on Saturday September 28.\n\n$30. ($10 if you have taken this workshop wit
 h us before.)\n\n&nbsp\; Viennese Waltz beginner workshop
