 man-her-alleycats-beginner-classes-2/
SUMMARY:Saturday Night Swing fts Alex Pangman & Her Alleycats + beginner cl
 asses
DESCRIPTION:Beginner dance classes 7pm to 9pm before the Dance Party\, Char
 leston 7pm\, Lindy Hop 8pm.\n\nSwing Dance Party 9:10pm to 1am.\nBand: Ale
 x Pangman &amp\; Her Alleycats!\n\nPlease invite your friends.\n\nEveryone
  is welcome! No prior experience is needed\, absolute beginners are welcom
 e. There is no need to bring your own dance partners. Parking and subway a
 re close by. Licensed bar.\n\nThe event is 19 years old and up after 10pm.
  Teenagers under 19 are very welcome to attend til then (for just $10 for 
 both classes and the dance til 10pm). If you are under 19 you may stay pas
 t 10pm only with parental accompaniment. (This is a policy of the venue\, 
 not of Swing Toronto.)\n\nWebsite: swingtoronto.com\n\nFacebook events: ht
 tps://www.facebook.com/groups/157279846382/events/\n\nDance Party $15\, $1
 7 with one class\, $20 with both. $5 off for full-time students. Saturday 
 Night Swing fts Alex Pangman &amp\; Her Alleycats + beginner classes
