X-SOURCE:Toronto Dance
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/
UID:3089@torontodance.com
DTSTART:20190914T193000Z
DTEND:20190914T223000Z
DTSTAMP:20190826T221247Z
URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/new-beginnings-conscious-dance-par
 ty/
SUMMARY:New Beginnings - Conscious Dance Party
DESCRIPTION:New Beginnings\n"Every new beginning comes from some other begi
 nning's end" - Seneca\n"Every day brings a chance for you to draw in a bre
 ath\, kick off your shoes\, and dance" -Oprah Winfrey\nEvery sunrise is an
  opportunity to start again.\n\nFall is a time of new beginnings\, a time 
 of change\, and a time of letting go.\nLet us welcome the new season by br
 eaking free of what no longer serves and dancing into the new.\n\nPart of 
 the proceeds from this event will go to the Amazon Fire relief fund\n\nFlo
 w of the Evening\n\n7:30pm Doors Open - Come land on the floor\, connect t
 o your breath\, warm-up and gently move before the main dance beginnings.\
 n\n8:00 Opening Circle\; Meditation &amp\; Community Ritual lead by Liz Di
 az &amp\; Crystal Bowl Soundscapes with Talia Greenberger (Doors will be t
 emporary closed during this time)\n\n8:30-10:00 DJ'ed dance journey of glo
 bal conscious grooves lead by DJ Liz Diaz the dance will end with a medita
 tive cystal bowl sound journey with Talia.\n\n10:00 Closing circle\n\nStay
  after the dance for Kombucha and Community social.\n\n******please come e
 arly\, limited capacity. doors will close at for opening circle at 8:00 an
 d temporarily reopening at 8:15 to let late comers in******\n\nWhy CDP?\n\
 nAcross time and cultures\, dance has long been created as an opportunity 
 to come together\; for celebration\, to heal and commune with all that is 
 sacred.  Conscious Dance Parties (CDP) are drug and alcohol free events\,
  please do not consume substances\, before coming to this event to honour 
 the sacredness of the space and your dance. No talking on the dance floor.
  All ages and abilities welcome. No dance experience required.\n\nAbout Yo
 ur Facilitator &amp\; Founder\n\nLiz Diaz\n\nHas been leading community ri
 tuals and conscious dance events since 2012. She has a deep passion for cr
 eating transformative\, transcendental dance experiences. Her music select
 ion can be described as conscious global grooves. She runs her coaching pr
 actice out of The Rocks Store in Toronto and hosts regularly women's only 
 dance circles Dance Temple visit Lizdiaz.ca for more info.\n\nJoin Liz in 
 Peru in 2020 for her 3rd annual Ecstatic Dance Retreat. New Beginnings - C
 onscious Dance Party
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2019/08/23034_image.jpg
CATEGORIES:Ecstatic,Experimental
LOCATION:Yoga Village\, 240 Roncesvalles Avenue\, Toronto\, ON M6R 2L8\, To
 ronto\, ON\, M6R 2L8\, Canada
GEO:43.645563;-79.449173
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=240 Roncesvalles Avenue\, T
 oronto\, ON M6R 2L8\, Toronto\, ON\, M6R 2L8\, Canada;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X
 -TITLE=Yoga Village:geo:43.645563,-79.449173
END:VEVENT
