URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/the-steps-social-september-shines/
SUMMARY:The Steps Social - September Shines!
DESCRIPTION:Join us for our upcoming studio party\, The Steps Social! This 
 month we'll be hosting a specialty Salsa Shines class and the Steps Teams 
 will be debuting their new Congress choreographies - come out and cheer th
 em on!\n\nSeptember Shines Party with DJ DeTox\n\nStudio 2:\n8pm: Salsa Sh
 ines class with Angelo (then you can perform the shines combo that night a
 t the party)\n9pm - 1am: Salsa &amp\; Bachata Music\, 9pm - 1am\n\nStudio 
 1:\n8pm: Hustle lesson with Jennifer\n9pm - midnight: Hustle\, West Coast 
 &amp\; Top 40 Music\n\nMeet other students and dancers. Practice what you 
 have learned in a relaxed &amp\; friendly environment. Not confident to us
 e some dance moves in the nightclub yet? Try them here first. Dance with y
 our fellow classmates\, Toronto dancers and your instructors. Join us for 
 a fun lesson and stay to party. All ages and all levels welcome\, includin
 g non Steps students and dancers. No partner necessary - everyone dances w
 ith everyone and most people rotate partners after every song.\n\nAdmissio
 n: $10 all night long (includes dance lesson) The Steps Social - September
  Shines!
