  SHOES!\n\nFAQS!\nWHAT CAN I EXPECT FROM THE CARNIVAL SPICE WORKSHOP?\nChe
 ck out our live interview with Breakfast Television https://youtu.be/kDN7Y
 nWPr3w\n\nHOW OLD DO I HAVE TO BE TO ATTEND?\nAll ages and dance levels ar
 e welcome. Recommended for 16-60 \;)\n\nWHERE CAN I PARK?\nStreet Parking 
 Available\; event is also a few steps away from Osgoode Station. Sweat Wit
 h Carnival Spice (Soca\, Dancehall Dance Workshop)
