 ow dance can bring you comfort and joy\n* Find new energy and happiness th
 rough movement\n* Build confidence in your abilities\n* Connect with diffe
 rent people who share similar interests\n\nShed old fears and let the musi
 c carry you.\nNo previous dance experience required. Just come as you are 
 and take the first step.\n\nCost: $15 + tax = $16.95 - registration and pa
 yment required before September 25th - go to website link provided to regi
 ster\n\nLocation:\nTraining Spaces\n567 College St · Toronto\, ON\n\nHow 
 to find us:\n*Please note that the entrance to this boutique gym facility 
 is just south of College off of Manning. I am going to be waiting for you 
 on the second floor once you enter the doors. Please arrive 5-10 min early
  if possible. Introduction to Dance Exploration
