SUMMARY:Resonance
DESCRIPTION:Human Body Expressions confronts the collective power of peacef
 ul protests with the Toronto premiere of the dance/rock concert hybrid Res
 onance. Directed and choreographed by the company’s award-winning Artist
 ic Director Hanna Kiel\, and featuring original music composed by Dora-nom
 inated Greg Harrison\, Resonance is an artistic response to the successful
  public protests demanding the impeachment of former South Korean Presiden
 t Park Geun-Hye. This bold and provocative work probes the evolution of so
 cial outcry into direct action.\n\nTickets from $15. Full details at brown
 papertickets.com Resonance
