URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/night-shift/
SUMMARY:Night Shift
DESCRIPTION:Oct. 2-5\, 2019\nThe Citadel: Ross Centre for Dance\n304 Parlia
 ment Street\nDoors and bar open @ 9pm\, Performances begin @ 10:30pm\n\nNi
 ght Shift is Citadel + Compagnie’s inaugural late-night event\, opening 
 the doors of The Citadel to present dynamic and boundary pushing artists. 
 Curated in partnership with Nova Dance and Making Moves Creative House\, t
 hree to four artists will be featured nightly celebrating the many forms b
 eing explored and practiced by Toronto movement makers\, as well as one in
 ternational guest.\n\nFrom urban dance to kathak\, western contemporary da
 nce to flamenco\, tap to bharatnatyam\, and ballet funk\, the showcase off
 ers a snapshot of the Toronto dance landscape and brings the community tog
 ether in a fun cabaret style setting following Fall for Dance North festiv
 al events.\n\nChoreographers:\nOct. 2: Sophie Dow\, Rachana Joshi\, Tanish
 a Mahesh Kumar\, Natasha Manvi\, Nancy Thavaruban\, Donya Sandhu\, Purawai
  Vyas\, Michael ‘Piecez’ Prosserman\nOct. 3: Mushtari Afroz\, Illumina
  Flamenco\, Kaitlyn Seibold\nOct. 4: Chrissy Kokiri (New Zealand Dance Com
 pany)\, Leela Samson\, Nicholas Rose\, SaMel Tanz\nOct. 5: Dianne Montgome
 ry\, Kevin Birung and Joseph Ianni\, Lukas Malkowski\n\nTickets: Tickets: 
 $15 in advance OR $10 at the door\nDoors and bar open @ 9pm\nPerformances 
 begin @ 10:30pm Night Shift
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2019/09/small-Michael-Piecez-Prosserman_Photo-CR-Glen-Co-Photography.jpg
