URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/union-dance-the-big-social/
SUMMARY:Union Dance: The Big Social
DESCRIPTION:he Union and Fall for Dance North partnership continues into it
 s third year to offer FREE public programming in one of Toronto’s most h
 istoric buildings. This partnership presents unique programming\, specific
 ally curated for Union Station\, to bring you closer to where Toronto is g
 oing on the arts and cultural scene!\n\nJoin us for 11 hours of social dan
 cing on October 5th with THE BIG SOCIAL. Dive into the movement styles of 
 swing\, tango and Haudenosaunee (Indigenous) social dances\, all with live
  music. Learn some new moves in beginner’s workshops and celebrate danci
 ng together in a social setting\, in the stunningly renovated West Wing.\n
 \nSchedule:\n\n12:00pm-2:00pm\n\nHaudenosaunee Social Dance (Indigenous)\n
 with live music by TBD\n\n4:00pm-7:00pm\n\nSwing Dance\nfeaturing a beginn
 ers workshop (4-5pm)\nplus a performance by Luis Arredondo and Tiffany Sin
 e\nwith live music by Bertie &amp\; The Gents\n\n8:00pm-11:00pm\n\nTango M
 ilonga\nfeaturing a beginners workshop (8-9pm)\nplus a performance by Bule
 nt Karabagli and Lina Chan\nwith live music by TBD\n\nHosted by Fall for D
 ance North in partnership with Kaha:wi Dance Theatre\, Lindy Hop Revolutio
 n and Bulent &amp\; Lina Tango.\n\n&nbsp\;\nAll activities are FREE and op
 erate on a first come first serve basis. Limited seating will be available
 .\n​\nThe West Wing is located immediately west of The Great Hall\, Un
 ion Station\, 65 Front Street West\, Toronto-ON\n​\nThe West Wing is ac
 cessible by TTC via the Union Station subway terminal on Line 1 and is w
 heelchair accessible from the Front Street Entrance. Click here for acce
 ssibility information. Union Dance: The Big Social
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2019/10/union-dance.png
