URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/hot-hoop-dance-mama/
SUMMARY:Hot Hoop Dance Mama
DESCRIPTION:Hey Hoopers!!\nGet excited for fall\, because HooperSonic is ho
 sting another awesome instructor in Toronto.....\nJasmine K - Hot Hoop Dan
 ce Mama is personally one of my fav people to watch on my Instagram!! Luck
 y us!! She is bringing her UNREAL Twin Flow workshops all the way from Tex
 as!!\n\nEach day will include:\nWorkshops\, Jam time &amp\; a Showcase on 
 the Sunday!\n\nTICKETS ARE LIMITED!\n\nWorkshop Descriptions from Hot Hoop
  Dance Mama Herself!:\n\nWORKSHOP #1: DOUBLE VISION\nMesmerize anyone with
  these hypnotic sequences for twin hoops. In this workshop we will learn t
 he art of framing and manipulation skills through several types of hybrid-
 based combos.\nSequences will include new material based on framed hybrids
  of double smears\, isolations\, folds\, weaves\, hip hinges\, along with 
 many transitional ideas for smoothness and illusion.\n\nWORKSHOP #2: TWIN 
 DIVA\nThis sassy workshop will focus on double wedgie entrances\, exits an
 d flourishes as well as double body locks to bring out your inner diva. In
  this workshop\, we will learn three combos complete with smooth transitio
 ns\, basic footwork body positioning to bring out your inner twin diva.\n\
 nWORKSHOP #3: ONE-HANDED MAGICIAN\nA twin hoop workshop based on a variety
  of two hoops/one hand skills. In this workshop we will explore how to sme
 ar\, twist\, escalate\, and finger-spin twin hoops using only one hand.\n\
 nWORKSHOP #4: ON BODY BLISS\nIn this workshop we will learn yoga pose sequ
 ences with twin hoops. We will be focusing on knee hooping while doing a v
 ariety of other on and off body skills as well as exploring the ins and ou
 ts of double lock poses in standing position. Hot Hoop Dance Mama
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2019/09/23118_image.png
CATEGORIES:Hoop,Other
