SUMMARY:Classical Indian Dance &amp\; Bollywood Fusion Workshop
DESCRIPTION:We're hosting a pop-up Classical Indian Dance and Bollywood Wor
 kshop to inspire you artistically\, mentally\, and physically. For women a
 nd teen girls of all levels. A bonus of this workshop is that you'll have 
 fun learning a new dance while getting to burn tons of calories before all
  of those Halloween parties start!\n\nSchedule\nIntroduction to Classical 
 Indian Dance (Beginners) (5:30 PM/55-min)\nIntroduction to Classical India
 n Dance with Bollywood Fusion (6:30 PM/55-min)\nBeginners Bollywood Dance 
 Choreography Class (option to perform at the end and be filmed) (7:30 PM/5
 5-min)\n\nRate\n1 Class - $30 / 2 Classes - $50 (save $10) / 3 Classes - $
 70 (save $20)\n\nTo sign up\, do visit: www.fusioncardiotoronto.com Classi
 cal Indian Dance &amp\; Bollywood Fusion Workshop
