URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/cws-caribbean-dance-a-thon/
SUMMARY:CWS Caribbean Dance-A-Thon
DESCRIPTION:Let's celebrate Caribbean Heritage Month!\n\n\n\n\nThe carnival
  vibes are here!\n\nAll are welcome to dance\, have fun\, and raise funds 
 for Caribbean Heritage Month\; by participating in\, the first-of-its kind
 \, family-friendly\, all-ages Caribbean dance-a-thon!\n\nWear comfortable 
 clothing/shoes\, bring your whistle and rag\; and work out your waist-line
  to sweet\, mesmerizing music from the Caribbean\, through this carnival-i
 nspired fundraising initiative! Dancing will be self-guided/paced\, unstru
 ctured\, freestyle. No experience necessary.\n\nOptional: Wear Caribbean f
 lag(s) colours\, Caribbean-themed\, tropical/festive clothing and/or acces
 sories!\n\nParts of this event will be photographed/filmed/streamed for pr
 omotional purposes only.\n\nDance-Participant Registration types: \n\nChil
 d/Senior/General: ONE-HOUR &amp\; ALL-DAY DANCE: Includes one bottled wate
 r\, one raffle ticket\, and one participant certificate.\n\nChild/Senior/G
 eneral: TWO-HOUR DANCE: Includes a special shout-out\, one bottled water\,
  one meat/veg patty\, TWO raffle tickets \, one participant certificate.\n
 \nFundraising activities will include: raffles tickets\, freshly-made frui
 t juices\, tshirts\, snacks\, loonie ($1.00) song-requests/shout-outs\, an
 d more!\n\n**For vendor space (reserved for Caribbean-Canadian business-ow
 ners/community organizations) and sponsorship opportunities\, click here: 
 Vendor/Sponsor Application **\n\n100% of profits will go directly to futur
 e Caribbean Women's Society and Caribbean Heritage Month activities.\n\nDa
 nce-a-thon Itinerary \n\n4:00 to 4:30 - sign in\, name tags\, raffle ticke
 t\, bottled water\n\n4:30 to 4:40 - Official welcome\n\n4:40 - 5:00 PM ven
 dor sales\, food/drink/raffle sales\, new memberships\, dance warm-up\n\n5
 :00 - 6:00 Dance-a-thon\n\n6:00 - 6:30 Break\, vendor sales\, food/drink/r
 affle sales\, new memberships\n\n6:30 - 7:30 Dance-a-thon\n\n7:30 - 7:50 B
 reak\, vendor sales\, food/drink/raffle sales\, new memberships\, raffle w
 inners\, presentation of participant certificates\, group photo\n\n7:50 - 
 8:00 Closing remarks\n\n\n\n\n CWS Caribbean Dance-A-Thon
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2019/09/23303_image.png
CATEGORIES:Caribbean
LOCATION:Downsview Hub\, 70 Canuck Avenue\, STE 102\, Toronto\, ON M3K 2C5\
 , Toronto\, ON\, M3K 2C5\, Canada
GEO:43.743271;-79.484877
