SUMMARY:Salsa/Latin Dance Classes
DESCRIPTION:Salsa/Latin Dance Classes\nClub Latin @ Parkway Forest\n\nSalsa
 \, Cha Cha\, Bachata\, Merengue\, Rumba …\nThe emphasis is on DANCING. T
 he focus is on Salsa\, with excursions into Rumba\, Cha Cha\, Merengue and
  Bachata. You’ll learn to move to and with\, the rhythm and tempo of the
  music and apply the movements learned to the various dances.\n\nFall clas
 ses will begin Sunday Oct. 13\, 2019 - so you better dust off those dancin
 g shoes and prepárate para calentar la pista de baile.\nPartner not requi
 red. All levels welcomed.\n\nAdults (19+)\n$111 for 9 lessons (9 weeks)\nS
 undays\, 6:00pm - 7:30pm - 1 1/2hrs in an actual dance studio.\n\nParkway 
 Forest C. C.\n55 Forest Manor Rd.\n(East of Don Mills Rd. &amp\; South of 
 Sheppard Ave. E and Fairview Mall)\n\nStarts Sunday Oct. 13th\, 2019\n(Oct
 . 13th – Dec. 8th)\nBarcode: 3223486\n\nFree Parking.\n\nTo Register By 
 Phone [7am - 5pm] - 416-338-4386 or 416-396-7378\n\nYou can also register 
 in person at the North York Civic Ctr.\n\n* Hispanic Dance Instructor\n* 1
 9 years teaching in dance studios\, night clubs\, privately and with recre
 ation organizations.\n* Qualified Dance Instructor\n* 25+ years of dance e
 xperience in Latin\, Ballroom and Swing.\nDeep Experience. Trusted Instruc
 tion Salsa/Latin Dance Classes
