SUMMARY:EVERYBODY DANCE NOW: Rave from the Grave
DESCRIPTION:\n\n\nGrab your kandi\, put on your widest pants\, your furries
 t hat and clip on some butterflies for flair\, cuz this Halloween\, we're 
 resurrecting the soul of classic dance music.\n\nYour hosts me time+ Danny
  Thrax will be joined by the unstoppable Ticky Ty\, for what promises to b
 e a music experience you cannot miss. Expect us to flip those dancefloor c
 lassics with a modern twist\, as we perform a musical seance to resurrect 
 our fallen venues of Toronto legends.\n\nThis haunted evening will bring u
 s the rebirth of rave excellence\, as we summon the original spirits of th
 e culture: PEACE\, LOVE\, UNITY\, and RESPECT.\n\nTheme: RAVE FROM THE GRA
 VE - dress as an OG dance icon\, a legendary DJ\, a campy club kid\, a dev
 ilish condo developer\, or an undead raver's revenge. DO YOU - the rave wa
 s a place where there were no limits on self-expression. Travel through ti
 me with us\, whether that brings you to electric circus\, or a warehouse j
 am at the edge of town.\n\nMore surprises in store so keep it locked!\n\nC
 ommunity dancefloor • bring your best energy\, behave with beauty\, conn
 ect with intention\n\nWe never want your wallet to stop you from dancing. 
 If your budget is tight\, please reach out to us\n\nFriendship supported b
 y We Met Dancing\n\nDecor by Calabra\n\n\n EVERYBODY DANCE NOW: Rave from 
 the Grave
