SUMMARY:Dance of the Damned Halloween Party
DESCRIPTION:Rue Morgue Annual Halloween Party\n\n\n\nLast year was the BEST
  party in the city and we are back to do it all again!\n\nRUE MORGUE retur
 ns to Toronto as the world’s leading horror in culture and entertainment
  brand with DANCE OF THE DAMNED Halloween Party! (Saturday\, October 26\, 
 The Opera House\, 735 Queen St East\, Toronto. Doors: 9 PM. $30 door /adva
 nce tickets available from https://www.eventbrite.com/e/rue-morgue-hallowe
 en-tickets-64625747350).\n\nDANCE OF THE DAMNED will feature a sinister sp
 ectacle of eye-popping visuals with digital-deco from VJ Keeping. Our annu
 al Midnight Costume Contest featuring $1000 in cash prizes to the winners 
 (1st Prize: $500\, 2nd Prize $300 3rd Prize $200\, Runner Up Prizes\, Rue 
 Morgue Mags\, DVDs\,+ More!!)\n\nJoin the staff and writers of the world
 ’s premiere horror in culture and entertainment publication for a night 
 of Halloween horror you won't forget! Also featuring the demonic dance mus
 ic of DJ JIMI LaMORT and DJ SAUCY MISO\, digital deco\, VIP Area and more!
 \n\nRue Morgue presents DANCE OF THE DAMNED Halloween Party\n\nOPERA HOUSE
 \n\n735 Queen St. E\n\nThe Gates of Hell open at 9:00 PM\n\nCostumes not m
 andatory but highly encouraged for the city’s sexiest\, scary party of t
 he season. We'll show you why we throw the most notorious Halloween party 
 in the city!\n\nBe sure to visit our PHOTO BOOTH\n\nPhotographer is the am
 azing John Lee!!\n\n19+ event. NOTE: Door staff may need to see your face 
 to confirm I.D.\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nAT DOOR:\n\nGeneral Admission: $30 before mi
 dnight / $40 after midnight\n\nVIP: $100\n\nVIP INFO\n\n-Access to upper f
 loor private lounge &amp\; bar\n\n-Free private coat check\n\n-Food tables
  done in style!!\n\n-Seating areas\n\n-Access to private bar\n\n&nbsp\;\n\
 nFACEBOOK: https://www.facebook.com/ruemorguemagazine/\n\nPoster art by: A
 ndrew Wright\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n\n Dance of the Damned Halloween Par
 ty
