SUMMARY:Opera Atelier presents Don Giovanni
DESCRIPTION:Opera Atelier is thrilled to present Mozart’s Don Giovanni
 \, from October 31–November 9\,\n2019 at the Ed Mirvish Theatre. Star
 ring Douglas Williams as the Don\, this comic masterpiece\ntells the story
  of the world’s most irresistible lover\, who blazes a path to his own d
 estruction in\njust 24 hours. Staged with Opera Atelier’s trademark glam
 our\, this glittering production –\ninspired by the Commedia dell’arte
  – took Toronto audiences by storm in 2011 and returns as\nan Opera Atel
 ier favourite. Don’t miss it. Opera Atelier presents Don Giovanni
