SUMMARY:Battery Dance: Dancing to Connect FREE Dance Performance
DESCRIPTION:Battery Dance\, in partnership with Canada's National Ballet Sc
 hool\, presents a FREE Dancing to Connect Performance!\n\n\n\n\nLed by Bat
 tery Dance Teaching Artists\, Dancing to Connect is a collaborative dance 
 workshop that aims to empower participants aged 14-24 to express their ind
 ividual creativity and share meaningful personal stories through movement.
 \n\nThe workshops culminate in a performance where participants will share
  their creations with family\, friends and the public.\n\nPERFORMANCE DETA
 ILS\n\nDate: Friday\, Nov 1\, 2019\, 3:00pm\n\nLocation: Betty Oliphant Th
 eatre\, 404 Jarvis Street\, Toronto ON M4Y 2G6\n\nRegister to hold your sp
 ot before seats run out!\n\n\n\n\n Battery Dance: Dancing to Connect FREE 
 Dance Performance
