 and beginner dance classes!\n\nNo prior experience is needed. Absolute beg
 inners are welcome. There's no need to bring your own dance partners. Lice
 nsed bar. Subway and parking are close by.\n\nBeginner classes 7pm to 9pm\
 , Charleston 7pm\, Lindy Hop 8pm.\n\nParty 9:10pm to 12:30am.\n\nLindy Hop
  is the most popular dance of the Swing Ear and the most popular swing dan
 ce around the world today.\n\nParty $15\, $17 with one class\, $20 with tw
 o\, $5 off for full-time students.\n\nswingtoronto.com facebook: https://w
 ww.facebook.com/SwingTorontoPage/ Saturday Night Swing features Heidi Lang
 e Swing Band and beginner classes
