SUMMARY:Intro to Salsa on2 Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Intro to Salsa on2 / NY Salsa!\n\nDates: Sundays\, November 3\,
  10\,17\, 24\n\n4 week intensive for students new to dancing Salsa on 2 (a
 lso called Mambo or New York or Puerto Rican style Salsa). This crash cour
 se workshop will teach you the Salsa on 2 fundamentals - basic timing\, tu
 rns and technique – to get you started to social dance Salsa on 2.\n\nAf
 ter completion of the workshop\, you may join Steps Dance Studio's upcomin
 g Salsa on 2 weekly class.\nOpen to students in Salsa (on1) levels 3-5. No
  prior on 2 experience required.\nPrice: $60 for 4 weeks.\nFREE for Steps 
 Monthly Auto Renew Members and Annual Members. Intro to Salsa on2 Workshop
