URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/proartedanza-the-9th-november-6-9-
 2019/
SUMMARY:ProArteDanza: The 9th! — November 6–9\, 2019
DESCRIPTION:ProArteDanza celebrates its 15th anniversary season with the To
 ronto premiere of The 9th!\, a full-length choreographed imagining of Ludw
 ig van Beethoven’s epic 9th Symphony\, on stage at Harbourfront Centre
 ’s Fleck Dance Theatre from November 6–9. Created and co-choreographed
  by the company’s award-winning Artistic Director Roberto Campanella and
  Artistic Associate Robert Glumbek\, this bold and provocative work celebr
 ates freedom and unity. The 9th! pays homage to the 30th anniversary of th
 e fall of the Berlin Wall in a fitting tribute to the thrilling physicalit
 y of Beethoven’s iconic music.\n\nTickets $20 – $50\, plus applicable 
 taxes and fees. Full details at proartedanza.com ProArteDanza: The 9th! 
 — November 6–9\, 2019
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2019/08/111.jpg
