SUMMARY:Traditional Viennese Waltz beginner workshop!
DESCRIPTION:Viennse Waltz beginner workshop!\nSaturday\, November 9\nDoverc
 ourt House\n805 Dovercourt Rd\, Toronto\, ON M6H 2X4\, Canada\nDescription
 :3pm to 6pm.\n\nLearn traditional Viennese Waltz\, one of the best and mos
 t fun partner dances ever\, popular since the early 19th century\, and don
 e all around the world! Done to great music of the 21st\, 20th and 19th ce
 nturies\, usually at tempos from medium to very fast. Easy to learn.\n\nNo
  prior experience is needed. Absolute beginners are welcome. There is no n
 eed to bring your own dance partners.\n\nTeachers: Bonnie &amp\; Simon.\n\
 nThis workshop focuses on Right Turning Viennese Waltz (revolving to your 
 right as you travel around the room with a partner). If you take this work
 shop you can also take our Viennese Waltz intermediate workshop on Saturda
 y May 25.\n\n$30. ($10 if you have taken this workshop with us before.)\n\
 nfacebook: https://www.facebook.com/groups/142519259606/ Traditional Vienn
 ese Waltz beginner workshop!
