SUMMARY:Pure Dance Convention TORONTO 2019
DESCRIPTION:https://youtu.be/724GwKhIExY\n\nPURE DANCE CONVENTION - TORONTO
  2019\nSunday November 10th\, 2019\n\nSuggested age levels:\n\nJunior: 7-
 9\n\nInter: 10-12\n\nSenior: 13+\n\nIndividual Tuition Rates:\n\nJUNIOR 
 Standard Tuition Rate - $130 + TAX\n\nINTER/SENIOR Standard Tuition Rate
  - $160 + TAX\n\nObserver Wristbands:\n\nWe love parents at Pure Dance &a
 mp\; would love to have you watch!\n\nObserver Wristband $25 + TAX\n\n\nAd
 ditional Rules &amp\; Regulations:\n\n 	All registrations are non-refundab
 le and only valid at the location and time indicated on the registration 
 form.\n\n\n 	Registrants will receive only one wristband for the conventio
 n. Wristbands must be worn at all times and are not to be removed for the
  duration of the convention.\n\n\n 	All observer wristbands are non-refund
 able and may not be transferred from one person to another. Observer wrist
 bands are only available to parents/legal guardians or registered teachers
  of a dancer. Pure Dance Convention reserves the right to remove any obser
 ver who is disruptive to the class.\n\n\n 	The ages outlined for each leve
 l are only a suggestion. Each registrant and/or parent or legal guardian i
 s responsible for determining the appropriate level to register for and th
 e decision is left to their discretion. Once registered\, dancers are not 
 permitted to change levels.\n\n\n 	Pure Dance Convention faculty is subjec
 t to change.\n Pure Dance Convention TORONTO 2019
