URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/totally-80s-fundraising-dance-part
 y/
SUMMARY:Totally 80s: Fundraising Dance Party
DESCRIPTION:Hands of Fire proudly welcomes you to our fourth annual fundrai
 sing event Totally 80s: Fundraising Dance Party!\n\n\n\n\nHands of Fire pr
 oudly welcomes you to our fourth annual fundraising event Totally 80s: A F
 undraising Dance Party! Hands of Fire is a not-for-profit organization and
  a chapter of the Canadian Council of the Blind which offers sculpture cla
 sses to blind and visually impaired individuals. We are a Toronto-based gr
 oup comprised of a number of talented blind and visually impaired artists 
 with amazing and diverse works of art showcased across the greater Toronto
  community.\n\nTotally 80s will be held on November 16th\, 2019 at the Cen
 ter for Social Innovation Spadina Lounge (192 Spadina Avenue). This year
 ’s event is unique because it will transport our guests back to a decade
  of partying\, dance\, and great music with our theme\, Totally 80’s! Th
 is event will be an exciting night of music\, dance\, and mingling all in 
 support of Hands of Fire. The night will include\, among other activities 
 a raffle draw\, and our first ever silent auction! With this auction\, we 
 hope to offer a number of great items for our guests to bid on in support 
 of a great cause.\n\nAny support we receive will go towards further suppor
 ting our group\; this includes purchasing materials such as paint\, clay\,
  and tools\, as well as planning future events to celebrate the hard work 
 and artwork in our community! We hope to see you there dancing your way ba
 ck into the 80s in support of Hands of Fire. Your presence will help us ac
 hieving our joint goals of ensuring a vibrant night of fun and dance\, and
  of further developing and strengthening our group.\n\n\n\n Totally 80s: F
 undraising Dance Party
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2019/10/23352_image.png
LOCATION:Centre for Social Innovation Spadina\, 192 Spadina Avenue\, Toront
 o\, ON M5T 2C2\, Toronto\, ON\, M5T 2C2\, Canada
GEO:43.649968;-79.397543
