  8pm-9pm\nStudio 2: Salsa &amp\; Bachata Music\, 9pm - 1am\, DJ Ef\nStudio
  1: Hustle Lesson\, 8pm-9pm\nStudio 1: Hustle\, West Coast &amp\; Top 40 M
 usic\, 9pm - 1am\, DJ DeTox\n\nMOVEmber!\nJoin Jena for a fun Body movemen
 t class!\n\nMeet other students and dancers. Practice what you have learne
 d in a relaxed &amp\; friendly environment. Not confident to use some danc
 e moves in the nightclub yet? Try them here first. Dance with your fellow 
 classmates\, Toronto dancers and your instructors. Join us for a fun lesso
 n and stay to party. All ages and all levels welcome\, including non Steps
  students and dancers. No partner necessary - everyone dances with everyon
 e and most people rotate partners after every song.\n\nAdmission: $10 all 
 night long (includes dance lesson) The Steps Social - MOVEmber
