URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/citadel-dance-mix-2019/
SUMMARY:Citadel Dance Mix 2019
DESCRIPTION:\n\nPresented by Citadel + Compagnie through Bright Nights Perf
 orming Arts series\, this second seasonal triple bill features some of Tor
 onto’s most dynamic and daring choreographers.\n\nChoreographers: Nova B
 hattacharya\, Syreeta Hector\, Christianne Ullmark\nNovember 27-30\, Decem
 ber 4-7\, 2019\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nRed &amp\; Yellow\n\nChoreographer: Nova Bhat
 tacharya\n\nDancers:  Michael Caldwell\, Luke Garwood\, Daniel Gomez\, Sa
 hara Morimoto\, Kaitlin Standeven.\nLighting designer: Simon Rossiter.\nS
 core: Santosh Naidu &amp\; Ian DeSouza\n\nBhattacharya’s Red &amp\; Yell
 ow is a meditation on finding solitude inside the multitudes. Originally c
 reated for Dancemakers in 2011\, C+C is thrilled to be remounting this vis
 ually stunning quintet that is a poetic\, metaphoric and humane expression
  of body and spirit.\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nBlack Ballerina\n\nChoreographer: Syree
 ta Hector\nDancer: Syreeta Hector\nMovement Dramaturge: Seika Boye\nSound 
 designer: Zarnoosh Bilimoria\nSet designer: Wesley McKenzie\n\nBased on He
 ctor’s relationship to race\, and her experiences in classical ballet\, 
 Black Ballerina is a powerful exploration of the nuances within one’s id
 entity\, and the unconscious ways that we all try to fit in. Performed by 
 Hector\, Black Ballerina brings an unbridled energy to this triple bill.\n
 \n&nbsp\;\n\nclose encounters in the fifth dimension\nWorld premiere\n\nCh
 oreographer: Christianne Ullmark\nDancers: TBA\nCostume designer: Valerie 
 Calam\nSound designer: Christianne Ullmark in collaboration with Johnny Sp
 ence.\nSet designer: Christianne Ullmark\n\nclose encounters in the fifth 
 dimension is a meditative experiment of arrivals and departures\, and of m
 eeting the ‘self’ and the ‘other’ somewhere in the middle.\n\n Cit
 adel Dance Mix 2019
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2019/08/23014_image.jpg
LOCATION:Citadel Ross Centre for Dance\, 304 Parliament St\, Toronto\, Onta
 rio\, M5A2Z6\, Canada
GEO:43.6591;-79.366
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=304 Parliament St\, Toronto
 \, Ontario\, M5A2Z6\, Canada;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Citadel Ross Centr
 e for Dance:geo:43.6591,-79.366
END:VEVENT
