SUMMARY:Arthur Murray Yorkville Holiday Cheer Studio Open House & Party
DESCRIPTION:Raise A Cup Of Cheer And Dance With Us!\n\n\n\n\nAre you intere
 sted in ballroom dancing? At Arthur Murray\, we have been teaching people 
 to dance for over 100 years. Our proven teaching method makes learning eas
 y and fun. Don't believe us? Come see for yourself!\n\nOur Yorkville studi
 o is having an open house on Wednesday\, November 27th. Come join us for a
  group class at 8:30pm (no experience necessary). At 9:15pm\, dance to hol
 iday classics with our staff and students at our Holiday Cheer dance party
 . Everyone welcome-singles and couples. Once you see how easy it is\, you 
 will wonder why you didn't come sooner! It's not too late to learn how to 
 dance for all those year-end parties...\n\n\n\n Arthur Murray Yorkville Ho
 liday Cheer Studio Open House &amp\; Party
