URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/dance-for-mental-health/
SUMMARY:Dance for Mental Health
DESCRIPTION:Join CESAR for a dance and destress event at the Ryerson Studen
 t Centre before we head into exams.\n\n\n\n\nThe event is simple\, come by
  the room (at any time) and dance to your own rhythm and pace. We will hav
 e a great playlist lined up\, some positive and inclusive facilitators and
  mentors\, and some beverages to keep up your energy. No dance experience 
 is required.\n\n 	Friday\, November 29\, 2019\n 	5pm-7pm\n 	Oakham Lounge\
 , Ryerson Student Centre (2nd Floor)\n 	55 Gould Street\n\nThe organizers 
 strive to create accessible and inclusive events. If you require any accom
 modations to ensure your participation\, please contact executivedirector@
 mycesar.ca.\n\n------\n\nHansel Igbavboa is a multidisciplinary artist pas
 sionate about social equity and innovation. He organizes with social justi
 ce seeking groups/organizations-on and off campus- in creating safer and m
 ore inclusive communities. He uses the arts as a tool for calling attentio
 n to social issues and celebrating marginalized folks. He is a dancer\, si
 nger\, videographer\, photographer and creative director.\n\n\n\n Dance fo
 r Mental Health
