 revue/
SUMMARY:Taj Express: The Bollywood Musical Revue - Nov 30
DESCRIPTION:TO Live presents the glitter and sparkle of Bollywood with Taj 
 Express\, at Toronto’s St. Lawrence Centre for the Arts Theatre November
  23 – December\n1\, 2019.\n\nTickets start at $49 and can be purchased o
 nline at stlc.ca\, by calling 416-366-7723 or\n1-800-708-6754\, or in pers
 on at select TO Live box offices.\n\nFeaturing a cast of 24\, including 21
  performers and 3 on-stage musicians\, Taj Express is full of high-energy 
 music and sensational dance scenes.\n\nSet to an unforgettable soundtrack 
 featuring the songs of Academy Award-winning composer A.R. Rahman (Slumdog
  Millionaire\, 127 Hours) Taj Express explodes with the sounds of India an
 d\ncaptures the vibrant\, expressive spirit of the world of Bollywood movi
 es that have been entertaining billions of people for generations. Taj Ex
 press is an uplifting show full of colour\, high-\nenergy music\, and sens
 ational dance scenes choreographed by one of Bollywood’s top young chor
 eographers\, Vaibhavi Merchant (The Merchants of Bollywood) and directed b
 y Shruti\nMerchant (“Dance India Dance”)\, immersing audiences in the 
 heart of contemporary Bollywood and Indian pop music.\n\nWatch scenes from
  the musical here:\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QiwqW-_2EkM\n\n&nbsp
 \; Taj Express: The Bollywood Musical Revue - Nov 30
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2019/11/Taj-Express.jpg
CATEGORIES:Bollywood
