URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/club-platinum-holiday-dance-party-
 for-seniors/
SUMMARY:Club Platinum Holiday Dance Party for Seniors
DESCRIPTION:Club Platinum - Seniors Dance Toronto - welcomes folks 65+ of a
 ll abilities\, mobility\, and cognitive levels to dance the afternoon  aw
 ay to the hits we all know and love. Be there December 1 at 2:30 pm for ou
 r first Holiday Dance Party at The Centre for Social Innovation\, 3rd Floo
 r Daniel's Spectrum building\, 585 Dundas Street East.  Caregivers or gui
 des are free. Limited income tickets are available upon request. We want 
 you to attend!\n\nTickets include DJ\, snacks\, and soft drinks. Caregiver
 s are most welcome and are free to enter. Beer and wine are extra. Must be
  65 or older to attend.\n\nYou have the option to attend the after-dance p
 rix-fixe meal at Vicino Italian Kitchen\, 148 Sumach Street\, a short walk
  from the dance venue for ONLY $30 (plus tax and tip). A $50 value!\n\nDon
 't take those old records off the shelf! Come on out to Club Platinum to h
 ear all your favs and dance with an amazing group of folks. Even if you ju
 st dance with your hands\, we want you! Club Platinum Holiday Dance Party 
