SUMMARY:Cuban Fusion Choreo Class
DESCRIPTION:Cuban Fusion Choreo Class with Dailyn &amp\; Jena\nTuesdays\, 9
 :00-10:00pm\nDecember 3 - January 28 (7 weeks)\n\nThis collaboration class
  with Dailyn &amp\; Jena will combine each of their specialties to create 
 a fun\, infectious and flavourful fusion! Learn a shines routine with elem
 ents of Cuban body movement &amp\; footwork\, isolations\, Caribbean style
 s\, hip hop\, Latin funk and Reggaeton. This class will help to improve yo
 ur memory of shines\, enhance your styling and quality of movement\, impro
 ve your timing and musicality. Unleash your inner performer\, increase you
 r confidence on the dancefloor\, meet new people and have fun!\n\nFor stud
 ents in salsa levels 2 - 5. No partner necessary. No previous Cuban salsa 
 or previous performance experience necessary.\n\nNot included with our mem
 bership but monthly auto-renew and annual members do get a great discount!
  Students perform at the annual Steps Snow Ball on Fri. Jan. 31st.\n\n$120
  for 7 weeks\, non members.\n$70 for members. A Steps member is a student 
 on a monthly auto-renew contract or with an annual membership. (Must have 
 a membership for the duration of the course.) Please note that all partici
 pants must commit for the full course. Class cards cannot be used. Cuban F
 usion Choreo Class
