 luded with admission).\n\nBeginner dance classes 7pm to 9pm before the Dan
 ce Party\, Charleston 7pm\, Lindy Hop 8pm.\n\nSwing Dance Party 9:10pm to 
 past midnight.\nBand: Dee &amp\; The Savoy Band!\n\nPlease invite your fri
 ends.\n\nEveryone is welcome! No prior experience is needed\, absolute beg
 inners are welcome. There is no need to bring your own dance partners. Par
 king and subway are close by. Licensed bar.\n\nThe event is 19 years old a
 nd up after 10pm. Teenagers under 19 are very welcome to attend til then (
 for just $10 for both classes and the dance til 10pm). If you are under 19
  you may stay past 10pm only with parental accompaniment. (This is a polic
 y of the venue\, not of Swing Toronto.)\n\nWebsite: swingtoronto.com\n\nFa
 cebook events: https://www.facebook.com/groups/157279846382/events/\n\nDan
 ce Party $15\, $17 with one class\, $20 with both. $5 off for full-time st
 udents. Yule/Christmas Saturday Night Swing with Dee &amp\; The Savoy Band
