SUMMARY:The Steps Xmas Social
DESCRIPTION:THE STEPS XMAS SOCIAL\nJoin us for Dominican December!\n\nSTUDI
 O 2:\n8pm-9pm: Dominican Bachata Footwork (Intermediate) with Angelo &amp\
 ; Jena\n9pm-1am: Salsa &amp\; Bachata Music with DJ Gio\n\nSTUDIO 1:\n8pm-
 9pm: Dominican Merengue (Beginner) with Jennifer\n9pm-midnight: Hustle\, W
 est Coast &amp\; Top 40 Music with DJ DeTox\n\nCome celebrate the festive 
 season with us!\n\nSnacks. Performances by teachers and students. Meet oth
 er students and dancers. Practice what you have learned in a relaxed &amp\
 ; friendly environment. Not confident to use some dance moves in the night
 club yet? Try them here first. Dance with your fellow classmates\, Toronto
  dancers and your instructors. Join us for a fun lesson and stay to party.
  All ages and all levels welcome\, including non-Steps students and dancer
 s. No partner necessary - everyone dances with everyone and most people ro
 tate partners after every song.\n\nAdmission: $10 all night long (includes
  dance lesson) The Steps Xmas Social
