URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/discover-dance-with-sze-yang-ade-l
 am-2/
SUMMARY:Discover Dance with Sze-Yang Ade-Lam
DESCRIPTION:This December meet artist Sze-Yang Ade-Lam!\n\n\n\nTuesday\, De
 cember 10\, 2019\n\nMERIDIAN ARTS CENTRE (formerly Toronto Centre for the 
 Arts)\n\n5040 Yonge Street\n\n12:00PM – 1:00PM \n\nThis is a FREE series
 . Doors open at 11:30am.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?time_continue=9&
 amp\;v=zV3nhOuZw8U&amp\;feature=emb_logo\n\nYou are invited to Discover Da
 nce\, a free\, all-ages\, lunch hour series\, where you will be introduced
  to some of Toronto’s incredible dance artists. Hosted by the award-winn
 ing choreographer Nova Bhattacharya\, Discover Dance is an hour packed wit
 h dance and conversation. You will have the opportunity to see dance and s
 hare your thoughts\; to hear stories and ask questions\; and to discover h
 ow dance forms from near and far are being woven in Toronto’s cultural s
 cene.\n\nABOUT THE ARTIST - Sze-Yang Ade-Lam is a queer\, Asian\, non-bina
 ry storyteller &amp\; community developer via dance\, movement\, martial a
 rts\, writing\, drawings and much more. Sze-Yang shares stories for love\,
  liberation\, representation &amp\; empowerment\, as an independent artist
 \, and as part of ILL NANA/DiverseCity Dance Company. Since 2011 Sze-Yang 
 has created more accessible affirming dance education and performance oppo
 rtunities for QTBIPOC’s and their adjacent communities\, as well as advo
 cated for change in the arts. (Photo credit DA Hoskins)\n\nSpecial thanks 
 to Nova Dance and the Toronto Arts Council!\n\n\n Discover Dance with Sze-
 Yang Ade-Lam
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2019/11/23645_image.png
LOCATION:Meridian Arts Centre\, 5040 Yonge St\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M2N 6R8
 \, North York\, Canada
GEO:43.766058;-79.414495
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=5040 Yonge St\, Toronto\, O
 ntario\, M2N 6R8\, North York\, Canada;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Meridian
  Arts Centre:geo:43.766058,-79.414495
END:VEVENT
