URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/discover-dance-with-sze-yang-ade-l
 am/
SUMMARY:Discover Dance with Sze-Yang Ade-Lam
DESCRIPTION:This December meet artist Sze-Yang Ade-Lam!\n\n\n\nWednesday\, 
 December 11\, 2019\n\nMERIDIAN HALL (formerly Sony Centre)\n\n1 Front St E
 ast\n\n12:00PM – 1:00PM \n\nThis is a FREE series. Doors open at 11:30am
 . RSVP to attend!\n\nYou are invited to Discover Dance\, a free\, all-ages
 \, lunch hour series\, where you will be introduced to some of Toronto’s
  incredible dance artists. Hosted by the award-winning choreographer Nova 
 Bhattacharya\, Discover Dance is an hour packed with dance and conversatio
 n. You will have the opportunity to see dance and share your thoughts\; to
  hear stories and ask questions\; and to discover how dance forms from nea
 r and far are being woven in Toronto’s cultural scene.\n\nABOUT THE ARTI
 ST - Sze-Yang Ade-Lam is a queer\, Asian\, non-binary storyteller &amp\; c
 ommunity developer via dance\, movement\, martial arts\, writing\, drawing
 s and much more. Sze-Yang shares stories for love\, liberation\, represent
 ation &amp\; empowerment\, as an independent artist\, and as part of ILL N
 ANA/DiverseCity Dance Company. Since 2011 Sze-Yang has created more access
 ible affirming dance education and performance opportunities for QTBIPOC
 ’s and their adjacent communities\, as well as advocated for change in t
 he arts. (Photo credit DA Hoskins)\n\n\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?ti
 me_continue=9&amp\;v=zV3nhOuZw8U&amp\;feature=emb_logo\n\n\n\nSpecial than
 ks to Nova Dance and the Toronto Arts Council!\n\n\n Discover Dance with S
 ze-Yang Ade-Lam
