SUMMARY:Beyond The Dance Sunday Afternoon Party (FREE)
DESCRIPTION:UNITED SOUL / GROOVE INSTITUTE are DJ members YOGI\, MARK &amp\
 ; ANAND\, an organization that has been promoting and supporting soulful d
 ance music since the early 90's. From their travels over the past 20+ year
 s\, they have accumulated and acquired an understanding of music that they
  wish to share with everyone. As United Soul\, they have organized well ov
 er 400+ events and recently celebrated 21 yrs of Solid Garage.\n\nTheir d
 epth and knowledge of music has helped them get booked with the likes of L
 ouie Vega\, Osunlade\, Joe Claussell\, Tony Allen\, Femi Kuti\, Seun Kuti\
 , Colonel Abrams\, Adeva\, Byron Stingily\, Jellybean Benitez\, Robert Owe
 ns\, Mark Farina\, Jazzanova\, Kenny Bobien\, JoshFromBlaze\, Tortured Sou
 l\, King Britt\, Ron Trent and many others. Their sets cover a wide spect
 rum of music\, incorporating a soulful mixture of Soul\, Jazz\, Latin\, Br
 azilian\, Disco\, Garage and House. Beyond The Dance Sunday Afternoon Part
 y (FREE)
