SUMMARY:New Year's Eve AFTERNOON Dance Party for Seniors
DESCRIPTION:Club Platinum is thrilled to announce its replacement December 
 Seniors Dance on New Year’s Eve in the afternoon! Know anyone who might 
 be interested? Please share!\n\nJoin us in a fun celebration of 2019\, loo
 king forward to 2020 at the Centre for Social Innovation\, 3rd floor\, Dan
 iel’s Spectrum Building\, 585 Dundas Street East at 2:30 pm - 5:00 pm.\n
 \nEven if you only dance with your hands\, we want you. All mobility and c
 ognitive levels wanted. Cost: Pay What You Can (suggested $15) but whateve
 r you can contribute is fine. We want you there! Caregivers free.\n\nWe wi
 ll supply a DJ\, light snacks\, and light refreshments. There will be wine
  and beer at a cash bar. For this dance\, only\, sparkling grape and champ
 agne will be served at the end of the afternoon.\n\nHere comes 2020\, you 
 guys! Let’s make it the best year yet!\n\nclubplatinumTO.com\nmedia@club
 platinumto.com\nhttps://www.facebook.com/clubplatinumTO/\nhttps://seniors-
 nye-dance.eventbrite.ca\n\n(Pay-What-You-Can at the door.) New Year&#039\;
 s Eve AFTERNOON Dance Party for Seniors
