SUMMARY:New Year's Eve Salsa\, Latin and Ballroom Dinner Dance Gala\, Dec 3
 1\, 2019
DESCRIPTION:New Year's Eve Salsa\, Latin and Ballroom Dinner Dance Gala\, D
 ec 31\, 2019 - Jan 1st\,\, 2020\, 6.30pm-2am\, DOOR OPEN AT 6PM\;\n\nThree
  course sit down served dinner and OPEN bar included\; complimentary hors 
 d’oeuvres for one hour at arrival.\n\nat Le Parc Dining and Banquet\, Ba
 llroom 3 Hall\; 8432 Leslie Street\, Thornhill\, L3T 7M6\, Hwy 7 &amp\; Le
 slie\n\nLatin\, salsa\, bachata and ballroom dance music and dancing\; FRE
 E parking\; Doors open at 6pm\; Large dance floor\, Ballroom # 3 dance flo
 or is large 49’ x 23’.\n\nWaltz\, rumba\, salsa and bachata basic step
 s dance lesson 6.30-7pm\n\nLine dancing and dance demonstrations\; DJ Fran
 k Bishun\n\nEarly bird tickets $95 by October 15\, 2019\n\nMENU:\n\nASSORT
 MENT of rolls and butter\; Salad\n\nENTREE: Combination of chicken supreme
  oven roasted with fresh herbs\; mushroom sauce on the side\; AND Grilled 
 salmon fillet lemon and white wine\; medley of seasonal vegetables and ove
 n roasted potatoes. (Vegan or vegetarian options available)\n\nDESSERT: TR
 IO of cheesecake with strawberry sauce\, chocolate mousse and sicilian can
 noli\n\nTEA\, COFFEE\, ESPRESSO and OPEN BAR included\; SPARKLING WINE at 
 midnight included\; The open bar includes rye\, rum\, gin\, vodka scotch\,
  house red and white wine\, domestic beer and 1 bottle of champagne per ta
 ble of 10 people at midnight is included also. The bar opens at 6:00pm and
  closes at 1:00am.\n\nVegan option can be Stir fried rice with vegetables 
 and Tofu or Vegetable strudel with vegetables and potatoes.\n\nVegetarian 
 options can be Stuffed peppers\, eggplant parmigiana or pasta Primavera\;\
 n\nKids tickets 60$\, menu: substitute adult main entree above with chicke
 n fingers and french fries\, same salad and dessert as for adult menu.\n\n
 https://www.youtube.com/watch?time_continue=55&amp\;v=_J2SsfA0Zlc New Year
 &#039\;s Eve Salsa\, Latin and Ballroom Dinner Dance Gala\, Dec 31\, 2019
