SUMMARY:Salsa Bellies - Free Prenatal Dance Classes
DESCRIPTION:Sway your hips and celebrate your “bump” in this low-impact
  yet lively dance class. Salsa Bellies&#x2122\; is a great way to stay act
 ive and feel sexy throughout pregnancy\, you’ll meet other moms-to-be an
 d enjoy comparing notes about the journey of motherhood.\n\nSpecifically d
 esigned with prenatal considerations in mind\, the class includes a warm-u
 p and instruction of basic Latin dance steps including Salsa\, Samba and R
 humba followed by floor exercises to help prepare the body\, mind\, and sp
 irit for labour and delivery.\n\nAll levels of fitness and dance experienc
 e are welcome.\n\nSpace is limited please register to save yours!\n\nTuesd
 ay's | 7 pm - 8 pm\nFitness by The Lake\, 329 Lakeshore Rd E.\nRegister at
  https://tinyurl.com/SalsaBellies\n\nPrenatal Health Screen required prio
 r to start of class. Please dress for fitness\, bring water and pack dry i
 ndoor running shoes.\n\nFind out more at http://salsababies.com/programs/s
 alsa-bellies/ Salsa Bellies - Free Prenatal Dance Classes
