 o might be interested? Please share and/or repost!\n\nJoin us for a fun an
 d inclusive afternoon at the Centre for Social Innovation\, 3rd floor\, Da
 niel’s Spectrum Building\, 585 Dundas Street East at 2:30 pm - 5:00 pm.\
 n\nEven if you only dance with your hands\, we want you. All mobility and 
 cognitive levels wanted. Cost is Pay What You Can (suggested $15) but what
 ever you can contribute is fine. We want you there! Caregivers free.\n\nNe
 xt three events:\nJanuary 26\, 2020\nMarch 1\, 2020\nMarch 28\, 2020\n\nWe
  will supply a DJ\, light snacks\, and light refreshments. There will be w
 ine and beer at a cash bar.\nWe are so looking forward to seeing you there
