  (Session begins Feb 3rd)\n***Open to both boys and girls***\n.\nWhat to e
 xpect?\nEach practice will begin with warm ups and stretching\, proceeding
  with steps from different Latin Rhythms such as salsa\, bachata\, cha cha
 \, and more. The class will learn an entire dance routine to be performed.
 \nThe goal for kids teams is to start competing and performing at events s
 uch as Salsa and Bachata Congresses and all style competitions as of Septe
 mber 2020.\n.\nPricing:\n3-month session: $225\n(Includes 1 practice a wee
 k + free group lessons)\n.\nFor more info and questions please contact us 
 at salemdanceco@gmail.com Latin Dance Kids Teams
