SUMMARY:BollyX
DESCRIPTION:BollyX is a Bollywood-inspired cardio dance fitness program tha
 t combines\ndynamic choreography with the hottest music from around the wo
 rld\n\n\n\n\nBollyX\, featured on ABC’s SHARK TANK\, is a Bollywood-insp
 ired dance-fitness program that combines dynamic choreography with the hot
 test music from around the world. Its 50-minute cardio workout cycles betw
 een higher and lower-intensity dance sequences to get you moving\, sweatin
 g\, and smiling. At the very core of a BollyX workout is the inspiration i
 t draws from the music and dance of Bollywood\, the film industry of India
 . We embody the infectious energy\, expression and movement of Bollywood a
 nd aim to expand the reach of fitness to more people worldwide.\n\nOur fit
 ness curriculum has been created by world-class choreographers and certifi
 ed fitness professionals to ensure a safe and effective total body dance w
 orkout for all.\n\n\n\n\n BollyX
