SUMMARY:Salsa Performance Class Level 3-5
DESCRIPTION:Learn an entire choreographed Salsa routine then perform it at 
 the Steps Anniversary party on Friday May 8 as well as at other nightclubs
  and events in Toronto and the Montreal Salsa Convention (optional).\n\nA 
 performance class will help to improve your memory of turn patterns and sh
 ines\, enhance your styling and body movement\, improve your timing and mu
 sicality\, and learn dips and tricks. Unleash your inner performer\, incre
 ase your confidence on the dance floor\, meet new people and have fun!\n\n
 Geared to students in levels 3-5 (or equivalent). Starts Friday\, February
  7th and runs until May 1st.\nThis course is great for first time &amp\; s
 easoned performers.\nPlease note all participants must commit for the full
  course.\n\nPrice: $210 for non-members. $130 for members.\nA Steps member
  is a student on a monthly auto-renew contract or with an annual membershi
 p. (Must have a membership for the duration of the course.) Payment can be
  made in 2 instalments (by Feb 7 &amp\; March 13). Salsa Performance Class
  Level 3-5
