SUMMARY:Salem Party
DESCRIPTION:First Party of the year with Salem Dance Company!\nSuper fun wo
 rkshops by our own Freya Ladies Team! As well as amazing shows\, social da
 ncing and a dance battle where you'll be able to win many prizes!\n\nSched
 ule:\n6:30pm: Doors Open\n7-8pm: Twerkshop (No previous experience needed)
 \n8-9pm: - Latin Fusion (Beg/Int Level)\n10pm - Shows\n11pm - Battle\n9pm-
 12am: Social Dancing\n\nPricing:\n2 Workshops + Social\nEarly bird: $25\nA
 t the door: $35\n\nSocial only: $10\nTo purchase tickets please see Eventb
 rite link on the top of the page.\n________________________________\nTwerk
 shop: A body movement class focused on mobility of the waist\, hips\, and 
 glutes to Afrobeats and dancehall music.\n\nLatin Fusion Workshop: Explore
  Latin rhythms and techniques with heels\, contemporary\, urban\, and jazz
  fusion. Strut with confidence and style\, this class is meant to shape yo
 ur outlook on movement.\n\nFreestyle Battle: Challenge yourself by partici
 pating in this fun Dance off! Free to sign up! Win amazing prizes!\n2 Cate
 gories: Partner dancing and Solo\nBattle will start with all the competito
 rs of the same category freestyling to either salsa or bachata song. With 
 each new song competitors will be eliminated until there is 3 winners.\n\n
 To sign up please email us at salemdanceco@gmail.com Salem Party
