SUMMARY:Children of Chemistry
DESCRIPTION:February 20-22\, 2020 at 8pm\nChoreographer: Sébastien Provenc
 her\n\nFrom a fashion show to a football field\, from femininity to hyperm
 asculinity\, Sébastien Provencher’s Children of Chemistry both confront
 s and questions the notion of manliness. In a repetitive dance with popula
 r and sporting references\, Provencher tackles stereotypes of masculinity.
  Hailed as “poignant performance” this Toronto premiere is a captivati
 ng piece that invites audiences to imagine the masculine through a differe
 nt lens. Presented by Citadel + Compagnie through Bright Nights. Children 
 of Chemistry
