URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/the-monthly-lindy-hop-workshop-for
 -february-beginner-plus-level/
SUMMARY:The Monthly LIndy Hop Workshop for February
DESCRIPTION:This workshop is for you if you have taken some Lindy Hop begin
 ner classes at Saturday Night Swing in 8-count Lindy Hop\, and want to go 
 further!\n\nThis workshop focuses on learning and working on the Swing Out
  and Lindy Circle\, the two main basics of Lindy Hop. Including connection
 \, momentum\, follower swivels and more.\n\nTeachers: Dan Amores &amp\; St
 ephanie Amores.\n\nDan is an outstanding Lindy Hop dancer\, teacher and pe
 rformer\, has been an invited Lindy Hop teacher across Europe\, the US\, C
 anada and parts of Asia\, and has won or placed in the top few at the high
 est levels of Lindy Hop dance competition in the US. He and Stephanie have
  taught together for years\, met doing Lindy Hop\, and are now married wit
 h three young kids.\n\nPrerequirement: You have taken some of the beginner
  classes in 8-count Lindy Hop at Saturday Night Swing\, or the equivalent 
 of that.\n\nAdmission: $35 (which includes the workshop and also Saturday 
 Night Swing that night\, including the beginner classes and party)\, $5 of
 f for full-time students.\n\nFeel free to bring something for supper to ea
 t at Dovercourt House between 6pm and 7pm. Or if some of those in the work
 shop wish to we can order pizza to Dovercourt House just after 6pm\, and t
 hose interested in that can chip in for the order. For those who prefer a 
 restaurant meal\, we will suggest a nearby restaurant or two where people 
 can go to have supper and hang out before the party.\n\nThe next dates for
  this monthly workshop are Saturdays March 14\, April 11\, and May 2. Take
  as many of them as you like\, there will be different teachers and somewh
 at different subject matter each time.\n\nIn addition\, on Saturday May 9 
 there is a Lindy Hop Workshop 2 for which the prequirement is having taken
  the Monthly Lindy Hop Workshop at least once (or the equivalent of that).
 \n\nSwing Toronto Schedule.\nWebsite. Facebook Invite. The Monthly LIndy H
 op Workshop for February
