SUMMARY:Audition: Dancers &amp\; Circus Arts Performers- DAT Project A
DESCRIPTION:FIRST TIME IN CANADA-An opportunity for all Dance &amp\; Circus
  Arts Performers to get in front of the biggest megastars in the Showbiz/E
 ntertianment world.\n\nAudition Panel includes: Choreographers for Cirque 
 du Soleil\, Netflix\, Disney Films\, Broadway\, Celebrity Artists &amp\; F
 eature Hollywood films.\nPanel: Jennifer Nichols Jeff Dimitriou Debra Brow
 n\, Mark Samuels\n\nAre you a creative performer\, duet or crew that goes 
 beyond the limits and pushes boundaries?\nDo you want to be considered for
  future roles in Broadway Productions\, Feature FIlms\, Celebrity Artist M
 usic Videos\, Cirque Du Soleil Shows &amp\; more?\nOur celebrity judges ar
 e looking for creative &amp\; unique performances!\n\nMUST SUBMIT Audition
  Video by Feb 9\, 2020 to be invited for Live Audition on Feb 23\, 2020!\n
 \nTop 100 Submission make it to the Live audition &amp\; Top 15 to the Liv
 e on Stage Show- DAT PROJECT A FINALE hosted by CP24's Patricia Jaggernaut
 h.\n\nBiggest multi genre production in Canada &#x1f1e8\;&#x1f1e6\; open t
 o all genres of dance &amp\; circus arts.\n\nWe are looking for performers
  &amp\; crews that are unique\, creative and push the limits! There are no
  boundaries or restrictions to the type of show you'd like to submit- prop
  use &amp\; fusion of genres is highly encouraged!\n\nCategories Include:\
 nSolo (16+)\nDuet (16+)\nTroupe/Crew (16+)\nSpecialty Acts (16+)\nKids Gro
 ups (under 15)\n\nTotal Prize Purse of $10\,000\n\nPlease submit your crea
 tive audition videos at www.datproject.ca (we transfer link required).\nDE
 ADLINE TO SUBMIT VIDEOS : FEB 9\,2020\nLIVE AUDITION FEB 23rd\, 2020 by in
 vite only based on video submissions\nFINALE GALA: March 15\, 2020- Betty 
 Oliphant Theater-404 Jarvis St\, Toronto\, ON Audition: Dancers &amp\; Cir
 cus Arts Performers- DAT Project A
