 avoid disappointment.\n\nSeries Information:\nThe session runs for 6 conse
 cutive weeks from Friday\, February 28th to April 3rd\n\nTime: 8pm to 9pm\
 nLocation: 527 Bloor St West (Dance Annex)\n\nAll dance and fitness levels
  welcomed.\n\nEntry: $150+hst\nincludes 6 classes\, a Carnival Spice T-Shi
 rt\, plus surprises &amp\; giveaways from our sponsors.\n\nTickets availab
 le through eventbrite (https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/carnival-spice-6-week-s
 oca-dance-series-tickets-92312106997) or email transfer $169.50 to info@ca
 rnivalspice.com (password: "carnivalspice") to secure your spot. 6 Week So
 ca Dance Series
