 cellent band is playing Swing Toronto!\n\nDJ Alexander when the band is on
  break.\n\nPlease invite your friends.\n\nEveryone is welcome! No prior ex
 perience is needed\, absolute beginners are welcome. There is no need to b
 ring your own dance partners. Parking and subway are close by. Licensed ba
 r.\n\nThe event is 19 years old and up after 10pm. Teenagers under 19 are 
 very welcome to attend til then (for just $10 for both classes and the dan
 ce til 10pm). If you are under 19 you may stay past 10pm only with parenta
 l accompaniment. (This is a policy of the venue\, not of Swing Toronto.)\n
