SUMMARY:Intro to Salsa on2 / New York Salsa Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Intro to Salsa on2 / NY Salsa!\n\n4 week intensive for students
  new to dancing Salsa on 2 (also called Mambo or New York or Puerto Rican 
 style Salsa). This crash course workshop will teach you the Salsa on 2 fun
 damentals - basic timing\, turns and technique – to get you started to s
 ocial dance Salsa on 2.\n\nAfter completion of the workshop\, you may join
  our upcoming Salsa on 2 weekly class.\nOpen to students in Salsa (on1) le
 vels 3-5. No prior on 2 experience required.\n\nDates: March 1\, 8\, 15\, 
 22\nPrice: $60 for 4 weeks. FREE for Steps Monthly Auto Renew Members and 
 Annual Members.\n\nfor more information\, email us at info@stepsdancestudi
 o.com Intro to Salsa on2 / New York Salsa Workshop
