URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/intro-to-latin-hustle-workshop-par
 t-1/
SUMMARY:Intro to Latin Hustle Workshop (Part 1)
DESCRIPTION:Part 1: Introduction to Hustle!\n\nAlready know some Salsa? Lik
 e partner dancing but don’t always hear salsa music at the functions you
  go to?\n\nLatin Hustle\, or "the Hustle" was created in the early '70s as
  Salsa and Mambo dancers tried to incorporate their Latin dance moves into
  the house music of the era: Disco. The most popular counting pattern is "
 &amp\; 1\, 2 3".\nToday\, Hustle can be danced to almost any top 40's song
 \, House\, Old House\, and to Disco music!\n\nThis is a two-part\, 8 week 
 intensive workshop for students new yo Latin Hustle.\nPart 1: Learn the Hu
 stle basic step\, popular Hustle turns and turn patterns. Learn hustle tec
 hnique\, how to lead and follow well and turn patterns to get you started 
 on the dancefloor.\n\nPrerequisites: No previous hustle experience require
 d. Students must start on the first day. Open to students in Salsa levels 
 2-5\, or people with at least 2 months experience dancing Salsa.\n\nPrice:
  $60 for 4 weeks. FREE for Steps students with a monthly auto renew or ann
 ual membership. Intro to Latin Hustle Workshop (Part 1)
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2020/02/march_hustle-part-1.jpg
CATEGORIES:Hustle
LOCATION:Steps Dance Studio - 819 Yonge\, 819 Yonge Street\, 3rd floor\, To
 ronto\, Ontario\, M4W 2G9\, Canada
GEO:43.67260580000001;-79.38748169999997
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=819 Yonge Street\, 3rd floo
 r\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M4W 2G9\, Canada;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Steps 
 Dance Studio - 819 Yonge:geo:43.67260580000001,-79.38748169999997
END:VEVENT
