SUMMARY:Polka Workshop
DESCRIPTION:3pm to 6pm.\n\nLearn one of the most fun\, spirited and playful
  partner dances ever! Popular since the 1840s Polkamania dance craze!\n\nN
 o prior experience is needed and there is no need to bring your own dance 
 partners. Big sprung wood dance floor.\n\nTeachers: Bonnie &amp\; Simon.\n
 \nThe material taught in this workshop is different from what we taught in
  the Fall Polka Workshop.\n\nIf you swing dance you will recognize Lindy H
 op in Polka\, including the triple step and other things. Note also that J
 azz Age Two Step is just a style of Polka\, and very easy to do if you can
  do Polka.\n\n$30. Polka Workshop
