SUMMARY:Shen Yun at Four Seasons Centre Postponed Until 2021
DESCRIPTION:On the advice of Ontario's Chief Medical Officer of Health\, al
 l programs at the Four Seasons Centre have been cancelled through the firs
 t week of April.  As a result Shen Yun in Toronto has been postponed unti
 l March 2021.\nShen Yun is now the world’s premier classical Chinese dan
 ce company. Some people fly from other countries or drive hundreds of mile
 s to see it. Others see the same performance five or six times. Why? There
 ’s only one way to find out\, and that’s to experience Shen Yun yourse
 lf.\n\n[w8_button color="blue" url="https://www.torontodance.com/shen-yun-
 toronto-2020/" title="More Info" target="blank" border_radius=""]More Info
