SUMMARY:TALENT/SHOW
DESCRIPTION:March 25-28\, 2020 at 8pm\nAs the line between amateur and prof
 essional blurs\, and entertainment and art grow closer together\, three pe
 rformers take to the stage to show you what they can do. Choreographer\, S
 abina Perry investigates success\, failure\, and audience expectation in a
  talent show about who the real losers are. This Canadian premiere is pres
 ented by Citadel + Compagnie through Bright Nights.\n\nChoreographer: Sabi
 na Perry\n\nDancers:\nLuke Garwood\nMolly Johnson\nSabina Perry TALENT/SHO
