SUMMARY:FREE Global Dance Party- Streamed Live From The Movement Loft
DESCRIPTION:In a time of social distancing - let dance bring us together! (
 via video dance party!)\n\n\nJoin us for a FREE live dance party streamed 
 from the Movement Loft studio to you in the comfort of your own home.\nJoi
 n other fellow dancers across the world via video dance party\; allowing u
 s to see each other and interact safely from the comfort of our own homes.
  Nothing heals like movement.\nHow to participate:\n- At the time of the e
 vent\, use the  link provided below:\n\n[w8_button color="pink" url="http
 s://zoom.us/j/5508308143" title="Visit Site" target="blank" border_radius=
 ""]Meeting Link[/w8_button]\n\nA note from Ellen\, Movement Loft owner: Th
 is is a way for us to build community through movement and creative expres
 sion. There are many 1:1 streaming classes right now\, but this is a uniqu
 e opportunity to connect both ways in creative dialogue with others who ar
 e experiencing the same things.\n\n\n FREE Global Dance Party- Streamed Li
 ve From The Movement Loft
