URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/dancemakers-presents-the-aisha-of-
 is/
SUMMARY:DANCEMAKERS PRESENTS “THE AISHA OF IS”
DESCRIPTION:Dancemakers is pleased to announce that Resident Artist Aisha S
 asha John’s "the aisha of is" opens on Thursday\, March 26\, playing for
  three evenings only until Saturday\, March 28 at Dancemakers Theatre Stud
 io 313 in Toronto's Distillery Historic District\, at 8 pm each evening.\n
 \nAisha Sasha John begins her three-year residency with Dancemakers by rem
 ounting an entirely revised version of her first full-length solo performa
 nce “the aisha of is\,” a show that was previously performed at the Wh
 itney Museum of American Art\, New York City (2017)\, MAI (2018) and Summe
 rWorks Festival (2018).\n\nCalled “truly sublime” by The Globe and Mai
 l\, live musical provides an atmosphere wherein John is both Wizard and Do
 rothy\, where the home being sought is perpetually found. Welcome to is.\n
 \n“the aisha of is” Creative Team: Choreographed &amp\; Performed by A
