SUMMARY:Bellydance Workshoop
DESCRIPTION:Award-winning dancer Anjelica Scannura will be teaching a mixed
  level Bellydance class at Ritmo Flamenco Studios on Sunday\, March 29 fro
 m 1-3pm. Anjelica has spent a lifetime dancing and traveling around the wo
 rld to study\, teach and perform. She is passionate about the benefits of 
 dancing and is currently the face of ONE TV which is one of Canada's most 
 informative fitness and wellness channels. She has used her expertise to w
 rite and star in "Anjelica's Dance Workout" and "Anjelica's 22 Minute Work
 out" that are currently airing on this channel. Whatever your dance and fi
 tness goals\, she will provide you with a great experience honing your bel
 lydance skills and having a great time at the spacious Ritmo Dance Studios
 . Bellydance Workshoop
