URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/intro-to-latin-hustle-workshop-par
 t-2/
SUMMARY:Intro to Latin Hustle Workshop (Part 2)
DESCRIPTION:Part 2: Foundations of Hustle!\n\nAlready know some Salsa? Like
  partner dancing but don’t always hear salsa music at the functions you 
 go to?\n\nDates: April 2nd - 23rd\n\nLatin Hustle\, or "the Hustle" was cr
 eated in the early '70s as Salsa and Mambo dancers tried to incorporate th
 eir Latin dance moves into the house music of the era: Disco. The most pop
 ular counting pattern is "&amp\; 1\, 2 3".\nToday\, Hustle can be danced t
 o almost any top 40's song\, House\, Old House\, and to Disco music!\n\nTh
 is is a two-part\, 8 week intensive workshop for students new to Latin Hus
 tle.\n\nPrerequisites: Students must start on the first day. Students must
  have completed Part 1 of this workshop\, or have some Hustle experience.\
 n\nPrice: $60 for 4 weeks. FREE for Steps students with a monthly auto ren
 ew or annual membership.\n\nFor more information\, email: info@stepsdances
 tudio.com Intro to Latin Hustle Workshop (Part 2)
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2020/02/april_hustle-part-2.jpg
