DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20200402T220000
DTSTAMP:20200109T010744Z
URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/introduction-to-casino-rueda-2/
SUMMARY:Introduction to Casino Rueda
DESCRIPTION:4 week intensive for students new to Casino Rueda.\n\nThis cras
 h course workshop will teach you the Casino fundamentals required to join 
 our Casino Rueda Level 2 class. Casino Rueda is a Cuban form of salsa ofte
 n described as "Salsa in a Circle". Building on the basic salsa step\, it 
 combines new turn patterns with a rotational movement of the whole circle\
 , exchanging partners continually throughout the song. It is a great way t
 o interact with other people\, have fun and add variety to your salsa at t
 he same time!\n\nOpen to levels 2-5\, or people with at least 4 months exp
