 eela-on-saturdays-mondays/
SUMMARY:FREE Virtual BollyCardio with Rangeela on Saturdays & Mondays!
DESCRIPTION:This 45-minute heart-pumping dance workout will keep you burnin
 g those calories while jamming it out to your favorite Bollywood songs!! M
 onika will guide you through a warmup\, followed by high energy Bollywood 
 cardio steps and finish with a stretching cool-down leaving you wanting mo
 re.\n\nOnce you register here on Eventbrite for FREE\, we'll send you the 
 Zoom Conference ID/Password so you can access the class from the comfort o
 f your own home.\n\nOnly those that have pre-registered will be admitted i
 nto the virtual class. We ask that you keep your video camera ON throughou
 t the class - you will be removed from the Zoom Conference if you do not a
 dhere to this.\n\nThank you for your understanding\, Monika is excited to 
 dance with you!\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nhttps://youtube.com/embed/FbkcBriRfVY/\n\n&n
 bsp\;\nAbout Your Instructor\nMonika is Rangeela's BollyCardio Fitness Ins
 tructor. Originally from Toronto\, Monika has been living in Seattle for j
 ust over 3 years. She trained in Kathak for 12 years\, and taught both Bol
 lywood and Kathak dance classes for 5 years. She has also taught a variety
  of fitness classes\, including Bollywood Fitness\, Zumba\, toning &amp\; 
 muscle conditioning\, and water aerobics. In Seattle\, she performed with 
 local arts organization\, Prathidhwani\, at ACT and Meydenbauer Center. Wh
 en she's not dancing or teaching\, you can find Monika working in Marketin
 g at Amazon\, or watching reruns of The Office. She's very excited to be s
 haring her passion for dance fitness with you all! FREE Virtual BollyCardi
 o with Rangeela on Saturdays &amp\; Mondays!
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2020/03/24233_image.png
CATEGORIES:Bollywood,Fitness
END:VEVENT
