URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/discover-dance-with-sukruti-tirupa
 ttur-at-meridian-arts-centre/
SUMMARY:Discover Dance with Sukruti Tirupattur at Meridian Arts Centre
DESCRIPTION:This April meet Sukruti Tirupattur - Bharatanatyam performer &a
 mp\; teacher.\n\n\n\n\nThis is a FREE series. Doors open at 11:30am. RSVP 
 to attend!\n\nYou are invited to Discover Dance\, a free\, all-ages\, lunc
 h hour series\, where you will be introduced to some of Toronto’s incred
 ible dance artists. Hosted by the award-winning choreographer Nova Bhattac
 harya\, Discover Dance is an hour packed with dance and conversation. You 
 will have the opportunity to see dance and share your thoughts\; to hear s
 tories and ask questions\; and to discover how dance forms from near and f
 ar are being woven in Toronto’s cultural scene.\n\nABOUT THE ARTIST - Su
 kruti Tirupattur is a Bharatanatyam performer\, teacher\, Yoga instructor 
 and holds a Master's degree in History. She is from Bangalore\, India\, no
 w residing in Toronto. She trained at the world renowned Kalakshetra Found
 ation to be a professional dancer. She has been mentored by acclaimed pers
 onalities in dance such as Adyar K. Lakshman\, Anita R. Ratnam and P. T. N
 arendran. As a performer\, she aims to present the traditional dance form 
 of Bharatanatyam to newer audiences with a fresh perspective. Sukruti is c
 urrently exploring community arts and is developing educational content fo
 r Bharatanatyam and holistic understanding of Indian culture. She is very 
 happy to be associated with Nova Bhattacharya. (Photo credit Giridhar Chan
 drasekar)\n\nDiscover Dance is also presented uptown at MERIDIAN HALL on A
 pril 8. Click here for more information.\n\nSpecial thanks to Nova Dance!\
 n\n\n\n Discover Dance with Sukruti Tirupattur at Meridian Arts Centre
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2020/03/24137_image.jpg
CATEGORIES:Indian Classical
LOCATION:Meridian Arts Centre\, 5040 Yonge St\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M2N 6R8
 \, North York\, Canada
GEO:43.766058;-79.414495
