SUMMARY:Opera Atelier: The Resurrection — April 11–19\, 2020
DESCRIPTION:Opera Atelier presents Handel’s visionary opera\, The Resurre
 ction\, April 11–19\, 2020 at Koerner Hall\, TELUS Centre. The Resurrect
 ion marks the Canadian premiere of Handel’s first acknowledged masterpie
 ce in a fully-staged production. Restoring the opera to its original grand
 eur\, Opera Atelier’s lavish production will feature an innovative\, mul
 ti-level set by Gerard Gauci. The all-star Canadian cast includes Soprano 
 Carla Huhtanen\, Soprano Meghan Lindsay\, Mezzo Soprano Allyson McHardy\, 
 Tenor Isaiah Bell\, and Bass Stephen Hegedus\, who will perform alongside 
 the renowned Tafelmusik Baroque Orchestra and Artists of Atelier Ballet.\n
 \nTickets from $49\, more information at operaatelier.com Opera Atelier: T
 he Resurrection — April 11–19\, 2020
