URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/another-day-in-covid-19-land-flash
 -show/
SUMMARY:Another Day in COVID-19 Land : Flash Show
DESCRIPTION:Released for 48 hours before it disappears forever\, Dance : Co
 rps is proud to present a mixed bill of hand-picked dance videos that have
  never been released publicly online…until now.\n\nAnother Day in COVID-
 19 Land : Flash Show will be made public via a YouTube playlist from 11am 
 on April 16th until 11am on April 18th 2020. Once it goes live\, the link 
 can be found on dancecorpscompany.com\n\nWhile the performance is free to 
 watch\, Dance : Corps both encourages and requests that spectators who are
  in a position to do so\, donate to an artist relief fund of their choice 
 such as The Dance Plug\, Toronto Arts Council\, Bad News Days’ grocery a
 llowance\, etc.\n\nLINE-UP INCLUDES\n\n• A rare opportunity to see the f
 ull-length rehearsal of Kylie Thompson’s engrossing 33/33\n\n• A duet 
 from UK guest artists Emma Clandon and Ian Green\n\n• Two works choreogr
 aphed by Rachel Levitt for Dance : Corps that have never been released in 
 whole for the public eye\n\nAnd more to be announced... Another Day in COV
 ID-19 Land : Flash Show
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2020/04/Banner.png
END:VEVENT
