 0/
SUMMARY:Viennese Waltz beginner workshop!
DESCRIPTION:3pm to 6pm.\n\nLearn traditional Viennese Waltz\, one of the be
 st and most fun partner dances ever\, popular since the early 19th century
 \, and done all around the world! Done to great music of the 21st\, 20th a
 nd 19th centuries\, usually at tempos from medium to very fast. It is easy
  to learn.\n\nNo prior experience is needed. Absolute beginners are welcom
 e. There is no need to bring your own dance partners.\n\nTeachers: Bonnie 
 &amp\; Simon.\n\nThis workshop focuses on Right Turning Viennese Waltz (re
 volving to your right as you travel around the room with a partner). If yo
 u take this workshop you can also take our Viennese Waltz intermediate wor
 kshop on Saturday April 25.\n\n$30. ($10 if you have taken this workshop w
 ith us before.)\n\nfacebook: https://www.facebook.com/groups/142519259606/
  Viennese Waltz beginner workshop!
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2020/02/waltz-cinderella-image-2-scaled.jpg
