SUMMARY:Women\\'s Garba-Indian Stick Dance Workshop For Beginners
DESCRIPTION:Garba is an energetic and fast-paced folk dance from India comb
 ining easy to follow movements and sticks and Bollywood and Gujrati songs.
  Through this workshop\, you'll learn the basic steps\, practice in pairs\
 , and get in a great workout to fun.\n\nFor women of all ages and levels. 
 We welcome teenage girls ages 13 to 18 in our workshops.\n\nAfter all of t
 he fun we had at our Valentine's Indian Dance Workshop\, we're excited to 
 bring our guest instructor Pooja back in time for Spring and Holi (the Ind
 ian festival of colors)\n\n&nbsp\; Women\\&#039\;s Garba-Indian Stick Danc
 e Workshop For Beginners
