URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/daybreaker-live-episode-5-disco-ho
 use-party/
SUMMARY:Daybreaker LIVE  - Disco House Party
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, April 25th at 11AM EDT\, meet us for ONLINE for Dayb
 reaker LIVE: Episode 5—Disco House Party\, a global dance experience!\n\
 n\n\n\nThis Love Train &#x1f496\;&#x1f682\; is packing some big disco ener
 gy\, fam. To celebrate the era of bell-bottoms\, leotards and Good Times\,
  we’re firing up for a (virtual) disco inferno with music to make us fun
 k. &#x1f57a\;&#x1f310\;\n\nSo for Episode 5 of Daybreaker LIVE\, let’s (
 electric &#x26a1\;) slide into our livestream wearing something a lil' ‘
 70s. &#x270c\; Sequins\, leopard prints\, platform boots and anything *c'e
 st chic\,* &#x1f485\; so long as you can still shake your groove thang. &#
 x1f351\;\n\nTogether in our homes with 1\,000 friends around the globe\, w
 e’ll warm up with a soulful yoga flow &#x1f9d8\;&#x200d\;&#x2640\;&#xfe0
 f\; before switching gears to do the hustle to throwbacks and sweet nu-dis
 co jams. &#x1f525\;Because friends\, these are the moments when we need to
  choose the things that make our hearts pound. &#x1f497\;\n\nDisco is a ce
 lebration\, a party\, a sweet release. Let’s step up\, dress up\, stand 
 out and move &#x2728\;John-Travolta-in-bell-bottoms&#x2728\; fast—this o
 ne’s about more than just Stayin’ Alive. &#x1f64f\; And remember: ever
 y time you show up for this community\, you’re helping keep our lights o
 n and this movement going. &#x1f4ab\; So share far and wide\, and virtuall
 y invite 10 friends to lock in your spot on our dance cam. &#x1f4f9\;\n\nS
 ee you on the dancefloor—online. &#x1f483\;\n\nTake a peek below of our 
 very first livestream &#x1f447\;\n\n\n\n\n Daybreaker LIVE  - Disco House 
 Party
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2020/04/24355_image.jpg
END:VEVENT
