URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/viennese-waltz-intermediate-worksh
 op-left-turning-viennese-waltz-2/
SUMMARY:Viennese Waltz intermediate workshop - Left Turning Viennese Waltz
DESCRIPTION:3pm to 6pm.\n\nGo further in Viennese Waltz\, one of the best a
 nd most fun partner dances ever\, popular since the early 19th century\, a
 nd done all around the world!\n\nPrerequirement: You have taken our Vienne
 se Waltz beginner workshop\, or can do right turning Viennese Waltz of som
 e kind.\n\nTeachers: Bonnie &amp\; Simon.\n\nThis workshop focuses on Left
  Turning Viennese Waltz (revolving to your left as you travel around the r
 oom with a partner)\, including transitions between left and right turning
  Viennese Waltz!\n\n$30.\n\nwww.mostlywaltz.ca\n\nfacebook: https://www.fa
 cebook.com/groups/142519259606/ Viennese Waltz intermediate workshop - Lef
 t Turning Viennese Waltz
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2018/01/WaltzAK3.jpg
CATEGORIES:Ballroom,Folk,Retro,Vintage
