DESCRIPTION:Description:\nBeginner dance classes 7pm to 9pm before the Danc
 e Party\, Charleston 7pm\, Lindy Hop 8pm.\n\nSwing Dance Party 9:05pm to 1
 2:10am.\nBand: Tuba Machine Dance Orchestra!\n\nThis is the time this exce
 llent band is playing Saturday Night Swing!\n\nPlease invite your friends.
 \n\nEveryone is welcome! No prior experience is needed\, absolute beginner
 s are welcome. There is no need to bring your own dance partners. Parking 
 and subway are close by. Licensed bar.\n\nThe event is 19 years old and up
  after 10pm. Teenagers under 19 are very welcome to attend til then (for j
 ust $10 for both classes and the dance til 10pm). If you are under 19 you 
 may stay past 10pm only with parental accompaniment. (This is a policy of 
 the venue\, not of Swing Toronto.)\n\nWebsite: swingtoronto.com\n\nFaceboo
 k events: https://www.facebook.com/groups/157279846382/events/\n\nDance Pa
