SUMMARY:Mom and Baby Latin Dance Fitness and Circuits - High Park
DESCRIPTION:Moms and Babies love working out and we love working out with t
 hem too!\n\nLatin Dance Fitness and Circuits combines easy-to-follow Latin
  dances and fun circuit training exercises to do alone or while having fun
  with your baby and other Toronto moms.\n\nAll classes are beginner-friend
 ly and low impact. Must bring a carrier or car seat to class. Women have t
 he option to come with or without their baby. For women with babies 5 mont
 hs &amp\; up. This is a 12-week program. Must register online in advance a
 nd fill out a waiver and PARQ forms confirming you are ready for an exerci
 se program under us.\n\nTo sign up or for the schedule\, please visit: www
 .fusioncardiotoronto.com Mom and Baby Latin Dance Fitness and Circuits - H
 igh Park
