SUMMARY:ONLINE KIDS &amp\; TEEN DANCE &amp\; FITNESS CLASSES  AGES 9 TO 17
DESCRIPTION:We're offering online-only dance and fitness classes with fun a
 ctivities to keep kids moving and groovin' at home!\n\nA cool fact – kid
 s that exercise regularly do better in school\, have improved self-esteem 
 and confidence\, and feel happier!\n\nDETAILS\nKIDS/TEEN ZUMBA + BOX FITNE
 SS - MON AT 4 PM FROM MAY 4 TO MAY 25 (45-MIN)\nKIDS/TEENS BOLLYWOOD DANCE
  - THURS AT 4 PM FROM  MAY 7 TO MAY 28  (45-MIN)\n$35 PER 4-WEEK PROGRAM
 \n\nTo get the registration link\, please email: fusioncardiotoronto@gmail
 .com\nFor more info about us\, please visit: www.fusioncardiotoronto.com\n
 \nIMPORTANT NOTES\nWe're allowing 15 kids ages 9 to 17 in each class onlin
 e to create a friendly &amp\; intimate class that will provide both the in
 structor and kids an opportunity to bond. Parents must submit waivers via 
 email for each child before their first class. Classes proceed with 3 kids
  registered/paid by May 1 and it is a final sale (no credits issued for cl
 asses unattended). If the requirements are not met\, a full refund will be
  issued at the end of the month in the form of payment provided. All payme
 nt rules and conditions online at https://fusioncardiotoronto.com/register
 andbuy ONLINE KIDS &amp\; TEEN DANCE &amp\; FITNESS CLASSES  AGES 9 TO 17
