SUMMARY:Les Paradis Perdus/Remix
DESCRIPTION:Inspired by childhood memories both fond and fearsome\, Les Par
 adis Perdus / Remix is a world within a world. Originally created in 2005\
 , the choreography has been revisited and reworked anew by Laurence Lemieu
 x. This remount will feature original music and live performance by compos
 er Christopher Butterfield\, and performances by Lemieux’s children\, da
 ncers Juliette and Jimmy Coleman. Presented by Citadel + Compagnie: May 15
 -16\, 20-23\, 2020 at 8pm\; Tickets $25 in advance\, $20 at the door. Les 
 Paradis Perdus/Remix
