SUMMARY:Women’s Drum Fitness (POUND) Express – Online Live Class
DESCRIPTION:Pound combines easy-to-follow cardio moves\, resistance trainin
 g &amp\; drumming. The combo works the entire body and raises the heart to
  a fat-burning zone.\n\nsee a clip of the home class experience here:\n\nh
 ttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OVZ2YfUdUn4&amp\;feature=emb_title\n\nThis 
 is a moderate impact class and accommodates women of all fitness levels an
 d ages. Weights &amp\; bodyweight exercises are often added for strength t
 raining.\n\nTo rock out at home\, please feel free to use any tools as sti
 cks (drum sticks\, wooden spatulas/spoons\, knitting sticks\, your hands w
 ork great too)\, and a yoga mat or carpet is highly suggested.\n\nYou can 
 also get a pair of Pound Ripstix on the Pound website or Fit Stix at a low
 er cost on Amazon\n\nTo take a class\, go to register and buy at: https://
 fusioncardiotoronto.com/ Women’s Drum Fitness (POUND) Express – Online
  Live Class
