 ges. Weights &amp\; bodyweight exercises are often added for strength trai
 ning.\n\nTo rock out at home\, please feel free to use any tools as sticks
  (drum sticks\, wooden spatulas/spoons\, knitting sticks\, your hands work
  great too)\, and a yoga mat or carpet is highly suggested.\n\nYou can als
 o get a pair of Pound Ripstix on the Pound website or Fit Stix at a lower 
