DESCRIPTION:Online Daybreaker event\, free!\n\nWe’ll warm up with 45 mins
  of guided hula dancing—grass skirts not optional.  Then with stunning 
 scenes of Hawaii’s natural wonders\, we’ll ride the blissful\, musical
  waves of a live\, tropical-inspired DJ set into a full-throttle beach par
 -tay with thousands of friends around the globe.\n\nWear polka-dot bikinis
  \, jellyfish parasols\, mermaid tails\, hula skirts\, Hawaiian  shirt se
 ts\, and don’t forget to pack your bags with a tasty virgin Piña Colada
  and playful ukulele.\n\nThis one’s going to feel like a mini vacay. &#x
 270c\;&#xfe0f\;&#x1f60e\; See you in paradise…\n\nHULA DANCING CLASS\n11
 :00am - 11:50am EDT\n\nGUIDED DANCE PARTY EXPERIENCE11:50am - 1pm EDT\nGui
 ded Dance Party Experience with Daybreaker Founder + Mama Radha\nEvery eve
 nt ends with a Meditation and Intention Setting Ceremony.\n\n[w8_button co
 lor="pink" url="https://www.daybreaker.com/event/hawaii-dance-party/" titl
 e="Visit Site" target="blank" border_radius=""]Sign Up[/w8_button]\n\n&nbs
 p\; Daybreaker Live Hawaii Dance Party
