DTSTAMP:20200623T195244Z
URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/community-folk-arts-council-presen
 ts-virtual-canada-day/
SUMMARY:Community Folk Arts Council Presents Virtual Canada Day
DESCRIPTION:The Community Folk Art Council of Toronto will apresent a Virtu
 al Multicultural Canada Day celebration \, featuring 25 Toronto-based worl
 d music and dance ensembles showcasing a bonanza of music\, dance and perf
 ormance traditions\, reflective of our diverse city.  The Community Folk 
 Art Council for some 40 years has been a leader in promoting the tradition
 al arts in Toronto. \n\nOn July 1\, tune in  to the Community Folk Art C
 ouncil Facebook page or Youtube channel for the Canada Day celebration fes
 tival livestream!\n\nToronto based groups performing music and dances from
  diverse heritages will be live-streamed to your living room\, including A
 fghan\, Armenian\, Azerbaijani\, Bulgarian\, Carribean\, English\, Egyptia
 n\, Hungarian\, Korean\, Kurdish\, Indian\, Macedonian\, Mexico\, Pakistan
 \, Peru\, the Philippines\, Poland\, Polynesia\, Portugal\, Serbia\, Spain
 \, Sweden\, Turtle Island and Uyghur heritage.\n\nHere's a look at a previ
 ous year's presentations at Dundas Square:\n\nhttps://youtu.be/4bXZcsdG-Ww
  Community Folk Arts Council Presents Virtual Canada Day
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2020/06/canada-day.jpg
CATEGORIES:Asian,Caribbean,Folk
END:VEVENT
