URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/aos-toronto-summer-of-sass-dress-s
 hirt-workshop-with-sorina-matheson/
SUMMARY:AOS Toronto : Summer of Sass (Dress Shirt Workshop with Sorina Math
 eson)
DESCRIPTION:Summer is officially here which means Summer of Sass is just ar
 ound the corner!\n\n\n\nEvery Tuesday from July 7th - August 25th join us 
 for weekly specialty themed workshops brought to you by your favourite AOS
  Toronto Teachers!\n\nThis Week's Theme: Dress Shirt Workshop with Sorina 
 Matheson\n\nGrab your heels\, you favourite oversized button up shirt and 
 get ready to get SASSY!\n\nNot able to make live classes? Not a problem! L
 ive replays of each class will be available the next day for all classes t
 his summer!\n\nWith the purchase of a single Summer of Sass Workshop - you
  will have access to said live replay for 1 week\n\nWith the purchase of a
  Summer of Sass Pass - you will have access to ALL live classes AND their 
 replays until September 30th\, 2020\n\nBuy one\, give one away free!\n\nWe
  know times are tough for many right now\, and we want to give back in any
  way that we can! Which is why Army of Sass Toronto is introducing ‘Get 
 One - Give One’ for this years’ Summer of Sass Programming. With each 
 purchase of as Summer of Sass Pass\, we will gift a Summer of Sass Pass to
  someone in need in our community! Have someone specific in mind that you 
 would like the pass to go to? Great! Simply let us know and we will gift i
 t to them on your behalf! Don’t have someone specific in mind and want t
 o donate your free pass? Not to worry! AOS Toronto will allocate free clas
 s passes to those in need. Now more than ever it’s important to reach ou
 t and help our neighbours. Kindness breeds kindness and what better way to
  celebrate life than through some sassy dancing?!\n\nWorkshop Themes to Ex
 pect:\n\n 	Chair Choreography\n 	Tiny Space Choreography\n 	Heels Conditio
 ning\n 	Wall Choreography\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n\n AOS Toronto : Summer of Sass (D
 ress Shirt Workshop with Sorina Matheson)
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2020/06/24674_image.png
CATEGORIES:Exotic,Experimental,Other
END:VEVENT
