URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/reopening-your-studio-success-stor
 ies-live/
SUMMARY:Reopening Your Studio - SUCCESS STORIES - LIVE
DESCRIPTION:Dance Teachers Network Presents:\nReopening Your Studio - Succe
 ss Stories\n\n\n\n\nDance Teachers Network is brought to you by Edward Sim
 on\, Tonja Martin Dias\, Timothy Haller and Teka Byrnes\, with more then 1
 25 years of collective industry experience.\n\nOur Success Stories Seminar
 s provide the opportunity to discuss and learn with the leaders of our com
 munity. Powerful lessons\, insights and conversations regarding important 
 topics in our business.\n\nOn this topic we have three presenters sharing 
 their stories on opening after Covid-19. Eddie Ares\, Jaana Lillemagi &amp
 \; Eddie Rivera.\n\nWhat worked\, what didn't and how we can all learn tog
 ether on reopening our businesses and getting back to dancing - safe and b
 etter then ever! We hope you enjoy :)\n\nJoin our LIVE Online Dance Teache
 r community and get access to priceless information to help your dance bus
 iness flourish! Learning and motivating each other through our open discus
 sion format\, mixed with our professional presentations\, is what makes Da
 nce Teachers Network the leader in dance business education.\n\nTHURSDAY\,
  JULY 9TH - 1PM TO 1:45PM EST.\n\nTHREE PRESENTERS!\n\nDETAILS:\n\nTo join
  our LIVE ZOOM webinar you will receive an email 24 hours before our sessi
 on starts. Simply read the email - click the link - and get ready for our 
 session!\n\nCongratulations on your investment to learn and grow in your d
 ance business education!\n\n\n\n Reopening Your Studio - SUCCESS STORIES -
  LIVE
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2020/07/24681_image.png
CATEGORIES:Other
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Toronto Dance
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/
UID:3614@torontodance.com
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20200709T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20200709T210000
DTSTAMP:20200710T184558Z
URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/mixed-level-belly-dance/
SUMMARY:Mixed Level Belly Dance
DESCRIPTION:This class is very exciting for everyone! People in this class 
 are at various levels from beginner to more advanced beginners. Some have 
 enough under their belt to learn choreography\, and some love a challenge!
  Where ever you are at\, it will be fun! For those who have less belly dan
 ce experience\, its advisable to take level 1 Belly dance class as well as
  Mixed level.\n\nEach class will start with a dynamic warm up\, then we wi
 ll move into some review of previously learned movements for belly dance. 
 Then we move into learning technique for new steps that will be in the cho
 reography. Learn a small portion of choreography in each class\, review an
 d practice. Depending on time\, there may be a chance to just dance. Every
  class will have a cool down with stretches.\n\nChoreography to - Oul Tani
  Eyh\n\nClasses run Thursdays 7:30-9pm\nTry your first class free\ndrop-in
  fee $22.50/class\n4 weeks $70 Mixed Level Belly Dance
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2020/07/belly-dance-art-1-1-1.jpg
CATEGORIES:Bellydance
END:VEVENT
