URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/body-resilience/
SUMMARY:Body Resilience
DESCRIPTION:In order to feel as though you are thriving through life\, mobi
 lity throughout our body at the different joints is so important. This cla
 ss is very important for increasing your quality of life for the long-term
  or if you want to improve the quality of your dancing. Learning the techn
 iques and skills in this class well enough to keep them up at home on a re
 gular basis\, will be the difference in your knee\, hip\, shoulder\, foot 
 health among many other things.\n\nLearn proper breathing from the diaphra
 gm\, myofascial tissue release methods\, various movement drills\, stretch
 es and strengthening techniques that will help your body feel revitalized 
 and ready for more!\n\nTo accommodate for the amount of material that need
 s to be covered during a class like this\, the classes will be 90 minutes 
 in length.\n\nClass runs Sundays 8:00-9:30pm on Zoom\nTry your first class
  free\nDrop-in fee is $22.50\n4 weeks is $70 Body Resilience
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2020/07/KKDres.jpg
CATEGORIES:Therapeutic
END:VEVENT
