URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/level-1-belly-dance/
SUMMARY:Level 1 Belly Dance
DESCRIPTION:Level 1 Belly Dance\n\nStarting from day 1 you will learn about
  proper body alignment for dancing and all the essential dance movements t
 hat are the foundation of this beautiful art form.\n\nWhile belly dance is
  an Art\, you will learn it more from the perspective of fitness and anato
 my\, which muscles work to create each movement\, and how that feels.\n\nE
 very Tuesday Evening 6:00-7:00pm\n\nLive classes through Zoom\nTRY FIRST C
 LASS FREE\nDrop-ins $15/class +HST\n4 weeks $50 +HST\n\nEach class at this
  level we will start with a warm up\, work through various movements and s
 teps which involve both isolation and full body movements\, put what we le
 arned that class together and dance\, then cool down.\n\nYou will learn ab
 out isolation\, ooey-gooey movements\, accented movements\, shimmies\, and
  basic travelling steps. Your instructor will tell you what the move/step 
 is called\, demonstrate it\, break it down\, then get people to practice. 
 After that\, we put those movements into a small combo to practice and dep
 ending how participants are progressing your instructor may throw in a thi
 ng or two to challenge you a bit further.\n\nWe will always review what wa
 s learned the class before and move forward until you have a basic reperto
 ire under your belt at which time you may want to discover more.\n\nYou ar
 e encouraged to ask questions\, voice concerns or just make comments. It m
 akes your experience that much better Level 1 Belly Dance
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2020/07/belly-dance-art-1-1-1.jpg
CATEGORIES:Bellydance
END:VEVENT
