URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/youth-day-festcast-2020/
SUMMARY:Youth Day FestCast 2020
DESCRIPTION:YOUTH DAY\, now in its 14th year was created after the 2005 
 “Summer of the Gun” in Toronto to engage youth\, help build their self
 -esteem\, and provide them a platform to showcase their passion in the Art
 s. The free family Festival attracts some 40\,000 visitors each July\, and
  is operated 100% by dedicated Volunteers.\n\nIn view of the recent impose
 d closure of public venues and gatherings\, Youth Day is adding a unique F
 estCast to ensure the Artists’ hard work and efforts over the year are n
 ow further seen around the World. The 12-hour event will still be happenin
 g from recorded performances in isolation\, and compiled into the BIG DAY 
 reel!\n\nRegular Festival updates and the Summer’s FestCast will be post
 ed on at www.youthdayglobal.com. Youth Day FestCast 2020
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2020/05/YD_FestCast_WebsiteHeader-e1590249751446.jpg
CATEGORIES:Kids / Youth
END:VEVENT
