URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/myseum-of-toronto-presents-powwow-
 dance-workshop/
SUMMARY:Myseum of Toronto presents: Powwow Dance Workshop
DESCRIPTION:As part of this Summer's Wigwam Chi-Chemung programming\, Myseu
 m of Toronto and Elder Dr. Duke Redbird present an online participatory ex
 perience examining the significance of dance in Indigenous culture\, and a
 n opportunity to learn Powwow dance .\n\nThis event happening via Zoom wil
 l feature a poetry reading by Elder Redbird\, a dance performance by Nimki
 i Osawamick (Wolf Clan) and a performance and dance workshop facilitated b
 y Angela Miracle Gladue (A Tribe Called Red).\n\nJoin us for this family f
 riendly event\, which is a unique opportunity to learn about and participa
 te in Powwow dance from the comfort of your own space (home\, office\, etc
 .).\n\n"Dance is not only a way to proudly express my identity as a Nehiya
 w Iskwew (Cree woman) but is a way of life that has consistently grounded 
 me emotionally\, physically\, mentally and spiritually and has been a grea
 t source of strength through times of trauma and grief. For me\, dance is 
 healing but is also an expression of freedom\, celebration of life and how
  I choose to honour my culture\, friends and family. I’ve been given thi
 s gift by my community since I was a little girl and I believe I have a re
 sponsibility to share any knowledge of these dances that I have back to th
 e community and am very proud to be a part of the Alberta arts scene that 
 has given me the platform to do so since 2003. Ay-Hay (Thank you) and I ho
 pe to continue sharing for many years to come." -Angela Miracle Gladue Mys
 eum of Toronto presents: Powwow Dance Workshop
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2020/08/Powwow-workshop_1080-x1080-newsletter-1-1.jpg
CATEGORIES:Indigenous
LOCATION:** ONLINE\, ONLINE\, Toronto\, Canada
GEO:43.658317;-79.382174
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=ONLINE\, Toronto\, Canada;X
 -APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=** ONLINE:geo:43.658317,-79.382174
END:VEVENT
