SUMMARY:AFRO CARIB FEST 2020
DESCRIPTION:The award winning 9th Annual Afro-Carib Fest (SACF) is back\, 
 bigger and better!! The 2-day FREE event offers celebrates the culture and
  diversity of the Afro-Caribbean communities\, through showcasing arts\, m
 usic\, dance\, food and heritage. Activities include: live musical perform
 ances from local and international artists\, food trucks\, drum and dance\
 , marketplace vendors\, Taste of Afro Carib\, drum and dance workshops\, d
 ance competition\, youth and  kids zone\, prizes giveaway and much more!\
 n AFRO CARIB FEST 2020
