SUMMARY:9th Annual James Bond Soiree
DESCRIPTION:Partnering with Rolex\, Versace\, Luis Vuitton\, Chanel\, and o
 thers\, this internationally-recognized 007 affair returns this year for a
  pandemic-proof evening of intrigue\, adventure\, and thrills\, while bene
 fiting breast cancer research. Join the live action without leaving home! 
 Guests within the U.S. can also receive MI-6 party kits delivered straight
  to their door…\n\nGuests within the U.S. also have the option of receiv
 ing VIP party kits delivered straight to their homes. Kits can include cha
 rcuterie boards or fresh oysters\, magnum bottles of high-end sparkling wi
 ne\, James Bond branded faced masks\, champagne glasses\, and more!\n\nPur
 chase tickets with confidence\, knowing that the event is fully pandemic p
 roof. We will be in full compliance with all health and safety standards.\
 n\nWARNING: This even has a history of selling out\, and party kits are al
 ready running low. You’re well-advised to secure tickets right away: htt
 p://globalbondsociety.vip/tickets 9th Annual James Bond Soiree
