SUMMARY:Senior Dance-a-thon!
DESCRIPTION:“Grab your dancing shoes and join us on September 10 for a co
 ast to coast virtual dance-a-thon with residents\, prospects and families!
 \n\n\n\n\n“Grab your dancing shoes and join us on September 10 for a coa
 st to coast dance-a-thon with residents\, prospects and families! All are 
 welcome to RSVP to this event hosted by Solstice at Normandy Park and Sols
 tice at East Amherst! Make sure to register for this free event by Septemb
 er 6. If you have any questions\, contact Samantha at (206) 242-1455 or em
 ail: normandydsm@solsticeseniorliving.com!\n\nAfter you RSVP\, you will re
 ceive an email with instructions on how to participate in the dance-a-thon
 ! This virtual event is hosted by Cage &amp\; Aquarium Productions! This e
 vent is moderated by a MC with a DJ spinning classic oldies! While enjoyin
 g your loved one's community dance\, you can memorialize their moment in o
 ur virtual photo booth!! At Solstice\, we recognize the need for contact w
 ith family and want to showcase our creative ways for keeping everyone con
 nected! It is as exiting as it sounds!\n\nHelp us kick off Grandparents Da
 y weekend with a virtual event that is one to remember!\n\n\n\n Senior Dan
 ce-a-thon!
