 \n\nTaught and developed by Beatriz BB\, co-hosted by House of YES\, this 
 class offers students the fundamentals of ballet with a focus on repetitio
 n and alignment. Barre Bump is for movers of any level\, requiring only a 
 bit of space and an at-home barre!\n\n*** All donations for the Month of J
 UNE will benefit BLM NYC and Campaign Zero!***\n\nSee description in ticke
 ting for Venmo &amp\; PayPal info!\n\n\n\n Barre Bump
