URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/other-dance-artists-other-dance-ci
 ties-online/
SUMMARY:Other Dance Artists\, Other Dance Cities- online
DESCRIPTION:We will discuss how independent dance makers work (and make wor
 k) and how that ecosystem sits within the field of contemporary performanc
 e.\n\n\n\n\nWe will discuss\, research\, and ideate about independent danc
 e artists in the field of contemporary/experimental dance/performance focu
 sing specifically on dance artists OUTSIDE of Chicago\, New York\, and LA.
  We will discuss how independent dance makers work (and make work) and how
  that ecosystem sits within the field of contemporary performance across t
 he US. We will pay special attention to: funding\, presenter/venue/festiva
 l relationships\, dancers—who they are\, their training\, what they do o
 utside of performing to make a living\, grants\, residencies\, and fellows
 hip opportunities. Additionally\, we will read and discuss the "Creating N
 ew Futures" document to raise awareness of how we might want to move forwa
 rd as independent dance artists in the (uncertain) foreseeable future. Thi
 s discussion group is facilitated by Joanna Furnans.\n\n*There are 3 sessi
 ons in this Main Course. Participants are registering for all 3 sessions.\
 n\nTuesday\, September 15 / 7pm-9pm\n\nTuesday\, September 22 / 7pm-9pm\n\
 nTuesday\, September 29 / 7pm-9pm\n\n*Participation is limited to 40 peopl
 e in this Main Course.\n\nFREE\, but advance registration is required.\n\n
 Joanna Furnans is an independent dance artist. Her work has been supported
  by a MANCC Forward Dialogues Laboratory\, an Offshore Creation Residency 
 at the Yard\, an Institutional Incubator Sponsorship at High Concept Labs\
 , a Chicago Dancemakers Forum Lab Artist Award\, the Illinois Arts Council
  Agency\, the Chicago Department of Cultural Affairs and Special Events (D
 CASE)\, the Chicago Dancers’ Fund\, the Chicago Moving Company\, Links H
 all\, and the Walker Art Center’s Choreographer’s Evening. Furnans is 
 a certified Pilates Mat instructor and a freelance dance writer. She is th
 e co-founder and co-director of the Performance Response Journal.\n\n\n\n 
 Other Dance Artists\, Other Dance Cities- online
