 s-cultural-borders/
SUMMARY:World Dance Festival: Dancing Across Cultural Borders
DESCRIPTION:World Dance Festival: Dancing Across Cultural Borders - Explori
 ng Hand Gestures in Dance with Bharata Natyam\, Hawaiian Hula &amp\; Burme
 se Dance.\n\n\n\n\nLotus Music and Dance present the World Dance Festival:
  Dancing Across Cultural Borders - Exploring Hand Gestures in Dance with B
 harata Natyam - Baladevi Chandrashekar\, Hula - Makalina Gallagher and Bur
 mese - U Win Maung on Sunday\, Oct. 18\, 2020 at 4PM ONLINE at www.lotusmu
