SUMMARY:Latin Dance Lessons with Unqork
DESCRIPTION:Unqork Latin Dance Class with Nieves Dance Studio\n\n\n\n\nJoin
  Unqork for a Latin dance class every Tuesday at 5:00 pm ET. Our instructo
 r\, Wil Nieves\, is a seasoned dance professional and has multiple studios
  across New York City. The class offers a mix of Salsa\, Bachata\, &amp\; 
 more.\n\nCome spend your Tuesday nights with Unqork! We are kicking off th
 is event next Tuesday (10/20).\n\nThe Nieves Dance Studio Approach:\n\n"Ou
 r instructors work to cultivate confidence and skill in a supportive and g
 rowing community. We encourage students to embrace their own salsa style a
 nd to dance with partners of all levels—with first-time salsa dancers as
  well as with more advanced students and instructors. Our instructors prov
 ide personal attention while fostering a sense of community that students 
 bring to the social scene and to salsa events all over New York City."\n\n
 \n\n Latin Dance Lessons with Unqork
