 19 era with dance.\n\nThrough this event\, participants will learn the wor
 ld's oldest forms of dances with an element of mysticism and enchantment i
 n a female-only environment.\n\nThe workshop will include Kathak (the fast
 -paced Classical Indian dance of kings) and Garba (Indian Stick dancing) t
 o Bollywood\n\nAs a fitness-based company\, our goal is always to make car
 dio fun!\n\nGet your pass at:\nhttps://fusioncardiotoronto.com/onlineclass
 es Halloween Online Dance Event - Kathak &amp\; Garba
