DESCRIPTION:Join Autism Ontario Windsor &amp\; Inspired Sounds Music Therap
 y on Saturday\, October 24th\, 2020 for a spooky and fun Halloween Dance P
 arty!\n\n\n\n\nJoin Autism Ontario Windsor &amp\; Inspired Sounds Music Th
 erapy on Saturday\, October 24th from 4:00 PM - 5:00 PM for an online Hall
 oween Dance Party!\n\nDress up in your best costumes and get ready for som
 e spooky\, Halloween fun!\n\nThis event is free to attend but you must reg
 ister each person attending the party! We will send out a Zoom link before
  the event so keep an eye out in your e-mail.\n\nOn Wednesday\, October 21
 st\, all those who registered can stop by the AO Windsor-Essex office loca
 ted at 1168 Drouillard Road in the Gino Marcus Community Centre to pick up
  your super awesome Halloween treat bag!\n\nIf you have any questions or c
 oncerns\, please e-mail livia.windsor@autismontario.com.\n\n\n\n Halloween
  Dance Party
