DESCRIPTION:Pound combines easy-to-follow cardio moves\, resistance trainin
 g &amp\; drumming. The combo works the entire body and raises the heart to
  a fat-burning zone.\n\nSee a clip of the home class experience here:\nhtt
 ps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OVZ2YfUdUn4&amp\;feature=emb_title\n\nThis is
  a moderate impact class and accommodates women of all fitness levels and 
 ages. Weights &amp\; bodyweight exercises are often added for strength tra
 ining. To rock out at home\, please feel free to use any tools as sticks (
 drum sticks\, wooden spatulas/spoons\, knitting sticks\, your hands work g
 reat too)\, and a yoga mat or carpet is highly suggested.\n\nTo take a cla
 ss\, go to register and buy at: https://fusioncardiotoronto.com/ Women&#03
 9\;s Pound Fit Program - Online
