URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/dance-and-dialogue-november/
SUMMARY:Dance and Dialogue November
DESCRIPTION:Explore societal issues through dance and discussion. Watch a d
 ance performance\, then discuss the piece with the choreographer and dance
 rs.\n\n\n\n\nThe Dance and Dialogue performance series are a way for our c
 ommunity to engage with the art of dance around central issues that are pl
 aguing our society such as mental illness\, climate change\, and human ine
 quality. Dance allows us an entry point to the humanity of these issues an
 d to discuss ways that we might heal together.\n\nHelp Us Keep Dance and D
 ialogue Free By Donating in one of the ways below:\n\nOne Ticket $15.00\,\
 n\nOne Performer $100.00.\n\nThank You For Your Generous Contribution! You
 r name will be spoken at the introduction of our next event!\n\n\n\n Dance
  and Dialogue November
