SUMMARY:2021 Canadian Masterclass Series with Prima Ballerina Chan Hon Goh
DESCRIPTION:The 2021 Chan Hon Goh National Masterclass Series presented by 
 RBC is a prestigious opportunity for young dancers to be mentored by Canad
 a’s Prima Ballerina herself\, Chan Hon Goh. Tailored to students 11 and 
 up\, the Masterclass Series visits 17 Canadian cities virtually\, to sprea
 d a message of hope and resilience to encourage youth to push through the 
 current pandemic and perform to the best of their abilities\, strengthenin
 g their mental and physical game as they develop their skills and grow as 
 people and performers. Participants are eligible for select scholarship aw
 ards. The series lands in the following cities on February 7\, 2021:\n\nTO
 RONTO\, OTTAWA\, LONDON\, HAMILTON\, NIAGARA ON THE LAKE &amp\; MONTREAL\n
 \nPIQUE (Junior Level) 4:30pm - 5:45pm EST\nJETE (Senior Level) 6:15pm - 7
 :30pm EST\nQ&amp\;A 5:45pm-6:15pm EST\n\nVisit www.gohballet.com/programs/
 masterclasses/ for more details. 2021 Canadian Masterclass Series with Pri
 ma Ballerina Chan Hon Goh
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2021/01/Goh-Masterclass-FB-Still-AD-R2.jpg
