SUMMARY:Global Dance Party
DESCRIPTION:Sashay into Valentine's Day weekend early on Thursday\, Februar
 y 11th with tunes and rhythms from around the world.\n\n\n\nCome connect w
 ith us through music and movement. Whether you like Dancing In The Dark or
  with Blinding Lights\, Pop your Hip-hop with Bollywood or K-Pop along wit
 h Latin Salsa! Here's an evening you can Shake It Off with loved ones or w
 ith your community on our virtual dancefloor.\n\n6:30-7PM: Learn the moves
  (with trainers)\n\n7-8PM: Show-off those moves!\n\nPresented by Mosaic Si
 licon Valley in partnership with Silicon Valley Reads and the Santa Clara 
 Public Library\n\n\n Global Dance Party
