 kshop/
SUMMARY:Valentine's Day Bollywood Dance Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Come with or without a partner and learn a fun choreography on 
 a Bollywood song!\n\n\n\nIf you are #quarantiningwithplusone or are in #LD
 R or #happilysingle\, this workshop is for everyone to dance their hearts 
 out on a fun Bollywood choreography taught by our instructor Pranjali on t
 he eve of Valentine's day!\n\nRight in time to set the mood for the V-Day!
 \n\nIt's a FREE and VIRTUAL event\, so it comes at no risk to your pockets
  and to your health.\n\nAnd if you are looking for a reason to dress up in
  these pandemic stricken times\, here it is!\n\n\n Valentine&#039\;s Day B
 ollywood Dance Workshop
