SUMMARY:Caribbean Dance Class
DESCRIPTION:Join us for this exhilarating dance fitness workout!\n\n\n\nThe
  Guelph Black Students’ Association will be offering a free dance class 
 featuring a creative blend of Caribbean and African movements set to dance
 hall\, afro\, and soca music. Join artist and community leader Kween for t
 his exhilarating dance fitness workout!\n\nFor more information\, contact 
 us at: gbsa@uoguelph.ca and cultural.diversity@uoguelph.ca\n\nGryphlife: h
 ttps://gryphlife.uoguelph.ca/event/176353\n\n\n Caribbean Dance Class
