SUMMARY:dance Immersion Presents: Online Versus Dance Battle
DESCRIPTION:Revisit some of your favourite Holla Jazz and Mix Mix Dance Col
 lective performance clips from the past!\n\nJoin us for dance Immersion’
 s FIRST online Versus Dance Battle\n\nFriday\, February 26\, 2021 @ 8:00 P
 M\n\nNo registration required. Join the event for free on dance Immersion
 ’s website – www.danceimmersion.ca/event/battle\n\nInspired by the pop
 ular music Versuz Battles\, dance Immersion has invited Holla Jazz &amp\; 
 Mix Mix Dance Collective to dig into their archives and pull out some of t
 heir favourite dances to share with us - jazz\, waacking\, house\, hip hop
 \, and more! Each company will battle video clips of a past solo\, duet/tr
 io\, and group work. No winners\, no losers\, just fun!\n\nHosted by Nicol
 e Inica Hamilton\, the Versus Dance Battle will feature stellar dance clip
 s\, commentary from artists Ashely “Colours” Perez and Natasha Powell\
 , and an interactive skincare product giveaway from Rub of Luv by Jaz Fair
 y J!\n\nClick the link on Feb. 26 around 8:00 PM to join this uplifting ce
 lebration of dance! dance Immersion Presents: Online Versus Dance Battle
