URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/feel-good-dance-with-workitjanet/
SUMMARY:Feel-good dance with WORKITJANET
DESCRIPTION:Move your body with a high-vibe dance class!\n\n\n\nAre you thi
 nking of ways you could move your body? Do you want to have fun while doin
 g it? We have good news for you! You can do both with an empowering dance 
 coach WORKITJANET! Get your dose of happiness and instantly boost your moo
 d with this energizing dance class!\n\nJanet will guide you through some s
 imple and easy-to-follow dance moves that will end in a short and fun danc
 e combo. Don’t worry if you think you can’t dance\, or if you are alre
 ady an expert\, because ALL LEVELS are welcome to join.\n\nCome and dance 
 it out on February 27th at 1:00pm EST!\n\nAnd before you go\, don’t forg
 et to follow her on Instagram and Youtube for empowering dance tutorials a
 nd find out more about what she does here.\n\n\n Feel-good dance with WORK
 ITJANET
