URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/dance-and-dialogue-february/
SUMMARY:Dance and Dialogue February
DESCRIPTION:Explore societal issues through dance and discussion. Watch a d
 ance performance\, then discuss the piece with the choreographer and dance
 rs.\n\n\n\nThe Dance and Dialogue performance series is a way for our audi
 ence to engage with dance in a whole new way.  We use a work from our r
 epertoire that explores central issues that are plaguing our society such 
 as mental illness\, climate change\, and human inequality. Dance\, like al
 l art\, provides a bridge to discuss divisive issues in our society.  Thi
 s bridge gives us a chance to discover ways that we might heal together. 
  At each one-hour event we will have four panelist speakers: a community l
 eader who is working for change\, a spiritual leader at the forefront of t
 he issue\, our theologian in residence\, and the choreographer of the work
  with the dancers.  The audience will have a chance to see the work perfo
 rmed again after discussing it in order to discover the intention of the m
 ovement.\n\nFebruary's event will address climate change.\n\nRegistration 
 closes on February 26 at 3:00 pm.\n\nHelp us keep dancing! Donate here! \n
 \n\n Dance and Dialogue February
