URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/bollywood-dance-party-with-secret-
 dance-addiction/
SUMMARY:Bollywood Dance Party with Secret Dance Addiction
DESCRIPTION:This is where music + mindfulness party! Meditate like the myst
 ics of the Himalayas. Enjoy a Bhangra lesson + 2 hour Bollywood dance part
 y.\n\n\n\nCelebrate the International Day of Happiness and Optimism Month 
 with positive vibes and healthy nightlife at SDA's monthly dance party!\n\
 n&#x1f4a5\; Shake your Bom Bom in your living room\, hallway or kitchen to
  Bollywood beats at SDA's March dance party. &#x1f57a\;Explore the joyful 
 practice of Bhangra with a short and sweet dance lesson. &#x1f1ee\;&#x1f1f
 3\; Tune IN with a community meditation and singing bowl experience just l
 ike a mystic of India. This is where music + mindfulness go to party!\n\nD
 ress up in your ankle bells\, saris\, and Bollywood best! Time to get glam
 \, fam!\n\nMusic is the magic.\n\n#partypositive\n\nJoin the movement.\nWe
 lcome to Secret Dance Addiction\nPlay\, dance\, celebrate\, and connect in
  a virtual space that we co-create together. Join SECRET DANCE ADDICTION f
 or a digital dance party where music + mindfulness go to party! Bring your
  family\, your pets\, your costumes\, and whatever TF else gets you in the
  party mood! This party is open to EVERYONE\, all over the WORLD\, and ALL
  AGES!\n\n&#x2728\;Secret Dance Addiction&#x2728\; is a transformational n
 ightlife community dedicated to partying positively. Find out more at app.
 secretdanceaddiction.com \n\n5PM LA // 8PM NYC // 1AM UK // 9AM TOKYO // 1
 0AM SYDNEY\n\nInstructions for how to join the party will be emailed to RS
 VPs the day of the party!\n\n\n\n\nWhat SDA Parties are Like\n\n\n\n: : : 
 FEATURING : : :\n&#x1f60e\; Bhangra dance lesson\n\n&#x1f3a7\; Lit dance p
 arty DJ set with a Bollywood DJ\n\n&#x1f389\; Costume Contest! The dance p
 arty theme is Bollywood!\n\n&#x1f30e\; Meet new party people from all over
  the world\n\n&#x1f929\;Be sure to have your camera on + ready to fire up 
 your party moves\n\nGet dressed up\, grab some dance floor decor + dance w
 ith us from ANYWHERE in the WORLD! This is an all ages event!\n\n&#x1f468\
 ;&#x200d\;&#x1f467\;&#x200d\;&#x1f466\; Parental Supervision Advised: some
  people like to dance in their club wear.\n\nDetailed instructions for joi
 ning the Zoom will be emailed to all RSVPs on the day of the party!\n\n5pm
  LA // 8pm NYC // 1am London // 2am Ibiza // 11am Sydney\nGet Ready to Par
 ty &#x1f389\;\n1. Download Zoom\n\n2. Decorate your party space!\n\n3. Pre
 pare your costume! This is a PJ PARTY!\n\n4. Join the growing Secret Dance
  Addiction community at app.secretdanceaddiction.com\nThe Day of the Party
  &#x1f46f\;&#x200d\;&#x2640\;&#xfe0f\;\n1. We will email you the secret Zo
 om link to join the party the day of.\n\n2. Keep yourself on mute please!\
 n\n3. Turn on your video camera!!!!! We want to see your costumes + dance 
 moves!\n\n4. DANCE!\n\nAbout Secret Dance Addiction\n\nThis is where music
  + mindfulness go to party! Secret Dance Addiction unites creators\, embra
 ces connection + celebrates each day to the fullest. Explore the future of
  nightlife with a community that puts health + connection first. No intoxi
 cants needed. #partypositive\n\nhttps://www.secretdanceaddiction.com/\n\n\
 n\n Bollywood Dance Party with Secret Dance Addiction
