SUMMARY:Free Open Hip Hop Dance Class
DESCRIPTION:Free Open Hip Hop Dance Class for the dancer and creator in eve
 ryone to  have fun and enjoy!!\n\n\n\nDanceCreate is hosting a Free Open 
 HIP HOP Dance Class ONLINE for everyone to enjoy! Come join the fun and ex
 perience a full Hip Hop dance class which includes a grove based warm up\,
  drilling basic Hip Hop steps and a fun dance routine!\n\nOur classes and 
 workshops are perfect for anyone who wants to learn how to dance or refine
  their dance ability\, build body and creative confidence and unleash more
  creativity\, imagination and self expression - in a safe\, fun environmen
 t! Class taught by our wonderful and experienced teacher Leah Zeiger :)\n\
 n\n Free Open Hip Hop Dance Class
