SUMMARY:Spring Break Virtual Dance Camp for Kids
DESCRIPTION:SPRING BREAK VIRTUAL DANCE CAMP FOR KIDS\nDates: Monday April 1
 2 to Friday April 16\nTime: 11am - 11:45am\nAges: 4 - 8 years\n\nLearn a f
 un dance choreography and brighten spring break! Let's get kids active\, h
 ealthy and learning something new. Over the course of 5 days\, the kids wi
 ll learn a fun choreography and on the last day\, the kids will dance in a
  mini virtual recital. This pandemic has been really hard on children and 
 we want them to remember that they can always tap into happiness inside of
  them and keep moving and dancing.\n\nDance classes will be taught by Kath
 y De Torres\, salsa and bachata dancer\, instructor and performer and mom 
 to 2 kids.\n\nPrice: $50 + HST for the 5 dance classes .\nClasses will b
 e taught on Zoom. Spring Break Virtual Dance Camp for Kids
