URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/dance-ontario-danceweekend-2021/
SUMMARY:Dance Ontario DanceWeekend 2021
DESCRIPTION:Join us from April 29th-May 2nd for Dance Ontario’s first eve
 r virtual weekend of dance films\, interactive workshops\, and more!\n\nDa
 nceWeekend’21 will kick off on April 29th with International Dance Day c
 elebrations followed by three action-packed days that will showcase a uniq
 uely captivating feast of globally inspired dance. Tune in on Friday for a
  dance film series featuring exclusive interviews with the filmmakers and 
 choreographers. On Saturday we’ll present additional films\, new choreog
 raphy\, awards and end the day with a DJ Dance partywith Andrew Tay! We’
 ll close off the weekend on Sunday with a full day of captivating workshop
 s in a range of dance styles from Hip Hop to Flamenco.\n\nThis year looks 
 a little different in many ways\, but DanceWeekend is here to stay. You’
 ll now be able to access the weekend of festivities from the comfort of yo
 ur own home. As a proud advocate of the Ontario Dance community\, we’re 
 owning our responsibility to ensure a wide-reaching\, sustainable\, inclus
 ive\, and vibrant dance community.\n\nWith prize-packed contests\, new dig
 ital dance creations\, and interactive workshops\, you don’t want to mis
 s DanceWeekend’21! Dance Ontario DanceWeekend 2021
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2021/04/DO_Dance-Weekend_IN_1080x1080223.gif
CATEGORIES:Contemporary,Other
