SUMMARY:DanceWeekend Digital Jam
DESCRIPTION:A virtual dance party to celebrate dance across Ontario! Twirl\
 , stomp and shake from your bedroom\, kitchen or wherever you may be! Wear
  something fun\, choose a cool background\, and show us your moves as you 
 dance alongside 8 featured artists from different styles who will be anima
 ting the event. Featuring DJ Andrew Tay\, newly appointed artistic directo
 r of Toronto Dance Theatre\, the Dance Weekend Digital Jam is imagined as 
 a much needed opportunity for us to all be together and connect through mo
 vement in these distanced times. See you on the (Virtual) dance floor!\n\n
 Register for the event to be seen and interact with other party goers on z
 oom\, or watch the party live on the DanceWeekend site.\n\nRegister here h
 ttps://www.eventbrite.ca/e/danceweekend21-tickets-149965399547 DanceWeeken
 d Digital Jam
