SUMMARY:Outdoor Kid's Fitness &amp\; Circuit Program - High Park
DESCRIPTION:We’re taking our favorite kid’s fitness program outdoors to
  give kids the chance to have fun moving while learning Fundamental Moveme
 nt Skills (outlined by the Coaching Association of Canada) through fitness
  drills\, circuits\, games\, and music!\n\nThe pandemic has been tough on 
 kids. We think it’s time to start having fun again and in a way that is 
 safer in our new covid-19 world.\n\nDue to the last-minute recreational cl
 osures in Toronto\, we will run a short 4-week pilot program.\n\nPrograms 
 will run 3 days per week and allow 8 kids per program (if permitted at thi
 s time).\n\nTo read more about our program and for the new schedule\, do v
 isit:\nhttps://fusioncardiotoronto.com/kids-fitness-circuit-programs-camps
  Outdoor Kid&#039\;s Fitness &amp\; Circuit Program - High Park
