SUMMARY:BEING Screening of Short dance films part of Contact Dance Internat
 ional Film Festival
DESCRIPTION:DESCRIPTION: Screening of 8 dance films from 6 countries that e
 xplore states of being. Includes the world premiere of "Contact Without Bo
 rders" by Olya Glotka (Canada).\n\nBOX OFFICE:\nhttps://contactdancefilmfe
 st.eventive.org/schedule/6095608eaf3579005b15d180\n\nFILMS:\nAnd You See M
 e - Director Emily Shapiro (US)\nThe Venusian Slip - Director Sam Mcgilp (
 Australia)\nInfinite Flow Sizzle Reel - Infinite Flow Company (US)\nRollin
 g in the Deep: Extract from "Put Out the Flames" - choreographer Jos Baker
  from Trodden Dreams (US)\nContacts - Filmmaker Itamar Baruch (Israel)\nBo
 rn in The Trees -Filmmaker/s: Magalie Lanriot and Rachel (Portugal)\nInbet
 ween - Tiina Jääskö (Finland)\nContact Without Borders. - Filmmaker Oly
 a Gotka (Canada)\n\nTIMING OF SCREENING:\nAll film screenings have a start
  time. Once this start time occurs you will have 24 hours to open your scr
 eening. We have done this to increase access for those working shift work 
 or from different time zones.\n\nOnce you start watching\, you have 7 days
  to finish watching the program. We have done this to increase access to t
 hose who need to take a break from watching.\n\nAll screenings are a one-t
 ime view.\n\nIf it helps to remember it say: "ONE day to open and ONE week
  to watch for a ONE time view"\n\nCREATOR CHAT:\nPlease note there is a Me
 et the Filmmakers Creator Chat on zoom at 9:00 pm (EDT) on Friday\, June 4
 \, 2021\, with filmmakers from the BEING program who are able to attend. S
 o you might want to see the whole program before the creator chat. However
 \, it can also be interesting to go to the creator chat and then see the f
 ilms. BEING Screening of Short dance films part of Contact Dance Internati
 onal Film Festival
