 or María Mayoral Moreno (Poland)\nImpression Banks - Director - Chris Hop
 kins (UK) and Banks Artiste (New York\, US)\nStaccare - Director Daniel Ga
 rcia (US)\nFalling Up - Director/Filmmaker - Esther Dganit Zimmerman (Isra
 el -Tel Aviv based)\n\nTIMING OF SCREENING:\nAll film screenings have a st
