 Flow Dance with Dancers Marisa Hamamoto Piotr Iwanicki with choreography b
 y Phillip Chbeeb (US)\nBOOKANIMA - Director SHON KIM (Republic of Korea)\n
 Nom finito/ Implied lines - Concept: Francesca Pedullà and Sabrina Marzag
 alli with direction by David Valolao (Italy)\nInfinite - Director Liam Che
 ng (Taiwan)\nContact improvisation: Tango Playground - Filmmakers Rosina P
 orto and Joaquín Cruz and Diegotzin (Uruguay)\nHic et Nunc "Here and Now"
  - Director Emma Cianchi (Italy)\n\nTIMING OF SCREENING:\nAll film screeni
