URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/holding-space-screening-of-short-d
 ance-films-part-of-contact-dance-international-film-festival/
SUMMARY:HOLDING SPACE Screening of short dance films part of Contact Dance 
 International Film Festival
DESCRIPTION:DESCRIPTION:\n11 films from 6 countries that explores dancers' 
 sense of loss of presence and touch during the COVID Pandemic\, and how th
 ey have coped and/or adapted. Includes world premiere of "Fallow" by Karen
  sand Allen and Kaeja (Canada).\n\nLINK:\nhttps://contactdancefilmfest.eve
 ntive.org/schedule/60904ba492b40201e2f71a5e\n\nFILMS:\nAbsence - Director/
 Choreographer Diego Funes (US)\nMoving On - Laura Doehler (UK)\nWORLD PREM
 IERE Fallow - Concept/Choreographer/Performer: Karen Kaeja and Co-Director
 s: Karen &amp\; Allen Kaeja (Canada)\nMy Body - Rythea Lee and Mac Boone (
 US)\nDois Corações Pertinhos (Two hearts close by) - Filmmakers Barbara 
 Cunha &amp\; Mary Gatis (Brazil)\nDear Contact Improvisation - Dancer/crea
 tor Sara Zolbrod (US)\nDistinctly Social - Filmmaker Malcolm Shute (US)\nH
 olding Space - Choreographer/Director Renay Aumiller (US)\nPROPinquity Dan
 ce Jam - Filmmaker: Oya Glotka (Canada/Ukraine)\nCOVID Contact Improvisati
 on in Quarantine - Filmmakers Marta Wrzesinska and Jesus Alonso (Spain)\nY
 ou and Me - Directors Karni and Saul (UK)\n\nTIMING OF SCREENING:\nAll fil
 m screenings have a start time. Once this start time occurs you will have 
 24 hours to open your screening. We have done this to increase access for 
 those working shift work or from different time zones.\n\nOnce you start w
 atching\, you have 7 days to finish watching the program. We have done thi
 s to increase access to those who need to take a break from watching.\n\nA
 ll screenings are a one-time view.\n\nIf it helps to remember it say: "ONE
  day to open and ONE week to watch for a ONE time view"\n\nCREATOR CHAT:\n
 Please note there is a Meet the Filmmakers Creator Chat on zoom at 5:00 pm
  (EDT) on Saturday\, June 12\, 2021\, with filmmakers from the HOLDING PLA
 CE program who are able to attend. So you might want to see the whole prog
 ram before the creator chat. However\, it can also be interesting to go to
  the creator chat and then see the films. HOLDING SPACE Screening of short
  dance films part of Contact Dance International Film Festival
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2021/05/3-FALLOW-FINAL-March-8-1_3.jpg
CATEGORIES:Contact Improvisation
END:VEVENT
