URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/here-screening-of-short-dance-film
 s-part-of-contact-dance-international-film-festival/
SUMMARY:HERE Screening of Short dance films part of Contact Dance Internati
 onal Film Festival
DESCRIPTION:DESCRIPTION: A screening of 6 dance films created in Canada and
  the US that explore improvisation\, racism\, the ego\, inner-dialogue\, u
 rban landscape\, and the identity of dancers including disability and refu
 gee experiences.\n\nLINK:\nhttps://contactdancefilmfest.eventive.org/sched
 ule/60904c411e510e00538eeda7\n\nFILMS:\nthe window kind of opens by itself
  - Director Anya Cloud and Rebecca Salzer (US)\nON EGO - Director Jessica 
 Ray (US)\nTerracotta - Umur Coskun (Canada and Turkey)\nThe Blood Harvest 
 -Director Alia Montijo (US)\nParcon Resilience - Sarah Jones (Canada) with
  dancer/facilitator Andrew Suseno (US)\nMy Disability Dancer - Filmmakers 
 Victor Pineda\, Zachary Kerschberg with dancer/teacher Antione Hunter (US)
 \n\nTIMING OF SCREENING:\nAll film screenings have a start time. Once this
  start time occurs you will have 24 hours to open your screening. We have 
 done this to increase access for those working shift work or from differen
 t time zones.\n\nOnce you start watching\, you have 7 days to finish watch
 ing the program. We have done this to increase access to those who need to
  take a break from watching.\n\nAll screenings are a one-time view.\n\nIf 
 it helps to remember it say: "ONE day to open and ONE week to watch for a 
 ONE time view"\n\nCREATOR:\nPlease note there is a Meet the Filmmakers Cre
 ator Chat on zoom at 9:00 pm (EDT) on Sunday\, June 13\, 2021\, with filmm
 akers from the HERE program who are able to attend. So you might want to s
 ee the whole program before the creator chat. However\, it can also be int
 eresting to go to the creator chat and then see the films. HERE Screening 
 of Short dance films part of Contact Dance International Film Festival
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2021/05/On-EGO.jpg
CATEGORIES:Other
END:VEVENT
