URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/international-dance-mentorship-pro
 gram/
SUMMARY:International Dance Mentorship Program
DESCRIPTION:Rhythm2Dance Inc. Announces Season 3 of International Dance Men
 torship\nDance program continues to connect professionals and students dur
 ing global pandemic\n\nToronto\, ON: Rhythm2Dance Inc. this week announced
  Season 3 of International Dance Mentorship\, an online dance training pro
 gram that brings industry professionals from across the world directly to 
 dancers at home. International Dance Mentorship is a 6 month mentorship pr
 ogram that offers a new way for emerging and pre-professional dancers to l
 earn foundational training\, self branding\, the business of dance\, and r
 eceive one-on-one feedback from mentors.\n\n[w8_blockquote icon="fa-quote-
 left"]“We want every dancer to have the opportunity to connect with indu
 stry leaders by removing all the usual barriers\, like international trave
 l or industry exclusivity/access”[/w8_blockquote]\n\nsays Reet Roy\, the
  founder of Rhythm2Dance Inc. and mentor for International Dance Mentorshi
 p.\n\n[w8_blockquote icon="fa-quote-left"]“We have been building momentu
 m from the last two season of IDM … Global community is more important t
 han ever right now and that is the basis of this program”[/w8_blockquote
 ]\n\nFeatures of the International Dance Mentorship program include:\n\nDa
 nce Sessions\; a mix of zoom sessions\, live webinars\, and tutorials sent
  exclusively to students of the IDM program.\nMentorship from current indu
 stry professionals\; valuable feedback for each dancer to help improve in 
 their technique\, and secrets to excel in every audition.\nConcept Videos\
 ; students work directly with mentors and other participants to film group
  projects and learn the importance of branding as an artist.\n\nSeason 3 o
 f International Dance Mentorship is accepting applications until June 15th
 . For more information\, see @internationaldancementorship on Instagram or
  email r2dcanada@gmail.com. Dancers can apply today by submitting here.\n\
 nAbout Rhythm2Dance Inc: Rhythm2dance was founded to provide a safe place 
 and a welcoming environment for dancers to foster their growth and success
 . Our mission is to provide dance education for all ages from the best and
  brightest in the industry. We create opportunities to promote up and comi
 ng choreographers and high caliber dancers in various settings (e.g. works
 hops\, events)\, with the overarching goal of unifying dance communities a
 cross Canada.\n\n### International Dance Mentorship Program
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2021/05/13913596_1227721767262214_9014280858749688698_o.jpg
CATEGORIES:Urban
END:VEVENT
