SUMMARY:Gravity's Edge Livestreem
DESCRIPTION:Celebrating Canadian Contemporary Dance Theatre's 40th annivers
 ary\, Gravity's Edge features a cutting-edge programme of mixed company re
 pertoire by leading choreographers from Canada and abroad\, filmed in a se
 lection of curious and stunning outdoor locations.\n\nThe production featu
 res a world premiere dance film by Artistic Director Deborah Lundmark\, al
 ongside vibrant and compelling works by Gioconda Barbuto\, Roderick George
 \, Sasha Ivanochko\, and Hanna Kiel. Gravity's Edge is captured on camera 
 by rising dance filmmakers Drew Berry and Krista Newey\, and will be broad
 cast to viewers around the world via Vimeo Live.\n\nDirectly following the
  livestream on July 17\, we invite you to join us on Zoom for a Virtual Re
 ception &amp\; 40th Anniversary Alumni Reunion in celebration of the perfo
 rmance and CCDT's four decades of bringing aspiring young dance artists to
  the stage. Gravity&#039\;s Edge Livestreem
