 021/
SUMMARY:Toronto Fringe ONLINE July 21 - 31\, 2021
DESCRIPTION:The Digital Toronto Fringe Festival returns July 21 - 31\, 2021
  taking place completely online. Toronto Fringe 2021 will present over 65 
 shows in four virtual series including the Fringe On-Demand series\, KidsF
 est On-Demand series\, Fringe Primetime series\, and POSTSCRIPT Live(strea
 m) events.\n\nDance shows at Toronto Fringe will include:\n\nAsylum\, a yo
 ung Iranian dancer waits in Turkey hoping to be granted asylum\, but can h
 e even make it to the border?\n\nDance of Torn Papers\, a double-bill imme
 rsive 360˚ film experience presented in both English and Farsi by Nowaday
 s Theatre.\n\nIn Transit\, a contemporary-jazz dance show exploring the tr
 ansitory nature of life\, trauma\, and memories.\n\nSteels Traps Don't Rus
 t\, a dance film exploring the communication breakdowns within the brain a
 nd relationships that are part of working through mental health issues and
  how that affects our approach to care.\n\nVenus &amp\; Adonis\, new take 
 on William Shakespeare's poem "Venus &amp\; Adonis" through contemporary d
 ance\, electronic soundscapes\, re-imagined prose and glam-pop styles. Tor
 onto Fringe ONLINE July 21 - 31\, 2021
