URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/tai-chi-with-eti-greenberg/
SUMMARY:Tai Chi with Eti Greenberg
DESCRIPTION:Join Eti Greenberg for Tai Chi every Tuesday at 11am at The Ben
 tway Studio to improve your health &amp\; wellbeing with movement.\n\n\n\n
 Eti Greenberg invites you to join her for an hour of Tai Chi on the Terrac
 e at The Bentway Studio (55 Fort York Blvd).\n\nTai Chi has an extra degre
 e of stretching and turning in each movement\, placing the emphasis on hea
 lth improvment. With diligent practice\, this type of movement produces a 
 profound effect on all systems of the body by reducing tension\, improving
  circulation\, and increasing strength and flexibility. Tai Chi can be an 
 effective therapy for a wide range of health problems (back pain\, arthrit
 is\, poor circulation\, etc...). It can improve balance and energy levels.
  It can also be great fun to study.\n\nThis class will last approximately 
 one hour with 15-20 minutes of meridian stretching to warm up. Please wear
  comfortable\, loose-fitting clothing and soft shoes. We will practice phy
 sical distancing\; please bring a mask.\n\nQuestions? Contact Eti via e-ma
 il (etigreenberg@sympatico.ca) or via phone (416-293-9729).\n\n\n Tai Chi 
 with Eti Greenberg
