SUMMARY:Fresh Air Fitness | Mindful Movement
DESCRIPTION:Join us at Mississauga Celebration Square’s Amphitheatre for 
 free outdoor fitness classes that are suitable for all fitness levels.\n\n
 \n\nJoin us at Mississauga Celebration Square’s Amphitheatre for free ou
 tdoor fitness classes that are suitable for all fitness levels and abiliti
 es! All Fresh Air Fitness classes will incorporate injury and/or accessibi
 lity modifications for everyone to join in the fun!\nMindful Movement\nIn 
 this class\, experience a combination of movement and focus inspired from 
 yoga\, Pilates\, Tai Chi and meditation in a flow that will leave you feel
 ing length\, strength and balance.\n\nFresh Air Fitness will have particip
 ant capacity of 20 people to ensure safe social distancing in the Amphithe
 atre. The Amphitheatre is a concrete and tiered venue\; classes being offe
 red are suitable for this environment.\n\nRegistration is required and ope
 ns 7 days before the Class. Fitness zones are assigned on a first come fir
 st serve basis. Walk up participation will be accommodated if space permit
 s. Reservations will be released 10 minutes after the class start time.\n\
 nPlease note that face coverings are required when entering and exiting th
 e Amphitheatre\, but may be removed during the class.\n\nThe Amphitheatre 
 offers accessible seating. If you require specific accommodations\, please
  call 311 at least 48 hours in advance of the class to make the request.\n
 \nOutdoor classes are weather permitting\, please check social media for e
 vent updates.\n\nIn Partnership with Mississauga Recreation\n\n\n Fresh Ai
 r Fitness | Mindful Movement
