 eational-classes/
SUMMARY:Modern Dance Expression - Adult Recreational Classes
DESCRIPTION:Modern Dance Expression\, taught by Megan Nadain\, is an all-le
 vels class created as a way to celebrate community\, music\, exercise\, an
 d of course\, our love for dance! The class uses technique as a pathway to
  fluid and powerful physical expression and integrates principals of Graha
 m and Limón technique. If you have a passion (or just a curiosity) for mo
 dern dance\, we invite you to join us to reconnect with ourselves and each
  other through movement in a stimulating and supportive environment.\n\nAl
 though we can't dance together in our usual ways at 80 Winchester\, we are
  hosting a hybrid series of classes both outdoors in a nearby park\, and v
 irtually from home. The term runs from September 14 to October 19 (outdoor
 s) and October 26 to November 30 (virtually).\n\nBook one session\, or bot
 h – the choice is yours! Modern Dance Expression - Adult Recreational Cl
 asses
CATEGORIES:Contemporary
