 ls (FMS) outlined by the Coaching Association of Canada through fun games\
 , HIIT circuits\, drills and music. FMS include\, throwing and catching\, 
 kicking and passing\, leaping and jumping. Such activities help children d
 evelop the building blocks of movement while helping them meet their daily
  exercise requirement of at least 60-minutes a day.\n\nTo find out more ab
 out our 2021 outdoor summer program\, click below https://fusioncardiotoro
 nto.com/fitbitsblogsintoronto/2021/8/27/te26k3k48sw90jvk0n6pgovszif7a7 Out
