DESCRIPTION:MOonhORsE Dance Theatre will launch the 2021 edition of their a
 cclaimed series celebrating mature dance artists Older &amp\; Reckless –
  now more than ever\, with an online edition premiering on Friday\, Novemb
 er 5. Older &amp\; Reckless – now more than ever\, curated by Artistic D
 irector Claudia Moore\, will feature innovative new dance films created an
