URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/impulse-2021-dinner-show/
SUMMARY:IMPULSE 2021 Dinner & Show
DESCRIPTION:Join us for IMPULSE 2021 Dinner &amp\; Show for an experience c
 reated and delivered in partnership with Daniel et Daniel!\n\n\n\nThe Scho
 ol of Toronto Dance Theatre presents IMPULSE 2021\, a live-streamed previe
 w performance of ensemble repertory\, showcasing dancers from all three ye
 ars of the Professional Training Program. Works by Kate Alton\, Michael Ca
 ldwell\, Pulga Muchochoma\, Brian Solomon\, and Darryl Tracy.\n\nIMPULSE 2
 021 DINNER &amp\; SHOW:\n\nJoin us on December 2\, 2021 for a special live
 -streamed preview performance of IMPULSE 2021 with a Dinner &amp\; Show ex
 perience created and delivered to your home by our community partners at D
 aniel et Daniel. Each Dinner &amp\; Show ticket includes a renowned three-
 course culinary experience (for one)\, instructions for serving and platin
 g\, and a link providing exclusive access to the live-streamed preview per
 formance of IMPULSE.\n\nThe Dinner &amp\; Show experience also includes on
 e free ticket to a LIVE IN-PERSON performance during the run of the show o
 n the night of your choice (December 3\, 4\, 10 or 11).\n\nBeverage add-on
 s are available at an additional cost.\n\nMENU\n\nAppetizer: Baby Spinach 
 Blood Orange &amp\; Pomegranate Salad with Carrot\, Radish Citrus Vinaigre
 tte (GF\, VE\, NF)\n\nMain Course Options (choose one):\n\n 	a) Braised Sh
 ort Rib with Apple Relish\, Crispy Potato Wedges &amp\; Roast Vegetables (
 NF)\n 	b) Branzino with Caper Tapenade\, Basmati Rice Rice &amp\; Roast Ve
 getables (NF)\n 	c) Truffled Cauliflower Quinoa with Mushroom Ragout\, Mis
 o Delicata Squash &amp\; Roast Vegetables (VE\, GF\, NF)\n\nDessert Trio: 
 Blueberry Cumin Ganache\, Tahini Millionaire Shortbread (NF) and Kefir &am
 p\; Chocolate Joe Louis\n\n***\n\nProceeds from the event will positively 
 benefit and contribute to student success. \n\nA tax receipt will be issue
 d for the maximum amount allowable after the event.\n\nSales for Dinner &a
 mp\; Show tickets end Sunday\, November 28\, 2021 at 11:59 p.m. EST.\n\nDe
 livery is only available to those in "M" postal codes. All deliveries will
  take place on the day of the event (December 2\, 2021). You will be notif
 ied of your delivery window 24 hours before showtime.\n\nPICK-UP is availa
 ble for those outside of Toronto at Daniel et Daniel: 248 Carlton Street\,
  Toronto\, ON M5A 2L1. You will be notified of your pick-up window 24 hour
 s before showtime.\n\nPlease note that though some menu items are nut and 
 gluten-free \, Daniel et Daniel is not a nut-free or gluten-free facility.
  \n\n\n IMPULSE 2021 Dinner &amp\; Show
