SUMMARY:Soca Dance Workshop by Carnival Spice (in studio)
DESCRIPTION:It feels surreal that we haven't been in studio together since 
 January 2020! Well it's time for us to connect in-person once again and cr
 eate some SPICE! See you Sunday\, December 5th from 1-3pm. We have planned
  an afternoon FULL AH VIBES and the festivities includes: a Caribbean danc
 e fitness workshop lead by the Carnival Spice fitness team. It will featur
 e a playlist of some of the top soca\, dancehall\, afro and chutney songs.
  PLUS learn carnival choreography to a top soca 2021 hit. There will also 
 be giveaways from our sponsors\nand a chance to connect with the Carnival 
 Spice community members a.k.a the #SpiceFam. This event WILL sell out - so
  be sure to register now to avoid disappointment. Further details availabl
 e here: https://spiceliveinperson.eventbrite.ca Soca Dance Workshop by Car
 nival Spice (in studio)
