SUMMARY:WINTERSONG
DESCRIPTION:Canadian Contemporary Dance Theatre presents\nWINTERSONG -- dan
 ces for a sacred season\n\nTICKETS &amp\; INFORMATION: https://www.eventbr
 ite.ca/e/wintersong-tickets-205324239327\n\nFleck Dance Theatre | 207 Quee
 ns Quay W\, Toronto\, ON M5J 1A7\nFriday\, December 10 | 8PM\nSaturday\, D
 ecember 11 | 8PM\nSunday\, December 12 | 2PM\n\nCelebrating the company’
 s LIVE return to the stage...\n\nand 33 years of illuminating the solstice
  through dance with a world premiere by Rodney Diverlus\, and the stage pr
 emiere of Alyssa Martin’s STAR SEED.\n\nWINTERSONG warms the hearts of f
 amily audiences with a breathtaking tapestry of seasonal dance inspired by
  the world’s rich solstice traditions. Also featured are Carol Anderson'
 s beloved holiday classic Nowell Sing We\, and Hanna Kiel's exuberant A Da
 y of Light.\n\nFor program and Covid-19 information\, visit our website! c
 cdt.org/wintersong WINTERSONG
