 virtual-competition/
SUMMARY:TEADE International Choreographic Virtual Competition
DESCRIPTION:During our 10th Anniversary of TEADE 2021\, International Dance
  Event\, our organizing committee invites you to participate in the First 
 TEADE International Choreographic Virtual Competition for professional dan
 cers\, choreographers and students. TEADE ’s competition will take place
  virtually and coincide with our Digital Gala Celebration and Conference X
  TEADE 2021\; In this first edition\, the contestants will compete in Cont
 emporary Dance style.\n\nThere will be two STREAMS:\n\nPROFESSIONAL STREAM
  – For Professional dancers &amp\; choreographers ( ages 18+) Competing 
 as choreographers and/or dancers.\n\n 	$1\,000 PRIZE Professional Choreogr
 aphy Prize + invitation to present the work in upcoming Danza Corpus Canad
 a events.\n 	**** $300 PRIZE Best Interpretation Award\n\nSTUDENT STREAM 
 – For Dance students (ages 13 +) Competing as choreographers and/or danc
 ers.\n\n 	$300 PRIZE Student Choreography Prize\n 	**** Best Interpretatio
 n Award: A Gift Card for Dance Classes with Danza Corpus Canada’s instru
 ctors.\n\nFinalists will be featured as part of our Virtual Gala on Decemb
 er 18\, and the winners will be announced on Sunday\, December 19 as part 
 of our Closing Gala. A diploma will be awarded to all contestants. All com
 petitors could attend the TEADE Digital Gala Showcase on Dec. 19th.\n\n&nb
 sp\; TEADE International Choreographic Virtual Competition
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2021/11/banner-GALA-2021-Ing-1.jpg
CATEGORIES:Contemporary
END:VEVENT
