SUMMARY:Jennifer Archibald’s ARCHCORE Winter Dance Intensive (Contemporar
 y &amp\; Hip Hop)
DESCRIPTION:Jennifer Archibald’s ARCHCORE Dance Intensive is coming to To
 ronto December 27th\n\nOn Dec 27th\, New York City based Canadian Choreogr
 apher Jennifer Archibald (Insagram @jarchdance) is holding her ArchCore Wi
 nter Intensive at Dancemakers (The Distillery District). This is a 3-hour 
 contemporary and hip-hop event open to advanced professional and pre-profe
 ssional dancers that will incorporate the technical fundamentals of modern
  dance and hip hop with a focus on technique\, repertory and improvisation
  acting concepts.\n\nParticipants are eligible to win a partial scholarshi
 p or early admission to Jennifer’s 1-week ArchCore40 NYC Summer Intensiv
 e. Auditions are not required to attend this Winter Intensive. Just regist
 er on-line to reserve your spot today! Don’t delay\, space is limited. O
 pen to ages 15 and up (must be advanced level)\n\nSafety Measures: Covid S
 creening required | Mask required |Vaccination Passport Policy | No specta
 tors allowed | Reduced capacity\n\nQuestions? Email us at archcore40@gmail
 .com Jennifer Archibald’s ARCHCORE Winter Dance Intensive (Contemporary 
 &amp\; Hip Hop)
