DESCRIPTION:Through our fun and female-only program\, participants will lea
 rn iconic Bollywood moves and songs from Bollywood movies dating as far ba
 ck as the ’70s. Classes will contain easy-to-follow movements\, beautifu
 l rhythms\, and group performance time.\n\nNo dance experience is required
 . Welcoming women of all levels and ages. To participate\, all you need is
  a bottle of water and a comfortable pair of dance or cross-training shoes
 .\n\nTo sign up for the 8-week program\, go to our website.\n\n&nbsp\; Wom
