SUMMARY:Introduction to Flamenco
DESCRIPTION:Wednesdays from 7:45– 8:45pm\nINTRODUCTION TO FLAMENCO (Absol
 ute Beginner) In Studio Only and Online RUMBA FLAMENCA\nJan 12 – March 3
 0 (no classes Feb 16 and 23)\nRegistration: $180 for 10 weeks (includes HS
 T) In person limite to 8 people per class\nThis class is for those who hav
 e no experience and are starting right from the beginning. This fun class 
 teaches all the basics of flamenco dance while learning a lively dance cal
 led ‘Rumba Flamenca”. Students can wear any workout style clothes with
  leather –soled shoes with a bit of a heel. Check out the music by Roger
  Scannura that will help you get acquainted with Rumba Flamenca!\nhttps://
 www.youtube.com/watch?v=IZsutLbMe1U\n\nAdvanced registration and vaccinati
 on proof required.\nMore info upon registration by emailing vscannura@gmai
 l.com\nE TRANSFER to vscannura@gmail.com\nDirect Paypal link: https://www.
 paypal.me/ritmoflamenco Introduction to Flamenco
