DESCRIPTION:PointeTango Dance Company and Payadora Tango Ensemble come toge
 ther to bring the magic of live music and dance to the Next Stage Festival
 !\n\n‘Tango in the Dark’ is an award-winning show that combines the pr
 ecision of ballet on pointe with the passion and intimacy of Argentine tan
 go.\n\nRoots Music Canada describes the artists’ performance as “movin
 g\, dramatic\, acrobatic\, sensual and haunting.”\n\nDon’t miss this o
 ne-of-a-kind performance as PointeTango’s sultry duo lights the way thro
 ugh the shadows and mysteries of the city night.\n\nNext Stage Festival JA
 NUARY 19-30\, 2022\n\nFor performance date and times https://fringetoronto
 .com/next-stage/schedule\nFor tickets and passes https://fringetoronto.com
 /next-stage/tickets-passes Tango in the Dark - part of Next Stage Festival
