URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/harbourfront-centre-presents-via-k
 atlehong-dance-in-via-kanana/
SUMMARY:Harbourfront Centre presents Via Katlehong Dance in Via Kanana
DESCRIPTION:In partnership with Digidance\, Harbourfront Centre announces t
 he North American premiere of the digital broadcast of South African dance
  company Via Katlehong Dance and contemporary choreographer Gregory Maqoma
 's Via Kanana\, streaming February 16 – March 6\, 2022. Pulsing with r
 hythmic vibrancy\, eight dancers combine the traditional\, high-energy dan
 ce of Pantsula (born out of South African protest) with tap\, step and gum
 boot - a miners' dance based on handstrokes on the thighs and calves - int
 o an exhilarating exploration of the problems and promise of their homelan
 d. The digital broadcast of Via Kanana will include a 20-minute pre-sh
 ow documentary. For tickets and information\, visit: harbourfrontcentre.
 com Harbourfront Centre presents Via Katlehong Dance in Via Kanana
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2022/01/Via-Kanana-by-Via-Katlehong-Gregory-Maqoma-9500-©-Christian-ganet
 -copy-2-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
