DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20220225T200000
DTSTAMP:20220214T175652Z
URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/windows-of-time-film-premiere/
SUMMARY:Windows of Time Film Premiere
DESCRIPTION:Dance Ontario presents Windows of Time\; a multi-regional film 
 project about dance and healing during COVID-19. Celebrating community\, c
 onnection and the power of dance to heal mental and physical scars.\nBe th
 e first to see and experience the Windows of Time Film! A collaboration wi
 th concept creator/facilitator Andrea Nann and concept creator/filmmaker H
 enry Mak. Through intuitive movement the film explores and cultivates hope
 .\n\n 	Friday\, February 25th\, 7pm to 8pm EST\n 	7 pm Film Screening\n 	7
 :30 pm Panel Talk with artists and participants\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nh
 ttps://www.eventbrite.ca/e/windows-of-time-film-premiere-tickets-259496399
 717\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n“Windows of Time was defined by our current global sit
 uation. The window is a transparent barrier that has separated and protect
 ed us\, trapped and restricted us\, isolated and contained us. It has kept
  us safe but also apart. We have been communicating through windows in our
  homes and in digital spaces with our loved ones and strangers. “ Andrea
  Nann Windows of Time Film Premiere
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2022/02/WOT_Newsletter-1.png
CATEGORIES:Experimental
END:VEVENT
