URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/harbourfront-centre-presents-l-e-v
 -chapter-3-the-brutal-journey-of-the-heart/
SUMMARY:Harbourfront Centre presents L-E-V Chapter 3: The Brutal Journey of
  the Heart
DESCRIPTION:Harbourfront Centre launches its international contemporary dan
 ce series\, Torque\, with the Canadian premiere of L-E-V’s visceral new 
 work\, Chapter 3: The Brutal Journey of the Heart\, on stage March 3 and 5
 \, 2022\, at 7:30pm at Fleck Dance Theatre - in strict observance of publi
 c health regulations. Through pulsating\, sensual movements and a haunting
 \, evocative score Chapter 3: The Brutal Journey of the Heart is a heart w
 renching examination of love and loss\, damage and brokenness\, and the be
 auty that comes when life unfolds in new and wonderful ways. For tickets a
 nd further information\, visit: harbourfrontcentre.com Harbourfront Centre
  presents L-E-V Chapter 3: The Brutal Journey of the Heart
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2022/02/2-Chapter-3-Photo-by-Stefan-Dotter-for-Dior-copy.jpg
CATEGORIES:Contemporary
END:VEVENT
