URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/harbourfront-centre-presents-anne-
 plamondons-only-you/
SUMMARY:Harbourfront Centre Presents Anne Plamondon’s Only You
DESCRIPTION:Harbourfront Centre presents the Ontario premiere of Only You\,
  an exhilarating new duet from Montreal-based choreographer Anne Plamondon
 \, on stage April 8 and 9\, 2022\, at 7:30pm at Fleck Dance Theatre\, as p
 art of the contemporary dance series Torque. A kinetic work imbued with su
 per-charged emotion\, Only You is a passionate exploration of the evolutio
 n of an intimate relationship. In a quest towards understanding\, acceptan
 ce and honesty\, the work’s two protagonists gradually remove the invisi
 ble veils between them to unmask a greater truth about self-discovery and 
 identity. Harbourfront Centre Presents Anne Plamondon’s Only You
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2022/03/Anne-Plamondon-Only-You-by-Michael-Slobodian-copy.jpg
CATEGORIES:Contemporary
LOCATION:Fleck Dance Theatre\, Harbourfront Centre\, 207 Queens Quay West\,
  Toronto\, Ontario\, M5J1A7\, GTA\, Canada
GEO:43.639301;-79.380898
