URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/face-to-face/
SUMMARY:Face to Face
DESCRIPTION:BRIGHT NIGHTS PRESENTS\nFace to Face\nChoreographed by Naishi W
 ang\n\nApril 20-23\, 27-30\, 2022\n8PM @ The Citadel\n\nIn an effective co
 nversation the following elements are involved: changes in facial expressi
 on and tone\, body movements and gestures – all expressed in a “face-t
 o-face” manner. But what about online? Are you really going to kiss me w
 hen you send a kiss emoji?\n\nFace to Face is a conceptual dance/body thea
 tre duet created and performed by Naishi Wang with Lukas Malkowski. Explor
 ing the complexity of human emotions in real space by looking at emoji cha
 racters in cyber reality\, the work seeks to find connections through nonv
 erbal forms of communication. Face to Face
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2022/04/Face-To-Face-2_Photo-CR-Ivy-Wang-scaled-1.jpg
