URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/the-fourth-r-reduce-reuse-recycle-
 revolutionize/
SUMMARY:THE FOURTH R: reduce\, reuse\, recycle\, REVOLUTIONIZE
DESCRIPTION:We cannot wait to celebrate the Earth together and unite in our
  fight for climate justice with our theatrical\, multi media dance show\, 
 THE FOURTH R! We all know the situation: the planet\, the people and the a
 nimals are in a really tough spot. Animals and resources are becoming exti
 nct\, the CO2 levels are rising and the Arctic is melting. But there is ho
 pe - and it’s US!\nIn and around this Earth day\, come honour the Earth 
 with us with this high energy\, high intensity dance show. We promise not 
 to disappoint!\nRun time: 50 minutes\nDisclaimer: This production deals wi
 th topics of human inequities.\nImportant Note: Theatre is a large room av
 ailable for patrons to socially distance. THE FOURTH R: reduce\, reuse\, r
 ecycle\, REVOLUTIONIZE
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2022/03/The4thR_2048x1080_2022.png
