SUMMARY:Family-Friendly Dist- Dance Party for International Dance DAy
DESCRIPTION:Calling all movers\, groovers and shakers for an intergeneratio
 nal party for International Dance Day 2022!\n\nCome Dance with US for a ca
 rdio pop/funk family friendly dist-dance party! everyBODY is invited to da
 nce along in a funky fusion inspired energizer and joyful session! Transfo
 rm any room in your space into a commUNITY dist-dance floor! Top 40\, Old 
 Skool\, Funk\, Bollywood…a mix of everything to get you moving and groov
 ing!\n\nCalling all movers\, groovers and shakers for an intergenerational
  party for International Dance Day 2022!\n\nA dance class is too serious..
 .join the virtual party and Dance ON! Family-Friendly Dist- Dance Party fo
 r International Dance DAy
