URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/intro-to-bollywood-workshop-with-c
 hase-constantino/
SUMMARY:Intro to Bollywood Workshop with Chase Constantino
DESCRIPTION:Have you always wanted to try Bollywood? Here is your chance!\n
 Join Dance Ontario as we celebrate International Dance Day with a FREE Int
 ro to Bollywood workshop with dancer and choreographer Chase Constantino. 
 Chase will get you moving and grooving with this fun and high energy works
 hop\, as you learn the basics of bollywood and a little of his amazing cho
 reography.\nDate: Friday\, April 29th\nTime: 6:00pm EST\nONLINE\nAbout Cha
 se\nChase Constantino is a Choreographer\, Creative Director and Actor. He
  is best known for his Indian- fusion dance work\, with his background bei
 ng in Bollywood \, Indian dance styles\, Jazz funk\, and Dancehall. Chase 
 loves uniting culture and stories through dance\, he is the Creative Direc
 tor of his dance company Broken Dance who were finalists on Canada’s Got
  Talent. He has also gone on to choreograph multiple projects as Lilly Sin
 gh’s choreographer\, choreographed for multiple film/tv projects\, as we
 ll as danced for numerous artists and celebrities within Bollywood and Hol
 lywood. Chase splits his time between LA and his hometown\, Toronto.\n\n&n
 bsp\;\n\nRegister here:\n\nhttps://www.eventbrite.ca/e/intro-to-bollywood-
 with-chase-constantino-tickets-320834242857\n\n&nbsp\; Intro to Bollywood 
 Workshop with Chase Constantino
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2022/04/chase-constantino-bollywood.jpg
CATEGORIES:Bollywood
END:VEVENT
