URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/bright-nights-presents-this-duet-t
 hat-weve-already-done-so-many-times/
SUMMARY:Bright Nights Presents: This Duet That We’ve Already Done (so man
 y times)
DESCRIPTION:MAY 5 -7\, 2022\n\nA choreographer\, musician\, dancer and jack
  of all trades who is both inspiring and unclassifiable\, Frédérick Grav
 el presents a duet that initially looks somewhat like a realistic painting
 . With the invigorating Brianna Lombardo he shares both the stage and a co
 mplicity that allows for all sorts of inventions\, and she becomes the cou
 nterpoint to his assumed awkwardness. Freed from the traditional codes of 
 dance performance\, they construct an original dramatic language where lit
 tle accidents are transformed into arguments for movement. Bright Nights P
 resents: This Duet That We’ve Already Done (so many times)
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2022/04/This-Duet-...-photo-by-Claudia-Chan-Tak.jpg
