URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/daybreaker-live-flower-power-dance
 -party/
SUMMARY:Daybreaker LIVE / Flower Power Dance Party
DESCRIPTION:On Saturday\, May 14th at 11AM ET (US)\, meet us ONLINE for our
  Flower Power Dance Party— a Daybreaker LIVE sponsored by AARP.\n\n\n\nD
 aybreaker LIVE Presents: A Flower Power Dance Party\n\nSponsored by AARP\n
 \nHappy Spring\, Daybreaker fam. &#x1f338\; The flower buds are emerging\,
  and we’re celebrating the only way we know how — by dancing. RSVP for
  free and join us for a 60s Flower Power dance sesh alongside our favorite
  collaborators at AARP. Yeah\, baby!\n\nLeading the groove is our Daybreak
 er Mama Radha Agrawal alongside Global MC Elliott LaRue. It’s going to b
 e shagadelic\, baby. You’ll hear some of your favorite hits from a live 
 DJ and special performers\, see friends old and new on the big screen\, an
 d feel all of the love from all over the world.\n\nIt doesn’t matter whe
 re you are on planet Earth\, join us online on Saturday\, April 14th at 11
 am EST as we dance with reckless abandon as one big happy family.\n\nRSVP 
 for free and we’ll see you there! &#x270c\;&#xfe0f\;\n\n——\n\nThe Li
 neup: MORE TBA! • RADHA AGRAWAL • ELLIOTT LARUE\n\n11am | Dance Warm-U
 p\n\n11:20am | Guided Dance Party Experience  hosted by Radha Agrawal and 
 Elliott LaRue + featuring live performances\n\n12:45pm - 1pm |  Closing \n
 \n**All times are posted in Eastern Daylight Time (US)\n Daybreaker LIVE /
  Flower Power Dance Party
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2022/04/25941_image.png
END:VEVENT
