SUMMARY:Barre & Choreography Class
DESCRIPTION:Every Friday - Claim your Free Trial!\n- Expressive Worship wit
 h Choreography - Learn different sequences of pre-created movements that w
 ill give you language to worship with your body. (approx. 20 min)\n\n- Wor
 ship Barre or Worship Workout - We will alternate these modalities between
  weeks. Worship Barre: fusion of ballet-inspired exercises using a chair/b
 arre to increase muscle strength\, balance and technique. Worship Workout:
  sequence of workout movements choreographed in worship songs. (approx. 25
  min) Barre &amp\; Choreography Class
