SUMMARY:Royal Ontario Ball 2022
DESCRIPTION:Royal Ontario Ball is a social dance event which includes a pro
 -am showcase and competition during the day and a Roaring 20’s Inspired 
 Ball in the evening. The Ball will feature spectacular professional shows\
 , a four course dinner\, live music\, general dancing and much more. The R
 oaring 20s is considered to be the golden era of ballroom dancing. Big ban
 ds\, grand dance halls\, jazz age and the dance craze. It’s the time whe
 n Arthur Murray and Frank Sinatra were dancing away on the big screen. Bri
 nging that energy\, ambiance\, and feeling back is what the Royal Ontario 
 Ball is all about.\n\nFull Day Ticket includes:\nAdmission to all sessions
 \, VIP Champagne Reception\, 4 Course Gourmet Sit Down Dinner\, Live Music
 \, Professional Shows\, Social Dancing\, and much more…\n\nTentative Sch
 edule-\n\nEvening :\n\n 	Roaring 20’s Theme Ball\n 	5:30-7pm Champagne R
 eception\n 	7pm Doors Open\n 	General Dancing &amp\; Live Music by The Bob
  Cary Orchestra\n 	Four Course Sit Down Dinner\n 	Pro-Am Solo Exhibitions\
 n 	World Twist Dance Championships\n 	Professional Shows\n 	&amp\; much mo
 re…\n\nVenue &amp\; Address: Old Mill Toronto\, 21 Old Mill Rd. Toronto 
 Royal Ontario Ball 2022
