SUMMARY:La Rumba Buena
DESCRIPTION:Sway your hips to old school salsa\, boogaloo and cumbia at thi
 s dance party dedicated to classic Latin sounds inspired by the salsatecas
  in Cali\, Havana\, and New York City. Featuring special guest DJ ASMA fro
 m Montreal.\n\nLa Rumba Buena is a night dedicated to classic Latin sounds
  inspired by the salsatecas in Cali\, Havana\, and New York. No frills\, p
 ure vibes\, and a non-stop dance floor open to anyone who catches the rhyt
 hm.\n\nCover is $10 all night long.\n\nLa Rumba Buena is a queer-positive 
 space.\n\n*We regret that 254 Lansdowne is not a fully accessible venue La
  Rumba Buena
