URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/ma-the-space-between-us/
SUMMARY:MA | The Space Between Us
DESCRIPTION:In the Japanese arts\, "MA" can refer to the negative space to 
 what is painted on the page\, or the silence between musical notes. In Far
 si\, MA means 'us' or 'union'. MA | The Space Between Us takes these two t
 ranslations as inspiration for a new collaborative work between Nagata Sha
 chu and Sashar Zarif. MA | The Space Between Us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2022/05/MA_Space-Between.png
