SUMMARY:TD Salsa in Toronto Festival Free Dance Classes
DESCRIPTION:Free Lessons.Register to receive reminders\, exclusive details 
 and TD Salsa in Toronto special offers/coupons including free shop salsa m
 erch\n\n\n\nDance your way through FREE Salsa\, Bachata and other Latin da
 nce lessons by the best professionals in Toronto and around the GTA.\n\nTh
 e largest Latino-themed cultural celebration in Canada\, the award-winning
  TD Salsa in Toronto Festival spans over a two-month period and is taking 
 over Toronto\, the GTA\, and the Kitchener-Waterloo and Halton regions wit
 h free dance lessons!\n\nJoin us from June 5 to July 10 for FREE Latin dan
 ce lessons with the best dance schools: Soul2Sole Latin Dance Company\, Te
 nC Dance Company\, Steps Dance Studio and Los Salsomanos! Get Salsa-Ready 
 for Toronto’s largest Latin street festival TD Salsa on St. Clair hits t
 he streets on July 9th and 10th!\n\nSUNDAY\, JUNE 5\n\n#Keepdancingcanada 
 with Soul2Sole’s FREE Salsa and Bachata lessons in York Region!\n\n 	4:3
 0pm: Bachata Beginners\n 	5:30pm: Salsa Beginners\n\nDance Mania\, 245 Wes
 t Beaver Creek Rd #5A\, Richmond Hill\, ON\n\nWEDNESDAY\, JUNE 8\n\n 	7pm:
  Beginners Bachata\n\nSoul2Sole\, 27 Roytec Rd\, Unit 104\, Woodbridge\, O
 N\n\nTHURSDAY\, JUNE 23 (Waterloo Region)\n\nJoin TenC Dance Company for F
 REE dance lessons in Waterloo Region and Toronto this summer!\n\n 	7PM: Ba
 chata Sensual class (No experience required!)\n\nTenC Dance Studio\, 329 K
 ing St E\, Kitchener\, ON.\n\nMake sure to stick around after for SBKZ Thu
 rsday nights right after your free lesson!\n\nJULY 6th\, 2022\n\nLet’s k
 ick off the week of TD Salsa on St Clair with FREE Bachata and Salsa lesso
 ns at Steps Dance Studio!\n\nLearn to dance: Salsa and Bachata (beginners)
 .\n\n 	The detailed schedule will be announced soon!\n\nSteps Dance Studio
 \, 819 Yonge Street\, 3rd Floor\, Toronto\, ON\, M4W 2G9\n\nJULY 9th &amp\
 ; 10th\, 2022\n\nTD SALSA ON ST. CLAIR STREET FESTIVAL – DANCE HOT SPOTS
 \n\nTD Salsa on St. Clair is the only festival where people do more than j
 ust eat and watch entertainment – they take part in non-stop dancing in 
 the streets! See below for details on our annual Dance Hot Spots where you
  can take part in FREE dance lessons all day long on the streets of St. Cl
 air!\n\nSt Clair West @ Winona – with Araguacu Dance Company\n\nSt Clair
  West @ Atlas – with DJ Gio and Los Salsomanos\n\nSt Clair West @ Arling
 ton – with Soul2Sole Latin Dance Company\n\nSt Clair West @ Rushton – 
 with Steps Dance Studio\n\nMore details:\n\nhttps://www.salsaintoronto.com
 /dancelessons/\n\n\n TD Salsa in Toronto Festival Free Dance Classes
