URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/dwps-disco-night-in/
SUMMARY:DWP's Disco Night - IN
DESCRIPTION:Since March 2020 we have been offering FREE LIVE\, ONLINE CLASS
 ES every day for seniors across the country to help them stay active and c
 onnected. We now have 150 seniors attending everyday to see their 'dance f
 amily' with over 3000 registered! We NEED to keep this going!\n\nHelping u
 s is easy and fun. We can all do this together...by dancing! Our annual fu
 ndraiser DWP's Disco Night-In will be held as a virtual dance party. We ar
 e going to dress up disco style\, enjoy performances and play a little 'Na
 me-that-Tune'!​\n​\nThe event is FREE\, and here is how you can help u
 s keep our daily classes free for all:\n​\nSimply sign up and send your 
 fundraising page to friends and family to request their pledges! Each dona
 tion receives an immediate tax receipt.\n​\nEvery donation dollar receiv
 ed will go directly to make sure our daily dance classes for seniors remai
 n free and accessible! DWP&#039\;s Disco Night - IN
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2022/05/Disco-Night-In-poster-2022.png
CATEGORIES:Disco
END:VEVENT
