URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/pushpull-dance-toronto-presents-si
 mple-pleasures/
SUMMARY:PushPULL Dance Toronto presents "Simple Pleasures"
DESCRIPTION:After more than two years of dancing in our living rooms\, Push
 PULL Dance Toronto is thrilled to be able to return to the stage for a mul
 timedia performance sharing the Simple Pleasures that got us through the p
 andemic. From rainy days to porches and ice cream\, from video games to tr
 ees and sweet dreams - each piece allows us to explore the most wonderful 
 simple pleasure of all: dancing together again. As always\, our two-hour s
 how will feature a variety of dance styles\, including Contemporary\, Tap\
 , Jazz Dance and Hip Hop.\n\nPushPULL Dance is a company of non-profession
 al\, adult dancers which embraces the diversity of the dance backgrounds a
 nd life experiences of its members. We all "Simply" love dance and find ti
 me in our busy lives to create\, collaborate\, and express through dance.\
 n\nPlease note that masks are required at each performance\, and that seat
 ing capacity is reduced. In the past\, our shows have sold out\, so be sur
 e to purchase your tickets in advance! PushPULL Dance Toronto presents &qu
 ot\;Simple Pleasures&quot\;
