SUMMARY:Bright Nights Presents: themselves
DESCRIPTION:Life pushes us together and pulls us apart\; we are constantly 
 living in a state of change\, however subtle. Hanging in the balance of me
  versus we\, themselves weaves amongst four people in search of place and 
 connection\, and asks if we can ever fully know someone else\, let alone o
 urselves. Building a world of redefined relationships\, themselves questio
 ns our willingness and ability to be permeable.\nJune 15-18\, 8PM @ the Ci
 tadel\nApproximate run time is 60 minutes.\nPost-show talkback: June 16 Br
 ight Nights Presents: themselves
