SUMMARY:4 Corners Cooksville - Conversations\, Art\, Music\, Dance and Well
 ness!
DESCRIPTION:Join us for any of the 3 special evenings of local talent\, com
 munity connections and art. Spend your time experiencing fun and new memor
 ies!\n\n\n\n*JUNE 25TH REGISTRATION*\n\nFor the past two years\, our abili
 ties to meet and connect with others was disrupted and opportunities were 
 sparse. However\, on Saturday\, June 4th\, 11th and 25th from 6PM to 8PM j
 oin us at the Southeast Corner on Hurontario St. and Dundas St.\, for an e
 vening of art\, dance\, music\, and conversations. Meet with local talent\
 , indulge in wellness activities\, get past the 2 years of isolation\, and
  get involved again within our community. We hope to see you and your fami
 lies there\, as everyone is welcome to attend!\n\nThis is a FREE event. Do
 nations are welcomed and will go towards supporting the Ukraine crisis. No
 n-perishable food items are welcomed for the Free Food Table project.\n\nT
 his event is sponsored by the Cooksville BIA\, the City of Mississauga\, C
 rane Creations Theatre Company and Heart Comonos. We thank all our partner
 s for making this happen! \n\nHeart Comonos (@heartcomonos) is a nonprofit
  organization in Cooksville\, Mississauga that engages with residents on a
  grassroots level. We collaborate with individuals and organizations to cr
 eate projects and programming that contribute to the many dimensions of we
 llness. Check us out at www.heartcomonos.ca for more information.\n\n\n 4 
 Corners Cooksville - Conversations\, Art\, Music\, Dance and Wellness!
