SUMMARY:Afrofest Toronto 2022
DESCRIPTION:Let's get together and celebrate Afro-Caribbean culture at Afro
 fest 2022!\n\n\n\nLet's get together and celebrate Afro-Caribbean culture 
 at Afrofest 2022! \n\nAFROFEST has become one of the most important Africa
 n cultural organizations in Canada as we present multicultural events and 
 initiatives which aim at reducing or eliminating anti-Black racism in Cana
 da.\n\nKey Points in 2022:\n\n 	Celebrating its 34th year\n 	Now a 3-day f
 estival at Woodbine Park.\n 	Largest free African festival in N. America w
 ith over 55 performances.\n 	Genres of music which showcase African and Bl
 ack culture (Afrobeat\, Afropop\, Soukous\, Makossa\, Rai\, Reggae\, Rumba
  etc.)\n 	Lineup focuses on local artists but also includes international 
 artists.\n\nSome new elements of AFROFEST 2022 are:\n\n 	DJ Sound Clash\n 
 	Fashion Show\n 	Afrofest Community Shield Awards\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n\n\n\n Afr
 ofest Toronto 2022
