SUMMARY:TD Salsa on St. Clair Street Festival
DESCRIPTION:TD Salsa on St. Clair Street Festival\, July 9th from 12PM to 1
 0:30PM and July 10th from 12PM to 8:30PM\nThe largest Latino-themed street
  fe\n\n\n\nCanada’s biggest Latin street party is back to heat up Toront
 o!\n\nTD Salsa on St. Clair Street Festival\, July 9th from 12PM to 10:30P
 M and July 10th from 12PM to 8:30PM\n\nThe FREE Annual TD Salsa on St. Cla
 ir Street Festival is the main event of the award-winning TD Salsa in Toro
 nto Festival.  The weekend celebration has garnered international recogn
 ition and attracts hundreds of thousands of salsa lovers from near and far
  to Toronto.\n\nA stretch of St. Clair Avenue West (from Winona Dr. to Chr
 istie St.) is transformed into a showcase of Latin life in Canada.  Enjo
 y the non-stop dancing in the streets and take in all the Latino beats alo
 ngside some of the best local and international entertainers. Take a strol
 l through the Latin pavilion\, get a taste of the authentic Latin American
  flavours\, and enjoy a fiesta of fun in the children’s zone.\n\nThe TD 
 Salsa in Toronto Festival and TD Salsa on St. Clair Street Festival are pr
 oduced by the Canadian Salsa Festivals Project\, a federally incorporate
 d Not-for-Profit organization.\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n\n TD Salsa on St. Clair Stre
 et Festival
