URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/jazz-with-chenise/
SUMMARY:Jazz with Chenise
DESCRIPTION:Yensa Festival invites you to explore Jazz with Chenise Mitchel
 l\n\n\nJoin Chenise through a grounding warm up\, exploration in connectio
 n to jazz music and expressions through the form. Her focus is on black or
 igins of jazz. Her class will flow with the level of who is in the room. B
 e prepared for a unique class as Chenise shares her Jazz journey with you.
 \n\n\n\n\nChenise’s artistic practice is who she is in essence: “Who I
  am is important to me. I have been part of communities that value artistr
 y for so long that I see everything I do through a lens of artistry\, but 
 I believe everyone can cultivate an artistic practice. It's mostly about h
 ow I reflect on my experiences and the world around me. It's a part of how
  I live my life on the daily. My artistic practice and my values are very 
 intertwined.”\n\n\n\n\n\nChenise Mitchell is a Jazzer\; an all-around pe
 rforming artist driven by rhythm and human connection. With 15 years of pr
 ofessional experience\, Chenise is a pro in many styles of performance. Th
 rough formal (BFA) and social based training\, Chenise believes that Jazz 
 ignites a connection to the rhythm of life. Chenise includes writing\, imp
 rov and music in her processes\; choreographing\, teaching or performing. 
 She has performed and collaborated in music videos\, concerts\, musicals a
 nd festivals with: Witch Prophet\, Esie Mensah\, Natasha Powell\, Nuit Bla
 nche\, Handsome Alice Theatre\, SummerWorks\, Fringe Festivals and more. C
 henise's creations have been featured in festivals and performances. Cheni
 se is also a published writer in The Capilano Review and The Dance Current
 . Chenise feels belonging with Jazz because it is healing\, social\, commu
 nity and it is meant to be shared. Chenise is passionate about emphasizing
  the Black origins of Jazz and uplifts you through her creations.\n\n\n Ja
 zz with Chenise
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2022/05/26070_image.jpg
CATEGORIES:Jazz
LOCATION:Regent Park Community Centre\, 402 Shuter St\, Toronto\, ON M5A 1X
 6\, Toronto\, ON\, M5A 1X6\, Canada
GEO:43.658149;-79.361779
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=402 Shuter St\, Toronto\, O
 N M5A 1X6\, Toronto\, ON\, M5A 1X6\, Canada;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Reg
 ent Park Community Centre:geo:43.658149,-79.361779
END:VEVENT
