URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/exploring-indigenous-dance-with-ba
 rbara-kaneratonni-diabo/
SUMMARY:Exploring Indigenous Dance With Barbara Kaneratonni Diabo
DESCRIPTION:Exploring Indigenous Dance\n\nWith Barbara Kaneratonni Diabo\n\
 nFriday\, July 15 2022 at 5 pm on ZOOM\n\nPay What You Can\n\nPresented by
  Dance Ontario as part of DanceWeekend'22 in partnership with the Indigeno
 us Performing Arts Alliance\n\nJoin Barbara Kaneratonni Diabo for an inter
 active workshop exploring various perspectives and styles of Indigenous da
 nce and music. Barbara originally comes from the Kanien'keha:ka Nation of 
 Kahnawake and believes in sharing her culture to encourage better understa
 ndings between nations and generations. All welcome - no dance experience 
 needed!\n\nPhoto of Barbara Diabo by Mira Dubay-Bureau Exploring Indigenou
 s Dance With Barbara Kaneratonni Diabo
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
