SUMMARY:Introduction to Flamenco
DESCRIPTION:Wednesday\, July 27 from 6:45 – 8:00pm\nINTRODUCTION TO FLAME
 NCO (In Person and Online)\nThis class is for absolute Beginners with no e
 xperience and the Rumba Flamenca will be introduced. Students can wear any
  workout clothes and shoes with a bit of heel that fit securely on the foo
 t. Flamenco shoes are not required but before buying flamenco shoes\, chec
 k with Valerie to make sure they are the proper shoes to get. There are ma
 ny brands that are not suitable. We can advise the best thing to wear for 
 this initiation class. Class is taught by Artistic Director Valerie Scannu
 ra and accompanied by the flamenco guitar of Roger Scannura E Transfer to 
 vscannura@gmail.com (Price includes taxes) Can be taken in person or onlin
 e.\nSingle class fee: $20 Introduction to Flamenco
