 debut of our “Chosen One” contest winner!\n\nTaking place during Carib
 ana weekend\, this event is one of the hottest tickets in town. Positive e
 nergy and good vibes only.\nJuly 30\, doors open at 7PM. Goes past midnigh
 t. $20-$30.\nThis is a 19+ event.\n\nDress code: Stylish (no baggy jeans\,
  athletic shoes\, timberlands and sportswear) The Dotbox - Caribana Saturd
 ay
