URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/taste-of-inda-festival-2022/
SUMMARY:TASTE OF INDA FESTIVAL 2022
DESCRIPTION:\n\n\nYoung Canadian Alliance &amp\; School of Flavours present
 s 5th Annual “TASTE OF INDIA FESTIVAL 2022” on July 31 &amp\; August 1
  @ Nathan Phillips Square\, 100 Queen St W\, Toronto M5H 2N2 from 12:00 No
 on to 10:00 pm.\n\nFinally\, after 2 years TASTE OF INDIA FESTIVAL the mos
 t diverse exhibition of Culture\, heritage &amp\; culinary art\, is back f
 or 2 days in person at the usual &amp\; most iconic venue of Canada “Nat
 han Phillips Square” downtown Toronto.\n\nThis family-friendly event was
  perfect example in 2019 summer with more than 100 vendors &amp\; attracte
 d over 80\,000 in attendance with open arms and welcomed all diverse commu
 nities\, which enjoyed the festival to the fullest and became part of mult
 icultural Bollywood style dances &amp\; competitions.\n\nIn 2022 the stage
  will be set on fire by classical dances\, bhangra\, music\, musical melod
 ies by singers and a live DJ and rock the square from 12:00 Noon to 10:00 
 Pm nonstop. The festival will set a setting stone as a true example of Mul
 ticulturalism &amp\; attract diverse communities.\n\nYour wait is over for
  the most awaited foodie utopia\, mesmerizing performances\, flash mobs\, 
 amazing competition &amp\; kid’s activities.\n\nAbout Taste of India 202
 2:\n\nTaste Of India Festival 2022 will promote richness of culture &amp\;
  heritage through its Art\, Music\, Dance\, Entertainment &amp\; cuisine b
 y connecting diverse communities together in an inclusive fashion to foste
 r socio and economic development of Canadians.\n\n75 Artist cultural perfo
 rmances &amp\; Indian culinary cuisines will be exhibited to celebrate “
 AZADI KA AMRIT MAHOTSAV @ INDIA 75” in association with Consulate Genera
 l of India in Toronto.\n\nA lot of events deliver on 1 or 2 senses but Tas
 te of India Food Festival delivered all 5 senses.\n\n“Visually everyone 
 will be treated with color and diversity\; interactive street performers a
 nd activities will allow everyone to touch the fun\; Crowd will hear amazi
 ng music\; Everyone’s taste buds will be delighted by amazing Flavours\,
  and everyone will smell the aroma of authentic &amp\; delicious street fo
 od.”\n\nOverall\, the festival will be a trip of mind-blowing sensory fe
 ast for everyone who visit on July 31 &amp\; August 1\, 2022 at Toronto Ci
 ty Hall. There will be frequent raffle draws for audiences including trave
 l credit vouchers\, dinner vouchers\, smart watches and lots giveaways by 
 Sponsors and Vendors.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n TASTE OF INDA FESTIVAL 2022
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2022/06/26197_image.jpg
CATEGORIES:Bollywood
LOCATION:Nathan Phillips Square\, 100 Queen St W\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M5H 
 2N2\, GTA\, Canada
GEO:43.652000;-79.382401
