SUMMARY:Kids' Latin Dance Performance Class
DESCRIPTION:Get your child's creative energy flowing! This class will focus
  on teamwork\, developing basic Latin dance skills and musicality. The kid
 s will learn a short piece of choreography over the course of 8 weeks in a
  welcoming and friendly environment. Improve your child's focus\, while ke
 eping them active and engaged in this incredibly rewarding activity. Stude
 nts will have the opportunity to unleash their inner performer and celebra
 te their accomplishments by performing during the afternoon show at this y
 ear's Canada Salsa &amp\; Bachata Congress in October!\n\nThursdays from 6
  pm - 6:45 pm\nAugust 11 to September 29\nFor kids ages 6 to 8\n$150+hst f
 or the 8-week program\nPlease note: All participants must commit for the f
 ull course\n\nParents\, want to take classes too? Enrolling your child in 
 this program gives you access to discounted adult classes:\n1 Parent: 2 mo
 nths of unlimited classes for $100\n2 Parents: 2 months of unlimited class
 es 6 days a week for $150 ($75 per parent) Kids&#039\; Latin Dance Perform
 ance Class
