 ational-final/
SUMMARY:Red Bull Dance Your Style Canada National Final
DESCRIPTION:Red Bull Dance Your Style is back for 2022\, bringing this glob
 al celebration of the diverse dance community back to Canada. Dancers perf
 orming all street dance styles need only do one thing – wow the audience
  with their unique freestyle dance skills and musicality as they hit the f
 loor to an unpredictable mix of tracks from global hits to classic beats. 
 Performers must win over the crowd as the winner is crowned by audience vo
 ting.\nWinners of the Vancouver and Montreal Qualifiers will join wildcard
  selected dancers in Toronto\, Ontario on August 26 for the National Final
 . There they will compete to become the national winner and represent Cana
 da at the 2022 Red Bull Dance Your Style World Final in Johannesburg\, Sou
 th Africa. Red Bull Dance Your Style Canada National Final
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2022/08/SI201908190033_news-min-1-scaled.jpg
CATEGORIES:Hip Hop
LOCATION:The Bentway\, 250 Fort York Blvd\, Toronto\, Canada
GEO:43.6374082;-79.40664609999999
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=250 Fort York Blvd\, Toront
 o\, Canada;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=The Bentway:geo:43.6374082,-79.40664
 609999999
END:VEVENT
