DTSTAMP:20220919T180410Z
URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/ihnale/
SUMMARY:IHNALE
DESCRIPTION:The Registry Theatre in Kitchener\, ON\, is hosting NLC Dance C
 ompany’s Debut Performance “Inhale” now through Sep 3\, with weeknig
 ht shows and 2 Saturday shows to close off this premiere. Visit the Eventb
 rite page for ticket details: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/inhale-presente
 d-by-nlc-dance-company-tickets-340278180197\n\nShow dates:\nAug 28 @6:30PM
 \nAug 29 @6:30PM\nAug 31 @7:00PM\nSep 1 @6:30PM\nSep 2 @7:00PM\nSep 3 @1:0
 0PM\nSep 3 @7:00PM\n\n‘’Inhale” is a contemporary presentation of se
 lf-discovery featuring choreography from 5 incredibly talented and well-kn
 own local artists\, and namely: Nicole Clinton (NLC Artistic Director and 
 Executive Producer)\, Nicky Garret\, Melissa Lang-Nichol\, Kyle Clinton an
 d Kara Flores. The performance is based on self-discovery\, shared human e
 xperiences and trust in the universe. The expressive movement of the NLC c
 ast takes you through several stages of life\, from young\, hopeful and in
 nocent\, to troublesome teenage years\, to young adulthood challenges deal
 ing with betrayal and loss\, all the way to maturity and feeling at peace 
 with oneself. IHNALE
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2022/08/Inhale-Poster-3.jpg
CATEGORIES:Contemporary
END:VEVENT
