SUMMARY:Women's Bollywood Dance Fitness Program - Runnymede and Bloor
DESCRIPTION:Our women's Bollywood Dance Fitness program is a dance workout 
 that combines easy-to-follow dance movements and exercises and beautiful r
 hythms spanning from South Asia to the Middle East.\n\nNo dance experience
  is required. This is a low to moderate impact class to accommodate women 
 of all fitness levels and ages\nWelcoming moms and their teenage daughters
  to create time for mother and daughter bonding.\n\nThis is a community-ba
 sed program that runs for 12-week sessions three times per year.\n\nTo sig
 n up for a class or for more info\, please visit our website. Women&#039\;
 s Bollywood Dance Fitness Program - Runnymede and Bloor
