URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/rolling-loud-hip-hop-festival/
SUMMARY:Rolling Loud Hip Hop Festival
DESCRIPTION:The world's largest hip-hop music festival\, the Rolling Loud f
 estival\,  will be making its way to Toronto this September.\n\nThe hip-h
 op music festival will be held at Ontario Place from Sept. 9 through Sept
 . 11 and will feature a huge gamut of major artists including Wizkid\, Fut
 ure\, and Dave all as headliners.\n\nTo attend Rolling Loud Toronto you mu
 st be at least 16 years of age. To purchase a VIP ticket or alcoholic beve
 rages at the festival you must be 19 years of age.\n\nHow do I get to the 
 festival?\n\nGetting there by Train:\n\n 	Take the GO transit train (Westb
 ound / Eastbound) and get off at Exhibition station. Walk to Ontario place
 .\n\nGetting there by Toronto Transit Commission (TTC) – Streetcar\n\n 	
 Subway to union station. Take the 509 Exhibition streetcar to Exhibition. 
 Walk to Ontario Place.\n Rolling Loud Hip Hop Festival
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2022/08/rolling-loud2.jpg
CATEGORIES:Hip Hop
LOCATION:Ontario Place\, 955 Lake Shore Blvd West\, Toronto\, ON\, Canada
GEO:43.628131;-79.416061
