DESCRIPTION:A moderate to high-impact dance workout celebrating Caribbean d
 ance\, energetic rhythms\, and relaxation practices. Yoga mats are recomme
 nded. This program is currently taught by a certified Yoga and Socacize Fi
 tness instructor.\n\nTo join our 12-week online program\, please visit our
  site.\n\nThis is a community-based program that runs for 12-week sessions
  three times per year.\n\nTo sign up for a class or for more info\, please
  visit our website. Socacize and Yoga Program for Women and Girls
