SUMMARY:Fall for Dance North 2022
DESCRIPTION:Toronto’s premier international dance festival Fall for Dance
  North (FFDN) presents its 8th annual festival from Sep 17 to Oct 8\, 2022
  – keeping all festival tickets at $15 for any seat. FFDN’s vast and d
 iverse line-up of innovative programming will include 15+ world premieres 
 from movement artists\, musicians and filmmakers\, presented at six venues
  across Toronto\, in partnership with more than 13 arts organizations. In 
 addition to the return of FFDN’s foundational indoor mixed programme at 
 the festival’s home stage\, Meridian Hall\, the programming is being exp
 anded to include a series of full-length and double bill presentations\, b
 oth indoors and outdoors\, as well as a series of digital and free program
 ming. Festival packages and single tickets at ffdnorth.com. Fall for Dance
  North 2022
