 ON\n\n\n\nGive your teens the opportunity to learn the social graces and g
 et mentally tough. The Fall 2022 Dance Season is starting. Come for a free
  trial or to find out more about the dance program for youth ages 12 - 16Y
 RS. From Tango to Salsa\, Cha Cha and more. Taught by professional dance i
 nstructors based on the internationally recognized DVIDA syllabus.\n\nThe 
 program is specifically crafted to capture the fun element and creativity 
 of young students whilst developing poise\, confidence\, and etiquette in 
 a social environment.\n\nSpaces are limited and registration is required.\
 n\n\n TEEN LATIN &amp\; BALLROOM DANCE FREE TRIAL
