SUMMARY:In Case of Emergency
DESCRIPTION:In Case of Emergency\, a film conceived by Karen and Allen Kaej
 a and directed by Allen will premiere in a screening presented by Kaeja d
 ’Dance and Dance Ontario. This new film celebrates the mosaic of our com
 munity by highlighting the history and identity of 18 passionate dance art
 ists.\n\nEach artist improvised movement of their informed practices inspi
 red by a transformative moment in their childhood that they have been touc
 hed by. This project is supported by the Department of Canadian Heritage S
 upport for Live Arts and Music Workers Fund.\n\nhttps://vimeo.com/73974590
 0\n\nIn Case of Emergency will be screened online on September 29 at 7:30p
 m EST. There will be a Q&amp\;A with a panel of artists following the scre
 ening.\n\nKaeja d'Dance is thrilled to share the fantastic artists involve
 d in this project: Jim Adams\, Jillia Cato\, Joshua DePerry\, Aria Evans\,
  Nickeshia Garrick\, Tamar Ilana\, Allen Kaeja\, Karen Kaeja\, Kalaisan Ka
 laichelvan\, Kin Nguien\, Jen Roy\, Jake Runeckles\, Lola Ryan\, Mio Sakam
 oto\, Katherine Semchuk\, Ashvini Sundaram\, Irma Villafuerte\, and Ravyn 
 Wngz. In Case of Emergency
