SUMMARY:Scholarship for Performing Arts Online Courses
DESCRIPTION:If any of you are just looking for online education\, then you 
 have a great opportunity to get an ArtUniverse Scholarship to study on 3-M
 onth Distance Learning Courses at NIPAI (https://www.nipai.org/online-cour
 ses).\n\nArtUniverse provides partial scholarships to support performers a
 nd creators in these difficult times\, because now online education is the
  safest and the most convenient way to develop professional skills at home
 .\n\nUpcoming courses:\n\n&#x25b6\;&#xfe0f\; "The Director and Play"\n&#x2
 5b6\;&#xfe0f\; "Choreography and Blocking in Performance"\n&#x25b6\;&#xfe0
 f\; "The Director and Ensemble Building"\n\nThe amount of the scholarship 
 for each applicant is determined individually based on his/her needs\, pro
 fessional achievements and goals.\n\nTo receive a scholarship\, you should
  fill out an application form\, proving that you need and deserve this sch
 olarship:\nhttps://www.artuniverse.org/application-process/\n\nMore inform
 ation about ArtUniverse: https://www.artuniverse.org/\n\nIf you have any q
 uestions\, feel free to contact me at info@artuniverse.org Scholarship for
  Performing Arts Online Courses
