SUMMARY:DCD Hall of Fame Induction Ceremony
DESCRIPTION:Now in its fourth year\, the DCD Hall of Fame will honour and c
 elebrate dynamic lifelong contributions to dance in Canada with a ceremony
  on Sunday\, October 2 at Palais Royale in Toronto.\n\nThe 2022 DCD Hall o
 f Fame live induction ceremony\, hosted by singer/songwriter Micah Barnes\
 , will also be live-streamed. The evening will include fabulous live perfo
 rmances by elite dancers\, remarks from illustrious presenters and inducte
 es\, food and cocktail service\, as well as a silent auction.\n\n&nbsp\;\n
 \nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=t_j8629f2J0\n\n&nbsp\; DCD Hall of Fame 
 Induction Ceremony
