DESCRIPTION:A platform for world-wide dance forms all on one stage! Along w
 ith some fun and FREE dance workshops\n\n\n\nThe Toronto International Dan
 ce Festival (TIDF) is an annual event hosted by Dancing Damsels Inc. to pr
 omote multicultural integration through dance and arts. This FREE communit
 y event brings together talented artists and provides a platform for them 
