DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto;VALUE=DATE:20221116
DTSTAMP:20221111T204221Z
URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/meditation/
SUMMARY:Meditation
DESCRIPTION:The Cultch Presents the Re/Play Feature: Meditation\, starting 
 October 14th.\nMeditation is an online\, on-demand dance performance chore
 ographed and performed by Amber Barton.\nTickets are Pay What You Can.\n\n
 &nbsp\;\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nSUdm30eFvQ\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nMEDIT
 ATION is a reflection on what was\, what is and what is to come. It is an 
 attempt to use movement to process the journey of award-winning dance arti
 st and choreographer Amber Barton as she unpacks her past and contemplates
  her future. Inspired by her personal journey as a professional dance arti
 st\, Amber likes to think of this solo as an autobiography\; an attempt to
  reconcile with her failures and achievements while simultaneously celebra
 ting the beauty\, fragility and temporary nature of the human body.\n\n&nb
 sp\;\n\nSTREAM NOW at : https://thecultch.com/event/meditation/ \n\n&nbsp
 \;\n\n&nbsp\; Meditation
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2022/10/meditation_promo_shots_Photo-Credit_-Cameron-Anderson.jpg
CATEGORIES:Contemporary
END:VEVENT
