 be donated to the TSP food drive. Let's end the year with some skate love!
 \n\nTRINITY ST. PAUL'S UNITED CHURCH (427 Bloor St. W\, Toronto\, ON)\n\nW
 ednesday\, December 7\, 2022\n\n8:30 PM - 10:00 PM\n\nFREE WITH A NON-PERI
