SUMMARY:Soca Dance Workshop by Carnival Spice (in studio)
DESCRIPTION:We have planned an afternoon full of vibes and the festivities 
 includes:\n\n- a 90 min Caribbean dance fitness workshop lead by the Carni
 val Spice fitness team. It will feature a playlist of some of the top soca
 \, dancehall\, afro and chutney songs. PLUS learn carnival choreography to
  a top soca hit.\n- surprises and giveaways from our sponsors\n- meet and 
 greet with the Carnival Spice community members a.k.a the #SpiceFam\n- THI
 S WILL SELL OUT so be sure to register now to avoid disappointment.\n\nLoc
 ation: Gotta Dance - 3581 Dundas St W\, York\, ON M6S 2S8\, Canada\n\nEntr
 y: $25+hst\nAvailable via https://sweatwithspice2022.eventbrite.ca or send
  email transfer of $28.25 to info@carnivalspice.com (password: "carnivalsp
 ice" to secure your spot). Only 30 tickets will be available.\n\nREMINDERS
 :\nWEAR YOUR CARNIVAL SPICE SHIRT and/or ATHLEISURE ATTIRE!\nBRING YOUR RA
 G OR’ YOUR FLAG!\nBRING WATER!\nDRESS TO SWEAT!\nWEAR COMFORTABLE SHOES!
 \n\nFAQS:\nWHAT CAN I EXPECT FROM THE CARNIVAL SPICE WORKSHOP?\nCheck out 
 this recap video: https://youtu.be/8gGAbNQeQy0\n\nHOW OLD DO I HAVE TO BE 
 TO ATTEND?\nAll ages and dance levels are welcome. Recommended for 16-60 \
 ;)\n\nWHERE CAN I PARK?\nGotta Dance is located beside Jane/Dundas Library
  with access to the TTC ample parking. Studio is on the lower level. Soca 
 Dance Workshop by Carnival Spice (in studio)
