 20s-dances-lessons/
SUMMARY:New Years Day Swing\, Waltz &amp\; Roaring 20s Dances &amp\; Lesson
 s!
DESCRIPTION:Swing Toronto and Waltz Toronto present:\n\nSwing\, Waltz and R
 oaring 20s New Years Day Dances and Lessons at St Barnabas Hall!\nJoin us 
 on New Years Day! Swing\, Waltz and Roar into 2023!\nNo prior experience i
 s needed. Absolute beginners are welcome\nwww.swingtoronto.com\n\nDoors 2p
 m\nROARING 20s TRAVELING PARTNER DANCES BEGINNER LESSON\n- 2:10pm to 2:50p
 m\n- Easy to learn. The fundamental step is just walking. Hugely popular i
 n the 1920s\, unlimited possibilities\, good for music from slow to fast.\
 nSHORT ROARING 20s DANCE\n- 3pm to 3:30pm\nVIENNESE WALTZ BEGINNER LESSON\
 n- 3:30pm to 4:30pm.\n- Traditional Viennese Waltz\, popular since the ear
 ly 19th century\, done around the world\, easy-to-learn\, and maybe the mo
 st romantic partner dance of all.\nWALTZ DANCE 4:40pm to 6pm\nLINDY HOP BE
 GINNER LESSON\n- 6:15pm to 7:15pm.\n- The joyful classic Swing Dance done 
 around the world.\nSWING DANCE PARTY 7:30pm to 10:30pm featuring VIPERS CL
 OUD! Quintet.\nVipers Cloud is a an excellent Swing band led by Nat Beja.\
 n\nWebpage: https://swingtoronto.com/swing/#st-sns_stbnyd2023_n\n\nPrices 
 (HST included)\n- $40 for everything 2pm to 10:30pm ($30 for full-time stu
 dents with ID)\n- $20 for the evening only\, 6:15pm to 10:30\, Lindy Hop l
 esson and Swing Dance featuring Vipers Cloud ($15 for full-time students)\
 n- $25 for the afternoon only\, 2pm to 6pm\, ($20 for full-time students)\
 n- $20 for Waltz only 3:30pm to 6pm ($15 for full-time students)\n- $10 fo
 r the Waltz Dance only\, 4:40pm to 6pm.\n\nFor supper\, there are restaura
 nts on the Danforth. For those who prefer to bring a "pic-nic" (no alcohol
 ) for supper\, tables and chairs will be available for that. New Years Day
  Swing\, Waltz &amp\; Roaring 20s Dances &amp\; Lessons!
