UID:4024@torontodance.com
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20230112T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20230112T210000
DTSTAMP:20230112T025857Z
URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/bright-nights-presents-la-complain
 te-du-givre/
SUMMARY:Bright Nights Presents: la complainte du givre
DESCRIPTION:Citadel + Compagnie is thrilled to ring in the new year with th
 e Toronto premiere of Simon Renaud (amour amour)’s la complainte du givr
 e.\nla complainte du givre is a creation situated on the thin line of fict
 ion\, abstraction\, dream and reality. Two women jump body and soul in a w
 ork exploring the vulnerability of relationships across spectrums\, touchi
 ng upon the ghosts of what love\, friendship\, absence leaves us\, their m
 emories in our body\, their forgotten traces that resurface.\nThe performa
 nce is punctuated by audio excerpts from a residency in Denmark in 2020\, 
 as one performer learned to dance and the other to sing. We can hear the t
 ensions of the past\, the insecurities of each in the face of their abilit
 ies\, but also the candor of these women and the laughter that can occur a
 t any time. While the past is present in our ears\, we witness an intimacy
 \, a gentleness and a trust firmly rooted in the present\, the fruit of th
 is past that we decide to share. As audiences\, this experience is a gift 
 offered by its preciousness and the rarity of being able to witness the be
 ginning of an adventure that unfolds and continues to grow before our eyes
 .\nDates: January 12th – 14th\, 2023 @ 8PM [artist talkback on January 1
 3th]\nTickets from $10.00\nPhone: (416) 364-8011\nWebsite: https://www.cit
 adelcie.com/ Bright Nights Presents: la complainte du givre
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2023/01/Screen-Shot-2023-01-03-at-3.42.47-PM.png
END:VEVENT
