URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/swing-an-aerial-dance-party/
SUMMARY:Swing! (an aerial dance party)
DESCRIPTION:A monthly dance party for aerialists in Toronto.\n\n\n\nA month
 ly community gathering/practice aerial time\, DJ'd live by Tal!\n\nOpen to
  intermediate students through to professionals\, this is a chance to prac
 tice ambient and durational performance or just jam out with some fun tune
 s and a disco ball.\n\nBring your own apparatus or use the house equipment
 * Depending on total number of participants registered\, you may be asked 
 to share a point.\n\nPWYC with a suggested donation of $20. Reserve your s
 pot in advance and pay cash at the door or send an e-transfer to hello@her
 ciniarts.com\n\nA collaboration between Tal\, The Circus Fix and Hercinia 
 Arts Collective\, proceeds from this event help support new artistic proje
 cts across the city.\n\nACCESS NOTES:\n\nThere will be dim/party lighting 
 and a disco ball with DJ music playing at a relatively high volume.\n\nPar
 ticipants are encouraged to move at their own pace and to take breaks as n
 eeded.\n\nStudio Flux is located on an industrial street with minimal side
 walks. Entrance and all activities are at ground level (no steps).\n\nTher
 e is one non-gendered washroom at the back. Washroom door is very narrow a
 nd unfortunately not accessible by wheelchair.\n\nThere are benches by the
  door. Chairs are also available and can be placed throughout the space.\n
 \nTransportation:\n\nThe 72 Bus stops less than a block from the door and 
 runs from both Union and Pape stations. The studio is also a 10min walk fr
 om the Queen streetcar. There are 6 Parking spots and 3 Bike Parking spots
  available right outside the studio. Additional Bike Parking is available 
 at the Esso Gas station at Carlaw/Lakeshore.\n\nFor any additional questio
 ns\, please feel free to contact us at hello@herciniarts.com.\n\n*Contact 
 us in advance if you are planning to use a house apparatus other than silk
 s\, as we want to ensure there is enough for everyone!\n\n\n Swing! (an ae
 rial dance party)
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2023/01/26579_image.png
