SUMMARY:Calefaction: Forro dance workshop with Forro for all - FREE WORKSHO
 P
DESCRIPTION:A free all levels Forró dance workshop facilitated by Clara an
 d Cem instructors from Forró for all.\n\n\nAbout the instructors:\nClara 
 and Cem are instructors from Forró for All\, a volunteer project aimed at
  building community and spreading the love of Brazilian culture through th
 e medium of social dance. Cem's salsa experience gives him a particular ap
 preciation for connection and musicality\, while Clara's background in com
 petitive Irish dance drives her interest in rhythm and intricate footwork.
  Both first encountered forró through this group and have been instructor
 s for 5+ years.\n\n\n\n\nCalefaction: A Winter Warm up on Dundas West from
  Jan 6 to 29th\nTonight's presentation is part of Calefaction 2023\, an ex
 citing new winter festival featuring concerts\, DJs\, karaoke\, dance &amp
 \; music workshops\, giveaways\, a sidewalk sale\, mural tours\, gallery &
 amp\; vintage crawls and more!\n\nCheck out lulaworld/calefaction for a fu
 ll schedule of free and ticketed events at Lula Lounge\, Baby G\, Orwell\,
  La Piscina\, Brockton Bakery and other Dundas West hot spots. (We'll be a
 dding events throughout the month so keep checking back!)\n\nPresented by 
 Lula Music and Arts and Little Portugal Toronto BIA with support from the 
 City of Torontn\, FedDev Canada\, Toronto Arts Council\, Ontario Arts Coun
 cil\, Ontario Creates\, Canada Council for the Arts and Heritage Canada.\n
 \n\n\n Calefaction: Forro dance workshop with Forro for all - FREE WORKSHO
 P
