URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/valentines-day-la-la-land/
SUMMARY:Valentine's Day: LA LA LAND
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Valentine's Day by watching Damian Chazelle's now-cul
 t romantic musical comedy\, LA LA LAND!\n\n\n\nCelebrate Valentine's Day b
 y watching Damian Chazelle's now-cult romantic musical comedy\, LA LA LAND
 !\nFebruary 14 is the ideal time to re-watch Damien Chazelle's now-cult ro
 mantic comedy. It's an opportunity to dive\, hand in hand\, into the love 
 story of Emma Stone and Ryan Gosling under the bright Los Angeles sun.\n\n
 Winner of 6 Oscars\, including Best Director and Best Actress for Emma Sto
 ne \, La La Land is an anomaly\, a musical that pays tribute to Cherbourg'
 s Umbrellas and Swing Time \, Fred Astaire and Ginger Rodgers . This movie
  brings about nostalgia\, as well as a desire to rediscover both the cinem
 atic experience and the city of Los Angeles. What better time than Valenti
 ne's Day to revisit this atypical love story? (VOGUE)\nABOUT THE FILM\nLA 
 LA LAND\n\nUSA | 2016 | 128 minutes | PG\n\nDirected by: Damien Chazelle\n
 \nStarring: Ryan Gosling\, Emma Stone\n\nRegular admission applies. For IN
 DIVIDUAL MEMBERSHIPS ($450) and FAMILY MEMBERSHIPS\, please email us at in
 fo@revuecinema.ca to get a ticket!\n\n\n Valentine&#039\;s Day: LA LA LAND
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2023/02/26728_image.jpg
