URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/dancing-for-non-dancers/
SUMMARY:DANCING for NON-DANCERS
DESCRIPTION:Movement Class with Alyssa Martin from Rock Bottom Movement.\n\
 n\n\nWhat: ZERO dance experience is required for this hour-long dip into t
 he dance world at the Bottom. Come together\, get hot\, learn a little dan
 ce and show off. No solo dancing. No pressure. We're just here to get you 
 moving\, teach you some moves and laugh together. Wear comfy clothes\, and
  bring a water bottle. You will leave... A DANSEUR!!\n\nWho's it for?: Any
 one can participate\, all ages\, all levels. This is a great community eng
 agement workshop.\n\nWhen: Wednesday February 15th\, 6pm-7pm\n\nWhere: Mar
 ket Hall Performing Arts Centre\, 140 Charlotte Street.\n\nCost: Pick your
  price\, from $5 to $25.\n\nWho is Alyssa: Alyssa Martin (she/her) is a ch
 oreographer and director based in Tkaronto. She’s using an absurdist app
 roach to bake imaginative coping mechanisms into celebratory homemade spec
 tacles. Bluring dance\, theatre and comedy from an anti-patriarchal perspe
 ctive\, she founded a company called Rock Bottom Movement in 2012 alongsid
 e friends/collaborators. Their works play with irreverent winks at modern 
 dance and have been shared in seasons and festivals ranging in size throug
 hout the country and abroad. Outside of Rock Bottom\, Alyssa has choreogra
 phed for Toronto Dance Theatre\, The Stratford Festival\, Tarragon Theatre
 \, Canadian Contemporary Dance Theatre\, and in residence at arts centres 
 including The Banff Centre\, Canadian Stage and The National Ballet of Can
 ada (CreativAction). Public Energy is presenting the world premiere of her
  latest work with Rock Bottom Movement\, Sex Dalmatian\, on February 17 at
  the Market Hall.\n\nSPACES ARE LIMITED - Masking is optional\n\nPurchasin
 g a ticket to the workshop grants you free admission to the World Premiere
  of Sex Dalmatian! Happening February 17th @ 7:30 at Market Hall Performin
 g Art Centre. Simply select "yes I would like to attend the performance" d
 uring checkout and we'll see you there!\n\n\n DANCING for NON-DANCERS
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2023/01/26707_image.png
LOCATION:The Market Hall Performing Arts Centre\, 140 Charlotte Street\, Pe
 terborough\, ON K9J7Y8\, Peterborough\, ON\, K9J7Y8\, Canada
GEO:44.304158;-78.319321
