SUMMARY:You Got Me Dancing Fundraiser
DESCRIPTION:YOU GOT ME DANCING!\nDWP + the music of Leonard Cohen\nCelebrat
 ing Dancing with Parkinson's 15th Anniversary!\nIn collaboration with the 
 AGO\, join our DWP dancers for an afternoon of poetry\, music and movement
  exploring the powerful artistry of Canadian icon Leonard Cohen.\nAGO | MA
 R 5 | 1:00pm\nHosted by Anisa Tejpar\, featuring Côté Danse\, Broadway s
 tar Cary Shields\, and the New Choir!\nArt Gallery of Ontario 317 Dundas S
 t W\nOnline via Zoom\nAll details can be found at www.dancingwithparkinson
 s.com.\nDancing with Parkinson’s (DWP) is a registered Canadian charity 
 that offers free programs for seniors and people living with neurological 
 disorders. DWP’s programs are changing lives by bringing the joy of move
 ment and social connection to those most at risk of isolation. Every year\
 , over 3\,000 people dance with DWP from their homes\, retirement and long
 -term care and retirement communities. You Got Me Dancing Fundraiser
