SUMMARY:Dance at the Magic Treehouse - March Break Dance Camp
DESCRIPTION:Dance at the Magic Treehouse - March Break Dance Camp\nMarch 13
 -17\, 2023 | Ages 3-6\nAt Goh Ballet Bayview\, Bayview Village Shopping Ce
 ntre\, 2902 Bayview Ave.\, Toronto\nFrom March 13-17\, little dancers ages
  3-6 can join Goh Ballet for a dance adventure in our Magic Treehouse Marc
 h Break Program. Let your little dancer's imagination be dazzled with move
 ments\, music &amp\; story magic as they celebrate dance\, art &amp\; natu
 re through characterization. Every day we will explore whimsical creativit
 y in the branches of the Treehouse\, from making colourful crafts to danci
 ng around the enchanted studios.\nTheme: Celebrate Nature\nCelebrate all t
 he joys of springtime through dance. Get ready to twirl to the song of the
  birds chirping\; Jump to the rhythm of the Woodpecker pecking\; and skip 
 by the sparkling springs.\nThis half-day program from 9:00AM-12:00PM featu
 res ballet\, creative movement\, storytelling\, and themed arts and crafts
 . Registration is now open\, and spots are limited. Dance at the Magic Tre
 ehouse - March Break Dance Camp
