SUMMARY:Just Dance - March Break Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Just Dance - March Break Workshop\nMarch 13-17\, 2023 | Ages 7-
 10\nAt Goh Ballet Bayview\, Bayview Village Shopping Centre\, 2902 Bayview
  Ave.\, Toronto\n\nMarch break is the perfect time for new and aspiring da
 ncers to discover different disciplines\, unleash artistic expression and 
 improve technique. Experience a variety of dance styles\, get crafty\, and
  create cool video content to share\, all while making new friends in our 
 state-of-the-art facilities during this five-day March Break workshop for 
 ages 7-10.\n\nThis full-day program from 9:15AM-3:15PM features ballet\, m
 usical theatre\, jazz\, lyrical movement\, arts and crafts and video conte
 nt creation.\n\nRegistration is now open\, and spots are limited. For more
  information and to sign up\, please visit: https://www.gohballet.com/prog
 rams/spring-programs-bayview/ Just Dance - March Break Workshop
