 nce and fitness levels welcomed.\n\nLocation: 3581 Dundas St W\, York (Go
 tta Dance)\nEntry: $120+hst\n\nIncludes 5 classes\, a Carnival Spice T-Shi
 rt\, plus surprises &amp\; giveaways from our sponsors.\n\nTickets availab
