SUMMARY:May The Tease Be With You: Burlesque Inspired by Star Wars
DESCRIPTION:Calling all Rebels\, Resistance Fighters\, Droids and Sith! Pee
 pshowTO is gathering an unlikely crew for an evening of burlesque inspired
  by Star Wars.\n\nWe'll also be officially celebrating our 10 YEAR ANNIVER
 SARY! Join us to celebrate this milestone with a galactic evening that you
  won't want to miss! Tease is the Way!\n\nFull cast of performers to be an
 nounced soon!\n\nHosted by Velvet Valhalla &amp\; Ajay Fry\n\n------------
 -----------------------------------------\n\nDate: Friday\, April 14th 202
 3\n\nVenue: The Great Hall (1087 Queen Street West\, Toronto)\n\nTime: Doo
 rs at 8PM\, Show at 9PM\n\nIndividual Tickets:\n$25 Early Bird (Only avail
 able until Friday\, February 17th)\n$30 General Admission Advance\n$50 VIP
  Seating (Includes exclusive swag bag!)\n$35 at the Door (Cash only for do
 or tickets and merch)\n\n-------------------------------------------------
 ----\n\nAccessibility:\n\nThe entrance to the Great Hall's Main Hall inclu
 des a long staircase. The Main Hall is also accessible with an elevator be
 tween the lower floor and second floor of the building. Accessible washroo
 ms are located on both the lower level and the second floor. For any acces
 sibility requests or questions\, please don't hesitate to contact us at pe
 ekaboo@peepshowto.com\n\nCovid-19 Guidelines:\n\nAlthough masking is no lo
 nger mandatory in Ontario\, it is still recommended by Health Canada to we
 ar masks in indoor settings\, particularly in situations where physical di
 stancing may be difficult or impossible. We strongly encourage wearing a m
 ask at the show if youre able to. If you are experiencing any symptoms of 
 Covid-19 on the day of the show\, or have been exposed to someone who has 
 tested positive for Covid-19\, please kindly stay home!\n\n**This is a 19+
  Event**\n\nPlease use hashtag #maytheteasebewithyou when mentioning this 
 show on social media!\n\n&nbsp\; May The Tease Be With You: Burlesque Insp
 ired by Star Wars
