DESCRIPTION:Feel the music in this encouraging\, comfortable dance class fo
 r all levels.\n\n\n\nHave a great time grooving with friends in this dance
  class for seniors. Warm up with stretches and gentle moves. Then\, learn 
 elements from various dance styles. Offered in partnership with the Dance 
 Together Project.\n\nThis program is for seniors. Priority will be given t
 o valid RHPL card holders.\n\nProgram date: May 19 / 2:30-3:30 p.m.\n\nPro
 gram location: Oak Ridges Library\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nAbout Dance Together:\n\nD
 ance Together offers exceptionally fun and inclusive dance programs for ad
 ults with a mission to facilitate enjoyable and engaging dance experiences
  for everybody\, regardless of skill level or variations in physical abili
 ty. To learn more about Dance Together\, visit their website: https://www.
 dancetogetherproject.com/\n\n\n Dance Together! Dance Class for Seniors
