URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/junior-festival/
SUMMARY:JUNIOR Festival
DESCRIPTION:Harbourfront Centre is the place to be on long weekends! From M
 ay 20 to 22\, Toronto’s annual international children’s festival\, JUN
 IOR\, offers free family fun and internationally renowned ticketed perform
 ances. Step off the beaten path and enjoy the many adventures of growing u
 p. Revel in cultural celebrations and experience the limitless possibiliti
 es of movement and creativity\, led by local and international artists and
  storytellers. Featuring both free and ticketed programming\, festival per
 formances\, workshops and inclusive events for the entire family\, JUNIOR 
 will take place at indoor and outdoor venues across Harbourfront Centre’
 s 10-acre waterfront campus. Pre-registration is required for some of the 
 festival’s free programming\, including Storybook Search and the Noir Ex
 perience culinary workshops. For tickets and to view the complete festival
  lineup\, visit HarbourfrontCentre.com. JUNIOR Festival
