SUMMARY:Multicultural Dance and Performance Night
DESCRIPTION:Join us to celebrate dancers and performers while witnessing th
 eir talent and dance in the spirit of community.\n\n\n\nDance and movement
  is an integral part of culture with the power to move and transform entir
 e communities. Join us to celebrate dancers and performers while witnessin
 g their talent and dance in the spirit of community.\n\nDate: Thursday\, M
 ay 25th\n\nTime: 6:00 - 9:00\n\nLocation: MUSE Arts Creative Lab at Earlsc
 ourt Park (1369B St Clair Ave West)\n\nAbout the Festival:\n\nHAPPENING Mu
 lticultural Festival is the first and only Toronto festival created by com
 munity artists\, giving center-stage to the talent and skills of immigrant
 \, newcomer\, and refugee artists. This multi-arts platform includes music
 \, dance\, visual arts\, community-engaged arts\, storytelling\, spoken wo
 rd\, and poetry. HAPPENING gives space to embrace the cultural richness of
  our city while creating professional development opportunities for artist
 s\, as well as offering a platform for organizations to connect and form m
 eaningful collaborations.\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n\n Multicultural Dance and Perform
 ance Night
