SUMMARY:Adult Tap Classes
DESCRIPTION:TAP CLASSES with Allison Plamondon\n\n5 Week Session\nWednesday
 s May 31-June 28th\, 2023\nLearn and practice with the same group each wee
 k (no drop-ins).\n\n-Absolute Beginner- Wednesdays 7:30-8:30pm\nSuitable f
 or students with very little or no tap experience\nFocusing on learning ba
 sic tap steps such as shuffles\, flaps\, time steps\, and paradiddles.\nWe
 ’ll also learn a tap combination that we’ll build on every week.\nNo t
 ap shoes required\n\n-Relaxed Intermediate- Wednesdays 6-7:15pm\nSuitable 
 for students with some tap experience (2-3 years+)\nFocusing on technique\
 , musicality\, and connecting steps together.\n\nLocation:\nCitadel + Comp
 agnie\n304 Parliament St\nToronto\n\nCost:\n$100 payable by e-transfer\n\n
 Please contact allisonplamondon@gmail.com for more info and to register.\n
 \nA bit about Allison -\nAllison Plamondon is a choreographer\, director\,
  performer\, and teacher originally from Edmonton. Most recently\, Allison
  choreographed Grease at WCT as well as Irving Berlin’s White Christmas\
 , Damn Yankees\, and Holiday Inn all for the Shaw Festival. As a performer
 \, Allison has been onstage at some of North America’s most exciting ven
 ues including Madison Square Garden\, La MaMa\, Symphony Space\, the Charl
 ottetown Festival and the National Arts Centre.\nAn avid teacher\, Allison
  is passionate about sharing movement with dancers of all ages and abiliti
 es. New York teaching highlights include AMDA\, Queens Theater\, Tom Todor
 off Conservatory\, Abrons Arts Center and Broadway Dance Center. In Toront
 o\, Allison has been on the faculty at Sheridan College and Randolph Acade
 my. Allison completed the Uta Hagen Teacher Training at HB Studio in 2016 
 and is a certified GYROTONIC® and GYROKINESIS® Trainer. Adult Tap Classe
 s
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2023/05/Tap-Classes-w-Allison-Plamondon-2023.png
CATEGORIES:Tap
LOCATION:Citadel Ross Centre for Dance\, 304 Parliament St\, Toronto\, Onta
 rio\, M5A2Z6\, Canada
