URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/pushpull-dance-toronto-presents-th
 ose-were-the-days/
SUMMARY:PushPULL Dance Toronto presents: "Those Were the Days"
DESCRIPTION:PushPULL Dance Toronto is once again looking forward to welcomi
 ng a full house back to the Al Green Theatre and sharing this year’s mul
 timedia performance\, Those Were The Days. In an age in which technology s
 eems to move us forward faster every day\, we revel in looking back at the
  simpler times our memories hold with tenderness\, melancholy\, joy\, laug
 hter\, and of course\, dance.\n\nPushPULL is a community company of divers
 e adult dancers who have never been satisfied to let the days of our child
 hood dance be relegated to the realm of the nostalgic. In spite of our bus
 y lives\, we all continue to make space for our love of dance and find tim
 e to create\, collaborate\, and express through dance\, making new memorie
 s every year.\n\nPlease note that while mask mandates may feel a bit nosta
 lgic at this point\, mask wearing is still recommended at the theatre to p
 rotect the vulnerable folks in our audiences. PushPULL Dance Toronto prese
 nts: &quot\;Those Were the Days&quot\;
