URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/danceable-2023/
SUMMARY:DANCEABLE 2023
DESCRIPTION:Free\, all-inclusive Dance Party for those 10+!\n\n\n\nVariety 
 – the Children’s Charity and Substance Cares are excited to be back fo
 r the FREE\, all-inclusive dance party\, Danceable! Created for people of 
 all abilities to enjoy DanceAble is a fun\, inclusive event taking place a
 t Cabana Pool Bar right on Toronto’s waterfront.\n\nNew this year! LUX C
 arnival\n\nPacked with feathers\, gems\, and cultural appeal\, Lux Junior 
 Carnival celebrates culture and diversity through teaching Caribbean herit
 age\, costume making\, and the "Art of Mas". This an exciting addition and
  an incredible opportunity to bring more diversity\, recognition\, and cel
 ebrate a wider community as guests become a part of the carnival celebrati
 on.\n\nThis party is specifically created for those with varying ability l
 evels to be able to let loose and enjoy. This evening will be upbeat\, fun
  and welcoming for all who attend.\n\nEMCEE Tony Monaco \n\nTop 40 music b
 y DJ Danny D | DJ Drew | DJ Stevie P\n\n\n\n\n\n 	Tickets are required for
  every attendee.\n\n\n 	Walk-ins. If the event is sold out\, unfortunately
 \, we will have to turn walk-ins away. Please be sure to register for a ti
 cket to avoid any issues with entry.\n\n\n 	Parking: Parking is provided a
 t a half-price rate of $10 and will be limited so we suggest you arrive ea
 rly at the venue or arrange other modes of transportation.\n\n\n 	Pizza No
 va: There will be gluten-free and dairy-free\, but pizza is not both glute
 n and dairy-free. Pizza is limited - 1 slice per attendee\, first come fir
 st served. We suggest that you do not arrive on an empty stomach!\n\n\n 	C
 are facilities and day programs are welcome. Please note\, that this is an
  unsupervised event\, and guests who require extra assistance must bring t
 heir own caregiver. All individuals in attendance must have a ticket.\n\n\
 n 	Families are welcome to bring children\, family\, and friends under 10+
 \, however\, supervision is required. The venue is located on the waterfro
 nt and there is a pool nearby. We ask that guests exercise judgement and t
 ake extreme precautions. All individuals in attendance must have a ticket.
 \n\n\n 	Dress code is casual &amp\; comfortable.\n\n\n 	Wheel trans Pick-u
 ps: Please note there will be no Wheel-Trans announcements\, guest must wa
 it outside at their assigned times for pick-up.\n\nPhotography/Video Event
  Disclaimer Crowd Release Notice\n\nBy taking part in this event you grant
  the event organizers full rights to use the images resulting from the pho
 tography/video filming\, and any reproductions or adaptations of the image
 s for fundraising\, publicity or other purposes to help achieve the group'
 s aims. This might include (but is not limited to)\, the right to use them
  in their printed and online publicity\, social media\, press releases and
  funding applications without compensation. If you do not wish to be photo
 graphed please inform an event organizer.\n\n\n DANCEABLE 2023
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2023/05/27191_image.jpg
