SUMMARY:Trinbago Toronto 2023
DESCRIPTION:Trinbago Toronto returns in 2023 with a bigger and better event
  on August 26th and 27th. Last year saw 18\,000 attendees flooding Yonge-D
 undas Square for a truly magical weekend. This year's festival celebrates 
 the accomplishments of the Trinidad and Tobago diaspora across academia\, 
 cuisine\, sports\, film\, music\, business\, and more. The event\, present
 ed by Trinidad Tourism Limited and supported by the Tobago Tourism Agency 
 Limited\, highlights the contributions of Trinbagonians in Canada and aims
  to bring the community together to showcase their culture and resilience.
  The festival takes place at Yonge-Dundas Square and aims to inspire a Tri
 nidad and Tobago experience for all attendees. Trinbago Toronto 2023
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2023/08/trinbago.jpg
