SUMMARY:Havana Night Social Dance Party at Access Ballroom Toronto Beaches
DESCRIPTION:Join us to experience the vibrant and lively atmosphere of Hava
 na\, without having to hop on the plane! Our annual Havana Night Social Da
 nce Party on August 26th will transport you to the streets of Cuba while y
 ou enjoy an unforgettable evening of social dancing.\nExpect to enjoy the 
 night of social dancing\, dance performances\, great music\, and complimen
 tary refreshments. And make sure you take the Salsa dance class at the beg
 inning of the party to get into the groove!\nOur party will feature a vari
 ety of Latin (and not only!!) dance styles\, including Salsa\, Bachata\, a
 nd Merengue\, all set to the beat of your favorite tunes.\nOpen to all –
  complete beginners and advanced dancers\, solos and couples! Our friendly
  and experienced instructors will be on hand to guide you through the step
 s and ensure that everyone feels comfortable and confident on the dance fl
 oor\, so no dance experience or partner is required.\nWe look forward to d
 ancing with you! Havana Night Social Dance Party at Access Ballroom Toront
 o Beaches
