 ay Oct 9)\nRegistration: $145 for 8 wks (includes taxes)\nThis class is fo
 r those who are new to flamenco and those who may have a bit of experience
 . This fun class teaches all the basics of flamenco dance while learning a
  lively dance called ‘Rumba Flamenca”. Students can wear any workout s
 tyle clothes with leather –soled shoes with a bit of a heel. Check out t
 he music by Roger Scannura that will help you get acquainted with Rumba Fl
 amenca!\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IZsutLbMe1U\n\nMore info upon r
 egistration by emailing vscannura@gmail.com\nE TRANSFER to vscannura@gmail
 .com\nDirect PayPal link: https://www.paypal.me/ritmoflamenco Introduction
  to Flamenco
