URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/adult-tap-classes-2/
SUMMARY:Adult Tap Classes
DESCRIPTION:TAP CLASSES with Allison Plamondon\n\n6 Week Session\nThursdays
 \, September 14-October 19th\, 2023\n\nLearn and practice with the same gr
 oup each week (no drop-ins).\n\nRelaxed Intermediate- Thursdays 6:05-7:20p
 m\nSuitable for students with some tap experience (3 years+)\nFocusing on 
 technique\, musicality\, and connecting steps together.\n\nContinuing Begi
 nner- Thursdays 7:30-8:30pm\nSuitable for students with very little tap ex
 perience.\nFocusing on basic tap steps such as shuffles\, flaps\, time ste
 ps\, and paradiddles. We’ll also learn a tap combination that we’ll bu
 ild on every week.\n\nLocation:\nThe S.P.A.C.E\n932 Danforth Ave\n\nCost:\
 n$125 payable by e-transfer\n\nPlease contact allisonplamondon@gmail.com
  for more info and to register.\n\nA bit about Allison -\nAllison Plamond
 on is a choreographer\, director\, performer\, and teacher originally from
  Edmonton. Most recently\, Allison choreographed Grease at WCT as well as 
 Irving Berlin’s White Christmas\, Damn Yankees\, and Holiday Inn all for
  the Shaw Festival. As a performer\, Allison has been onstage at some of N
 orth America’s most exciting venues including Madison Square Garden\, La
  MaMa\, Symphony Space\, the Charlottetown Festival and the National Arts 
 Centre.\nAn avid teacher\, Allison is passionate about sharing movement wi
 th dancers of all ages and abilities. New York teaching highlights include
  AMDA\, Queens Theater\, Tom Todoroff Conservatory\, Abrons Arts Center an
 d Broadway Dance Center. In Toronto\, Allison has been on the faculty at S
 heridan College and Randolph Academy. Allison completed the Uta Hagen Teac
 her Training at HB Studio in 2016 and is a certified GYROTONIC® and GYROK
 INESIS® Trainer. Adult Tap Classes
