URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/september-toronto-silent-disco/
SUMMARY:September Toronto Silent Disco
DESCRIPTION:A Silent Disco is an outdoor dance party where participants dow
 nload a 1.5 hour track\, hit play at the same time\, and dance!\n\n\n\nJoi
 n us for an unforgettable afternoon of music\, dancing\, and pure fun at t
 he September Toronto Silent Disco! A silent disco is an outdoor dance part
 y where participants download a 1.5 hour mp3 file\, put on headphones\, an
 d dance to their hearts content. It will be on Saturday\, September 30th\,
  starting at Augusta Square park.\n\nAll are welcome! This is a super fun 
 opportunity to let loose\, get some endorphins running\, and have a good t
 ime while the weather is still nice. On the chance of rain this event will
  be moved to the Path with exact locations to be announced in that event.\
 n\n\n September Toronto Silent Disco
