SUMMARY:Cuban Fusion with Dailyn Martinez
DESCRIPTION:In this workshop we will play with various Cuban Rhythms\, such
  as Mambo\, Cha-cha-cha\, Salsa and Reggaeton. All ages welcome!\n\n\n\nIn
  this workshop we will play with various Cuban Rhythms\, such as Mambo\, C
 hachacha\, Salsa and Reggaeton. Dailyn Martinez will guide you through the
  basic footwork and body movement in her signature style of Shumdesalsa. A
 ll ages welcome!\n\nFree to attend\, please register to secure your spot!\
 n\nThis workshop is part of Dance Together Festival York Region. It is fre
 e for participants\, thanks to the generous support of the Richmond Hill C
 ommunity and Cultural Grant Program and in partnership with Assembly Park\
