DESCRIPTION:Our women’s Bollywood Dance Fitness program is a dance workou
 t that combines easy-to-follow dance movements and exercises and beautiful
  rhythms spanning from South Asia to the Middle East.\n\nNo dance experien
 ce is required. This is a low to moderate-impact class to accommodate wome
 n of all fitness levels and ages\nWelcoming moms and their teenage daughte
 rs to create time for mother and daughter bonding.\n\nThis is a community-
 based program that runs for 12-week sessions three times per year.\n\nTo s
 ign up for a class or for more info\, please visit our website. Women&#039
 \;s Bollywood Dance Fitness Program - Spadina and Bloor
