SUMMARY:Night Shift 2023
DESCRIPTION:Night Shift is a late-night event that showcases innovative and
  thought-provoking dance by today’s dynamic movement makers. Join us at 
 The Citadel: Ross Centre for Dance\, for an immersive experience like no o
 ther. The series investigates themes of identity and human connection and 
 offers a powerful examination of current issues through different cultural
  and generational perspectives.\n\nProgrammed by distinguished dance artis
 ts Penny Couchie\, Christine Friday and Dedra McDermott\, this highly anti
 cipated late-night dance series returns live October 5-7\, 2023. All perfo
 rmances and livestreams begin at 10PM EDT.\n\nDetails and ticket: https://
 www.citadelcie.com/event/night-shift-2023/ Night Shift 2023
