SUMMARY:Toronto Swing Dance Society Dance with music by Danny Marks Combo
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Swing Dance Society is hosting our next dance on Friday
  October 13th. Join us for a fun filled evening of all styles of swing dan
 cing to music by Danny Marks. Beginners Welcome. No partner required\n\n7:
 30- Doors Open\n8:00-11:00 pm- Dance to music by Danny Marks Combo (variet
 y of DJ music during the breaks\, may include some Latin and Ballroom)\nBE
 VERLEY HALLS \, 206 Beverley Street\, Toronto\, M5T 1Z3\nMembers $5/Non-me
 mbers $10 (Cash only\, exact change appreciated)\nOur dances are open to e
 veryone.\nBeginners are always welcome at our events.\n\nYou don’t need 
 to bring a partner. Most people who come to our dances don’t come with a
  “designated partner”.\nBring your own water bottle.\nContact Jay for 
 more information\, info@torontoswingdancesociety.ca\nOr visit http://toron
 toswingdancesociety.ca/friday-dances/ Toronto Swing Dance Society Dance wi
 th music by Danny Marks Combo
