SUMMARY:Dance Through the Decades - An Intergenerational Dance Party
DESCRIPTION:Whether you’re 5 or 95 there’s fun for the whole family at 
 the first ever intergenerational dance festival at Evergreen Brick Works!\
 n\n\n\nPut on your dancing shoes and join us for an afternoon of singing\,
  dancing\, and live perfromances in BMO Atrium at the Evergreen Brick Work
 s!\n\n2B1Music Duo will be singing your favourite songs live\, along with 
 Samba Dancers\, Drag Performances and a Nia Fitness dance class with Jenni
 fer Hicks. Featuring a caricature artist\, face painter\, food\, prizes an
 d more!\n\nCheck out the Brick Works Farmer’s Market and stay for the pa
 rty as we sing and dance to celebrate our community and all the diversity 
 that Toronto has to offer!\n\n*No registration required*\n\n\n\n Dance Thr
 ough the Decades - An Intergenerational Dance Party
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2023/09/27328_image.jpg
