 ng-event-for-dinner-with-dignity/
SUMMARY:80's Dance Party Reboot - A Fundraising Event for Dinner with Digni
 ty
DESCRIPTION:Remember Motley Crue\, mullets and mall hair? What about Rick
  Astley and Reeboks? And don't forget Spandau Ballet and Spandex.\n\n\n\n
 Remember Motley Crue\, mullets and mall hair? What about Rick Astley and
  Reeboks? And don't forget Spandau Ballet and Spandex. The 80s set the go
 ld standard for music and fashion.\n\nHere is your chance to relive that m
 agical decade. Rock-out to your favorite dance tunes with good friends\, f
 or a good cause. 80s attire and hairstyles are optional\, but highly reco
 mmended.\n\nThere will be a cash bar\, snacks and a plethora of embarrassi
 ng moments as old people pretend to be young.\n\nTickets are $30 (plus a s
 ervice fee of $3.28) on Eventbrite and $35 at the door. This event is cash
  only. There are multiple bank machines a short stumble from the venue.\n\
 nMoney raised will go to Dinner with Dignity\, a community kitchen that s
 erves delicious and nutritious meals to about 100 people every Sunday. Me
 als are created and served by volunteers in a safe and welcoming space.\n\
 nCan't attend but want to support DWD? Head over to tickets and click on t
 he donation button.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hAYogbS9BMU\n\n&nbs
 p\;\n\n\n 80&#039\;s Dance Party Reboot - A Fundraising Event for Dinner w
 ith Dignity
