SUMMARY:FREE Weekly Salsa Dance Class in Cooksville
DESCRIPTION:Join our salsa dance classes\, in Cooksville Mississauga!\n\n\n
 \nAttention Cooksville!\n\nJoin Heart Comonos every Monday evening for our
  FREE salsa dance classes\, suitable for those aged 14+.\n\nThese classes 
 are perfect for anyone interested in learning salsa dancing\, for those wh
 o are looking to get out of the house\, move their body/ break a sweat and
  maybe even make some new friends.\n\nAll classes in this series are begin
 ner- friendly. Come as you are!\n\nPlease arrive 15 minutes early for each
  class so we may begin on time.\n\nQuestions? Email heartcomonos@gmail.com
 \n\n\n FREE Weekly Salsa Dance Class in Cooksville
