SUMMARY:Stompin' Boots With Cheatin' Hearts
DESCRIPTION:Friday Night Dance Parties\n\n\n\nWe are so excited to host a F
 riday Night Dance Party WOMEN OF COUNTRY\, THEMED!\n\nWhat is Stompin’ B
 oots with Cheatin’ Hearts? It is a place where we gather to have FUN on 
 Friday nights – a chance to line dance to country music or dance to the 
 top 100 songs.\n\nPLUS Cheatin’ Hearts will teach you 4 line dances thro
 ughout the night!\n\nEveryone Welcome – Adults ONLY – NO cover charge 
 – NO Judgement - Cash Bar – COMPLIMENTARY Snacks – Limited Capacity-
  ID &amp\; RSVP required\n\nWhere? Claremont Legion 4937 Old Brock Rd\, Cl
