SUMMARY:Dance Arts Institute Open House 2023
DESCRIPTION:Join us to learn more about our full-time post-secondary Profes
 sional Training Program in Contemporary dance.\n\n\n\nDance Arts Institute
  invites you to join our Open House on November 10\, 2023 to learn more ab
 out our three-year full-time Professional Training Program.\n\nProspective
  students who are interested in pursuing post-secondary education in Conte
 mporary dance can take this opportunity to explore our integrated studio-b
 ased program that prepares students for a professional dance career.\n\nDu
 ring the Open House\, you will\n\n 	participate in an engaging Contemporar
 y dance technique class\,\n 	observe our talented students at work\,\n 	an
 d tour our purpose-built dance facility and nearby amenities.\n\n&nbsp\;\n
 \nFollowing that will be a dynamic Q&amp\;A discussion period\, where you 
 can connect directly with our staff who will provide you with a detailed u
 nderstanding of our innovative and student-centered approach to our compre
 hensive curriculum.\n\nDon't miss this opportunity to discover the artistr
 y\, dedication\, and excellence that define Dance Arts Institute. Register
  now for a memorable Open House experience that could shape your path towa
 rds a fulfilling professional dance career!\n\n\n Dance Arts Institute Ope
 n House 2023
