 e looking forward to connecting with you! No skill level is needed and it'
 s FREE for the public.\n\nRegistration is required through the official we
 bsite link - https://tidfcanada.com/event\n\nGouri Kundu - is a promising 
 Kathak dancer. She was introduced to Kathak Dance\, one of the eight class
 ical dances of India\, from the tender age of five years under the guidanc
 e of Guru Smt. Sreelekha Mukherjee. She is now under the tutelage of Katha
 k exponent and Guru Dr. Malabika Mitra for the past 15 years. Being a dili
 gent student\, she has imbibed the essence of both ‘Lucknow’ and ‘Ja
 ipur’ Gharanas of Kathak. The vigor of Jaipur and the soft delicacy of L
 ucknow are immaculately blended in her performance. She has performed in v
 arious dance festivals in India and abroad. She has also won the state-lev
 el Kathak competition in India and received many other recognitions.\n\n&n
 bsp\;\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=K8wlW4zegTE TIDF 2023 - Dance Wor
 kshop 2
