 t! DJ Brendon will be spinning irresistible Latin beats\, keeping the danc
 e floor sizzling from start to finish. Want to perfect your bachata moves?
  Join Mike from 7:30 to 8:30 for complimentary lessons that cater to all s
 kill levels. But that's not all\; the fun doesn't stop there! We've got yo
 u covered with complimentary bowling\, top golf\, and arcade games to keep
  the party going all night long. Don't miss this unforgettable evening of 
 Latin rhythm\, dance\, and entertainment!\n\nNon-members registered throug
 h Eventbrite or OpenTable may enter Catalyst for free. All guests must sig
 n waiver. Entry into the gym space beyond Catalyst is strictly prohibited.
 \n\n\n Latin Dance Night!
