SUMMARY:Durham Dance Clinic and Social
DESCRIPTION:Dance all day and all night at the Durham Dance Clinic! Enjoy t
 wo (2) workshops\, a class\, and an evening social.\n\nHarmony in Motion M
 usicality Workshop (3 hours): Discover how to better interpret and express
  music through your movements. Dive into diverse music styles and learn ho
 w to incorporate musical accents and syncopations into your social dancing
 .\n\nPartner Connection Workshop (3 hours): Explore the basics of partner 
 connection in social dancing. Establish a strong\,\nphysical connection an
 d effectively communicate through body language and signals.\n\nPre-Social
  Kizomba class (1 hour): Enjoy an introductory Kizomba class.\n\nSocial (3
  hours): 50% Salsa\, 20% Bachata\, 20% Kizomba\, 10% Cha Cha and Merengue.
 \n\nSolina Community Hall\n1964 Conc. Rd. 6\, Clarington\n$85 for day / $1
 5 social only\nseekingsabor@gmail.com Durham Dance Clinic and Social
