SUMMARY:Jump &amp\; Lime: Soca Dance Class
DESCRIPTION:Join us at this special Fitness Event as we continue to celebra
 te 10 beautiful years of Carnival Spice!\n\nYou will enjoy:\n\n• a signa
 ture 'Sweat with Spice' dance fitness class\n\n• fun interactive games &
 amp\; mingling with the Spice Team\n\n• an exclusive look back at specia
