DESCRIPTION:Dance with us and meet new friends! All are welcome!\n\n\n\nBol
 lywood dancing is a colourful\, dynamic and highly theatrical dance style 
 seen in Indian films. Bhangra is a type of traditional folk dance originat
 ing from the Punjab region of South Asia. It is associated with the Punjab
 i culture.\n\nOur FREE weekly classes will teach you the basics of these d
 ance styles\, in a cozy coffee-shop turned dance studio!\n\nAll classes in
  this series are beginner-friendly. Come as you are!\n\nPlease arrive 15 m
 inutes early for each class so we may begin on time.\n\nQuestions? Email h
 eartcomonos@gmail.com\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n\n Bollywood &amp\; Bhangra Dance Clas
