URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/frontiers-frontieres-and-water-spi
 rit/
SUMMARY:FRONTIERS | FRONTIÈRES and WATER SPIRIT
DESCRIPTION:Lua Shayenne Dance Company presents the Canadian Premiere of tw
 o new works FRONTIERS | FRONTIÈRES &amp\; WATER SPIRIT at Betty Oliphant 
 Theatre from January 25-27\, 2024.\n\nThis Lua Shayenne Dance Company prod
 uction\, running January 25-27\, 2024\, features two new works that draw f
 rom the artistry of the African diaspora\, the research and the lived expe
 rience of the choreographer Lua Shayenne\, to explore themes related to hu
 man migration\, identity\, spirituality\, and the mystical elements associ
 ated with Mami Wata in African and Afro-Caribbean traditions.\n\nDancers i
 nclude Lua Shayenne\, Rosie Harbans\, Miranda Liverpool\, Kwasi Obeng Adje
 i\, Aisha Nicholson\, and Kemora Manning. The composer for FRONTIERS | FRO
 NTIÈRES is Yohance Francis Parsons\, and the composer for WATER SPIRIT is
  Fara Tolno\, with musicians Yohance Francis Parsons\, Cécé Haba\, Kemar
  Scarlett\, Kevin Howe\, and Connor “Chino” Chang. FRONTIERS | FRONTI
 ÈRES and WATER SPIRIT
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
