 s largest and longest-running Black Futures Month festival. For more infor
 mation\, visit HarbourfrontCentre.com\n\nThe venue:\n\nThe Harbourfront Ce
 ntre - Brigantine Room\n235 Queens Quay West\nToronto ON M5J 2G8\nCanada\n
