SUMMARY:Harbourfront Centre and DanceWorks present Deciphers
DESCRIPTION:Harbourfront Centre and DanceWorks present the Ontario premiere
  of the thought-provoking dance/theatre hybrid Deciphers\, performed and c
 horeographed by independent dancemakers Naishi Wang and Jean Abreu\, on st
 age February 8–10\, 2024 at 7:30pm at Harbourfront Centre Theatre\, as p
 art of its 2023/24 international contemporary dance series\, Torque. Pairi
 ng elements of traditional Chinese and Brazilian dance styles with spoken 
 word\, the contemporary duet is an intensely physical cultural exchange\, 
 exploring the immigrant experience\, communication across cultural divides
  and the transcendent nature of human identity. For tickets and informatio
 n\, visit HarbourfrontCentre.com Harbourfront Centre and DanceWorks presen
 t Deciphers
