SUMMARY:Between me and you
DESCRIPTION:Choreographed and Performed by Heidi Strauss\n\nbetween me and 
 you is a solo work that plays with the inconsistency of memory. It opens a
  conversation between the real and represented\, personal and relational\,
  past and present. Here movement unfolds as response. We witness each othe
 r. Momentary points of connection slip in and out of our consciousness so 
 that\, slowly\, the space between us changes. Between me and you
