SUMMARY:Omaagomaan
DESCRIPTION:Native Earth Performing Arts is proud to present Omaagomaan by 
 Waawaate Fobister at Aki Studio from February 15-18\, 2024. This dance pie
 ce choreographed and performed by multiple Dora Award winner Waawaate Fobi
 ster\, and originally directed by the late Troy Emery Twigg\, uses movemen
 t\, sound\, and storytelling to illustrate the fierce land defenders of Gr
 assy Narrows in the face of ongoing logging and the lasting effects of mer
 cury poisoning.\n\nFebruary 15-17 at 7:30pm\nFebruary 18 at 2pm Omaagomaan
