 -win-air-canada-vacation-voucher-tv/
SUMMARY:Valentines Dinner and Dance at Casa Ricca Banquet Hall
DESCRIPTION:Indulge in an Unforgettable Valentine's Dinner &amp\; Dance Exp
 erience! Join us for a night of exquisite romance and celebration.\n\n\n\n
 &#x1f496\;&#x2728\; Indulge in an Unforgettable Valentine's Dinner &amp\; 
 Dance Experience! &#x2728\;&#x1f496\;Join us for a night of exquisite roma
 nce and celebration at our Valentine's Dinner and Dance event!\n\n&#x1f4c6
 \; Event Details: Saturday February 17\, 2024 | 7pm\n\nCASA RICCA BANQUET 
 HALL | 4801 STEELES AVE WEST\, Toronto\n\nPRICE:\n\nFIRST 200 TICKETS $75 
 P/P +HST\n\n$90 P/P +HST once sale ends\n\nPrepare your senses for a culin
 ary journey and enchanting entertainment.\n\nHere's a glimpse of what awai
 ts you:\n\n&#x1f37d\;&#xfe0f\; 3-Course Culinary Extravaganza:\n\nExperien
 ce love on a plate with our specially crafted menu\, dinner begins at 8pm:
 \n\n 	Starter: Heart-shaped Three Cheese Ravioli in a luscious Rose Sauce\
 n 	Main Course: Succulent 8oz Veal Chop served with Roasted Potatoes and S
 easonal Veggies\n 	Salad Bowl per Table to complement your dining experien
 ce\n 	Dessert Course to satisfy your sweet cravings\n\n&#x1f3b6\; DJ Enter
 tainment:Groove to the rhythm of love with our dynamic DJ Kreation! They'l
 l be spinning a mix of romantic tunes and upbeat tracks to set the perfect
  mood for the evening.\n\n&#x1f483\;&#x1f57a\; Captivating Dance Show:Be m
 esmerized by a breathtaking dance show that promises to add flair and eleg
 ance to your night. Our talented performers will leave you in awe with the
 ir enchanting moves.\n\n&#x1f4f8\; 360 Photo Booth and Stunning Backdrop:I
 mmerse yourself in the magic of the moment with our 360 Photo Booth! Strik
 e poses against our stunning backdrop\, creating picture-perfect memories 
 that you'll cherish forever.\n\n&#x1f378\;&#x1f942\; Cash Bar:Raise a toas
 t to love and laughter at our cash bar! Indulge in a selection of beverage
 s\, from handcrafted cocktails to fine wines\, ensuring a night filled wit
 h delightful sips.\n\n&#x1f381\; Chance to Win Fantastic Prizes:As our way
  of spreading the love\, every ticket purchase grants you an entry to win 
 fabulous prizes! Two lucky winners will have the chance to take home 4k LE
 D TV and another Two winners have a chance to with Air Canada voucher\, ea
 ch valued at $500.\n\n&#x1f39f\;&#xfe0f\; Secure Your Tickets:Visit casari
 cca.ca to reserve your spot for an enchanting evening filled with gourmet 
 delights\, sensational entertainment\, and the chance to win incredible pr
 izes.Let love be the guide as we create magical moments together.\n\nThis 
 Valentine's\, let's dance\, dine\, and celebrate the beauty of connection.
  See you there! &#x1f491\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&#x2728\; Valentine's Dinner and 
 Dance Event Rules:Ticket Policy\n\n 	All attendees must have a valid ticke
 t for entry.\n 	Tickets are non-refundable.\n\nAge Restriction:\n\n 	This 
 event is open to all individuals.\n 	ID verification may be required for d
 rink purchase or age verification.\n\nDress Code:\n\n 	Please adhere to th
 e formal dress code.\n\nRespectful Conduct:\n\n 	All attendees are expecte
 d to treat others with respect and courtesy.\n 	Any form of harassment\, d
 iscrimination\, or disruptive behavior will not be tolerated.\n\nDining Et
 iquette:\n\n 	Enjoy the 3-course dinner with courtesy and respect for fell
 ow diners.\n 	Dietary preferences and allergies should be communicated in 
 advance.\n\nAlcohol Policy:\n\n 	The event features a cash bar\; please dr
 ink responsibly.\n 	Individuals must be of legal drinking age to purchase 
 alcoholic beverages.\n\nPrize Draw Rules:\n\n 	All attendees are automatic
 ally entered into the prize draw with their ticket purchase.\n 	Winners wi
 ll be announced at 11:30pm. Attendance is required to win.\n\nLost and Fou
 nd:\n\n 	Report any lost items to event staff.\n 	Event organizers are not
  responsible for lost or stolen personal belongings.\n\nEvent Timings:\n\n
  	Adhere to the schedule provided for dinner\, entertainment\, and other a
