SUMMARY:Sex Dalmatian
DESCRIPTION:CITADEL LIVE PRESENTS\nSex Dalmatian\nChoreographed by Alyssa M
 artin\n\nRecipient of 3 Dora Mavor Moore Awards (Dance Division) – Outst
 anding Performance by an Ensemble\, Outstanding Choreography\, Outstanding
  Production\n\nThe tragic tale of Sex Dalmatian\, the canine business mogu
 l we love to hate (or\, love to love\, whatever gnaws your bone!). Through
  dance theatre glam drama\, we romp through the twisted hellscape of the w
 ellness industry\, the heartbreak industry and the insides of our own brai
 ns. Leash up to experience the many sides of Sex Dalmatian\, her too eager
  assistant\, Amalia\, and her psychosexually charged arch nemesis\, Mr. Me
 eks\, as they shove heavy feelings into bizarre containers while shining a
  humorous light on some of the darker corners of the collective consciousn
 ess. Sex Dalmatian
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2023/10/DSC01798-by-Alyssa-Martin.jpeg
