URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/open-studio-cinnamoon-collective/
SUMMARY:Open Studio: CinnaMoon Collective
DESCRIPTION:Curious what a dance rehearsal process may be like? Come observ
 e a dance rehearsal of CinnaMoon Collective!\n\n\n\nCurious what a dance r
 ehearsal process may be like? It is different for each and every artist. C
 ome by Assembly Park Studios and take a sneak peek into the process of Cin
 naMoon Collective!\n\nCinnaMoon Collective\, co-founded by dance artists N
 ickeshia Garrick and Irma Villafuerte\, is a Central American and Afro-Car
 ibbean contemporary dance duo that is dedicated to reclaiming and honourin
 g ancestral stories from a decolonial perspective\, with the mission to ig
 nite collective healing and recontextualize identity through the lens of b
 lack\, indigenous and racialized femme presenting queer bodies.\n\nhttps:/
 /www.instagram.com/cinnamoon.collective/\n\nPhoto by Enzo Romero / @enzoro
 mero\n\nThis open studio event is part of the Dance Together Residencies a
 t Assembly Park. Presented in partnership with the Dance Together Project\
 , Assembly Park\, and York Region Arts Council.\n\nFree to attend\, please
  register to secure your spot!\n\n\n Open Studio: CinnaMoon Collective
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2024/03/27759_image.jpg
