 -in-the-enchanted-garden-ages-7-9/
SUMMARY:Bayview - March Break Workshop: Dance in the Enchanted Garden (Ages
  7-9)
DESCRIPTION:Monday\, March 11 - Friday\, March 15\, 2024\n\nLimited spaces 
 available\, so RESERVE YOUR SPOT with this one-time New Student Registrati
 on Fee!\n\nOnce you have reserved your spot\, Goh Ballet Bayview will reac
 h out to complete your regsitration process and to confirm your enrolment.
 \n\nREGISTRATIONS ARE NON-REFUNDABLE &amp\; NON-TRANSFERABLE.\n\nOne Week 
 Enrolment Tuition = $375.00 + HST\n\nBefore Care Add-On: 12:30pm - 1:00pm 
 = $50.00 + HST (one week inclusive)\n\nAfter Care Add-On: 4:00pm - 5:00pm 
 = $75.00 + HST (one week inclusive)\n\nOur talented instructors will guide
  the dancers through our carefully curated ballet classes that focus on bu
 ilding artistic expression\, musical appreciation\, self-confidence\, and 
 body awareness. Dancers also express themselves through arts and crafts th
 at come to life with our themes of magic and nature. On the final day of t
 he workshop\, dancers will participate in an interactive 'Unicorn' Princes
 s experience with singing\, dancing and games!\n\nThe workshop will take p
 lace in person at Goh Ballet Bayview\, located in a convenient and accessi
 ble location. Our spacious and well-equipped dance studio provides the per
 fect environment for your child to learn and have fun.\n\nSo mark your cal
 endars for Monday\, March 11 - 15\, 2024\, from 1:00 PM - 4:00 PM (Eastern
  Daylight Time)\, and let your child experience the joy of 'Dance in the E
 nchanted Garden'. Don't miss out on this wonderful opportunity to nurture 
 their love for movement and creativity!\n\nPlease contact bayview@gohballe
 t.com or call 416-628-1999 for more information. Bayview - March Break Wor
 kshop: Dance in the Enchanted Garden (Ages 7-9)
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2024/02/BAYVIEW-EB-BANNER-JUNIOR-Copy.png
CATEGORIES:Ballet,Kids / Youth
LOCATION:Goh Ballet Bayview\, Unit 132A\, 2901 Bayview Avenue\, Toronto\, O
 N\, Canada
