URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/goh-bayview-march-break-workshop-d
 ance-at-the-magic-treehouse-ages-3-6/
SUMMARY:Goh Bayview - March Break Workshop: Dance at the Magic Treehouse (A
 ges 3-6)
DESCRIPTION:Monday\, March 11 - Friday\, March 15\, 2024\n\nLimited spaces 
 available\, so RESERVE YOUR SPOT with this one-time New Student Registrati
 on Fee!\n\nOnce you have reserved your spot\, Goh Ballet Bayview will reac
 h out to complete your regsitration process and to confirm your enrolment.
 \n\nREGISTRATIONS ARE NON-REFUNDABLE &amp\; NON-TRANSFERABLE.\n\nOne Week 
 Enrolment Tuition = $375.00 + HST\n\nBefore Care Add-On: 8:30am - 9:00am =
  $50.00 + HST (one week inclusive)\n\nAfter Care Add-On: 12:00pm - 1:00pm 
 = $75.00 + HST (one week inclusive)\n\nJoin us for an exciting dance works
 hop at Goh Ballet Bayview during the March Break! This fun-filled event is
  perfect for children aged 3 to 6. Get ready to embark on a magical advent
 ure as we explore the enchanting world of Dance at the Magic Treehouse.\n\
 nOur talented instructors will guide the little ones through carefully cur
 ated ballet classes helping them develop coordination\, rhythm\, and creat
 ivity. With imaginative storytelling\, music\, and arts and crafts\, your 
 child will be transported to a whimsical realm where they can let their im
 agination soar with our themes of magic and nature. On the final day of th
 e workshop\, dancers will participate in an interactive 'Unicorn' Princess
  experience with singing\, dancing and games!\n\nThe workshop will take pl
 ace in person at Goh Ballet Bayview\, located in a convenient and accessib
 le location. Our spacious and well-equipped dance studio provides the perf
 ect environment for your child to learn and have fun.\n\nSo mark your cale
 ndars for Monday\, March 11 - 15\, 2024\, from 9:00 am - 12:00pm (Eastern 
 Daylight Time)\, and let your child experience the joy of 'Dance at the Ma
 gic Treehouse'. Don't miss out on this wonderful opportunity to nurture th
 eir love for movement and creativity!\n\nPlease reach out to bayview@gohba
 llet.com or call 416-628-1999 for more information. Goh Bayview - March Br
 eak Workshop: Dance at the Magic Treehouse (Ages 3-6)
