URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/ohdcs-jubilee-25th-anniversary-dan
 ce-show/
SUMMARY:OHDC’s Jubilee 25th Anniversary Dance Show
DESCRIPTION:A jubilee is the celebration of an anniversary - and what an an
 niversary this is!\n\n25 years ago\, before the turn of the millennium\, t
 he Only Human Dance Collective was formed to be a truly inclusive dance co
 mpany. Our mission is to promote both a love of dance and an opportunity t
 o learn and perform\, regardless of experience or ability. Over the last t
 wo and a half decades\, OHDC has introduced many to the world of dance\, r
 eacquainted seasoned dancers with their first love\, and created a home fo
 r those who have moved away from their original studios.\n\nThis year\, we
  celebrate our 25th anniversary with our show\, Jubilee! A jubilee can be 
 light and playful\, or somber and reflective. We've taken this season as a
 n opportunity to rejoice about all the things we've accomplished\, in danc
 e and in our lives\, and to joyfully plan for what is yet to come.\n\nWe a
 re proud to present a family-friendly show featuring original works of cho
 reography in a variety of styles. Wheelchair accessible venue. OHDC’s Ju
 bilee 25th Anniversary Dance Show
