URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/the-chimera-project-dance-theatre-
 presents-unclearing/
SUMMARY:The Chimera Project Dance Theatre Presents Unclearing
DESCRIPTION:The Chimera Project Dance Theatre presents Unclearing\, an extr
 aordinary double bill featuring two world premieres at Harbourfront Centre
  Theatre on April 5 &amp\; 6\, 2024.\n\nCo-created by choreographer Sophie
  Dow and composer/musician Laura Reznek\, Agrimony navigates the delicate 
 balance between a captivating live concert experience and deeply embodied 
 contemporary dance. Delving into the human condition\, Agrimony explores o
 ur relentless pursuit of authenticity in a society that often compels us t
 o conceal our true selves.\n\nChoreographed by Chimera's founding Artistic
  Director\, Malgorzata Nowacka-May\, Soft is a dynamic collision between t
 he dissonance of mundane daily routines and the primal fear that inhibits 
 us from reaching our fullest potential. With an original score by composer
  Eric Cadesky\, Soft ignites the stage with athleticism and emotional inte
 nsity. The Chimera Project Dance Theatre Presents Unclearing
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2024/03/03_Soft_photo-credit-David-Hou_Provided-by-The-Chimera-Project-Dan
 ce-Theatre_One-Time-Use-copy-1.jpg
