URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/japanese-yosakoi-dance-workshop-wi
 th-sakuramai-toronto/
SUMMARY:Japanese Yosakoi Dance Workshop with Sakuramai Toronto
DESCRIPTION:You're invited to join Sakuramai Toronto for a yosakoi dance wo
 rkshop!\n\nWhat is Yosakoi?\nYosakoi is a unique dance from Japan that ble
 nds elements of traditional and modern forms of movement. It is often perf
 ormed at street festivals with teams of up to 120 dancers! Yosakoi is ofte
 n distinguished by the use of wooden hand clappers called Naruko\, and is 
 growing in popularity all around the world for its unique music\, costumes
 \, and energetic team coordination.\n\nAbout Sakuramai Toronto\nSakuramai 
 Toronto was formed in 2011 and has been performing yosakoi in the GTA and 
 in other regions of Canada since then. We've even had the opportunity to p
 articipate in a yosakoi festival in Japan! Our goal is to spread the joy o
 f yosakoi to Canadian communities\, and to introduce others to Japan's ric
 h culture!\nWe are always looking for new members! We are hosting a 2-hour
  introductory yosakoi workshop for those who are interested in trying it o
 ut for the first time.\n\nTo sign up\, please RSVP using the google form p
 osted.\n\nWorkshop Details\nDate: Sunday\, April 7\, 2024\nLocation: The R
 ailpath Arts Centre - 35 Golden Avenue\, Toronto\, M6R 2J5 (near Dundas We
 st Station)\nTime: 11:30am-1:30pm\nParticipation Fee: $15\n\nBe sure to br
 ing with you:\nwater\ntowel\nchange of clothes\nindoor shoes (outdoor shoe
 s are prohibited in the studio)\n\nWe look forward to seeing you there. Le
 t's enjoy yosakoi together! Japanese Yosakoi Dance Workshop with Sakuramai
  Toronto
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2024/03/sakuramaito.jpg
CATEGORIES:Asian
LOCATION:Railpath Arts Centre\, 35 Golden Avenue\, Toronto\, Canada
GEO:43.653902;-79.447921
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=35 Golden Avenue\, Toronto\
 , Canada;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Railpath Arts Centre:geo:43.653902,-79
 .447921
END:VEVENT
