URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/ecstatic-dance-toronto/
SUMMARY:Ecstatic Dance Toronto
DESCRIPTION:Move wild &amp\; free with Toronto’s leading weekly Ecstatic 
 Dance every Thursday 7:30pm-10:30pm in a big church with 100 beautiful hum
 an beings.\n\n\n\nAre you looking for a DANCE GATHERING that does not invo
 lve drugs and alcohol? A new way of connecting to yourself and others that
  is healthy and natural!\n\n&nbsp\;\nWho are we?\nWe are a conscious weekl
 y dance gathering centred around the love of dancing to good music with ot
 hers. Every week is a real\, grounded\, joyful\, exuberant and liberating 
 gathering of beautiful human beings. You’re all welcome to come dance an
 d express however you wish.\n\nEcstatic dance is freestyle dance - move ho
 wever you wish - honour your body - dance with bare feet - no experience n
 ecessary - all ages\, genders\, cultures\, sizes are welcome - respect you
 rself and one another - bring comfortable clothes to move in - bring water
  to drink - alcohol-free and recreational drug-free - safe and sacred spac
 e - let the music take you on a journey - see you on the dance floor\n\nJo
 in Toronto’s leading weekly Ecstatic Dance Community with nearly 900 dan
 ces offered and counting. Literally\, thousands have danced\, healed and c
 elebrated with us since our first dance in January 2006. Join our growing 
 dance community!\n\nLearn more about the space that we create\, our intent
 ion\, our guidelines or join our newsletter and register for dance here: w
 ww.ecstaticdance.ca\n- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -
  - - - - - - - - -\n"Coming to dance revives my soul\, every time!\nThe pl
 ayfulness\, the community\, the dance has truly\nchanged my life and I enc
 ourage everyone to come!"\n- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -
  - - - - - - - - - - - -\n&nbsp\;\nWe invite you to ...\nWe invite you to 
 dance\, sweat and connect with yourselves and each other. This is a place 
 where you can feel free to move and express whatever is alive in you and w
 hatever comes up when you shake up your cells. It is also nonverbal\, bare
 foot\, alcohol/drug-free to keep the experience intentional. Together we c
 reate a safe space for dance and authentic connection that is healing\, in
 spiring and uplifting. Community\, music and dance is our medicine.\n\n“
 Ecstatic Dance is the way we use to gather as a community and dance to rhy
 thms and beats for the purpose of celebration\, healing\, transformation a
 nd prayer.”\n\nJulia Ray\, Ecstatic Dance Toronto Visionary\n\n&nbsp\;\n
 All are welcome. Community. Music. Dance. Ecstatic Dance is a chance to da
 nce freely and move however you want to all kinds of rhythms\, beats and g
 enres with a room full of beautiful people doing exactly the same thing! F
 ind yourself dancing &#x1f642\;\n\nOur DJs draw inspiration from many genr
 es and craft fun\, unique journeys for your energies to root\, renew and f
 low like a river running clear\, strong\, wild and free. Don't miss this o
 pportunity to dance! There is freedom in motion.\n\nDetails:\nDoors Open 7
 :30pm. (You can come after Opening Circle)\n\n7:30p | WELCOMING DANCE | Ar
 rive. Stretch. Socialize. Ground. Breath.\n\n8:00p | OPENING CIRCLE | Gent
 ly Guided Movement Exercise &amp\; Meditation\n\n8:15p | 1.5HR ED JOURNEY 
 | Ecstatic Dance DJ of the Week\n\n9:45p | CLOSING CIRCLE with Sounding &a
 mp\; Sharing (totally optional)\n\n...until 10:30p | COMMUNITY-INSPIRED SO
 CIAL TIME\, SNACKS\, MUSIC MAKING\, SINGING\, SOUNDING\, DANCING\n\n&nbsp\
 ;\nYOU BRING:\n- Your own personal supply of water (you can refill your wa
 ter bottle)\n\n- Comfortable clothes for the entire evening\n\n&nbsp\;\nFE
 E: $25-$30 Cash at the Door or Interac: hub@ecstaticdancetoronto.com or re
 gister here through Eventbrite\nLocation: Sts Cyril &amp\; Methody\, 237 S
 ackville Street\, Toronto\, M5A 3G1\n\n&nbsp\;\nWhat is the Church like to
  dance in?\nINCREDIBLY SPACIOUS. Our weekly dances are held in a 5000 sq. 
 ft. chruch hall with high ceilings\, huge windows\, amazing hardwood floor
  &amp\; a crystal clear high fidelity sound system.\n\n&nbsp\;\nInvite you
 r dancing friends &amp\; share the love of dance\, music &amp\; community.
  www.ecstaticdance.ca\n\n\n\n\n\n Ecstatic Dance Toronto
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2024/03/27779_image.jpg
CATEGORIES:Ecstatic
LOCATION:Sts Cyril & Methody Church\, 237 Sackville Street\, Toronto\, ON M
 5A 3G1\, Toronto\, ON\, M5A 3G1\, Canada
GEO:43.660471;-79.362836
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=237 Sackville Street\, Toro
 nto\, ON M5A 3G1\, Toronto\, ON\, M5A 3G1\, Canada;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TI
 TLE=Sts Cyril & Methody Church:geo:43.660471,-79.362836
END:VEVENT
