SUMMARY:Harbourfront Centre Presents  Gauthier Dance/Dance Theaterhaus Stut
 tgart – Swan Lakes + Minus 16
DESCRIPTION:Harbourfront Centre presents the Canadian premiere of Gauthier 
 Dance//Dance Company Theaterhaus Stuttgart’s explosive mixed program\, S
 wan Lakes and Minus 16\, on stage April 18–20\, 2024\, at 7:30pm at Flec
 k Dance Theatre\, which closes the 2023/24 international contemporary danc
 e series\, Torque. In Swan Lakes\, two of the world’s finest choreograph
 ers - Marie Chouinard and Hofesh Shechter - will present their daring inte
 rpretations of the iconic ballet. The mixed program concludes with legenda
 ry choreographer Ohad Naharin’s cult classic Minus 16\, celebrating the 
 pure joy of dancing. Tickets and information: HarbourfrontCentre.com. Harb
 ourfront Centre Presents  Gauthier Dance/Dance Theaterhaus Stuttgart – S
 wan Lakes + Minus 16
