DESCRIPTION:ITADEL LIVE PRESENTS\nKasheDance\nKasheDance\, Company-in-Resid
 ence at The Citadel: Ross Centre for Dance\, is an Afro-Contemporary dance
  company with roots in Toronto and branches connecting it to the United St
 ates and the Caribbean. The company is unique in Canada in its use of the 
