SUMMARY:FREE Salsa dance classes
DESCRIPTION:Every Wednesday evening\, at the Cooksville Legion.\n\n\n\nAtte
 ntion Cooksville!\n\nJoin Heart Comonos for FREE Salsa dance classes\, sui
 table for those aged 14+.\n\nSalsa is a Latin dance\, associated with sals
 a music\, which was first popularized in the United States during the 1960
 s in New York City. Salsa is a mixture of Cuban dances\, such as mambo\, p
 achanga\, and rumba\, as well as American dances such as swing and tap.\n\
 nThis class is perfect for anyone interested in learning the basics of Sal
 sa dancing\, for those who are looking to get out of the house\, move thei
 r body/ break a sweat and maybe even make some new friends.\n\nPlease arri
 ve 15 minutes early so we may begin on time.\n\nQuestions? Email contact@h
 eartcomonos.ca\n\nNOTICE OF PHOTOGRAPHY AND FILMING\n\nWhen you attend thi
 s event\, you will enter an area where photography\, and/or video recordin
 g may occur\, for promotional purposes. By entering the event space you co
 nsent to potentially being photographed or filmed\, and its release\, publ
 ication\, exhibition or reproduction by Heart Comonos. Questions or concer
 ns? Speak to a Heart Comonos staff member at the event\, or email contact@
 heartcomonos.ca\n\n\n FREE Salsa dance classes
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2024/06/28030_image.png
CATEGORIES:Salsa
LOCATION:Royal Canadian Legion Branch 582\, 456 Hensall Circle\, Mississaug
 a\, ON L5A 1X7\, Mississauga\, ON\, L5A 1X7\, Canada
GEO:43.589362;-79.604517
