SUMMARY:STOMP Urban Dance Competition/Showcase
DESCRIPTION:STOMP Urban Dance Competition/Showcase returns for its 21st sh
 ow on Saturday\, May 4 at 1 p.m. at Meridian Hall\, welcoming families and
  attendees of all ages!\nSTOMP started as a vehicle to engage young women 
 in recreational opportunities with just 100 participants. Over the last tw
 o decades\, it has grown to become the premier youth event of its kind in 
 Toronto.\nThis year’s theme is Music Fusion. Performing teams will fus
 e music and dance with anything and everything – someone playing an inst
 rument\, reading a poem\, or dancing to the tune of basketball bouncing. 
 A variety of creative modalities and expressions will take the stage at th
 is year’s event!\n$5 tickets are available at select community centres
  (no service charge) and at Meridian Hall or Ticketmaster (with service
  charge).\nFor more information\, visit: toronto.ca/stomp\n&nbsp\;\n\nhtt
 ps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1gFQj5m-0hs\n\n&nbsp\; STOMP Urban Dance Comp
 etition/Showcase
