  swing music\, some Latin and Ballroom plus a West Coast Swing lesson taug
 ht by Shelley Saxena.\n.\nBeginners welcome. No partner required. Bring yo
 ur own water bottle. The lesson before the dance is about 45 minutes long 
 and progresses from beginner to intermediate skill level.\n7:00 Doors open
 \n7:30-8:15 Lesson followed by swing dance. The first few songs will be mu
 sic appropriate to the lesson.\n8:15- 11:00 Dance (DJ)\nWe look forward to
  seeing you there!\nMembers $5/Non-members $10 (Cash only\, exact change p
 lease)\nBeverley Halls\, 206 Beverley St.\, Toronto\, M5T 1Z3\ninfo@toront
 oswingdancesociety.ca\nhttps://torontoswingdancesociety.ca/dances\nLike TS
 DS on Facebook at www.facebook.com/TorontoSwingDanceSociety.ca Toronto Swi
 ng Dance Society Dance on Friday May 10th with West Coast Swing Lesson
