 on-friday-june-7th-with-the-jordan-klapman-band/
SUMMARY:Toronto Swing Dance Society Dance on Friday June 7th with The Jorda
 n Klapman Band
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Swing Dance Society is hosting our next dance on Friday
  June 7th. Join us for a fun filled evening of all styles of swing dancing
  to music by The Jordan Klapman Band. Beginners welcome. No partner requir
 ed\n\n7:30- Doors Open\n8:00-11:00 pm- Dance to music of the Jordan Klapma
 n Band.\n(variety of DJ music during the breaks\, may include some Latin a
 nd Ballroom)\nBEVERLEY HALLS \, 206 Beverley Street\, Toronto\, M5T 1Z3\nM
 embers $5/Non-members $10 (Cash only\, exact change appreciated)\nOur danc
 es are open to everyone.\nBeginners are always welcome at our events.\n\nY
 ou don’t need to bring a partner. Most people who come to our dances don
 ’t come with a “designated partner”.\nBring your own water bottle.\n
 Contact Jay for more information\, info@torontoswingdancesociety.ca\nOr vi
 sit https://torontoswingdancesociety.ca/dances Toronto Swing Dance Society
  Dance on Friday June 7th with The Jordan Klapman Band
