URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/flamenco-dance-intensive/
SUMMARY:Flamenco Dance Intensive
DESCRIPTION:June Workshop Intensives at Ritmo Flamenco\nJune 12th\, 13th\, 
 19th and 20th\n\nSummer workshops are a great time to enjoy flamenco by wo
 rking on different areas of technique\, stretch and strength\, rhythm and 
 compas. The levels are more general during the summer so feel free to emai
 l me if you are not sure what class you should take.\nSpace is limited so 
 don’t wait too long to reserve!\n\nWednesday\, June 12th and June 19th\,
  2024\n\nElementary/Intermediate Technique\n6:45-8:00pm\nThis is the class
  for those who have just finished Tangos and Bulerias levels. We will be w
 orking on all areas of technique like arms\, hands\, footwork\, stretch an
 d strength.\nRegistration: $25 for single class or $45 for both classes.\n
 \nAdvanced Flamenco Technique\n8:00-9:15pm\nFor the Advanced students who 
 have currently been in Garrotin\nRegistration: $25 for a single class or $
 45 for both classes.\n\nThursday\, June 13th and 20th\nBeginner Flamenco\n
 6:45-8:00pm\nFor new students interested in starting flamenco as well as c
 ontinuing students that are currently still in their first year of trainin
 g. (Rumba levels)\nRegistration: $25 for a single class or $45 for both cl
 asses.\n\nE Transfer to vscannura@gmail.com Flamenco Dance Intensive
