SUMMARY:Intro to World Dance Beginner Lesson — Afro-Caribbean Dance
DESCRIPTION:Come join us for a fun and lively intro lesson to Afro-Caribbea
 n dance - perfect for beginners wanting to explore world dance styles!\n\n
 \n\nIntro to World Dance Beginner Lesson — Afro-Caribbean Dance\n\nCome 
 join us for a fun and energetic free beginner lesson in Afro-Caribbean Dan
 ce! This in-person event will be held at Sorauren Avenue Park\, behind the
  Fieldhouse. All ages welcome. This is the first of a series of six weekly
  Wednesday-evening drop-in classes\, which will include West African dance
 \, Latin Salsa\, Brazilian Samba and more. No experience necessary\, just 
 bring your enthusiasm and get ready to move to the rhythm of the world bea
 ts. For the full schedule of classes: https://soraurenpark.wordpress.com. 
 Organizer: Friends of Sorauren Park.\n\n\n Intro to World Dance Beginner L
 esson — Afro-Caribbean Dance
