SUMMARY:Wednesday Zumba with Steps Studio
DESCRIPTION:Get fit while having fun! Zumba is a lively dance class that gi
 ves you a full body workout.\n\n\n\nReady to get sweaty? Every Wednesday\,
  join Heather in Barbara Hall Park for Zumba. Add some excitement to your 
 midweek routine with an active outdoor class. Zumba is an active dance-bas
 ed class for all ages.\n\nThis class is free to attend\, but you're invite
 d to register. Please join us even if this page indicates that the program
  is sold out.\n\nDress for the weather\, bring water and comfortable footw
 ear.\n\nWe'll meet on the East side of the stage in Barbara Hall Park\, se
 e you there!\n\n****NOTE: There will be no class on June 26th due to Pride
  Festivities.\n\nNotice of Collection:\n\nThe personal information is coll
 ected under the authority of the City of Toronto Act\, S.O. 2006 ss. 8\, &
 amp\; 136 (a) &amp\; (c). The personal contact information will be used to
  confirm event registration and to plan programming. The 3rd party app (Ev
 entbrite) may send you independent notifications about registration confir
 mation and future events which may be unsubscribed from at any time. The 5
 19 will not trade personal information with other organizations. Questions
  about this collection can be directed to the Privacy Officer at The 519\,
  519 Church Street\, Toronto\, ON\, M4Y 2C9 by email at privacy@The519.org
  or by phone at 416-392-6874.\n\n\n Wednesday Zumba with Steps Studio
