SUMMARY:Arts in the Parks: The Power of Movement
DESCRIPTION:Come dance with ICONS Dance Group at the Power of Movement.\n\n
 \n\nThis is a 4 week family friendly Afro-Caribbean dance workshop in Bell
  Manor Park. Each week you will learn new steps\, have fun and experience 
 the mental and physical benefits of movement. The workshop will be led by 
 ICONS and a Resident Artist.\n\nTakes place in Bell Manor Park.\n\nPlease 
 note that dates and times are subject to change. You are encouraged to vis
 it this website closer to the event to confirm the dates.\n\n\n Arts in th
 e Parks: The Power of Movement
