 w friends in a supportive environment. We’ll have a rotation of live DJs
 \, your favourite food trucks\, and a bar. Our friends at SUSO Skate Co wi
 ll have skate and protective gear rentals available on site.\nThe Hippie M
 arket will be there too with 20+ vendors selling vintage and handmade find
 s.\nOur July 12 Roller Skate Party features sets from Doomgurl and Tdesu.\
