SUMMARY:Porch View Dances  July 17 - 24\, 2024
DESCRIPTION:Porch View Dances (PVD): ‘Real People Dancing In Real Spaces
 ’\, conceived in 2012 by the visionary Karen Kaeja\, is a celebrated and
  award-winning community dance event that transforms the ordinary into the
  extraordinary. This annual spectacle invites everyday people to become cr
 eators\, storytellers\, and performers\, many of whom are stepping into th
 e world of dance for the very first time.\n\nPVD 2024 runs from July 17-2
 4 in Seaton Village\, Toronto.\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nhttps://youtu.be/S1srsEE2tnw?
 feature=shared\n\nAudience members embark on a journey through the neighbo
 rhood\, witnessing fresh and innovative dance works crafted in collaborati
 on with professional choreographers. These performances unfold on the fron
 t porches and lawns of the participants' homes\, turning familiar spaces i
 nto stages where local residents shine. The event reaches its zenith with 
 a Flock Landing at the local park\, where people of all ages and mobility 
 levels are warmly invited to join in and dance together.\n\nPVD is a vibra
 nt celebration of community stories\, bringing dance out of the theatre an
 d embedding it into the fabric of everyday life. It sends a resounding and
  inclusive message that art is for everyone\, enriching the neighborhood w
 ith its creativity and spirit.\nDates:\n\n\n 	\nJuly 17\, 2024 @ 7pm\n\n 	
 \nJuly 18\, 2024 @ 7pm\n\n 	\nJuly 19\, 2024 @ 7pm\n\n 	\nJuly 20\, 2024 @
  7pm\n\n 	\nJuly 21\, 2024 @ 2pm\n\n\nStarting Location: Porch View Dances
  Lane &amp\; London St.\nAdmission: Pay What You Want Porch View Dances  J
 uly 17 - 24\, 2024
