SUMMARY:WORK IT GIRL COMMUNITY SUMMER EVENT
DESCRIPTION:WORK IT GIRL COMMUNITY SUMMER EVENT\n\n\n\nYou're invited to ou
 r FREE WORK IT GIRL Summer Community Event!\n\nJoin our Toronto West Commu
 nity of families and friends for some interactive games\, dancing and musi
 cal performances.\n\nDuring this summer event\, we will be running our sig
 nature leadership and dance class for young girls aged 6-10 years old. WOR
 K IT Girl offers confidence-boosting leadership and dance programs for gir
 ls in downtown Toronto and participants will get a taste of this innovativ
 e programming to empower them!\n\nLed by highly-qualified and dynamic inst
 ructors\, participants will warm up\, learn a positive mindset skill throu
 gh a story and then get up and learn some creative dance moves! No dance e
 xperience is required.\n\nAfter the trial\, families and friends are invit
 ed to join in some fun team-building games and activities\, and learn some
  upbeat dance moves as well.\n\nThe afternoon will close out with a powerf
 ul musical performance by Toronto singer/songwriter KYRA DANIEL (Former Mi
 ni Pop Kids Performer)\n\nDon't miss this FREE COMMUNITY EVENT!\n\nE mail 
 info@janetco.live should you have any questions.\n\n\n\n\nClick here to le
 arn more about WORK IT Girl Programs\n\n\n WORK IT GIRL COMMUNITY SUMMER E
 VENT
