SUMMARY:Summer Salsa Mini Marathon
DESCRIPTION:Calling all salsa lovers! If you love to dance\, do we have a o
 ne-of-a-kind event for you!\n\nFit and Dance Dimensions is pleased to run 
 Durham’s first-ever Summer Salsa Mini Marathon. At this event\, the sals
 a-curious and salsa-obsessed can expect:\n\n10 hours of pure salsa social 
 dancing\nCatered dinner\nSalsa Beginner Bootcamp before the event\n\nThe m
 usic will play all day and you’re free to come and go as you please. Hit
  the dancefloor\, connect with fellow salsa enthusiasts\, and chill out in
  the downstairs dining room or outside in the neighbouring park. Dance\, e
 at\, rest\, and repeat!\n\nDon’t miss this unique opportunity to dive in
 to the world of salsa. Beginners welcome!\n\nPre-registration required\, l
 imited spaces available. Get your pass today for only $85.00.\n\nEVENT SCH
 EDULE\n\n11:45 -13:00 - Doors open and dancer check-in\n12:00 -13:00 - Sal
 sa Beginner Bootcamp\n13:00 - 23:00 - Social Dancing\n18:00 - 19:30 - Dinn
 er Summer Salsa Mini Marathon
