URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/2024-toronto-dragon-festival/
SUMMARY:2024 Toronto Dragon Festival
DESCRIPTION:2024 Toronto Dragon Festival Returns to Nathan Phillips Square 
 with Foods\, Beers\, and Luminati Night Shows\n\nToronto and the world are
  eager to watch the stunning acrobatic performances of the lion dance\, bu
 t only better with new shows with foods\, beer garden and enchanting Lumin
 ati Night Light Show\, exclusively at the 2024 Toronto Dragon Festival (TD
 F).\n\nLoyal TDF fans are likely familiar with the iconic showcases of the
  Festival’s captivating lion and dragon dances\, alongside the awe-inspi
 ring spectacle of acrobatic lion dances on high poles. The 2024 TDF will b
 ring a few brand-new shows to surprise tens of thousands of visitors with 
 a beer garden for beer lovers to raise their glasses. Experience the magic
  after dark – join us for the Luminati Night Light Show\, where dazzling
  displays and enchanting illuminations transform the night into a breathta
 king spectacle.\n\nFestival goers can look forward to all their favorite T
 DF traditions that mark the perfect end to summer. From mouth-watering Asi
 an street food to vibrant cultural presentations\, and the always-improvis
 ed Reflection Water Show\, everything will converge on Toronto’s iconic 
 Reflecting Pool in Nathan Phillips Square with even more spectacular flair
  this year.\n\nWhere: Nathan Phillips Square\, Toronto\nWhen: Friday\, Aug
 ust 30 – Sunday\, September 1\, 2024\n\nEclipsing the splendor of last y
 ear's shows\, the 2024 TDF promises an unparalleled multicultural spectacl
 e\, highlighted by a new Calligraphy Show\, where every stroke narrates a 
 tale of beauty and finesse. The festival will also showcase talents from C
 anada's indigenous communities\, as well as vibrant performances from Asia
 n\, Caribbean\, and other cultural groups\, alongside sold-out food booths
 .\n\nCome witness the magic firsthand! The festival welcomes all\, with fr
 ee admission and family-friendly fun. 2024 Toronto Dragon Festival
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2024/07/2024-TDF_V.jpg
CATEGORIES:Asian,Indigenous
LOCATION:Nathan Phillips Square\, 100 Queen St W\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M5H 
 2N2\, GTA\, Canada
GEO:43.652000;-79.382401
