DESCRIPTION:Toronto Swing Dance Society is hosting our next dance on Friday
  October 18th. Join us for a fun filled evening of all styles of swing dan
 cing to music by the Soul Mates Band. Beginners welcome. No partner requir
 ed.\n\n7:30- Doors Open\n8:00-11:00 pm- Dance to music of the Soul Mates B
 and.\n(variety of DJ music during the breaks\, may include some Latin and 
 Ballroom)\nBEVERLEY HALLS \, 206 Beverley Street\, Toronto\, M5T 1Z3\nMemb
 ers $5/Non-members $10 (Cash only\, exact change appreciated)\nOur dances 
 are open to everyone.\nBeginners are always welcome at our events.\n\nYou 
 don’t need to bring a partner. Most people who come to our dances don’
 t come with a “designated partner”.\nBring your own water bottle.\nCon
 tact Jay for more information\, info@torontoswingdancesociety.ca Toronto S
 wing Dance Society Dance on Friday October 18th with Soul Mates Band
