URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/70th-anniversary-traditional-squar
 e-dance-party/
SUMMARY:70th Anniversary Traditional Square Dance Party
DESCRIPTION:We're going to Party like it's 1954!\n\nJoin traditional square
  dancers on Saturday afternoon\, October 19 in north Toronto and celebrate
  the 70th anniversary of Canadian olde tyme square dancing and calling. Ye
 s! There will be cake.\n\nNo need for a partner or dance experience. If yo
 u can walk energetically\, you can square dance. We'll also do a big circl
 e dance / mixer\, maybe a line or two\, a waltz (of course)\, and a few ot
 her super fun and easy to learn couple or group dances.\n\nCome on your ow
 n\, bring a partner or gather a whole group.\n\n2 - 5 pm (lesson / mini re
 fresher at 1:30)\n\n$15 per person (Canadian Olde Tyme Association members
