SUMMARY:WORK IT GIRL KIDS WORKSHOP FREE FALL SERIES - EAST TORONTO
DESCRIPTION:Free Monthly Confidence-Building Leadership &amp\; Dance Worksh
 ops in Toronto's East End.\n\n\n\nCalling all girls who love dance\, music
  and self-expression and want to have fun while learning positive mindset 
 and team-building skills!\n\nJoin us at our WORK IT GIRL WORKSHOP SERIES -
  TORONTO EAST EDITION\n\nWORK IT Girl offers confidence-boosting leadershi
 p and dance programs for young girls. We believe that every girl can be a 
 leader and envision a world where every girl is proud of who they are\, fe
 arlessly following their passions\, and take pride in lifting others up.\n
 \nDuring the free workshops\, girls aged 6-11 years old will experience ou
 r signature leadership and dance class that has transformed girls from the
  inside out.\n\nWhat to expect:\n\n 	A supportive and non-judgmental envir
 onment to dance\, express\, and try new things.\n 	Fun dance warm-up\, a p
 owerful mindset story and discussion\, and a creative dance routine taught
  by dynamic instructors!\n 	No dance experience? No problem! Everyone is w
 elcome.\n\nIn these workshps\, girls will learn an upbeat dance routine wh
 ile also learning important mindest skills through storytelling including 
 positive self-talk\, honouring your uniqueness\, and becoming the leader o
 f your own life.\n\nLearn more about the WORK IT GIRL Movement here.\n\nFo
 llow us on IG @workitgirlmovement to learn more!\n\nE mail info@janetco.li
 ve should you have any questions.\n\n\n WORK IT GIRL KIDS WORKSHOP FREE FA
 LL SERIES - EAST TORONTO
