SUMMARY:FREE Seniors Fitness Classes in Cooksville\, Mississauga
DESCRIPTION:Ages 55+\, Monday &amp\; Wednesday mornings at the Cooksville L
 egion.\n\n\n\nAttention Seniors!\n\nJoin Heart Comonos every Monday and We
 dnesday morning for our FREE senior's fitness classes\, suitable for those
  aged 55+.\n\nThese classes are perfect for seniors who are looking to get
  out of the house\, move their body and maybe even make some new friends.\
 n\nWednesdays in October\, you can expect a Chair Yoga series. \n\n&nbsp\;
 \n\nAdditional information:\n\n 	Modifications will be offered for those w
 ith joint issues and physical limitations stemming from surgery or injury.
 \n 	A variety of equipment will be used in addition to the participants ow
 n body weight.\n 	We will include some work on the mat as well as standing
 — although many standing exercises can be performed in a chair if that w
 orks better for you.\n 	Participants have the option of whether or not to 
 use weights.\n 	Functional exercises will be included\n 	Every class will 
 include a beginning warm up and cool down/stretching at the end\n 	Suitabl
 e for all levels.\n\n&nbsp\;\nAfter class on the last Monday of each month
 \, we also host a potluck!\nAll classes in this series are beginner- frien
 dly. Any equipment that is needed will be provided. Come as you are - all 
 abilities welcome!\n\nPlease arrive 15 minutes early for each class as all
  classes will begin on time.\n\n&nbsp\;\nWe also host a Weekly Walking Gro
 up!\nJoin us each week to get outside in nature and explore the beautiful 
 trails of Mississauga and the GTA. Register: https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/f
 ree-walking-group-with-heart-comonos-tickets-942835565557?aff=oddtdtcreato
 r\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nNOTICE OF PHOTOGRAPHY AND FILMING\n\nWhen you attend this 
 event\, you will enter an area where photography\, and/or video recording 
 may occur\, for promotional purposes. By entering the event space you cons
 ent to potentially being photographed or filmed\, and its release\, public
 ation\, exhibition or reproduction by Heart Comonos. Questions or concerns
 ? Speak to a Heart Comonos staff member at the event\, or email contact@he
 artcomonos.ca\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n\n FREE Seniors Fitness Classes in Cooksville\
 , Mississauga
