URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/chocolate-groove-hallows-eve-god-g
 oddess-ecstatic-costume-dance-party/
SUMMARY:HALLOWS EVE GOD & GODDESS ECSTATIC COSTUME DANCE PARTY
DESCRIPTION:We are an intentional\, all-inclusive safe space for everyone t
 o come together\, connect authentically &amp\; DANCE. A Cacao Ecstatic Dan
 ce Social\n\n\n\nJoin us as we gather at the massive &amp\; sacred Holy Tr
 inity Church for a night to dress up as GODS &amp\; GODDESES as we Celebra
 te Halloween with a FULL POWER HALLOWEEN COSTUME PARTY!\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nFull
 y loaded with our Unity Production Sound system\, Projection mapping\,Live
  art\, Live performances &amp\; a stellar lineup of DJS\, we will be going
  BIG on this sacred night.\n\nMore on Halloween\n\nIn the Pagan Wheel of t
 he Year\, Samhain/Hallowe'en is one of the eight seasonal festivals when w
 e gather to honour the spiritual rhythms of our world. On this day\, when 
 the veil between worlds is thin\, it is also a time to honour the ancestor
 s\, the dearly departed. It is also a time of powerful divination\, as we 
 are open to the influences of the Faeirie realm of spirits and mysticism\,
  as well as receiving messages from our ancestral connections.\n\nIt is al
 so a time to honour the final harvest as we pray for warmth and blessings 
 to keep us nourished and alight in the further descent into the holy darkn
 ess of Autumn and the onset of Winter\, which is honoured in the rebirth o
 f the light of the Winter Solstice. As the leaves continue to fall\, leavi
 ng trees barren\, so are we invited to release what no longer serves to ma
 ke space for new growth.\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&gt\;&gt\;&gt\; Live Art -\n\n 	Liv
 e Painting\n 	Visual Prana\n 	Self Reflectron\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&gt\;&gt\;&gt\
 ; ENERGY Exchange -\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n 	Early Birds - $30 (lIMITED AMOUNT)\n 	
 General Admission - $40\n 	Door - $50\n 	COMMUNITY SUPPORTER - $60\n\n(thi
 s ticket option supports those who require financial assistance)\n\n&nbsp\
 ;\n\nWe do our best to make our events as affordable as possible and if yo
 u need financial assistance to attend\, please reach out.\n\nchocolategroo
 ve111@gmail.com\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&gt\;&gt\;&gt\; LOCATION -Holy Trinity Churc
 h - 10 Trinity Square\, Toronto\, ON M5G 1B1\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nWhat is Chocola
 te Groove?\n\nChocolate Groove has been offering alcohol-free dance gather
 ings since the summer of 2018 and has evolved over the years. We are very 
 excited to continue hosting events that create space for Ecstatic Dance &a
 mp\; room for a more Social experience. At the root of all our elements\, 
 we are more than a dance party but a community that creates a safe space f
 or celebration &amp\; connection. We are an intentional\, all-inclusive sa
 fe space for everyone to come together\, connect authentically &amp\; DANC
 E.\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n..:: CODE OF CONDUCT AGREEMENT ::.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nPlease Re
 spect\, honour &amp\; Love ...\n\n 	Yourself\n 	The Space\n 	Each Other\n\
 nThis is a space of intentional &amp\; Consensual connection\n\nThis is an
  Alcohol / Drug-free Space\n\nWe Are Co-Creating a Safe\, All Inclusive\, 
 Family Friendly\, Non-Judgmental\, Shame Free Space for Radical Community 
 Expression &amp\; Care.\n\nWe are learning how to do this together and eac
 h person is an active participant in their own learning with us!\n\nIf you
  experience yourself or someone else struggling to hold up any of our Valu
 es &amp\; Pillars\, please come connect with us so we can care and support
  you as a community!\n\nYour Chocolate Groove Team\n\n\n HALLOWS EVE GOD &
 amp\; GODDESS ECSTATIC COSTUME DANCE PARTY
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2024/10/28291_image.png
CATEGORIES:Ecstatic
LOCATION:Church of the Holy Trinity\, 10 Trinity Square\, Toronto\, ON M5G 
