SUMMARY:Community Latin Dance Program
DESCRIPTION:Join us for FREE Latin Dancing Classes\n\n\n\nHave you ever wan
 ted to learn the Salsa\, or Merengue or Bachata?\n\nThis class is perfect 
 for anyone interested in learning the basics of Latin dance.\n\nDancing is
  a great way to move your body\, improve your over all health\, communicat
 ion and maybe even make some new friends.\n\nLed by Boris and Kate Rozenbe
 rg\, a local couple with five years of dance experience\, who are eager to
  share their knowledge and highlight the many benefits of dance!\n\nAdditi
 onal details:\n\n 	wear light &amp\; comfortable clothing and layer as you
  will feel warm\n 	wear comfortable indoor shoes\, high heels not required
 \n 	water for hydration\n 	all are welcome\; however a dance partner is re
 commended\n\nNo previous dance experience required!\n\nGet ready to shake 
 it off and dance your stress away - it is time to feel good!\n\n\n Communi
 ty Latin Dance Program
