 lass is first)\n8:45 – 9:45 Beginner class\n\nTo take the intermediate c
 lass you must have a solid knowledge of the basics.\n\nFull series: $55 fo
 r members\, $70 for non-members (includes membership)\nClass size is limit
 ed. Early registration is recommended.\nOn line registration only. Registr
 ation closes at 7:00 pm one day prior to first class.\nYou should arrive 2
