 mances\, visit local vendors\, and envision your dream wedding on Fri Nov 
 08 2024 at 8:30 at the Arthur Murray Dance Centres. This event is perfect 
 for couples looking to add a special touch to their wedding reception. Lea
 rn from experienced instructors\, meet other couples\, connect with hand-p
 icked local wedding vendors and have a blast preparing for your first danc
 e as a married couple. Don't miss out on this fun and exciting event!\n\n\
 n The Wedding Dance Expo
