SUMMARY:DCD Hall of Fame Induction Ceremony
DESCRIPTION:The 6th Annual DCD Hall of Fame\, presented by Dance Collection
  Danse\, is proud to announce the 2024 Inductees with 13 notable contribut
 ors to dance from across the country. The DCD Hall of Fame will honour and
  celebrate dynamic lifelong contributions to dance in Canada with a ceremo
 ny on Sunday\, November 10 at the Palais Royale in Toronto.\n\nThe 2024 Da
 nce Collection Danse Hall of Fame inductees represent a diverse range of d
 ance forms and backgrounds\, highlighting the rich tapestry of the dance i
 n Canada. The evening will feature celebrity presenters and inductees\, li
 ve performances by the current generation of elite dancers\, and a cocktai
 l and food reception. For those unable to make it in person\, tickets are 
 also available for the live stream. DCD Hall of Fame Induction Ceremony
