URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/dance-revolt-conference-humber-col
 lege-2024/
SUMMARY:Dance Revolt - Full Day Dance Conference
DESCRIPTION:Dance REVOLT is a full day dance conference open to students in
  grades 8-12 + College and University students.\n\n\n\nDate: November 25\,
  2024\nTime: 9:00 AM – 3:30 PM\nLocation: Humber College\, 5th floor of 
 the Barrett Centre for Technology Innovation (North Campus). 205 Humber Co
 llege Blvd.\nCost: $45/student (Includes 2 workshops\, 1 masterclass\, and
  a commemorative t-shirt)\n\nDance Revolt 2024 is back with a vibrant cele
 bration of Caribbean Diasporic Dance! This year’s theme brings the rich 
 rhythms of Soca\, Dancehall\, and Reggaeton to the forefront. Students wil
 l immerse themselves in a cultural experience that connects the powerful h
 istories of the Caribbean and Latin America with the vibrant energy of mod
 ern dance.\n\n&nbsp\;\nWhat to Expect:\n\n 	Interactive Workshops: Dive in
 to the history\, cultural context\, and signature moves of Caribbean and L
 atin American dance forms.\n 	Masterclass: Learn from expert choreographer
 s (Stay tuned for the full lineup!).\n 	Cultural Conversations: Explore ho
 w these dance forms have shaped and been shaped by the migration and exper
 iences of Caribbean and Latin American communities in Canada.\n 	Networkin
 g &amp\; Community: Connect with fellow dancers\, educators\, and industry
  professionals in a dynamic environment.\n\nDance Revolt is more than just
  a dance event—it’s an opportunity to learn about the history\, cultur
 e\, and significance behind the moves. We’ll explore how Caribbean and L
 atin American Canadians have contributed to Canada’s cultural landscape 
 through music and dance\, building a stronger understanding of the diaspor
 a experience.\n\nSpaces are limited—register now to secure your spot!\n\
 n\n Dance Revolt - Full Day Dance Conference
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2024/10/28303_image.png
CATEGORIES:Caribbean,Kids / Youth,Latin
LOCATION:Humber College\, 205 Humber College Boulevard 5th floor of the Bar
 rett Centre for Technology Innovation\, Toronto\, ON M9W 5L7\, Toronto\, O
 N\, M9W 5L7\, Canada
GEO:43.728823;-79.60658
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=205 Humber College Boulevar
