 ed by Laurence Lemieux\nLive Musical Performance by Echo Chamber\nNovember
  27–30\, 2024\n8pm @ The Citadel\nSet to Olivier Messiaen’s Quartet fo
 r The End of Time and performed live by the musicians of Echo Chamber\, Co
 ntes pour la fin du temps (Tales for the End of Time) explores the concept
