URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/danceworks-presents-raven-mother/
SUMMARY:DanceWorks presents Raven Mother
DESCRIPTION:DanceWorks proudly presents the Toronto debut of Raven Mother\,
  a mesmerizing full-length multimedia performance by the Dancers of Damela
 hamid. Mark your calendars for Wednesday\, November 29 with shows at 12:15
  PM and 7:30 PM at the beautiful Fleck Dance Theatre in Harbourfront Centr
 e.\n\nThis stunning work is a heartfelt tribute to the power of matriarchs
 \, honoring the late Elder Margaret Harris\, co-founder of Dancers of Dame
 lahamid (est. 1967) and mother to the company’s Executive &amp\; Artisti
 c Director\, Margaret Grenier. Through breathtaking performances\, Raven M
 other celebrates Elder Harris’s profound role in preserving and revitali
 zing Indigenous dance along the Northwest Coast and highlights the incredi
 ble cultural knowledge carried by women.\n\nExpect a captivating journey t
 old through stories\, music\, live vocals\, vibrant regalia\, intricate ma
 sks\, and sculptures from the Gitxsan people—all brought to life in powe
 rful vignettes that will leave you spellbound.\n\n✨ Bonus for daytime ad
 venturers! The 12:15 PM matinee includes a 60-minute version of the show\,
  perfect for school groups and curious minds. Stick around afterward for a
  15-minute artist talk to dive deeper into the magic.\n\n️ Tickets are P
 ay-What-You-Can (from free to $48)\, making this an accessible and unforge
 ttable experience for everyone.\n\nHead to danceworks.ca to snag your tick
 ets and learn more. Don’t miss it! DanceWorks presents Raven Mother
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2024/11/02_Dancers-of-Damelahamid-Raven-Mother_Photo-Credit-Chris-Randle_P
 rovided-by-DanceWorks_One-Time-Use-copy.jpg
CATEGORIES:Contemporary
LOCATION:Fleck Dance Theatre\, Harbourfront Centre\, 207 Queens Quay West\,
  Toronto\, Ontario\, M5J1A7\, GTA\, Canada
GEO:43.639301;-79.380898
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=207 Queens Quay West\, Toro
