SUMMARY:Gallery Talk: Intergalactic Arts Collective @ Koffler Arts
DESCRIPTION:Koffler Arts is proud to present a FREE Gallery Talk by four ch
 oreographers/dancers on Wednesday\, December 11th at 6:30 pm.\n\nSince the
  1990s\, Intergalactic Arts Collective (IGAC) has been a creative hub for 
 movement artists wanting a collective environment as an alternative to wor
 king in isolation. Over the years\, the space and the members involved hav
 e evolved but the commitment remains the same.\n\nNow based at Youngplace 
 (180 Shaw Street)\, and represented in the exhibition Another DECADE\, fou
 r of the members of IGAC – Maxine Heppner\, Suzanne Liska\, Tracey Norma
 n\, and Jessica Runge – will share insights about their individual appro
 aches to dance and videos of their works in the exhibition. We will welcom
 e questions from the audience.\n\nTo register for FREE:\nhttps://www.event
 brite.ca/e/1105862136419 Gallery Talk: Intergalactic Arts Collective @ Kof
 fler Arts
