  the holiday cheer with you as we say goodbye to 2024.\n\nAs featured on C
 P24\, Nike Toronto\, CanFit Pro and more\, the Carnival Spice classes fuse
  Soca and Dancehall music through a high-energy\, dance fitness experience
 . For this holiday edition\, you may even hear some sweet Parang!\nRegiste
 r now to avoid disappointment.\n\n 	Workshop Information:\n 	Sunday Decemb
 er 15th\, 2024\n 	Time: 2-4pm\n 	Location: 805 Dovercourt Road Toronto\, O
 N M6H 2X4 (Dovercourt House)\n 	All dance and fitness levels welcomed.\n\n
 General Entry: $25+hst\n\nYou can also gift our holiday edition class to y
 our loved ones OR give the gift of quality time and a new experience to a 
 friend\, family member or significant other\; bring them with you! Special
  holiday pricing for participants that bring a guest\, 2 passes for only $
 40.\nTickets available through (https://spicesocachristmas.eventbrite.ca) 
