SUMMARY:Toronto: Ballet and Snowflakes - Complimentary Trial Class
DESCRIPTION:Experience Goh Ballet's 2024/2025 Annual Programs with a compli
 mentary trial class and orientation.\n\n\n\nBallet and Snowflakes: A Rare 
 Opportunity to Experience Goh Ballet!\n\nStep into the enchanting world of
  ballet this winter with Ballet and Snowflakes\, join a complimentary clas
 s offering an exclusive chance to experience the programs at Goh Ballet. D
 esigned for children and juniors ages 3–10\, this one-day event is a per
 fect introduction to the artistry of dance while building creativity\, con
 fidence\, and coordination.\n\nSession Times\, January 4th 2025:\n\n 	Ages
  3–6: 9:30 AM – 10:30 AM\n 	Ages 7–10: 11:30 AM – 12:30 PM\n\nLed 
 by our certified\, award-winning instructors\, students will explore the m
 agic of ballet through imaginative winter themes\, foundational steps\, an
 d engaging musicality. With the new term starting soon\, this is a rare op
 portunity to try classes at Goh Ballet and secure a place in our sought-af
 ter programs.\n\nSpaces are limited - classes are complimentary\, don’t 
 miss this exceptional chance! Register today and begin your child’s ball
 et journey with us. Please note that only 1 parent per dancer will be allo
 wed to attend this event.\n\nUnable to join our event? Register for one of
  our upcoming auditions or request more information and we will contact yo
 u personally.\n\n*This event is free-of-charge\, but pre-registration is r
 equired. Please register each attendee by reserving a ticket.\n\n\n Toront
 o: Ballet and Snowflakes - Complimentary Trial Class
