URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/nipai-international-workshop-movem
 ent-for-actors-acting-for-dancers-workshop/
SUMMARY:NIPAI INTERNATIONAL WORKSHOP | Movement for Actors / Acting for Dan
 cers Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Dates:\nMonday\, 6.01.2025 - Friday\, 10.01.2025\n\nLocation:\n
 DOCK 11 EDEN\nBreite Str. 43\, 13187 Berlin\, Germany\n\nRegistration:\n\n
 This international workshop is designed for professional dancers\, choreog
 raphers\, actors\, theatre directors\, and performing arts practitioners f
 rom all over the world.\n\nThe program is ideal for dancers who are intere
 sted in learning more about acting and actors who are interested in expand
 ing their knowledge and practice of movement.\n\nThe workshop is highly pr
 actical and aims to provide participants with the tools to develop a more 
 physical approach to acting and performance.\n\nDuring the workshop\, part
 icipants will explore how to build compelling characters\, how to embody a
 nd express emotions through movement\, and how to connect deeply with othe
 r performers. The workshop will also include training in improvisation\, w
 hich will help participants become more spontaneous and present in their p
 erformances.\n\nThe working language of the workshop is English. NIPAI INT
 ERNATIONAL WORKSHOP | Movement for Actors / Acting for Dancers Workshop
