 ry 6th
DESCRIPTION:TORONTO SWING DANCE SOCIETY is very happy to have Steven James 
 teach our next series of West Coast Swing Lessons beginning Jan 6th. Begin
 ners always welcome. No partner required.\n.\nJan 6\, 13\, 20\, 27\, Feb 3
 \, 10 &amp\; 24\n7:30 – 8:30 Intermediate class (note intermediate class
  is first)\n8:45 – 9:45 Beginner class\nTo take the intermediate class y
 ou must have a solid knowledge of the basics.\n\nFull series: $55 for memb
 ers\, $70 for non-members (includes membership)\nClass size is limited. Ea
 rly registration is recommended.\nOn line registration only. Registration 
 closes at 7:00 pm one day prior to first class.\nYou should arrive 20 minu
 tes before the first class and 10 minutes before remaining classes in the 
 series.\n\nLOCATION: Beverley Halls\, 206 Beverley Street\, Toronto\, M5T 
