SUMMARY:Toronto Swing Dance Society Dance with West Coast Swing Lesson
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Swing Dance Society is hosting our next dance on Friday
  Jan 10th\, 2025. Please join us for a fun filled evening of all styles of
  swing music\, some Latin and Ballroom plus a West Coast Swing lesson taug
 ht by Julie Epplett.\n.\nBeginners welcome. No partner required. Bring you
 r own water bottle. The lesson before the dance is about 45 minutes long a
 nd progresses from beginner to intermediate skill level.\n7:00 Doors open\
 n7:30-8:15 Lesson followed by swing dance. The first few songs will be mus
 ic appropriate to the lesson.\n8:15- 11:00 Dance (Guest DJ Julie Epplett)\
 nWe look forward to seeing you there!\nMembers $5/Non-members $10\nBeverle
 y Halls\, 206 Beverley St.\, Toronto\, M5T 1Z3\ninfo@torontoswingdancesoci
 ety.ca\nhttps://torontoswingdancesociety.ca/dances\nLike TSDS on Facebook 
 at www.facebook.com/TorontoSwingDanceSociety.ca Toronto Swing Dance Societ
 y Dance with West Coast Swing Lesson
