URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/what-we-carry/
SUMMARY:What We Carry
DESCRIPTION:Native Earth Performing Arts is proud to present the Ontario Pr
 emiere of What We Carry\, an A’nó:wara Dance Theatre solo dance piece c
 horeographed and performed by Barbara Kaneratonni Diabo\, at Aki Studio in
  Toronto from February 6-9\, 2025. What We Carry is an expression of Diabo
 ’s life’s journey as she shares many experiences that she carries in t
 he bundle of her body\, mind\, and spirit.\n\nTold through five scenes and
  video interstitials\, What We Carry is a deeply personal expression of th
 e things that are bigger than words\, the things that are sometimes painfu
 l and sometimes joyous. Diabo gives these things to dance and music as she
  explores motherhood\, Indigenous language and cultural responsibility\, t
 he feminine body\, ancestors\, and the universal journey. What We Carry
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2025/01/WhatWeCarry-photo-by-Chris-Randle_DSC_5108.jpeg
CATEGORIES:Contemporary
LOCATION:Aki Studio Theatre @ Daniels Spectrum\, 585 Dundas St East\,\, Tor
 onto\, Ontario\, M5A 2B7\, Canada
