URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/black-excellence-event-at-eaton-ce
 ntre/
SUMMARY:Black Excellence Event at Eaton Centre
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an unforgettable celebration of culture\, creativit
 y\, and community at adidas Toronto Eaton Centre!\n\n\n\nExperience a cura
 ted Black-Owned Business Market\, live performances (1-3pm)\, DJs and insp
 iring entrepreneur spotlights - all in an atmosphere fueled by music\, con
 nection\, and empowerment.\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nAdidas is committed to fostering 
 inclusivity and diversity\, reflecting the vibrant city we call home. Thro
 ugh fashion\, sport\, and community-driven experiences\, we strive to crea
 te spaces that uplift and inspire.\n\n&nbsp\;\nWhat to Expect:\n\n 	Black-
 Owned Business Market (12:00 PM – 6:00 PM): Discover and support local B
 lack-owned brands - featuring Sam's Juices\, Essentials by Temi\, That Goo
 d Good Shea\, Butter &amp\; Spice\, Bubbles &amp\; Lips\, Beevibe Juicery 
 &amp\; Run The Flex Dance Studio - in our curated in-store marketplace.\n\
 n\n 	Honey Jam Pop-up (1:00 PM – 3:00 PM): Live Music &amp\; Performing 
 Arts. Enjoy powerful performances from local singers\, songwriters\, and r
 appers\, lighting up the stage outside the store by the fountain.\n 	Entre
 preneur Spotlights: Between performances\, our moderator will shine a ligh
 t on business owners\, engaging them in dynamic conversations about entrep
 reneurship\, culture\, and community—a fresh take on our traditional pan
 el discussions.\n 	Live DJs: Featuring DJ Melboogie &amp\; Killa Kels\n\nI
 n-Store Experience:\n\nA live DJ will keep the energy high\, while you cus
 tomize an exclusive Black Excellence tee with unique graphics at our in-st
 ore customization lab.\n\nThis is more than an event - it’s a movement. 
 Don’t miss your chance to be part of it!\n\n\n Black Excellence Event at
  Eaton Centre
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2025/02/28684_image-scaled.jpg
