SUMMARY:Citadel Dance Exchange
DESCRIPTION:Citadel dance exchange\nCitadel Dance Exchange is an exciting a
 nnual dance series featuring works by some of Canada’s most talented art
 ists.\nA joint initiative with The National Ballet of Canada’s Creative 
 Action Programme\, Citadel Dance Exchange brings together works by Toronto
 -based artists alongside works by Montreal-based artists for 2 weeks of ex
 ceptional dance sure to provoke\, move and inspire.\nJoin us April 2 – 1
 2\, 2025 to witness the incredible works on offer.\nThis year we welcome S
 ovann Rochon-Prom Tep and Manu Roque from Montreal\, alongside Toronto-bas
 ed artists Carol Anderson\, Nyda Kwasowsky\, The Unknown Floor Force (TUFF
 ) and Yui Ugai. Citadel Dance Exchange
