DESCRIPTION:Citadel LIVE presents\nএকসঙ্গে / Akshongay\nChore
 ographed and Performed by Nova Bhattacharya and Louis Laberge-Côté\n\nAp
 ril 23–26\, 2025\n8pm @ The Citadel\n\nএকসঙ্গে / Akshongay
  is a captivating duet that unites Bharatnatyam and modern dance to expres
 s themes of love\, friendship\, heartbreak and togetherness. Since its 201
 3 debut\, it has deeply touched audiences with its exquisite fusion of tra
 dition and innovation. Embodying the lasting connection between two artist
 s it offers a dreamlike world rich in passion and heartbreak\, reflecting 
 a profound collaboration spanning over two decades. একসঙ্গে 
 / Akshongay
