 by Laurence Lemieux\n\nMay 29–31\, 2025 @ 8pm\nMay 31\, 2025 @ 2pm\n\nIn
 spired by childhood memories both fond and fearsome\, Les Paradis Perdus/R
 emix is a world within a world. Originally created and performed by Lauren
 ce Lemieux\, and then husband Bill Coleman in 2005\, the choreography was 
 revisited and reworked anew by Lemieux in 2015 and garnered two Dora Award
  nominations. This remount will feature original music and live performanc
 e by composer Christopher Butterfield\, and performances by dancers Juliet
 te and Jimmy Coleman. Les Paradis Perdus/Remix
