SUMMARY:DOUBLE
DESCRIPTION:Citadel LIVE presents\nDOUBLE\nCommissioned by Leon Arts\nChore
 ographed by Sharon Moore\n\nJune 18– 21\, 2025\n8pm @ The Citadel\n\nTwo
  explorers navigate a moving landscape of identities\, existences and conn
 ectivity. Through multiple performative experiments they bend their foible
 s and the divine\, tracing back toward their point of origin – hoping to
  discover the hidden equation of love. This intimate and playful collabora
 tion integrates multiple languages into an abstracted narrative\; the lang
 uage of the body\, the spoken languages of English and Spanish\, and the v
 isual language of video design. DOUBLE
