SUMMARY:South by South East International Festival
DESCRIPTION:The SxSE International Festival aims to celebrate the rich cult
 ural heritages of Asia and Latin America by fostering inclusivity.\n\n\n\n
 Festival Highlights:\n\n 	Live Performances: The festival will feature Liv
 e Latin music\, Salsa and Latin dance shows\, headliner artist in Latin + 
 Kpop\, Latin Drag show\, traditional lion dances\, Cultural Fashion Show\,
  martial arts demos.\n 	Children's Programming: A dedicated area feature c
 ircus center \, animal interaction\, craft workshops\, waterplay area and 
 active play zones\, encouraging young attendees to connect.\n 	Culinary Ex
 periences + Market: Food lovers can indulge in diverse Latin American and 
 Asian dishes through a vibrant array of food stalls and trucks. The Night 
 Market with international vendors will enhance the experience.\n 	Workshop
 s and Panels: Attendees will have the opportunity to participate in hands-
 on workshops such as Japanese flower arranging\, martial arts\, traditiona
 l dance\, cooking techniques\, and more\, offering immersive cultural lear
 ning experiences.\n\nRegister: Performers\, Volunteers\, Vendors\n\n&nbsp\
 ;\n\nFor Sponsorship :\n\nCall 647-282-3279 | 647-831-7223 | info@mokshaca
