SUMMARY:TD Salsa on St. Clair Street Festival
DESCRIPTION:! The largest Latino-themed Street festival in Canada Celebrate
 s 21 Years!\n\n\n\nCANADA’S BIGGEST LATIN STREET PARTY IS BACK TO HEAT U
 P TORONTO!\nThe FREE 20th Annual TD Salsa on St. Clair Street Festival is 
 the main event of the award-winning TD Salsa in Toronto Festival. The week
 end celebration has garnered international recognition and attracts hundre
 ds of thousands of salsa lovers from near and far to Toronto. Join the sal
 sa party as a stretch of St. Clair Avenue West (from Winona Dr. to Christi
 e St.) is transformed into a vibrant showcase of Latin life in Canada. Exp
 erience non-stop dancing in the streets\, take in all the cultural beats/r
 hythms alongside some of the best local and international entertainers\, a
 nd immerse yourself in the Latin pavilion. Enjoy authentic Latin American 
 flavors and a fiesta of fun in the children's zone ! The TD Salsa in Toron
 to Festival and TD Salsa on St. Clair Street Festival are produced by the 
 Canadian Salsa Festivals Project\, a federally incorporated Not-for-Profit
  organization. Join us in celebrating two decades of Latin culture and pas
 sion in Toronto! #KeepDancingCanada\n\n\n TD Salsa on St. Clair Street Fes
 tival
