SUMMARY:HIP-HOP CULTURE CAMP
DESCRIPTION:Hip-Hop Culture Camp – 2025 Summer Program\nA fun and educati
 onal summer dance camp for kids ages 4-11\, exploring the four pillars of 
 Hip-Hop Culture:Emceeing – Writing and performing rhymesDJing – Produc
 ing beats and musicDance – Learning grooves\, breaking\, locking &amp\; 
 poppingGraffiti Art – Expressing creativity through visual art\nNo dance
  experience required! Campers will enhance skills\, stay active\, and make
  new friends. Health &amp\; safety protocols will be followed.\nCamp Dates
 :\n\n\n 	Week 1: July 7 – 11\n 	Week 2: July 14 – 18\n 	Week 3: July 2
 1 – 25\n\nMini Campers (Ages 4-5): 9:30 AM - 12:30 PM | $135 + HST/WeekJ
 unior Campers (Ages 6-11): 9:30 AM - 3:30 PM | $275 + HST/Week (Pizza Part
 y Fridays included!)\nBefore Care: 8:00 AM - 9:30 AM (email for rates)Afte
 r Care: 3:30 PM - 6:00 PM (email for rates)\nDiscounts: 10% off for multip
 le weeks &amp\; siblings!\nJoin us for 1\, 2\, or all 3 weeks and experien
 ce Hip-Hop in an exciting\, immersive way! HIP-HOP CULTURE CAMP
