SUMMARY:Bachata with Soul2Sole
DESCRIPTION:This Latin-themed evening kicks off with a bachata dance lesson
  led by the talented instructors from Soul2Sole. Originating in the Domini
 can Republic\, bachata is a passionate and soulful music genre and social 
 dance known for its smooth\, romantic style. After the lesson\, keep the e
 nergy high and the dance floor moving with live music by the sensational R
 icky Franco and his band. Whether you’re a seasoned dancer or brand new 
 to bachata\, come ready to move\, connect and celebrate Latin culture thro
 ugh music and dance!\n7–7:45pm: Dance Class*\n8–9:45pm: Live Band\n*Si
 gn up below for your Free Ticket to attend the Dance Class portion of the 
 evening.\nThis event is rain or shine! Bachata with Soul2Sole
