SUMMARY:Balfolk with Balfolk Toronto
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an evening of balfolk\, a vibrant style of social d
 ance rooted in traditional (mostly French) folk dances. From bourrées\, j
 igues and gavottes to mazurkas\, waltzes and scottishes\, you will explore
  a mix of partner\, group and flowing chain dances. Dance to the dynamic s
 ounds of live music featuring clarinet\, accordion and fiddle\, blending t
 raditional folk melodies with fresh new compositions written just for thes
 e dances. Whether you’re a complete beginner or a curious dancer\, this 
 is your chance to step into a warm\, inclusive atmosphere and discover the
  magic of balfolk!\n\n7–7:45pm: Dance Class*\n\n8–9:45pm: Live Band\n\
 n*Sign up below for your Free Ticket to attend the Dance Class portion of 
 the evening.\n\nThis event is rain or shine! Balfolk with Balfolk Toronto
