SUMMARY:Wicked – Sparkle & shine with dance\, fashion & fun!
DESCRIPTION:​Fouetté Academy of Dance presents "Wicked – Sparkle &amp\
 ; Shine with Dance\, Fashion &amp\; Fun!" This vibrant summer camp\, sched
 uled for July 29-31\, 2025\, invites children aged 4.5 to 14 to immerse th
 emselves in a world of dance and creativity. Campers will explore various 
 dance styles\, including ballet\, jazz\, hip-hop\, and acro\, while also e
 ngaging in fashion-themed activities that encourage self-expression and co
 nfidence. The program includes arts and crafts\, games\, and outdoor adven
 tures\, ensuring a well-rounded and enjoyable experience. Located in Vaugh
 an\, Ontario\, Fouetté Academy offers a supportive environment where part
 icipants can develop their skills and make lasting friendships. Limited sp
 ots are available\, so early registration is recommended. Wicked – Spark
 le &amp\; shine with dance\, fashion &amp\; fun!
