DESCRIPTION:Kick off the festivities with a vibrant soca dance lesson led b
 y Toronto dancer and choreographer KJ McKnight.\n\nSoca\, born in Trinidad
  and Tobago\, is a thrilling blend of African and Caribbean dance styles\,
  full of rhythm\, energy and joy. After the lesson\, keep the vibes going 
 with live music from local soca sensation LVL Exodus. Bring your best ener
 gy\, your dancing shoes and prepare for an unforgettable evening of Caribb
 ean heat and rhythm.\n\n7–7:45pm: Dance Class*\n\n8–9:45pm: Live Band\
 n\n*Sign up for your Free Ticket to attend the Dance Class portion of the 
 evening.\n\nThis event is rain or shine! SOCA with KJ McKnight
