URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/red-bull-dance-your-style-toronto/
SUMMARY:Red Bull Dance Your Style Toronto
DESCRIPTION:Red Bull Dance Your Style\, is the most entertaining street dan
 ce event with the audience as the judge at its heart.\n\n\n\nEach year\, t
 housands of street dancers compete to be the best and represent their regi
 on at the Red Bull Dance Your Style National Final. This season\, top danc
 ers from across Canada will showcase their talents in electrifying battles
  at this unmissable competition.\n\nRegional Open-Qualifiers\n\nIn order t
 o make it to the National Final\, b-boys and b-girls will first have to ba
 ttle it out in the regional open-qualifiers. This year\, open-qualifiers w
 ill be held in Montreal on August 16th\, Toronto on August 22nd and Vancou
 ver on September 4th. Doors will open at 7:00pm and the live battles will 
 kick off at 8:00pm.\n\nNational Final\n\nThe best street dancers from coas
 t to coast will battle for their chance to represent Canada on the world s
 tage at the Red Bull Dance Your Style World Final 2025 in Los Angeles\, Ca
 lifornia. This years National Final will be taking place in Vancouver on S
 eptember 5th at The Commodore.\n\n\n Red Bull Dance Your Style Toronto
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2025/08/28864_image.jpg
