URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/free-intro-to-square-dancing/
SUMMARY:FREE Intro to Square Dancing
DESCRIPTION:Come join us for a fun and FREE introduction to square dancing 
 - no experience necessary\, just bring your dancing shoes and a smile!\n\n
 \n\nFREE Intro to Square Dancing\n\nCome join us for a fun-filled evening 
 of square dancing at St. Paul's Bloor Street!\n\nWhether you come with a f
 riend or on your own\, no partner or experience is required. Just bring co
 mfortable shoes and a water bottle. If you can walk\, you can square dance
 !\n\nDoors open at 6:45 pm. Dancing begins promptly at 7 pm.\n\nWhat is Mo
 dern Square Dancing? Groups of 8 are brought together for a fun\, fast-pac
 ed activity. Dancers follow "calls" from a live caller. It's like Simon Sa
 ys meets Social Dancing set to upbeat\, contemporary music.\n\nIt's not co
 mpetitive\, great for your mind and body\, in an alcohol-free environment 
 that builds teamwork + memory + fast-thinking skills. And you will make ne
 w friends!\n\nCan't make it on August 27? Mark your calendar for our next 
 free dance intro on Wednesday September 3\, 2025 at The 519 Church Communi
 ty Centre.\n\n\n FREE Intro to Square Dancing
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2025/08/28870_image.png
