URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/online-hawaiian-and-tahitian-dance
 -fitness-program-2/
SUMMARY:Online Hawaiian and Tahitian Dance Fitness Program
DESCRIPTION:Through our online program\, participants get to move to the be
 autiful dance movements and drums and rhythms of the Pacific Islands. Cher
 yl takes us right from our very homes to the islands of Hawaii\, Tahiti\, 
 and Samoa.\nThis style of dance is not commonly offered in Toronto and we 
 wanted to give our members and more Canadians a chance to experience a new
  workout experience.\nClasses are beginner and drop-in friendly.\nFor the 
 schedule\, please visit us online. Online Hawaiian and Tahitian Dance Fitn
 ess Program
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.torontodance.com/wp-content/uploads/
 2025/03/hula.jpg
CATEGORIES:Hula
END:VEVENT
