URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/hip-hop-dance-class-for-children/
SUMMARY:Hip-Hop Dance Class For Children
DESCRIPTION:Let's bust a move and groove to the rhythm at our Hip-Hop Dance
  Class.\n\n\n\nIf your child loves music\, movement\, and creativity\, thi
 s is the perfect opportunity to shake it up! Come join us\, try a free cla
 ss\, and see how much fun hip-hop can be.\n\nChildren 6–12 yrs: 2:00 PM 
 – 3:00 PM\nChildren 4–6 yrs: 3:00 PM – 4:00 PM\n\nWe can’t wait to
  dance with you!\n\n\n\n Hip-Hop Dance Class For Children
