URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/for-the-love-of-dance-2025-photo-e
 xhibit/
SUMMARY:For The Love Of Dance 2025 Photo Exhibit
DESCRIPTION:Our gala exhibition featuring the participants of "For The Love
  Of Dance" 2025 - where the arts of dance and photography meet!\n\n\n\nJoi
 n us for our "For The Love Of Dance" 2025 Photography Exhibition!\n\nImmer
 se yourself in the beauty and artistry of dance through stunning photograp
 hs. This event is made for our 2025 participants to celebrate their passio
 n and inspire others!\n\nThe exhibit features 50 portraits of young dancer
 s ages 7-18 of all skills and genres. Its mission is to celebrate the danc
 ers' beauty\, passion\, and hard work\, and appreciate their craft and ded
 ication as performance artists.\n\nOur mission is to help all dancers trul
 y connect with themselves\, see their beauty &amp\; spirit the way others 
 already do.\n\nPLEASE NOTE THAT THE TIME IS SUBJECT TO CHANGE.\n\nThe even
 t will run for 2 hours\, with doors open 30 minutes before the official st
 art time.\n\nThis year expect:\n\n 	Gorgeous dancer portraits beautifully 
 enlarged and displayed\n 	Formal dress code (optional)\n 	Photobooth to ta
 ke home memories\n 	Light snacks\n 	Surprise entertainment and more!\n\nBr
 ing your family\, friends\, and anyone who appreciates the arts of dance a
 nd photography!\n\nLearn more about the campaign here: https://www.vonguea
 rt.com/loveofdance\n\nSee you there!\n\n\n\n For The Love Of Dance 2025 Ph
 oto Exhibit
