URL:https://www.torontodance.com/events/soul-line-dance-social/
SUMMARY:Soul Line Dance Social
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Soul Line Dance Social\, a fun night of grooving an
 d good vibes on the dance floor!\n\n\nSoul Line Dance Social\nLearn basic 
 Soul Line Dances. Meet New Friends. Enjoy Refreshments.\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nCome
  groove with us at our December Soul Line Dance Social! Get ready to shuff
 le\, and sway to the soul and R&amp\;B tunes. Fun and friends come togethe
 r for a night of fantastic music and smooth moves. Whether you're a season
 ed dancer or new to line dancing\, everyone is welcome! Mark your calendar
  for this event that promises good vibes and great company. We'll be colle
 cting donations of period products for Help A Girl Out's Period Jamaica Re
 lief Drive\, so bring a product or two.\n\n\n Soul Line Dance Social
